ke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"6\"/></g></svg></span>　<div class=\"choices\"><b>3</b><span>　/　</span><b>4</b><span>　/　</span><b>5</b></div></div></div>","answer":"10, 1, 2, 3","marks":4},{"title":"इन अंकों को देखकर लिखिए।","body":"<div class=\"traces\"><span class=\"trace\">10</span><span class=\"trace\">1</span><span class=\"trace\">2</span><span class=\"trace\">3</span></div><div class=\"answer-lines small-lines\"><i></i><i></i></div>","answer":"अंक: 10, 1, 2, 3","marks":4},{"title":"खाली स्थान में अगला अंक लिखिए।","body":"<div class=\"questions-grid\"><div class=\"opt-line\">1　<span class=\"blank\">_____</span>　3</div><div class=\"opt-line\">2　<span class=\"blank\">_____</span>　4</div><div class=\"opt-line\">3　<span class=\"blank\">_____</span>　5</div></div>","answer":"2, 3, 4","marks":4},{"title":"आकृतियों को पहचानकर नाम बोलिए और गोले को रंगिए।","body":"<div class=\"shape-row\"><span class=\"shape-tile\"><svg width=\"65\" height=\"65\" viewBox=\"0 0 70 70\"><g stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"/></g></svg><small>वर्ग / Square</small></span><span class=\"shape-tile\"><svg width=\"65\" height=\"65\" viewBox=\"0 0 70 70\"><g stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M35 8L64 61H6Z\"/></g></svg><small>त्रिभुज / Triangle</small></span><span class=\"shape-tile\"><svg width=\"65\" height=\"65\" viewBox=\"0 0 70 70\"><g stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"35\" cy=\"35\" r=\"25\"/></g></svg><small>गोला / Circle</small></span></div><p class=\"microtask\">Read / पढ़िए: <b>4 · 4 · 1 · 7 · 2</b></p>","answer":"आकृति: circle/गोला, square/वर्ग, triangle/त्रिभुज; गोले को रंगा।; number reading: 4, 4, 1, 7, 2","marks":4}]},"Nursery|2|5|EVS":{"grade":"Nursery","term":2,"year":5,"subject":"EVS","marks":20,"duration":"25–30 मिनट","qs":[{"title":"चित्र पहचानकर नाम लिखिए / बोलिए।","body":"<div class=\"questions-grid\"><div class=\"opt-line\"><svg class=\"