many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 9 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 1 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 4 rows with 2 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 4 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 2 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"4 reusable bottles are shared equally among 2 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"4 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 2 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"2","ans_hi":"2","options":[{"en":"0","hi":"0"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 8 birds on a tree. 4 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 8 पक्षी थे, 4 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"4","ans_hi":"4","options":[{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 3 pages each day for 3 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 3 दिन तक रोज़ 3 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 4 litres of water a day for 2 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 2 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 4 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"7","h