ा मदद करता है?","ans":"Lamp","ans_hi":"लैंप","options":[{"en":"Helmet","hi":"हेलमेट"},{"en":"Zebra crossing","hi":"ज़ेब्रा क्रॉसिंग"},{"en":"Lamp","hi":"लैंप"},{"en":"Dustbin","hi":"कूड़ादान"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Where do we buy vegetables?","hi":"हम सब्जियाँ कहाँ खरीदते हैं?","ans":"Market","ans_hi":"बाज़ार","options":[{"en":"Zoo","hi":"चिड़ियाघर"},{"en":"Market","hi":"बाज़ार"},{"en":"Railway station","hi":"रेलवे स्टेशन"},{"en":"Library","hi":"पुस्तकालय"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Where do we post a letter?","hi":"हम पत्र कहाँ डालते हैं?","ans":"Post office","ans_hi":"डाकघर","options":[{"en":"Hospital","hi":"अस्पताल"},{"en":"Playground","hi":"खेल का मैदान"},{"en":"School","hi":"विद्यालय"},{"en":"Post office","hi":"डाकघर"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Where do trains stop for passengers?","hi":"यात्रियों के लिए रेलगाड़ियाँ कहाँ रुकती हैं?","ans":"Railway station","ans_hi":"रेलवे स्टेशन","options":[{"en":"School","hi":"विद्यालय"},{"en":"Railway station","hi":"रेलवे स्टेशन"},{"en":"Post office","hi":"डाकघर"},{"en":"Library","hi":"पुस्तकालय"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What can grow from a seed?","hi":"बीज से क्या उग सकता है?","ans":"Plant","ans_hi":"पौधा","options":[{"en":"Rain","hi":"वर्षा"},{"en":"Water","hi":"पानी"},{"en":"Plant","hi":"पौधा"},{"en":"Air","hi":"वायु"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 5 trees on Monday and 3 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 5 और मंगलवार को 3 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 3 paper sheets and reused 1. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 3 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 1 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"2","ans_hi":"2","options":[{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 3 rows with 3 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 3 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 3 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"6 reusable bottles are shared equally among 2 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"6 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 2 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"3","ans_hi":"3","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 5 birds on a tree. 4 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 5 पक्षी थे, 4 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"1","ans_hi":"1","options":[{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"0","hi":"0"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 2 pages each day for 3 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 3 दिन तक रोज़ 2 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 2 litres of water a day for 2 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 2 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 2 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"4","ans_hi":"4","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 7 pencils, and 5 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 7 पेंसिल में 5 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"2","ans_hi":"2","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 8 recyclable items in the morning and 2 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 8 और शाम 2 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"10","ans_hi":"10","options":[{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 5 seedlings. 3 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 5 पौध थे, 3 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"Which action keeps the classroom clean?","hi":"कक्षा को साफ रखने के लिए क्या करें?","ans":"Use the dustbin","ans_hi":"कूड़ादान प्रयोग करें","options":[{"en":"Use the dustbin","hi":"कूड़ादान प्रयोग करें"},{"en":"Scatter papers","hi":"कागज़ बिखेरें"},{"en":"Drop wrappers on floor","hi":"रैपर नीचे फेंकें"},{"en":"Mark desks with pen","hi":"मेज़ पर लिखें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Your friend falls while playing. What is the kind first step?","hi":"खेलते समय मित्र गिर जाए तो पहला अच्छा कदम क्या है?","ans":"Call a teacher and help","ans_hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें","options":[{"en":"Call a teacher and help","hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें"},{"en":"Push the friend again","hi":"फिर धक्का दें"},{"en":"Laugh at the friend","hi":"मित्र पर हँसें"},{"en":"Run away without telling","hi":"बिना बताए भाग जाएँ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"An unknown player asks for your home address. What should you do?","hi":"ऑनलाइन अनजान खिलाड़ी घर का पता माँगे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","ans_hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Send it in chat","hi":"चैट में भेज दें"},{"en":"Post the address publicly","hi":"पता सबको दिखाएँ"},{"en":"Give your school password too","hi":"स्कूल का पासवर्ड भी दें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A tap is left running after use. What is the best action?","hi":"उपयोग के बाद नल खुला रह गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Turn it off safely","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें","options":[{"en":"Break the tap","hi":"नल तोड़ दें"},{"en":"Waste more water","hi":"और पानी बहाएँ"},{"en":"Leave it running","hi":"चलने दें"},{"en":"Turn it off safely","hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A screen asks you to tell your password. What should you do?","hi":"स्क्रीन पासवर्ड बताने को कहे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Keep it private and ask an adult","ans_hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें","options":[{"en":"Shout it aloud","hi":"जोर से बता दें"},{"en":"Write it on a wall","hi":"दीवार पर लिख दें"},{"en":"Keep it private and ask an adult","hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें"},{"en":"Share it with strangers","hi":"अजनबियों को भेज दें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-1-1-02"},"1|0|3|GK":{"grade":"1","term":0,"year":3,"subjec