6"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 3 pages each day for 2 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 2 दिन तक रोज़ 3 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 4 litres of water a day for 3 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 3 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 4 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 6 pencils, and 3 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 6 पेंसिल में 3 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"3","ans_hi":"3","options":[{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 5 recyclable items in the morning and 2 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 5 और शाम 2 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"7","ans_hi":"7","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 9 seedlings. 5 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 9 पौध थे, 5 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"14","ans_hi":"14","options":[{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A classmate is sad. Which response shows kindness?","hi":"सहपाठी उदास हो तो कौन-सा व्यवहार अच्