 many in each group?","hi":"4 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 2 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"2","ans_hi":"2","options":[{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"0","hi":"0"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 6 birds on a tree. 1 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 6 पक्षी थे, 1 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 4 pages each day for 3 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 3 दिन तक रोज़ 4 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 4 litres of water a day for 3 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 3 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 4 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 4 pencils, and 1 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 4 पेंसिल में 1 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"3","ans_hi":"3","options":[{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 8 recyclable items in the morning and 1 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 8 और शाम 1 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 7 seedlings. 6 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 7 पौध थे, 6 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"13","ans_hi":"13","options":[{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"An unknown player asks for your home address. What should you do?","hi":"ऑनलाइन अनजान खिलाड़ी घर का पता माँगे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","ans_hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Give your school password too","hi":"स्कूल का पासवर्ड भी दें"},{"en":"Post the address publicly","hi":"पता सबको दिखाएँ"},{"en":"Send it in chat","hi":"चैट में भेज दें"},{"en":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"You find another child's ID card. What should you do?","hi":"आपको दूसरे बच्चे का पहचानपत्र मिले तो क्या करें?","ans":"Give it to a teacher","ans_hi":"उसे शिक्षक को दें","options":[{"en":"Throw it away","hi":"फेंक दें"},{"en":"Keep it secretly","hi":"चुपके से रख लें"},{"en":"Post the photo online","hi":"उसका फोटो ऑनलाइन डालें"},{"en":"Give it to a teacher","hi":"उसे शिक्षक को दें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Your friend falls while playing. What is the kind first step?","hi":"खेलते समय मित्र गिर जाए तो पहला अच्छा कदम क्या है?","ans":"Call a teacher and help","ans_hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें","options":[{"en":"Laugh at the friend","hi":"मित्र पर हँसें"},{"en":"Run away without telling","hi":"बिना बताए भाग जाएँ"},{"en":"Push the friend again","hi":"फिर धक्का दें"},{"en":"Call a teacher and help","hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A tap is left running after use. What is the best action?","hi":"उपयोग के बाद नल खुला रह गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Turn it off safely","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें","options":[{"en":"Break the tap","hi":"नल तोड़ दें"},{"en":"Waste more water","hi":"और पानी बहाएँ"},{"en":"Turn it off safely","hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें"},{"en":"Leave it running","hi":"चलने दें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A classmate is sad. Which response shows kindness?","hi":"सहपाठी उदास हो तो कौन-सा व्यवहार अच्छा है?","ans":"Listen kindly and offer help","ans_hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें","options":[{"en":"Ignore them always","hi":"हमेशा अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Call them names","hi":"बुरे नाम से बुलाएँ"},{"en":"Spread rumours","hi":"अफवाह फैलाएँ"},{"en":"Listen kindly and offer help","hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-1-1-07"},"1|0|8|GK":{"grade":"1","term":0,"year":8,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"60 minutes / 60 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"How many eyes do we have?","hi":"हमारी कितनी आँखें होती हैं?","ans":"Two","ans_hi":"दो","options":[{"en":"Two","hi":"दो"},{"en":"Five","hi":"पाँच"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"Seven","hi":"सात"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"quantities"},{"en":"How many ears do we have?","hi":"हमारे कितने कान होते हैं?","ans":"Two","ans_hi":"दो","options":[{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"Twenty","hi":"बीस"},{"en":"Seven","hi":"सात"},{"en":"Two","hi":"दो"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"quantities"},{"en":"Which body part helps us smell?","hi":"शरीर का कौन-सा अंग सूँघने में मदद करता है?","ans":"Nose","ans_hi":"नाक","options":[{"en":"Ears","hi":"कान"},{"en":"Nose