"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 4 rows with 2 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 4 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 2 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"6 reusable bottles are shared equally among 2 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"6 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 2 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"3","ans_hi":"3","options":[{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 8 birds on a tree. 3 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 8 पक्षी थे, 3 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 4 pages each day for 2 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 2 दिन तक रोज़ 4 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 4 litres of water a day for 2 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 2 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 4 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 9 pencils, and 1 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 9 पेंसिल में 1 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 8 recyclable items in the morning and 2 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 8 और शाम 2 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"10","ans_hi":"10","options":[{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 6 seedlings. 4 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 6 पौध थे, 4 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"10","ans_hi":"10","options":[{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A classmate is sad. Which response shows kindness?","hi":"सहपाठी उदास हो तो कौन-सा व्यवहार अच्छा है?","ans":"Listen kindly and offer help","ans_hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें","options":[{"en":"Ignore them always","hi":"हमेशा अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Spread rumours","hi":"अफवाह फैलाएँ"},{"en":"Listen kindly and offer help","hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें"},{"en":"Call them names","hi":"बुरे नाम से बुलाएँ"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"An unknown player asks for your home address. What should you do?","hi":"ऑनलाइन अनजान खिलाड़ी घर का पता माँगे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","ans_hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Send it in chat","hi":"चैट में भेज दें"},{"en":"Give your school password too","hi":"स्कूल का पासवर्ड भी दें"},{"en":"Post the address publicly","hi":"पता सबको दिखाएँ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","