n":"Eraser","hi":"रबड़"},{"en":"Umbrella","hi":"छाता"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 8 trees on Monday and 5 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 8 और मंगलवार को 5 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"13","ans_hi":"13","options":[{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 4 paper sheets and reused 4. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 4 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 4 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"0","ans_hi":"0","options":[{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"0","hi":"0"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 3 rows with 2 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 3 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 2 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"6 reusable bottles are shared equally among 2 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"6 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 2 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"3","ans_hi":"3","options":[{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 7 birds on a tree. 2 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 7 पक्षी थे, 2 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 2 pages each day for 2 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 2 दिन तक रोज़ 2 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"4","ans_hi":"4","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 3 litres of water a day for 3 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 3 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 3 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 6 pencils, and 3 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 6 पेंसिल में 3 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"3","ans_hi":"3","options":[{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 4 recyclable items in the morning and 1 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 4 और शाम 1 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 7 seedlings. 6 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 7 पौध थे, 6 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"13","ans_hi":"13","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"Someone is being teased unfairly in class. What is right?","hi":"कक्षा में किसी को अनुचित रूप से चिढ़ाया जा रहा है। क्या सही है?","ans":"Support them and tell a teacher","ans_hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Join in teasing","hi":"चिढ़