oning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 9 birds on a tree. 1 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 9 पक्षी थे, 1 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 2 pages each day for 2 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 2 दिन तक रोज़ 2 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"4","ans_hi":"4","options":[{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 4 litres of water a day for 2 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 2 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 4 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 7 pencils, and 3 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 7 पेंसिल में 3 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"4","ans_hi":"4","options":[{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 8 recyclable items in the morning and 1 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 8 और शाम 1 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 7 seedlings. 6 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 7 पौध थे, 6 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"13","ans_hi":"13","options":[{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"19","hi":"