rt helps us see?","hi":"शरीर का कौन-सा अंग देखने में सहायता करता है?","ans":"Eyes","ans_hi":"आँखें","options":[{"en":"Teeth","hi":"दाँत"},{"en":"Legs","hi":"पैर"},{"en":"Ears","hi":"कान"},{"en":"Eyes","hi":"आँखें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What protects our head on a bicycle?","hi":"साइकिल पर हमारे सिर की रक्षा क्या करता है?","ans":"Helmet","ans_hi":"हेलमेट","options":[{"en":"Dustbin","hi":"कूड़ादान"},{"en":"Zebra crossing","hi":"ज़ेब्रा क्रॉसिंग"},{"en":"Eraser","hi":"रबड़"},{"en":"Helmet","hi":"हेलमेट"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which place lends us books?","hi":"कौन-सा स्थान किताबें उधार देता है?","ans":"Library","ans_hi":"पुस्तकालय","options":[{"en":"Library","hi":"पुस्तकालय"},{"en":"Hospital","hi":"अस्पताल"},{"en":"Zoo","hi":"चिड़ियाघर"},{"en":"Railway station","hi":"रेलवे स्टेशन"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which item protects us from rain?","hi":"वर्षा से हमें कौन-सी वस्तु बचाती है?","ans":"Umbrella","ans_hi":"छाता","options":[{"en":"Clean water","hi":"स्वच्छ पानी"},{"en":"Umbrella","hi":"छाता"},{"en":"Dustbin","hi":"कूड़ादान"},{"en":"Zebra crossing","hi":"ज़ेब्रा क्रॉसिंग"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What gives light at night in the sky by reflecting sunlight?","hi":"रात में सूर्य का प्रकाश परावर्तित करके आकाश में क्या चमकता है?","ans":"Moon","ans_hi":"चंद्रमा","options":[{"en":"Plant","hi":"पौधा"},{"en":"Wind","hi":"हवा"},{"en":"Moon","hi":"चंद्रमा"},{"en":"Clouds","hi":"बादल"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 5 trees on Monday and 4 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 5 और मंगलवार को 4 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 5 paper sheets and reused 4. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 5 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 4 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"1","ans_hi":"1","options":[{"en":"0","hi":"0"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 3 rows with 2 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 3 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 2 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"4 reusable bottles are shared equally among 2 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"4 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 2 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"2","ans_hi":"2","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 8 birds on a tree. 5 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 8 पक्षी थे, 5 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"3","ans_hi":"3","options":[{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 3 pages each day for 3 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 3 दिन तक रोज़ 3 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 4 litres of water a day for 2 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 2 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 4 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 4 pencils, and 2 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 4 पेंसिल में 2 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"2","ans_hi":"2","options":[{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 4 recyclable items in the morning and 3 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 4 और शाम 3 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"7","ans_hi":"7","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 8 seedlings. 2 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 8 पौध थे, 2 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"10","ans_hi":"10","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"You need to wash hands before lunch. What do you use?","hi":"भोजन से पहले हाथ धोने के लिए क्या उपयोग करें?","ans":"Soap and clean water","ans_hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी","options":[{"en":"Only coloured paint","hi":"केवल रंग"},{"en":"A dirty cloth","hi":"गंदा कपड़ा"},{"en":"Only dry soil","hi":"केवल सूखी मिट्टी"},{"en":"Soap and clean water","hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The pedestrian light shows red. What should you do?","hi":"पैदल यात्री का सिग्नल लाल हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","ans