How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 4 और मंगलवार को 5 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 5 paper sheets and reused 2. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 5 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 2 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"3","ans_hi":"3","options":[{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 4 rows with 2 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 4 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 2 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"12 reusable bottles are shared equally among 3 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"12 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 3 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"4","ans_hi":"4","options":[{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 8 birds on a tree. 4 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 8 पक्षी थे, 4 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"4","ans_hi":"4","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 2 pages each day for 2 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 2 दिन तक रोज़ 2 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"4","ans_hi":"4","options":[{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 4 litres of water a day for 3 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 3 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 4 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 4 pencils, and 2 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 4 पेंसिल में 2 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"2","ans_hi":"2","options":[{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 4 recyclable items in the morning and 4 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 4 और शाम 4 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 5 seedlings. 1 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 5 पौध थे, 1 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"An unknown player asks for your home address. What should you do?","hi":"ऑनलाइन अनजान खिलाड़ी घर का पता माँगे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","ans_hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Send it in chat","hi":"चैट में भेज दें"},{"en":"Post the address publicly","hi":"पता सबको दिखाएँ"},{"en":"Give your school password too","hi":"स्कूल का पासवर्ड भी दें"},{"en":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसन