ern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What do we breathe to stay alive?","hi":"जीवित रहने के लिए हम क्या साँस में लेते हैं?","ans":"Air","ans_hi":"वायु","options":[{"en":"Air","hi":"वायु"},{"en":"Plant","hi":"पौधा"},{"en":"Sun","hi":"सूर्य"},{"en":"Rain","hi":"वर्षा"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 4 trees on Monday and 2 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 4 और मंगलवार को 2 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 8 paper sheets and reused 5. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 8 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 5 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"3","ans_hi":"3","options":[{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 4 rows with 3 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 4 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 3 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"9 reusable bottles are shared equally among 3 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"9 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 3 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"3","ans_hi":"3","options":[{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 3 birds on a tree. 6 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 3 पक्षी थे, 6 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"-3","ans_hi":"-3","optio