य ज्ञान"},{"en":"Where do trains stop for passengers?","hi":"यात्रियों के लिए रेलगाड़ियाँ कहाँ रुकती हैं?","ans":"Railway station","ans_hi":"रेलवे स्टेशन","options":[{"en":"Railway station","hi":"रेलवे स्टेशन"},{"en":"Playground","hi":"खेल का मैदान"},{"en":"Market","hi":"बाज़ार"},{"en":"Zoo","hi":"चिड़ियाघर"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Where do we buy vegetables?","hi":"हम सब्जियाँ कहाँ खरीदते हैं?","ans":"Market","ans_hi":"बाज़ार","options":[{"en":"Market","hi":"बाज़ार"},{"en":"School","hi":"विद्यालय"},{"en":"Zoo","hi":"चिड़ियाघर"},{"en":"Railway station","hi":"रेलवे स्टेशन"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 8 trees on Monday and 2 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 8 और मंगलवार को 2 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"10","ans_hi":"10","options":[{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 6 paper sheets and reused 1. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 6 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 1 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 4 rows with 3 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 4 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 3 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"9 reusable bottles are shared equally among 3 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"9 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 3 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"3","ans_hi":"3","options":[{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 5 birds on a tree. 5 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 5 पक्षी थे, 5 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"0","ans_hi":"0","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"0","hi":"0"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 4 pages each day for 2 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 2 दिन तक रोज़ 4 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 2 litres of water a day for 2 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 2 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 2 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"4","ans_hi":"4","options":[{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 9 pencils, and 6 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 9 पेंसिल में 6 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"3","ans_hi":"3","options":[{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 5 recyclable items in the morning and 3 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 5 और शाम 3 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 8 seedlings. 3 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 8 पौध थे, 3 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"11","ans_hi":"11","options":[{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A classmate is sad. Which response shows kindness?","hi":"सहपाठी उदास हो तो कौन-सा व्यवहार अच्छा है?","ans":"Listen kindly and offer help","ans_hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें","options":[{"en":"Spread rumours","hi":"अफवाह फैलाएँ"},{"en":"Call them names","hi":"बुरे नाम से बुलाएँ"},{"en":"Ignore them always","hi":"हमेशा अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Listen kindly and offer help","hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A tap is left running after use. What is the best action?","hi":"उपयोग के बाद नल खुला रह गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Turn it off safely","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें","options":[{"en":"Turn it off safely","hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें"},{"en":"Break the tap","hi":"नल तोड़ दें"},{"en":"Leave it running","hi":"चलने दें"},{"en":"Waste more water","hi":"और पानी बहाएँ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Someone is being teased unfairly in class. What is right?","hi":"कक्षा में किसी को अनुचित रूप से चिढ़ाया जा रहा है। क्या सही है?","ans":"Support them and tell a teacher","ans_hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Record and mock them","hi":"वीडियो बनाकर मज़ाक करें"},{"en":"Keep encouraging teasing","hi":"चिढ़ाना बढ़ाएँ"},{"en":"Support them and tell a teacher","hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ"},{"en":"Join in teasing","hi":"चिढ़ाने में शामिल हों"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"An unknown player asks for your home address. What should you do?","hi":"ऑनलाइन अनजान खिलाड़ी घर का पता माँगे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","ans_hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Post the address publicly","hi":"पता सबको दिखाएँ"},{"en":"Send it in chat","hi":"चैट में भेज दें"},{"en":"Give your school password too","hi":"स्कूल का पासवर्ड भी दें"},{"en":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A stranger sends a link promising free toys. What should you do?","hi":"अनजान व्यक्ति मुफ्त खिलौनों का लिंक भेजे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask a trusted adult before opening","ans_hi":"खोलने से पहले विश्वसनीय बड़े से पूछें","options":[{"en":"Open it at once","hi":"तुरंत खोलें"},{"en":"Forward without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे आगे भेजें"},{"en":"Send personal photos","hi":"निजी फोटो भेजें"},{"en":"Ask a trusted adult before opening","hi":"खोलने से पहले विश्वसनीय बड़े से पूछें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-1-2-09"},"1|1|10|GK":{"grade":"1","term":1,"year":10,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"60 minutes / 60 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"Which animal is known for a long trunk?","hi":"किस जानवर की लंबी सूँड़ होती है?","ans":"Elephant","ans_hi":"हाथी","options":[{"en":"Cat","hi":"बिल्ली"},{"en":"Elephant","hi":"हाथी"},{"en":"Rabbit","hi":"खरगोश"},{"en":"Horse","hi":"घोड़ा"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"animals"},{"en":"Which bird is famous for a colourful tail?","hi":"कौन-सा पक्षी रंग-बिरंगी पूँछ के लिए प्रसिद्ध है?","ans":"Peacock","ans_hi":"मोर","options":[{"en":"Eagle","hi":"गरुड़"},{"en":"Pigeon","hi":"कबूतर"},{"en":"Peacock","hi":"मोर"},{"en":"Crow","hi":"कौआ"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"birds"},{"en":"Which animal gives us wool?"