र कतार में 3 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"4 reusable bottles are shared equally among 2 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"4 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 2 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"2","ans_hi":"2","options":[{"en":"0","hi":"0"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 6 birds on a tree. 1 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 6 पक्षी थे, 1 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 4 pages each day for 3 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 3 दिन तक रोज़ 4 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 2 litres of water a day for 3 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 3 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 2 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 9 pencils, and 4 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 9 पेंसिल में 4 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 6 recyclable items in the morning and 6 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 6 और शाम 6 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 9 seedlings. 5 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 9 पौध थे, 5 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"14","ans_hi":"14","options":[{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A classmate is sad. Which response shows kindness?","hi":"सहपाठी उदास हो तो कौन-सा व्यवहार अच्छा है?","ans":"Listen kindly and offer help","ans_hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें","options":[{"en":"Listen kindly and offer help","hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें"},{"en":"Call them names","hi":"बुरे नाम से बुलाएँ"},{"en":"Spread rumours","hi":"अफवाह फैलाएँ"},{"en":"Ignore them always","hi":"हमेशा अनदेखा करें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A stranger sends a link promising free toys. What should you do?","hi":"अनजान व्यक्ति मुफ्त खिलौनों का लिंक भेजे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask a trusted adult before opening","ans_hi":"खोलने से पहले विश्वसनीय बड़े से पूछें","options":[{"en":"Open it at once","hi":"तुरंत खोलें"},{"en":"Ask a trusted adult before opening","hi":"खोलने से पहले विश्वसनीय बड़े से पूछें"},{"en":"Forward without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे आगे भेजें"},{"en":"Send personal photos","hi":"निजी फोटो भेजें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"An unknown player asks for your home address. What should you do?","hi":"ऑनलाइन अनजान खिलाड़ी घर का पता माँगे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","ans_hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Give your school password too","hi":"स्कूल का पासवर्ड भी दें"},{"en":"Send it in chat","hi":"चैट में भेज दें"},{"en":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Post the address publicly","hi":"पता सबको दिखाएँ"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"You need to wash hands before lunch. What do you use?","hi":"भोजन से पहले हाथ धोने के लिए क्या उपयोग करें?","ans":"Soap and clean water","ans_hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी","options":[{"en":"Only coloured paint","hi":"केवल रंग"},{"en":"Only dry soil","hi":"केवल सूखी मिट्टी"},{"en":"Soap and clean water","hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी"},{"en":"A dirty cloth","hi":"गंदा कपड़ा"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A tap is left running after use. What is the best action?","hi":"उपयोग के बाद नल खुला रह गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Turn it off safely","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें","options":[{"en":"Waste more water","hi":"और पानी बहाएँ"},{"en":"Leave it running","hi":"चलने दें"},{"en":"Break the tap","hi":"नल तोड़ दें"},{"en":"Turn it off safely","hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-1-2-10"},"1|2|1|GK":{"grade":"1","term":2,"year":1,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"60 minutes / 60 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"What is the capital of India?","hi":"भारत की राजधानी क्या है?","ans":"New Delhi","ans_hi":"नई दिल्ली","options":[{"en":"Jaipur","hi":"जयपुर"},{"en":"Mumbai","hi":"मुंबई"},{"en":"Agra","hi":"आगरा"},{"en":"New Delhi","hi":"नई दिल्ली"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"cities"},{"en":"What is the name of our country?","hi":"हमारे देश का नाम क्या है?","ans":"I