Legs","hi":"पैर"},{"en":"Skull","hi":"खोपड़ी"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 4 trees on Monday and 1 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 4 और मंगलवार को 1 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 8 paper sheets and reused 1. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 8 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 1 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"7","ans_hi":"7","options":[{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 3 rows with 2 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 3 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 2 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"6 reusable bottles are shared equally among 3 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"6 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 3 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"2","ans_hi":"2","options":[{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"0","hi":"0"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 6 birds on a tree. 5 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 6 पक्षी थे, 5 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"1","ans_hi":"1","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 4 pages each day for 2 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 2 दिन तक रोज़ 4 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 3 litres of water a day for 3 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 3 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 3 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 9 pencils, and 4 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 9 पेंसिल में 4 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 6 recyclable items in the morning and 1 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 6 और शाम 1 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"7","ans_hi":"7","options":[{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 6 seedlings. 3 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 6 पौध थे, 3 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"Which action protects a garden sapling?","hi":"बगीचे के छोटे पौधे को किससे बचाया जा सकता है?","ans":"Avoid stepping on it","ans_hi":"उस पर पैर न रखें","options":[{"en":"Avoid stepping on it","hi":"उस पर पैर न रखें"},{"en":"Cover it with litter","hi":"उस पर कूड़ा डालें"}