ing signal","hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें"},{"en":"Close your eyes and cross","hi":"आँख बंद कर पार करें"},{"en":"Run onto the road","hi":"सड़क पर दौड़ पड़ें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-1-3-01"},"1|2|2|GK":{"grade":"1","term":2,"year":2,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"60 minutes / 60 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"What is the capital of India?","hi":"भारत की राजधानी क्या है?","ans":"New Delhi","ans_hi":"नई दिल्ली","options":[{"en":"Mumbai","hi":"मुंबई"},{"en":"New Delhi","hi":"नई दिल्ली"},{"en":"Lucknow","hi":"लखनऊ"},{"en":"Agra","hi":"आगरा"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"cities"},{"en":"What is the name of our country?","hi":"हमारे देश का नाम क्या है?","ans":"India","ans_hi":"भारत","options":[{"en":"Nepal","hi":"नेपाल"},{"en":"India","hi":"भारत"},{"en":"Bangladesh","hi":"बांग्लादेश"},{"en":"Sri Lanka","hi":"श्रीलंका"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"countries"},{"en":"What are the colours of the Indian flag, top to bottom?","hi":"भारतीय ध्वज के रंग ऊपर से नीचे किस क्रम में हैं?","ans":"Saffron, white, green","ans_hi":"केसरिया, सफेद, हरा","options":[{"en":"Green, white, saffron","hi":"हरा, सफेद, केसरिया"},{"en":"Saffron, blue, green","hi":"केसरिया, नीला, हरा"},{"en":"Orange, black, green","hi":"नारंगी, काला, हरा"},{"en":"Saffron, white, green","hi":"केसरिया, सफेद, हरा"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"colors-forced"},{"en":"What is in the centre of India's flag?","hi":"भारत के ध्वज के बीच में क्या है?","ans":"Ashoka Chakra","ans_hi":"अशोक चक्र","options":[{"en":"Lotus","hi":"कमल"},{"en":"Star","hi":"तारा"},{"en":"Ashoka Chakra","hi":"अशोक चक्र"},{"en":"Lion Capital","hi":"सिंह स्तंभ"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","mark