,"ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 7 paper sheets and reused 6. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 7 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 6 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"1","ans_hi":"1","options":[{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"0","hi":"0"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 4 rows with 2 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 4 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 2 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"12 reusable bottles are shared equally among 3 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"12 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 3 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"4","ans_hi":"4","options":[{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 6 birds on a tree. 2 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 6 पक्षी थे, 2 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"4","ans_hi":"4","options":[{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 3 pages each day for 3 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 3 दिन तक रोज़ 3 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्