 body part helps us smell?","hi":"शरीर का कौन-सा अंग सूँघने में सहायता करता है?","ans":"Nose","ans_hi":"नाक","options":[{"en":"Legs","hi":"पैर"},{"en":"Eyes","hi":"आँखें"},{"en":"Nose","hi":"नाक"},{"en":"Hand","hi":"हाथ"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What should we drink when thirsty?","hi":"प्यास लगने पर क्या पीना चाहिए?","ans":"Clean water","ans_hi":"स्वच्छ पानी","options":[{"en":"Clean water","hi":"स्वच्छ पानी"},{"en":"Eraser","hi":"रबड़"},{"en":"Umbrella","hi":"छाता"},{"en":"Soap","hi":"साबुन"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Where are many animals cared for and displayed?","hi":"कई जानवरों की देखभाल करके उन्हें कहाँ दिखाया जाता है?","ans":"Zoo","ans_hi":"चिड़ियाघर","options":[{"en":"Hospital","hi":"अस्पताल"},{"en":"Playground","hi":"खेल का मैदान"},{"en":"Zoo","hi":"चिड़ियाघर"},{"en":"Library","hi":"पुस्तकालय"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Where does a doctor treat patients?","hi":"डॉक्टर रोगियों का इलाज कहाँ करते हैं?","ans":"Hospital","ans_hi":"अस्पताल","options":[{"en":"Playground","hi":"खेल का मैदान"},{"en":"Railway station","hi":"रेलवे स्टेशन"},{"en":"Market","hi":"बाज़ार"},{"en":"Hospital","hi":"अस्पताल"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What can grow from a seed?","hi":"बीज से क्या उग सकता है?","ans":"Plant","ans_hi":"पौधा","options":[{"en":"Wind","hi":"हवा"},{"en":"Plant","hi":"पौधा"},{"en":"Moon","hi":"चंद्रमा"},{"en":"Sun","hi":"सूर्य"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 7 trees on Monday and 5 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 7 और मंगलवार को 5 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 9 paper sheets and reused 4. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 9 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 4 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 3 rows with 3 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 3 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 3 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"4 reusable bottles are shared equally among 2 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"4 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 2 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"2","ans_hi":"2","options":[{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"0","hi":"0"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 3 birds on a tree. 2 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 3 पक्षी थे, 2 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"1","ans_hi":"1","options":[{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 4 pages each day for 2 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 2 दिन तक रोज़ 4 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 3 litres of water a day for 3 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 3 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 3 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 5 pencils, and 4 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 5 पेंसिल में 4 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"1","ans_hi":"1","options":[{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"0","hi":"0"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 7 recyclable items in the morning and 2 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 7 और शाम 2 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 4 seedlings. 4 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 4 पौध थे, 4 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The pedestrian light shows red. What should you do?","hi":"पैदल यात्री का सिग्नल लाल हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें","options":[{"en":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें"},{"en":"Close your eyes and cross","hi":"आँख बंद कर पार करें"},{"en":"Run onto the road","hi":"सड़क पर दौड़ पड़ें"},{"en":"Ignore road markings","hi":"चिह्न अनदेखे करें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Someone is being teased unfairly in class. What is right?","hi":"कक्षा में किसी को अनुचित रूप से चिढ़ाया जा रहा है। क्या सही है?","ans":"Support them and tell a teacher","ans_hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Support them and tell a teacher","hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ"},{"en":"Record and mock them","hi":"वीडियो बनाकर मज़ाक करें"},{"en":"Join in teasing","hi":"चिढ़ाने में शामिल हों"},{"en":"Keep encouraging teasing","hi":"चिढ़ाना बढ़ाएँ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A screen asks you to tell your password. What should you do?","hi":"स्क्रीन पासवर्ड बताने को कहे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Keep it private and ask an adult","ans_hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें","options":[{"en":"Shout it aloud","hi":"जोर से बता दें"},{"en":"Write it on a wall","hi":"दीवार पर लिख दें"},{"en":"Share it with strangers","hi":"अजनबियों को भेज दें"},{"en":"Keep it private and ask an adult","hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"An unknown player asks for your home address. What should you do?","hi":"ऑनलाइन अनजान खिलाड़ी घर का पता माँगे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","ans_hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Send it in chat","hi":"चैट में भेज दें"},{"en":"Post the address publicly","hi":"पता सबको दिखाएँ"},{"en":"Give your school password too","hi":"स्कूल का पासवर्ड भी दें"},{"en":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A classmate is sad. Which response shows kindness?","hi":"सहपाठी उदास हो तो कौन-सा व्यवहार अच्छा है?","ans":"Listen kindly and offer help","ans_hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें","options":[{"en":"Spread rumours","hi":"अफवाह फैलाएँ"},{"en":"Ignore them always","hi":"हमेशा अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Call them names","hi":"बुरे नाम से बुलाएँ"},{"en":"Listen kindly and offer help","hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-1-3-05"},"1|2|6|GK":{"grade":"1","term":2,"year":6,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"60 minutes / 60 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"What is the capital of India?","hi":"भारत की राजधानी क्या है?","ans":"New Delhi","ans_hi":"नई दिल्ली","options":[{"en":"New Delhi","hi":"नई दिल्ली"},{"en":"Kolkata","hi":"कोलकाता"},{"en":"Agra","hi":"आगरा"},{"en":"Mumbai","hi":"मुंबई"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"cities"},{"en":"What is the name of our country?","hi":"हमारे देश का नाम क्या है?","ans":"India","ans_hi":"भारत","options":[{"en":"Japan","hi":"जापान"},{"en":"Bhutan","hi":"भूटान"},{"en":"Pakistan","hi":"पाकिस्तान"},{"en":"India","hi":"भारत"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"countries"},{"en":"What are the colours of the Indian flag, top to bottom?","hi":"भारतीय ध्वज के रंग ऊपर से नीचे किस क्रम में हैं?","ans":"Saffron, white, green","ans_hi":"केसरिया, सफेद, हरा","options":[{"en":"Orange, black, green","hi":"नारंगी, काला, हरा"},{"en":"Saffron, blue, green","hi":"केसरिया, नीला, हरा"},{"en":"Saffron, white, green","hi":"केसरिया, सफेद, हरा"},{"en":"Green, white, saffron","hi":"हरा, सफेद, केसरिया"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"colors-forced"},{"en":"What is in the centre of India's flag?","hi":"भारत के ध्वज के बीच में क्या है?","ans":"Ashoka Chakra","ans_hi":"अशोक चक्र","options":[{"en":"Star","hi":"तारा"},{"en":"Ashoka Chakra","hi":"अशोक चक्र"},{"en":"Lotus","hi":"कमल"},{"en":"Lion Capital","hi":"सिंह स्तंभ"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"emblems-forced"},{"en":"How many spokes does the Ashoka Chakra have?","hi":"अशोक चक्र में कितनी तीलियाँ हैं?","ans":"24","ans_hi":"24","options":[{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"Ten","hi":"दस"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"Three","hi":"तीन"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"quantities"},{"en":"Which animal is India's national animal?","hi":"भारत का राष्ट्रीय पशु कौन-सा है?","ans":"Tiger","ans_hi":"बाघ","options":[{"en":"Cow","hi":"गाय"},{"en":"Camel","hi":"ऊँट"},{"en":"Cat","hi":"बिल्ली"},{"en":"Tiger","hi":"बाघ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"animals-forced"},{"en":"Which bird is India's national bird?","hi":"भारत का राष्ट्रीय पक्षी कौन-सा है?","ans":"Indian peafowl","ans_hi":"भारतीय मोर","options":[{"en":"Crow","hi":"कौआ"},{"en":"Pigeon","hi":"कबूतर"},{"en":"Indian peafowl","hi":"भारतीय मोर"},{"en":"Sparrow","hi":"गौरैया"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"birds-forced"},{"en":"What is India's national flower?","hi":"भारत का राष्ट्रीय पुष्प कौन-सा है?","ans":"Lotus","ans_hi":"कमल","options":[{"en":"Lotus","hi":"कमल"},{"en":"Rose","hi":"गुलाब"},{"en":"Sunflower","hi":"सूरजमुखी"},{"en":"Marigold","hi":"गेंदा"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What do we call a person who treats sick people?","hi":"बीमार लोगों का इलाज करने वाले व्यक्ति को क्या कहते हैं?","ans":"Doctor","ans_hi":"डॉक्टर","options":[{"en":"Doctor","hi":"डॉक्टर"},{"en":"Police officer","hi":"पुलिसकर्मी"},{"en":"Cleaning staff","hi":"सफाईकर्मी"},{"en":"Farmer","hi":"किसान"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"workers"},{"en":"Who delivers letters to homes?","hi":"घरों तक चिट्ठियाँ कौन पहुँचाता है?","ans":"Postal worker","ans_hi":"डाककर्मी","options":[{"en":"Cleaning staff","hi":"सफाईकर्मी"},{"en":"Postal worker","hi":"डाककर्मी"},{"en":"Doctor","hi":"डॉक्टर"},{"en":"Firefighter","hi":"अग्निशामक कर्मी"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"workers"},{"en":"Who puts out fires?","hi":"आग कौन बुझाता है