ouds","ans_hi":"बादल","options":[{"en":"Air","hi":"वायु"},{"en":"Moon","hi":"चंद्रमा"},{"en":"Clouds","hi":"बादल"},{"en":"Water","hi":"पानी"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which body part helps us walk?","hi":"शरीर का कौन-सा अंग चलने में सहायता करता है?","ans":"Legs","ans_hi":"पैर","options":[{"en":"Skull","hi":"खोपड़ी"},{"en":"Legs","hi":"पैर"},{"en":"Eyes","hi":"आँखें"},{"en":"Tongue","hi":"जीभ"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Where does a doctor treat patients?","hi":"डॉक्टर रोगियों का इलाज कहाँ करते हैं?","ans":"Hospital","ans_hi":"अस्पताल","options":[{"en":"Market","hi":"बाज़ार"},{"en":"Hospital","hi":"अस्पताल"},{"en":"Railway station","hi":"रेलवे स्टेशन"},{"en":"Playground","hi":"खेल का मैदान"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What do plants absorb with roots?","hi":"पौधे जड़ों से क्या सोखते हैं?","ans":"Water","ans_hi":"पानी","options":[{"en":"Rain","hi":"वर्षा"},{"en":"Water","hi":"पानी"},{"en":"Sun","hi":"सूर्य"},{"en":"Plant","hi":"पौधा"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Where do we buy vegetables?","hi":"हम सब्जियाँ कहाँ खरीदते हैं?","ans":"Market","ans_hi":"बाज़ार","options":[{"en":"Post office","hi":"डाकघर"},{"en":"Playground","hi":"खेल का मैदान"},{"en":"Market","hi":"बाज़ार"},{"en":"Railway station","hi":"रेलवे स्टेशन"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which body part helps us see?","hi":"शरीर का कौन-सा अंग देखने में सहायता करता है?","ans":"Eyes","ans_hi":"आँखें","options":[{"en":"Ears","hi":"कान"},{"en":"Legs","hi":"पैर"},{"en":"Tongue","hi":"जीभ"},{"en":"Eyes","hi":"आँखें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What should we put litter into?","hi":"कूड़ा 