 वाली बोतलें 3 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"2","ans_hi":"2","options":[{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"0","hi":"0"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 6 birds on a tree. 3 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 6 पक्षी थे, 3 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"3","ans_hi":"3","options":[{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 2 pages each day for 3 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 3 दिन तक रोज़ 2 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 4 litres of water a day for 2 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 2 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 4 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 7 pencils, and 2 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 7 पेंसिल में 2 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 9 recyclable items in the morning and 5 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 9 और शाम 5 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"14","ans_hi":"14","options":[{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainab