},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 6 paper sheets and reused 6. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 6 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 6 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"0","ans_hi":"0","options":[{"en":"0","hi":"0"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 4 rows with 3 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 4 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 3 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"8 reusable bottles are shared equally among 2 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"8 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 2 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"4","ans_hi":"4","options":[{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 8 birds on a tree. 2 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 8 पक्षी थे, 2 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 3 pages each day for 2 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 2 दिन तक रोज़ 3 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 4 litres of water a day for 3 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 3 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 4 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 9 pencils, and 3 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 9 पेंसिल में 3 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 4 recyclable items in the morning and 4 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 4 और शाम 4 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 4 seedlings. 5 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 4 पौध थे, 5 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The pedestrian light shows red. What should you do?","hi":"पैदल यात्री का सिग्नल लाल हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें","options":[{"en":"Close your eyes and cross","hi":"आँख बंद कर पार करें"},{"en":"Run onto the road","hi":"सड़क पर दौड़ पड़ें"},{"en":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें"},{"en":"Ignore road markings","hi":"चिह्न अनदेखे करें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Your friend falls while playing. What is the kind first step?","hi":"खेलते समय मित्र गिर जाए तो पहला अच्छा कदम क्या है?","ans":"Call a teacher and help","ans_hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें","options":[{"en":"Call a teacher and help","hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें"},{"en":"Push the friend again","hi":"फिर धक्का दें"},{"en":"Laugh at the friend","hi":"मित्र पर हँसें"},{"en":"Run away without telling","hi":"बिना बताए भाग जाएँ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"An unknown player asks for your home address. What should you do?","hi":"ऑनलाइन अनजान खिलाड़ी घर का पता माँगे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","ans_hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Send it in chat","hi":"चैट में भेज दें"},{"en":"Give your school password too","hi":"स्कूल का पासवर्ड भी दें"},{"en":"Post the address publicly","hi":"पता सबको दिखाएँ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"You need to wash hands before lunch. What do you use?","hi":"भोजन से पहले हाथ धोने के लिए क्या उपयोग करें?","ans":"Soap and clean water","ans_hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी","options":[{"en":"Only coloured paint","hi":"केवल रंग"},{"en":"Only dry soil","hi":"केवल सूखी मिट्टी"},{"en":"Soap and clean water","hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी"},{"en":"A dirty cloth","hi":"गंदा कपड़ा"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Someone is being teased unfairly in class. What is right?","hi":"कक्षा में किसी को अनुचित रूप से चिढ़ाया जा रहा है। क्या सही है?","ans":"Support them and tell a teacher","ans_hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Support them and tell a teacher","hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ"},{"en":"Keep encouraging teasing","hi":"चिढ़ाना बढ़ाएँ"},{"en":"Record and mock them","hi":"वीडियो बनाकर मज़ाक करें"},{"en":"Join in teasing","hi":"चिढ़ाने में शामिल हों"}],"correct":0,"kin