h tool helps us erase pencil marks?","hi":"पेंसिल के निशान मिटाने के लिए कौन-सी वस्तु है?","ans":"Eraser","ans_hi":"रबड़","options":[{"en":"Eraser","hi":"रबड़"},{"en":"Lamp","hi":"लैंप"},{"en":"Helmet","hi":"हेलमेट"},{"en":"Zebra crossing","hi":"ज़ेब्रा क्रॉसिंग"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Where do we learn with teachers?","hi":"हम अध्यापकों के साथ कहाँ पढ़ते हैं?","ans":"School","ans_hi":"विद्यालय","options":[{"en":"Library","hi":"पुस्तकालय"},{"en":"Railway station","hi":"रेलवे स्टेशन"},{"en":"Market","hi":"बाज़ार"},{"en":"School","hi":"विद्यालय"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What should we drink when thirsty?","hi":"प्यास लगने पर क्या पीना चाहिए?","ans":"Clean water","ans_hi":"स्वच्छ पानी","options":[{"en":"Helmet","hi":"हेलमेट"},{"en":"Umbrella","hi":"छाता"},{"en":"Clean water","hi":"स्वच्छ पानी"},{"en":"Dustbin","hi":"कूड़ादान"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What shines in the daytime sky?","hi":"दिन में आकाश में क्या चमकता है?","ans":"Sun","ans_hi":"सूर्य","options":[{"en":"Water","hi":"पानी"},{"en":"Air","hi":"वायु"},{"en":"Sun","hi":"सूर्य"},{"en":"Rain","hi":"वर्षा"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What helps us see in the dark indoors?","hi":"कमरे में अँधेरे में देखने के लिए क्या मदद करता है?","ans":"Lamp","ans_hi":"लैंप","options":[{"en":"Dustbin","hi":"कूड़ादान"},{"en":"Helmet","hi":"हेलमेट"},{"en":"Lamp","hi":"लैंप"},{"en":"Umbrella","hi":"छाता"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Where does a doctor treat patients?","hi":"डॉक्टर रोगियों का इलाज कहाँ करते हैं?","ans":"Hospital","ans_hi":"अस्पताल","options":[{"en":"Market","hi":"बाज़ार"},{"en":"Hospital","hi":"अस्पताल"},{"en":"Zoo","hi":"चिड़ियाघर"},{"en":"Post office","hi":"डाकघर"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which body part helps us walk?","hi":"शरीर का कौन-सा अंग चलने में सहायता करता है?","ans":"Legs","ans_hi":"पैर","options":[{"en":"Ears","hi":"कान"},{"en":"Tongue","hi":"जीभ"},{"en":"Skull","hi":"खोपड़ी"},{"en":"Legs","hi":"पैर"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What do we breathe to stay alive?","hi":"जीवित रहने के लिए हम क्या साँस में लेते हैं?","ans":"Air","ans_hi":"वायु","options":[{"en":"Air","hi":"वायु"},{"en":"Water","hi":"पानी"},{"en":"Moon","hi":"चंद्रमा"},{"en":"Rain","hi":"वर्षा"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 6 trees on Monday and 2 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 6 और मंगलवार को 2 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 5 paper sheets and reused 3. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 5 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 3 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"2","ans_hi":"2","options":[{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 2 rows with 2 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 2 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 2 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"4","ans_hi":"4","options":[{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"6 reusable bottles are shared equally among 3 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"6 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 3 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"2","ans_hi":"2","options":[{"en":"0","hi":"0"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 3 birds on a tree. 1 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 3 पक्षी थे, 1 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"2","ans_hi":"2","options":[{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 2 pages each day for 2 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 2 दिन तक रोज़ 2 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"4","ans_hi":"4","options":[{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 3 litres of water a day for 2 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 2 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 3 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 4 pencils, and 6 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 4 पेंसिल में 6 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"-2","ans_hi":"-2","options":[{"en":"0","hi":"0"},{"en":"-2","hi":"-2"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 6 recyclable items in the morning and 3 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 6 और शाम 3 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / प