","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"6 reusable bottles are shared equally among 3 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"6 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 3 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"2","ans_hi":"2","options":[{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"0","hi":"0"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 3 birds on a tree. 3 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 3 पक्षी थे, 3 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"0","ans_hi":"0","options":[{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"0","hi":"0"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 2 pages each day for 3 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 3 दिन तक रोज़ 2 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 4 litres of water a day for 3 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 3 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 4 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 3 pencils, and 5 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 3 पेंसिल में 5 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"-2","ans_hi":"-2","options":[{"en":"0","hi":"0"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"-2","hi":"-2"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 8 recyclable items in the morning and 3 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 8 और शाम 3 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"11","ans_hi":"11","options":[{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 5 seedlings. 3 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 5 पौध थे, 3 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The pedestrian light shows red. What should you do?","hi":"पैदल यात्री का सिग्नल लाल हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें","options":[{"en":"Run onto the road","hi":"सड़क पर दौड़ पड़ें"},{"en":"Ignore road markings","hi":"चिह्न अनदेखे करें"},{"en":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें"},{"en":"Close your eyes and cross","hi":"आँख बंद कर पार करें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"You find another child's ID card. What should you do?","hi":"आपको दूसरे बच्चे का पहचानपत्र मिले तो क्या करें?","ans":"Give it to a teacher","ans_hi":"उसे शिक्षक को दें","options":[{"en":"Post the photo online","hi":"उसका फोटो ऑनलाइन डालें"},{"en":"Give it to a teacher","hi":"उसे शिक्षक को दें"},{"en":"Throw it away","hi":"फेंक दें"},{"en":"Keep it secretly","hi":"चुपके से रख लें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"You need to wash hands before lunch. What do you use?","hi":"भोजन से पहले हाथ धोने के लिए क्या उपयोग करें?","ans":"Soap and clean water","ans_hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी","options":[{"en":"Soap and clean water","hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी"},{"en":"Only dry soil","hi":"केवल सूखी मिट्टी"},{"en":"A dirty cloth","hi":"गंदा कपड़ा"},{"en":"Only coloured paint","hi":"केवल रंग"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case