ows with 3 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 2 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 3 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"6 reusable bottles are shared equally among 3 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"6 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 3 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"2","ans_hi":"2","options":[{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 4 birds on a tree. 6 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 4 पक्षी थे, 6 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"-2","ans_hi":"-2","options":[{"en":"0","hi":"0"},{"en":"-2","hi":"-2"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 4 pages each day for 2 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 2 दिन तक रोज़ 4 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 3 litres of water a day for 2 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 2 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 3 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 4 pencils, and 5 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 4 पेंसिल में 5 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"-1","ans_hi":"-1","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"0","hi":"0"},{"en":"-1","hi":"-1"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"}],"c