er sheets and reused 4. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 6 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 4 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"2","ans_hi":"2","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 2 rows with 3 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 2 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 3 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"6 reusable bottles are shared equally among 2 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"6 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 2 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"3","ans_hi":"3","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 4 birds on a tree. 4 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 4 पक्षी थे, 4 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"0","ans_hi":"0","options":[{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"0","hi":"0"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 3 pages each day for 2 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 2 दिन तक रोज़ 3 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 4 litres of water a day for 3 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 3 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 4 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"17","