ny trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 5 और मंगलवार को 2 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"7","ans_hi":"7","options":[{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 9 paper sheets and reused 6. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 9 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 6 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"3","ans_hi":"3","options":[{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 3 rows with 2 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 3 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 2 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"4 reusable bottles are shared equally among 2 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"4 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 2 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"2","ans_hi":"2","options":[{"en":"0","hi":"0"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 9 birds on a tree. 1 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 9 पक्षी थे, 1 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 2 pages each day for 2 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 2 दिन तक रोज़ 2 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"4","ans_hi":"4","options":[{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 2 litres of water a day for 2 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 2 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 2 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"4","ans_hi":"4","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 7 pencils, and 4 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 7 पेंसिल में 4 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"3","ans_hi":"3","options":[{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 6 recyclable items in the morning and 1 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 6 और शाम 1 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"7","ans_hi":"7","options":[{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 6 seedlings. 4 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 6 पौध थे, 4 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"10","ans_hi":"10","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"Someone is being teased unfairly in class. What is right?","hi":"कक्षा में किसी को अनुचित रूप से चिढ़ाया जा रहा है। क्या सही है?","ans":"Support them and tell a teacher","ans_hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Record and mock them","hi":"वीडियो बनाकर मज़ाक करें"},{"en":"Keep encouraging teasing","hi":"चिढ़ाना बढ़ाएँ"},{"en":"Join in teasing","hi":"चिढ़ाने में शामिल हों"},{"en":"Support them and tell a teacher","hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ"}],"c