":"What may fall from clouds?","hi":"बादलों से क्या गिर सकता है?","ans":"Rain","ans_hi":"वर्षा","options":[{"en":"Sun","hi":"सूर्य"},{"en":"Rain","hi":"वर्षा"},{"en":"Water","hi":"पानी"},{"en":"Clouds","hi":"बादल"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 9 trees on Monday and 2 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 9 और मंगलवार को 2 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"11","ans_hi":"11","options":[{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 8 paper sheets and reused 2. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 8 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 2 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 4 rows with 2 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 4 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 2 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"12 reusable bottles are shared equally among 3 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"12 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 3 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"4","ans_hi":"4","options":[{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 8 birds on a tree. 3 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 8 पक्षी थे, 3 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 2 pages each day for 2 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 2 दिन तक रोज़ 2 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"4","ans_hi":"4","options":[{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 2 litres of water a day for 2 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 2 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 2 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"4","ans_hi":"4","options":[{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 7 pencils, and 2 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 7 पेंसिल में 2 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 5 recyclable items in the morning and 1 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 5 और शाम 1 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 3 seedlings. 6 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 3 पौध थे, 6 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"An unknown player asks for your home address. What should you do?","hi":"ऑनलाइन अनजान खिलाड़ी घर का 