plied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"Which action keeps the classroom clean?","hi":"कक्षा को साफ रखने के लिए क्या करें?","ans":"Use the dustbin","ans_hi":"कूड़ादान प्रयोग करें","options":[{"en":"Scatter papers","hi":"कागज़ बिखेरें"},{"en":"Use the dustbin","hi":"कूड़ादान प्रयोग करें"},{"en":"Mark desks with pen","hi":"मेज़ पर लिखें"},{"en":"Drop wrappers on floor","hi":"रैपर नीचे फेंकें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"You need to wash hands before lunch. What do you use?","hi":"भोजन से पहले हाथ धोने के लिए क्या उपयोग करें?","ans":"Soap and clean water","ans_hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी","options":[{"en":"A dirty cloth","hi":"गंदा कपड़ा"},{"en":"Only dry soil","hi":"केवल सूखी मिट्टी"},{"en":"Soap and clean water","hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी"},{"en":"Only coloured paint","hi":"केवल रंग"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A screen asks you to tell your password. What should you do?","hi":"स्क्रीन पासवर्ड बताने को कहे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Keep it private and ask an adult","ans_hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें","options":[{"en":"Keep it private and ask an adult","hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें"},{"en":"Write it on a wall","hi":"दीवार पर लिख दें"},{"en":"Share it with strangers","hi":"अजनबियों को भेज दें"},{"en":"Shout it aloud","hi":"जोर से बता दें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Your friend falls while playing. What is the kind first step?","hi":"खेलते समय मित्र गिर जाए तो पहला अच्छा कदम क्या है?","ans":"Call a teacher and help","ans_hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें","options":[{"en":"Run away without telling","hi":"बिना बताए भाग जाएँ"},{"en":"Laugh at the friend","hi":"मित्र पर हँसें"},{"en":"Call a teacher and help","hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें"},{"en":"Push the friend again","hi":"फिर धक्का दें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case