hat helps us see in the dark indoors?","hi":"कमरे में अँधेरे में देखने के लिए क्या मदद करता है?","ans":"Lamp","ans_hi":"लैंप","options":[{"en":"Zebra crossing","hi":"ज़ेब्रा क्रॉसिंग"},{"en":"Eraser","hi":"रबड़"},{"en":"Clean water","hi":"स्वच्छ पानी"},{"en":"Lamp","hi":"लैंप"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What gives light at night in the sky by reflecting sunlight?","hi":"रात में सूर्य का प्रकाश परावर्तित करके आकाश में क्या चमकता है?","ans":"Moon","ans_hi":"चंद्रमा","options":[{"en":"Wind","hi":"हवा"},{"en":"Clouds","hi":"बादल"},{"en":"Moon","hi":"चंद्रमा"},{"en":"Water","hi":"पानी"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 4 trees on Monday and 6 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 4 और मंगलवार को 6 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"10","ans_hi":"10","options":[{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 5 paper sheets and reused 6. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 5 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 6 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"-1","ans_hi":"-1","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"0","hi":"0"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"-1","hi":"-1"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 4 rows with 3 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 4 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 3 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"6 reusable bottles are shared equally among 3 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"6 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 3 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"2","ans_hi":"2","options":[{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"0","hi":"0"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 4 birds on a tree. 5 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 4 पक्षी थे, 5 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"-1","ans_hi":"-1","options":[{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"0","hi":"0"},{"en":"-1","hi":"-1"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 2 pages each day for 3 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 3 दिन तक रोज़ 2 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 4 litres of water a day for 2 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 2 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 4 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 6 pencils, and 1 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 6 पेंसिल में 1 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 7 recyclable items in the morning and 1 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 7 और शाम 1 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 3 seedlings. 6 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 3 पौध थे, 6 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"Which action protects a garden sapling?","hi":"बगीचे के छोटे पौधे को किससे बचाया जा सकता है?","ans":"Avoid stepping on it","ans_hi":"उस पर पैर न रखें","options":[{"en":"Cover it with litter","hi":"उस पर कूड़ा डालें"},{"en":"Avoid stepping on it","hi":"उस पर पैर न रखें"},{"en":"Pull its leaves","hi":"पत्तियाँ नोचें"},{"en":"Break its stem","hi":"तना तोड़ें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"An unknown player asks for your home address. What should you do?","hi":"ऑनलाइन अनजान खिलाड़ी घर का पता माँगे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","ans_hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Post the address publicly","hi":"पता सबको दिखाएँ"},{"en":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Send it in chat","hi":"चैट में भेज दें"},{"en":"Give your school password too","hi":"स्कूल का पासवर्ड भी दें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The pedestrian light shows red. What should you do?","hi":"पैदल यात्री का सिग्नल लाल हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें","options":[{"en":"Run onto the road","hi":"सड़क पर दौड़ पड़ें"},{"en":"Ignore road markings","hi":"चिह्न अनदेखे करें"},{"en":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें"},{"en":"Close your eyes and cross","hi":"आँख बंद कर पार करें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"You need to wash hands before lunch. What do you use?","hi":"भोजन से पहले हाथ धोने के लिए क्या उपयोग करें?","ans":"Soap and clean water","ans_hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी","options":[{"en":"Soap and clean water","hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी"},{"en":"Only dry soil","hi":"केवल सूखी मिट्टी"},{"en":"Only coloured paint","hi":"केवल रंग"},{"en":"A dirty cloth","hi":"गंदा कपड़ा"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A stranger sends a link promising free toys. What should you do?","hi":"अनजान व्यक्ति मुफ्त खिलौनों का लिंक भेजे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask a trusted adult before opening","ans_hi":"खोलने से पहले विश्वसनीय बड़े से पूछें","options":[{"en":"Send personal photos","hi":"निजी फोटो भेजें"},{"en":"Forward without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे आगे भेजें"},{"en":"Ask a trusted adult before opening","hi":"खोलने से पहले विश्वसनीय बड़े से पूछें"},{"en":"Open it at once","hi":"तुरंत खोलें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-1-4-08"},"1|3|9|GK":{"grade":"1","term":3,"year":9,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"60 minutes / 60 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"How many days are in one week?","hi":"एक सप्ताह में कितने दिन होते हैं?","ans":"Seven","ans_hi":"सात","options":[{"en":"Seven","hi":"सात"},{"en":"Eight","hi":"आठ"},{"en":"Ten","hi":"दस"},{"en":"Six","hi":"छह"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"quantities"},{"en":"How many months are in one year?","hi":"एक वर्ष में कितने महीने होते हैं?","ans":"Twelve","ans_hi":"बारह","options":[{"en":"Three","hi":"तीन"},{"en":"Four","hi":"चार"},{"en":"Twelve","hi":"बारह"},{"en":"48","hi":"48"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"quantities"},{"en":"Which day comes after Monday?","hi":"सोमवार के बाद कौन-सा दिन आता है?","ans":"Tuesday","ans_hi":"मंगलवार","options":[{"en":"Wednesday","hi":"बुधवार"},{