},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"9 reusable bottles are shared equally among 3 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"9 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 3 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"3","ans_hi":"3","options":[{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 7 birds on a tree. 4 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 7 पक्षी थे, 4 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"3","ans_hi":"3","options":[{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 3 pages each day for 2 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 2 दिन तक रोज़ 3 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 3 litres of water a day for 2 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 2 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 3 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 7 pencils, and 1 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 7 पेंसिल में 1 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 3 recyclable items in the morning and 3 in the evening. How many items?","