","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 6 litres of water a day for 4 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 4 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 6 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"24","ans_hi":"24","options":[{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"23","hi":"23"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 21 pencils, and 4 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 21 पेंसिल में 4 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"17","ans_hi":"17","options":[{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"23","hi":"23"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 20 recyclable items in the morning and 8 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 20 और शाम 8 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"38","hi":"38"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 18 seedlings. 5 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 18 पौध थे, 5 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"23","ans_hi":"23","options":[{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"23","hi":"23"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"You find another child's ID card. What should you do?","hi":"आपको दूसरे बच्चे का पहचानपत्र मिले तो क्या करें?","ans":"Give it to a teacher","ans_hi":"उसे शिक्षक को दें","options":[{"en":"Keep it secretly","hi":"चुपके से रख लें"},{"en":"Post the photo online","hi":"उसका फोटो ऑनलाइन डालें"},{"en":"Throw it away","hi":"फेंक दें"},{"en":"Give it to a teacher","hi":"उसे शिक्षक को दें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Which action protects a garden sapling?","hi":"बगीचे के छोटे पौधे को किससे बचाया जा सकता है?","ans":"Avoid stepping on it","ans_hi":"उस पर पैर न रखें","options":[{"en":"Pull its leaves","hi":"पत्तियाँ नोचें"},{"en":"Break its stem","hi":"तना तोड़ें"},{"en":"Cover it with litter","hi":"उस पर कूड़ा डालें"},{"en":"Avoid stepping on it","hi":"उस पर पैर न रखें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A screen asks you to tell your password. What should you do?","hi":"स्क्रीन पासवर्ड बताने को कहे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Keep it private and ask an adult","ans_hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें","options":[{"en":"Share it with strangers","hi":"अजनबियों को भेज दें"},{"en":"Keep it private and ask an adult","hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें"},{"en":"Write it on a wall","hi":"दीवार पर लिख दें"},{"en":"Shout it aloud","hi":"जोर से बता दें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"You need to wash hands before lunch. What do you use?","hi":"भोजन से पहले हाथ धोने के लिए क्या उपयोग करें?","ans":"Soap and clean water","ans_hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी","options":[{"en":"Only coloured paint","hi":"केवल रंग"},{"en":"A dirty cloth","hi":"गंदा कपड़ा"},{"en":"Only dry soil","hi":"केवल सूखी मिट्टी"},{"en":"Soap and clean water","hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The pedestrian light shows red. What should you do?","hi":"पैदल यात्री का सिग्नल लाल हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें","options":[{"en":"Ignore road markings","hi":"चिह्न अनदेखे करें"},{"en":"Run onto the road","hi":"सड़क पर दौड़ पड़ें"},{"en":"Close your eyes and cross","hi":"आँख बंद कर पार करें"},{"en":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"An unknown player asks for your home address. What should you do?","hi":"ऑनलाइन अनजान खिलाड़ी घर का पता माँगे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","ans_hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Send it in chat","hi":"चैट में भेज दें"},{"en":"Give your school password too","hi":"स्कूल का पासवर्ड भी दें"},{"en":"Post the address publicly","hi":"पता सबको दिखाएँ"},{"en":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Someone is being teased unfairly in class. What is right?","hi":"कक्षा में किसी को अनुचित रूप से चिढ़ाया जा रहा है। क्या सही है?","ans":"Support them and tell a teacher","ans_hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Keep encouraging teasing","hi":"चिढ़ाना बढ़ाएँ"},{"en":"Record and mock them","hi":"वीडियो बनाकर मज़ाक करें"},{"en":"Support them and tell a teacher","hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ"},{"en":"Join in teasing","hi":"चिढ़ाने में शामिल हों"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A tap is left running after use. What is the best action?","hi":"उपयोग के बाद नल खुला रह गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Turn it off safely","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें","options":[{"en":"Waste more water","hi":"और पानी बहाएँ"},{"en":"Turn it off safely","hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें"},{"en":"Leave it running","hi":"चलने दें"},{"en":"Break the tap","hi":"नल तोड़ दें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-2-1-01"},"2|0|2|GK":{"grade":"2","term":0,"year":2,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"60 minutes / 60 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"What is the shape of a ball?","hi":"गेंद सामान्यतः किस आकार की होती है?","ans":"Sphere","ans_hi":"गोला","options":[{"en":"Cube","