:"23"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 22 paper sheets and reused 6. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 22 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 6 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"16","ans_hi":"16","options":[{"en":"32","hi":"32"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 7 rows with 3 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 7 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 3 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"21","ans_hi":"21","options":[{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"25 reusable bottles are shared equally among 5 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"25 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 5 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 19 birds on a tree. 6 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 19 पक्षी थे, 6 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"13","ans_hi":"13","options":[{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 7 pages each day for 3 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 3 दिन तक रोज़ 7 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"21","ans_hi":"21","options":[{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 5 litres of water a day for 5 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 5 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 5 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"25","ans_hi":"25","options":[{"en":"25","hi":"25"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 15 pencils, and 2 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 15 पेंसिल में 2 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"13","ans_hi":"13","options":[{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 13 recyclable items in the morning and 7 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 13 और शाम 7 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"20","ans_hi":"20","options":[{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 11 seedlings. 6 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 11 पौध थे, 6 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"17","ans_hi":"17","options":[{"en":"34","hi":"34"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"23","hi":"23"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"You find another child's ID card. What should you do?","hi":"आपको दूसरे बच्चे का पहचानपत्र मिले तो क्या करें?","ans":"Give it to a teacher","ans_hi":"उसे शिक्षक को दें","options":[{"en":"Give it to a teacher","hi":"उसे शिक्षक को दें"},{"en":"Throw it away","hi":"फेंक दें"},{"en":"Keep it secretly","hi":"चुपके से रख लें"},{"en":"Post the photo online","hi":"उसका फोटो ऑनलाइन डालें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Your friend falls while playing. What is the kind first 