rd","hi":"पासवर्ड"},{"en":"Trusted adult","hi":"विश्वसनीय वयस्क"},{"en":"Stop","hi":"रुकना"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What is safer to share online?","hi":"ऑनलाइन कौन-सी चीज़ साझा करना सुरक्षित है?","ans":"A drawing without personal details","ans_hi":"बिना निजी जानकारी वाला चित्र","options":[{"en":"A drawing without personal details","hi":"बिना निजी जानकारी वाला चित्र"},{"en":"Trusted adult","hi":"विश्वसनीय वयस्क"},{"en":"Close the tap","hi":"नल बंद करना"},{"en":"Password","hi":"पासवर्ड"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Who grows crops on a farm?","hi":"खेत में फसल कौन उगाता है?","ans":"Farmer","ans_hi":"किसान","options":[{"en":"Farmer","hi":"किसान"},{"en":"Postal worker","hi":"डाककर्मी"},{"en":"Painter","hi":"रंगकर्मी"},{"en":"Veterinarian","hi":"पशु चिकित्सक"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which instrument shows temperature?","hi":"तापमान कौन-सा यंत्र बताता है?","ans":"Thermometer","ans_hi":"तापमापी","options":[{"en":"Monitor","hi":"मॉनिटर"},{"en":"Camera","hi":"कैमरा"},{"en":"Thermometer","hi":"तापमापी"},{"en":"Compass","hi":"दिशासूचक यंत्र"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Who repairs leaking taps?","hi":"टपकते नल कौन ठीक करता है?","ans":"Plumber","ans_hi":"प्लंबर","options":[{"en":"Bus driver","hi":"बस चालक"},{"en":"Postal worker","hi":"डाककर्मी"},{"en":"Plumber","hi":"प्लंबर"},{"en":"Dentist","hi":"दंत चिकित्सक"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 21 trees on Monday and 2 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 21 और मंगलवार को 2 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"23","ans_hi":"23","options":[{"en":"23","hi":"23"},{"en":"46","hi":"46"},{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 23 paper sheets and reused 2. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 23 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 2 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"21","ans_hi":"21","options":[{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"25","hi":"25"},{"en":"23","hi":"23"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 6 rows with 2 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 6 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 2 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"30 reusable bottles are shared equally among 5 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"30 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 5 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 19 birds on a tree. 8 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 19 पक्षी थे, 8 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"11","ans_hi":"11","options":[{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 4 pages each day for 5 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 5 दिन तक रोज़ 4 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"20","ans_hi":"20","options":[{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"25","hi":"25"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 8 litres of water a day for 5 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 5 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 8 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"40","ans_hi":"40","options":[{"en":"45","hi":"45"},{"en":"41","hi":"41"},{"en":"39","hi":"39"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 15 pencils, and 8 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 15 पेंसिल में 8 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"7","ans_hi":"7","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 21 recyclable items in the morning and 7 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 21 और शाम 7 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"29","hi":"29"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"37","hi":"37"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 17 seedlings. 4 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 17 पौध थे, 4 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"21","ans_hi":"21","options":[{"en":"23","hi":"23"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"Your friend falls while playing. What is the kind first step?","hi":"खेलते समय मित्र गिर जाए तो पहला अच्छा कदम क्या है?","ans":"Call a teacher and help","ans_hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें","options":[{"en":"Call a teacher and help","hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें"},{"en":"Run away without telling","hi":"बिना बताए भाग जाएँ"},{"en":"Laugh at the friend","hi":"मित्र पर हँसें"},{"en":"Push the friend again","hi":"फिर धक्का दें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"You find another child's ID card. What should you do?","hi":"आपको दूसरे बच्चे का पहचानपत्र मिले तो क्या करें?","ans":"Give it to a teacher","ans_hi":"उसे शिक्षक को दें","options":[{"en":"Post the photo online","hi":"उसका फोटो ऑनलाइन डालें"},{"en":"Give it to a teacher","hi":"उसे शिक्षक को दें"},{"en":"Throw it away","hi":"फेंक दें"},{"en":"Keep it secretly","hi":"चुपके से रख लें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"You need to wash hands before lunch. What do you use?","hi":"भोजन से पहले हाथ धोने के लिए क्या उपयोग करें?","ans":"Soap and clean water","ans_hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी","options":[{"en":"Only dry soil","hi":"केवल सूखी मिट्टी"},{"en":"Soap and clean water","hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी"},{"en":"A dirty cloth","hi":"गंदा कपड़ा"},{"en":"Only coloured paint","hi":"केवल रंग"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A tap is left running after use. What is the best action?","hi":"उपयोग के बाद नल खुला रह गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Turn it off safely","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें","options":[{"en":"Turn it off safely","hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें"},{"en":"Waste more water","hi":"और पानी बहाएँ"},{"en":"Break the tap","hi":"नल तोड़ दें"},{"en":"Leave it running","hi":"चलने दें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Which action protects a garden sapling?","hi":"बगीचे के छोटे पौधे को किससे बचाया जा सकता है?","ans":"Avoid stepping on it","ans_hi":"उस पर पैर न रखें","options":[{"en":"Pull its leaves","hi":"पत्तियाँ नोचें"},{"en":"Avoid stepping on it","hi":"उस पर पैर न रखें"},{"en":"Cover it with litter","hi":"उस पर कूड़ा डालें"},{"en":"Break its stem","hi":"तना तोड़ें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A screen asks you to tell your password. What should you do?","hi":"स्क्रीन पासवर्ड बताने को कहे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Keep it private and ask an adult","ans_hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें","options":[{"en":"Share it w