 machine is used to print pages?","hi":"पृष्ठ छापने की मशीन कौन-सी है?","ans":"Printer","ans_hi":"प्रिंटर","options":[{"en":"Printer","hi":"प्रिंटर"},{"en":"Magnifying glass","hi":"आवर्धक काँच"},{"en":"Clock","hi":"घड़ी"},{"en":"Camera","hi":"कैमरा"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Who puts out fires?","hi":"आग कौन बुझाता है?","ans":"Firefighter","ans_hi":"अग्निशामक कर्मी","options":[{"en":"Postal worker","hi":"डाककर्मी"},{"en":"Bus driver","hi":"बस चालक"},{"en":"Painter","hi":"रंगकर्मी"},{"en":"Firefighter","hi":"अग्निशामक कर्मी"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What should we do before touching a hot pan?","hi":"गर्म पतीला छूने से पहले क्या करना चाहिए?","ans":"Ask an adult","ans_hi":"किसी बड़े से पूछें","options":[{"en":"Tell a teacher","hi":"शिक्षक को बताएँ"},{"en":"Password","hi":"पासवर्ड"},{"en":"A drawing without personal details","hi":"बिना निजी जानकारी वाला चित्र"},{"en":"Ask an adult","hi":"किसी बड़े से पूछें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Who should help when a strange link appears?","hi":"अनजान लिंक आने पर किसकी मदद लेनी चाहिए?","ans":"Trusted adult","ans_hi":"विश्वसनीय वयस्क","options":[{"en":"Stop","hi":"रुकना"},{"en":"Ask an adult","hi":"किसी बड़े से पूछें"},{"en":"Tell a teacher","hi":"शिक्षक को बताएँ"},{"en":"Trusted adult","hi":"विश्वसनीय वयस्क"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 15 trees on Monday and 6 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 15 और मंगलवार को 6 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"21","ans_hi":"21","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"29","hi":"29"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 12 paper sheets and reused 6. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 12 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 6 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 8 rows with 2 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 8 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 2 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"16","ans_hi":"16","options":[{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"32 reusable bottles are shared equally among 4 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"32 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 4 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 11 birds on a tree. 7 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 11 पक्षी थे, 7 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"4","ans_hi":"4","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 7 pages each day for 4 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 4 दिन तक रोज़ 7 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 5 litres of water a day for 4 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 4 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 5 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"20","ans_hi":"20","options":[{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 20 pencils, and 7 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 20 पेंसिल में 7 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"13","ans_hi":"13","options":[{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 13 recyclable items in the morning and 2 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 13 और शाम 2 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"15","ans_hi":"15","options":[{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 20 seedlings. 5 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 20 पौध थे, 5 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"25","ans_hi":"25","options":[{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"25","hi":"25"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"23","hi":"23"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"You need to wash hands before lunch. What do you use?","hi":"भोजन से पहले हाथ धोने के लिए क्या उपयोग करें?","ans":"Soap and clean water","ans_hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी","options":[{"en":"A dirty cloth","hi":"गंदा कपड़ा"},{"en":"Soap and clean water","hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी"},{"en":"Only dry soil","hi":"केवल सूखी मिट्टी"},{"en":"Only coloured paint","hi":"केवल रंग"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Which action protects a garden sapling?","hi":"बगीचे के छोटे पौधे को किससे बचाया जा सकता है?","ans":"Avoid stepping on it","ans_hi":"उस पर पैर न रखें","options":[{"en":"Break its stem","hi":"तना तोड़ें"},{"en":"Avoid stepping on it","hi":"उस पर पैर न रखें"},{"en":"Pull its leaves","hi":"पत्