"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 7 rows with 5 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 7 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 5 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"35","ans_hi":"35","options":[{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"35","hi":"35"},{"en":"70","hi":"70"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"12 reusable bottles are shared equally among 3 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"12 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 3 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"4","ans_hi":"4","options":[{"en":"2","hi":"2"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 13 birds on a tree. 6 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 13 पक्षी थे, 6 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"7","ans_hi":"7","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 5 pages each day for 2 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 2 दिन तक रोज़ 5 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"10","ans_hi":"10","options":[{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 4 litres of water a day for 4 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 4 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 4 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"16","ans_hi":"16","options":[{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 15 pencils, and 7 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 15 पेंसिल में 7 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 21 recyclable items in the morning and 5 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 21 और शाम 5 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"26","ans_hi":"26","options":[{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"33","hi":"33"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 16 seedlings. 7 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 16 पौध थे, 7 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"23","ans_hi":"23","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"23","hi":"23"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"Which action keeps the classroom clean?","hi":"कक्षा को साफ रखने के लिए क्या करें?","ans":"Use the dustbin","ans_hi":"कूड़ादान प्रयोग करें","options":[{"en":"Scatter papers","hi":"कागज़ बिखेरें"},{"en":"Mark desks with pen","hi":"मेज़ पर लिखें"},{"en":"Use the dustbin","hi":"कूड़ादान प्रयोग करें"},{"en":"Drop wrappers on floor","hi":"रैपर नीचे फेंकें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"You find another child's ID card. What should you do?","hi":"आपको दूसरे बच्चे का पहचानपत्र मिले तो क्या करें?","ans":"Give it to a teacher","ans_hi":"उसे शिक्षक को दें","options":[{"en":"Post the photo online","hi":"उसका फोटो ऑनलाइन डालें"},{"en":"Give it to a teacher","hi":"उसे शिक्षक को दें"},{"en":"Throw it away","hi":"फेंक दें"},{"en":"Keep it secretly","hi":"चुपके से रख लें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A tap is left running after use. What is the best action?","hi":"उपयोग के बाद नल खुला रह गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Turn it off safely","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें","options":[{"en":"Break the tap","hi":"नल तोड़ दें"},{"en":"Leave it running","hi":"चलने दें"},{"en":"Waste more water","hi":"और पानी बहाएँ"},{"en":"Turn it off safely","hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Someone is being teased unfairly in class. What is right?","hi":"कक्षा में किसी को अनुचित रूप से चिढ़ाया जा रहा है। क्या सही है?","ans":"Support them and tell a teacher","ans_hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Record and mock them","hi":"वीडियो बनाकर मज़ाक करें"},{"en":"Support them and tell a teacher","hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ"},{"en":"Keep encouraging teasing","hi":"चिढ़ाना बढ़ाएँ"},{"en":"Join in teasing","hi":"चिढ़ाने में शामिल हों"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Your friend falls while playing. What is the kind first step?","hi":"खेलते समय मित्र गिर जाए तो पहला अच्छा कदम क्या है?","ans":"Call a teacher and help","ans_hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें","options":[{"en":"Push the friend again","hi":"फिर धक्का दें"},{"en":"Laugh at the friend","hi":"मित्र पर हँसें"},{"en":"Run away without telling","hi":"बिना बताए भाग जाएँ"},{"en":"Call a teacher and help","hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A stranger sends a link promising free toys. What should you do?","hi":"अनजान व्यक्ति मुफ्त खिलौनों का लिंक भेजे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask a trusted adult before opening","ans_hi":"खोलने से पहले विश्वसनीय बड़े से पूछें","options":[{"en":"Send personal photos","hi":"निजी फोटो भेजें"},{"en":"Ask a trusted adult before opening","hi":"खोलने से पहले विश्वसनीय बड़े से पूछें"},{"en":"Open it at once","h