ows with 5 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 8 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 5 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"40","ans_hi":"40","options":[{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"41","hi":"41"},{"en":"80","hi":"80"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"25 reusable bottles are shared equally among 5 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"25 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 5 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 18 birds on a tree. 7 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 18 पक्षी थे, 7 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"11","ans_hi":"11","options":[{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 5 pages each day for 3 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 3 दिन तक रोज़ 5 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"15","ans_hi":"15","options":[{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 7 litres of water a day for 2 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 2 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 7 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"14","ans_hi":"14","options":[{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 18 pencils, and 5 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 18 पेंसिल में 5 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"13","ans_hi":"13","options":[{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 18 recyclable items in the morning and 3 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 18 और शाम 3 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"21","ans_hi":"21","options":[{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 23 seedlings. 6 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 23 पौध थे, 6 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"29","ans_hi":"29","options":[{"en":"58","hi":"58"},{"en":"29","hi":"29"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"31","hi":"31"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"Your friend falls while playing. What is the kind first step?","hi":"खेलते समय मित्र गिर जाए तो पहला अच्छा कदम क्या है?","ans":"Call a teacher and help","ans_hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें","options":[{"en":"Run away without telling","hi":"बिना बताए भाग जाएँ"},{"en":"Laugh at the friend","hi":"मित्र पर हँसें"},{"en":"Push the friend again","hi":"फिर धक्का दें"},{"en":"Call a teacher and help","hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Which action keeps the classroom clean?","hi":"कक्षा को साफ रखने के लिए क्या करें?","ans":"Use the dustbin","ans_hi":"कूड़ादान प्रयोग करें","options":[{"en":"Drop wrappers on floor","hi":"रैपर नीचे फेंकें"},{"en":"Mark desks with pen","hi":"मेज़ पर लिखें"},{"en":"Use the dustbin","hi":"कूड़ादान प्रयोग करें"},{"en":"Scatter papers","hi":"कागज़ बिखेरें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Which action protects a garden sapling?","hi":"बगीचे के छोटे पौधे को किससे बचाया जा सकता है?","ans":"Avoid stepping on it","ans_hi"