ैं और हर कतार में 5 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"40","ans_hi":"40","options":[{"en":"45","hi":"45"},{"en":"38","hi":"38"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"24 reusable bottles are shared equally among 3 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"24 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 3 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 18 birds on a tree. 2 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 18 पक्षी थे, 2 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"16","ans_hi":"16","options":[{"en":"32","hi":"32"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 4 pages each day for 2 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 2 दिन तक रोज़ 4 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 4 litres of water a day for 3 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 3 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 4 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 18 pencils, and 5 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 18 पेंसिल में 5 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"13","ans_hi":"13","options":[{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 22 recyclable items in the morning and 8 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 22 और शाम 8 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"30","ans_hi":"30","options":[{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"38","hi":"38"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"60","hi":"60"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 12 seedlings. 6 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 12 पौध थे, 6 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"18","ans_hi":"18","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A tap is left running after use. What is the best action?","hi":"उपयोग के बाद नल खुला रह गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Turn it off safely","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें","options":[{"en":"Leave it running","hi":"चलने दें"},{"en":"Break the tap","hi":"नल तोड़ दें"},{"en":"Waste more water","hi":"और पानी बहाएँ"},{"en":"Turn it off safely","hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Which action keeps the classroom clean?","hi":"कक्षा को साफ रखने के लिए क्या करें?","ans":"Use the dustbin","ans_hi":"कूड़ादान प्रयोग करें","options":[{"en":"Use the dustbin","hi":"कूड़ादान प्रयोग करें"},{"en":"Scatter papers","hi":"कागज़ बिखेरें"},{"en":"Mark desks with pen","hi":"मेज़ पर लिखें"},{"en":"Drop wrappers on floor","hi":"रैपर नीचे फेंकें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"You need to wash hands before lunch. What do you use?","hi":"भोजन से पहले हाथ धोने के लिए क्या उपयोग करें?","ans":"Soap and clean water","ans_hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी","options":[{"en":"Only coloured paint","hi":"केवल रंग"},{"en":"A dirty cloth","hi":"गंदा कपड़ा"},{"en":"Soap and clean water","hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी"},{"en":"Only dry soil","hi":"केवल सूखी मिट्टी"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Someone is being teased unfairly in class. What is right?","hi":"कक्षा में किसी को अनुचित रूप से चिढ़ाया जा रहा है। क्या सही है?","ans":"Support them and tell a teacher","ans_hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Record and mock them","hi":"वीडियो बनाकर मज़ाक करें"},{"en":"Support them and tell a teacher","hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ"},{"en":"Keep encouraging teasing","hi":"चिढ़ाना बढ़ाएँ"},{"en":"Join in teasing","hi":"चिढ़ाने में शामिल हों"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A screen asks you to tell your password. What should you do?","hi":"स्क्रीन पासवर्ड बताने को कहे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Keep it private and ask an adult","ans_hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें","options":[{"en":"Shout it aloud","hi":"जोर से बता दें"},{"en":"Share it with strangers","hi":"अजनबियों को भेज दें"},{"en":"Keep it private and ask an adult","hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें"},{"en":"Write it on a wall","hi":"दीवार पर लिख दें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"An unknown player asks for your home address. What should you do?","hi":"ऑनलाइन अनजान खिलाड़ी घर का पता माँगे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","ans_hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Post the address publicly","hi":"पता सबको दिखाएँ"},{"en":"Send it in chat","hi":"चैट में भेज दें"},{"en":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Give your school password too","hi":"स्कूल का पासवर्ड भी दें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A stranger sends a link promising free toys. What should you do?","hi":"अनजान व्यक्ति मुफ्त खिलौनों का लिंक भेजे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask a trusted adult before opening","ans_hi":"खोलने से पहले विश्वसनीय बड़े से पूछें","options":[{"en":"Forward without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे आगे भेजें"},{"en":"Open it at once","hi":"तुरंत खोलें"},{"en":"Send personal photos","hi":"निजी फोटो भेजें"},{"en":"Ask a trusted adult before opening","hi":"खोलने से पहले विश्वसनीय बड़े से पूछें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Your friend falls while playing. What is the kind first step?","hi":"खेलते समय मित्र गिर जाए तो पहला अच्छा कदम क्या है?","ans":"Call a teacher and help","ans_hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें","options":[{"en":"Laugh at the friend","hi":"मित्र पर हँसें"},{"en":"Run away without telling","hi":"बिना बताए भाग जाएँ"},{"en":"Call a teacher and help","hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें"},{"en":"Push the friend again","hi":"फिर धक्का दें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-2-1-09"},"2|0|10|GK":{"grade":"2","term":0,"year":10,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"60 minutes / 60 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"What is the shape of a ball?","hi":"गेंद सामान्यतः किस आकार की होती है?","ans":"Sphere","ans_hi":"गोला","options":[{"en":"Cylinder","hi":"बेलन"},{"en":"Cone","hi":"शंकु"},{"en":"Sphere","hi":"गोला"},{"en":"Cube","hi":"घन"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"How many teeth do most children initially have in their first set?","hi":"बच्चों के दूध के दाँतों की पूरी संख्या सामान्यतः कितनी होती है?","ans":"20","ans_hi":"20","options":[{"en":"Six","hi":"छह"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"Three","hi":"तीन"},{"en":"Four","hi":"चार"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"quantities"},{"en":"Which body part helps us chew food?","hi":"शरीर का कौन-सा भाग भोजन चबाने में मदद करता है?","ans":"Teeth","ans_hi":"दाँत","options":[{"en":"Teeth","hi":"दाँत"},{"en":"Skin","hi":"त्वचा"},{"en":"Eyes","hi":"आँखें"},{"en":"Hands","hi":"हाथ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"body"},{"en":"What should we do after using the toilet?","hi":"शौचालय के उपयोग के बाद क्या करना चाहिए?","ans":"Wash hands with soap","ans_hi":"साबुन से हाथ धोना","options":[{"en":"Only blow on hands","hi":"हाथों पर फूँक मारना"},{"en":"Leave without washing","hi":"बिना हाथ धोए जाना"},{"en":"Wipe hands on clothes","hi":"कपड़ों पर हाथ पोंछना"},{"en":"Wash hands with soap","hi":"साबुन से हाथ धोना"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What part of a flower can have bright colours?","hi":"फूल का कौन-सा भाग चमकीले रंगों का हो सकता है?","ans":"Petals","ans_hi":"पंखुड़ियाँ","options":[{"en":"Fruit","hi":"फल"},{"en":"Stem","hi":"तना"},{"en":"Petals","hi":"पंखुड़ियाँ"},{"en":"Leaf","hi":"पत्ती"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"plantparts"},{"en":"What do we call a plant with a strong woody trunk?","hi":"मजबूत लकड़ी जैसे तने वाले पौधे को क्या कहते हैं?","ans":"Tree","ans_hi":"पेड़","options":[{"en":"Tree","hi":"पेड़"},{"en":"Herb","hi":"शाकीय पौधा"},{"en":"Shrub","hi":"झाड़ी"},{"en":"Grass","hi":"घास"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What is the capital of Bihar?","hi":"बिहार की राजधानी क्या है?","ans":"Patna","ans_hi":"पटना","options":[{"en":"Kolkata","hi":"कोलकाता"},{"en":"Bhopal","hi":"भोपाल"},{"en":"New Delhi","hi":"नई दिल्ली"},{"en":"Patna","hi":"पटना"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"cities"},{"en":"What do we call a place where books can be borrowed?","hi":"जहाँ से किताबें पढ़ने के लिए मिलती हैं वह क्या कहलाता है?","ans":"Library","ans_hi":"पुस्तकालय","options":[{"en":"School","hi":"विद्यालय"},{"en":"Library",