ows with 3 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 7 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 3 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"21","ans_hi":"21","options":[{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"35 reusable bottles are shared equally among 5 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"35 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 5 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"7","ans_hi":"7","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 24 birds on a tree. 4 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 24 पक्षी थे, 4 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"20","ans_hi":"20","options":[{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 7 pages each day for 3 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 3 दिन तक रोज़ 7 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"21","ans_hi":"21","options":[{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 7 litres of water a day for 5 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 5 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 7 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"35","ans_hi":"35","options":[{"en":"34","hi":"34"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"70","hi":"70"},{"en":"35","hi":"35"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 23 pencils, and 4 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 23 पेंसिल में 4 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"19","ans_hi":"19","options":[{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"e