":"Which tool makes small print look larger?","hi":"छोटे अक्षरों को बड़ा देखने का उपकरण कौन-सा है?","ans":"Magnifying glass","ans_hi":"आवर्धक काँच","options":[{"en":"Clock","hi":"घड़ी"},{"en":"Camera","hi":"कैमरा"},{"en":"Keyboard","hi":"कीबोर्ड"},{"en":"Magnifying glass","hi":"आवर्धक काँच"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What is safer to share online?","hi":"ऑनलाइन कौन-सी चीज़ साझा करना सुरक्षित है?","ans":"A drawing without personal details","ans_hi":"बिना निजी जानकारी वाला चित्र","options":[{"en":"Ask an adult","hi":"किसी बड़े से पूछें"},{"en":"A drawing without personal details","hi":"बिना निजी जानकारी वाला चित्र"},{"en":"Password","hi":"पासवर्ड"},{"en":"Trusted adult","hi":"विश्वसनीय वयस्क"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 16 trees on Monday and 5 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 16 और मंगलवार को 5 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"21","ans_hi":"21","options":[{"en":"23","hi":"23"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 15 paper sheets and reused 6. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 15 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 6 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 7 rows with 4 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 7 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 4 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"29","hi":"29"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"14 reusable bottles are shared equally among 2 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"14 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 2 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"7","ans_hi":"7","options":[{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 19 birds on a tree. 8 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 19 पक्षी थे, 8 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"11","ans_hi":"11","options":[{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 8 pages each day for 2 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 2 दिन तक रोज़ 8 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"16","ans_hi":"16","options":[{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 7 litres of water a day for 5 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 5 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 7 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"35","ans_hi":"35","options":[{"en":"35","hi":"35"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"33","hi":"33"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 22 pencils, and 4 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 22 पेंसिल में 4 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"18","ans_hi":"18","options":[{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 13 recyclable items in the morning and 4 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 13 और शाम 4 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"17","ans_hi":"17","options":[{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"23","hi":"23"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 15 seedlings. 6 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 15 पौध थे, 6 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"21","ans_hi":"21","options":[{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"An unknown player asks for your home address. What should you do?","hi":"ऑनलाइन अनजान खिलाड़ी घर का पता माँगे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","ans_hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Send it in chat","hi":"चैट में भेज दें"},{"en":"Post the address publicly","hi":"पता सबको दिखाएँ"},{"en":"Give your school password too","hi":"स्कूल का पासवर्ड भी दें"},{"en":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Someone is being teased unfairly in class. What is right?","hi":"कक्षा में किसी को अनुचित रूप से चिढ़ाया जा रहा है। क्या सही है?","ans":"Support them and tell a teacher","ans_hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Support them and tell a teacher","hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ"},{"en":"Keep encouraging teasing","hi":"चिढ़ाना बढ़ाएँ"},{"en":"Record and mock them","hi":"वीडियो बनाकर मज़ाक करें"},{"en":"Join in teasing","hi":"चिढ़ाने में शामिल हों"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A classmate is sad. Which response shows kindness?","hi":"सहपाठी उदास हो तो कौन-सा व्यवहार अच्छा है?","ans":"Listen kindly and offer help","ans_hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें","options":[{"en":"Call them names","hi":"बुरे नाम से बुलाएँ"},{"en":"Listen kindly and offer help","hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें"},{"e