cts a garden sapling?","hi":"बगीचे के छोटे पौधे को किससे बचाया जा सकता है?","ans":"Avoid stepping on it","ans_hi":"उस पर पैर न रखें","options":[{"en":"Break its stem","hi":"तना तोड़ें"},{"en":"Pull its leaves","hi":"पत्तियाँ नोचें"},{"en":"Cover it with litter","hi":"उस पर कूड़ा डालें"},{"en":"Avoid stepping on it","hi":"उस पर पैर न रखें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The pedestrian light shows red. What should you do?","hi":"पैदल यात्री का सिग्नल लाल हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें","options":[{"en":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें"},{"en":"Ignore road markings","hi":"चिह्न अनदेखे करें"},{"en":"Close your eyes and cross","hi":"आँख बंद कर पार करें"},{"en":"Run onto the road","hi":"सड़क पर दौड़ पड़ें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A screen asks you to tell your password. What should you do?","hi":"स्क्रीन पासवर्ड बताने को कहे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Keep it private and ask an adult","ans_hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें","options":[{"en":"Write it on a wall","hi":"दीवार पर लिख दें"},{"en":"Share it with strangers","hi":"अजनबियों को भेज दें"},{"en":"Shout it aloud","hi":"जोर से बता दें"},{"en":"Keep it private and ask an adult","hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A stranger sends a link promising free toys. What should you do?","hi":"अनजान व्यक्ति मुफ्त खिलौनों का लिंक भेजे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask a trusted adult before opening","ans_hi":"खोलने से पहले विश्वसनीय बड़े से पूछें","options":[{"en":"Send personal photos","hi":"निजी फोटो भेजें"},{"en":"Open it at once","hi":"तुरंत खोलें"},{"en":"Forward without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे आगे भेजें"},{"en":"Ask a trusted adult before opening","hi":"खोलने से पहले विश्वसनीय बड़े से पूछें"}],"