ind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 18 birds on a tree. 4 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 18 पक्षी थे, 4 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"14","ans_hi":"14","options":[{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 8 pages each day for 2 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 2 दिन तक रोज़ 8 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"16","ans_hi":"16","options":[{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 8 litres of water a day for 3 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 3 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 8 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"24","ans_hi":"24","options":[{"en":"29","hi":"29"},{"en":"23","hi":"23"},{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 24 pencils, and 6 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 24 पेंसिल में 6 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"18","ans_hi":"18","options":[{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 14 recyclable items in the morning and 6 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 14 और शाम 6 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"20","ans_hi":"20","options":[{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 18 seedlings. 5 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 18 पौध थे, 5 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कि