tainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 19 birds on a tree. 5 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 19 पक्षी थे, 5 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"14","ans_hi":"14","options":[{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 7 pages each day for 2 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 2 दिन तक रोज़ 7 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"14","ans_hi":"14","options":[{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 5 litres of water a day for 5 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 5 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 5 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"25","ans_hi":"25","options":[{"en":"23","hi":"23"},{"en":"25","hi":"25"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 22 pencils, and 7 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 22 पेंसिल में 7 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"15","ans_hi":"15","options":[{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 22 recyclable items in the morning and 4 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 22 और शाम 4 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"26","ans_hi":"26","options":[{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"52","hi":"52"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 12 seedlings. 7 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 12 पौध थे, 7 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"19","ans_hi":"19","optio