 it off safely","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें","options":[{"en":"Leave it running","hi":"चलने दें"},{"en":"Break the tap","hi":"नल तोड़ दें"},{"en":"Waste more water","hi":"और पानी बहाएँ"},{"en":"Turn it off safely","hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The pedestrian light shows red. What should you do?","hi":"पैदल यात्री का सिग्नल लाल हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें","options":[{"en":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें"},{"en":"Ignore road markings","hi":"चिह्न अनदेखे करें"},{"en":"Close your eyes and cross","hi":"आँख बंद कर पार करें"},{"en":"Run onto the road","hi":"सड़क पर दौड़ पड़ें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"You find another child's ID card. What should you do?","hi":"आपको दूसरे बच्चे का पहचानपत्र मिले तो क्या करें?","ans":"Give it to a teacher","ans_hi":"उसे शिक्षक को दें","options":[{"en":"Throw it away","hi":"फेंक दें"},{"en":"Keep it secretly","hi":"चुपके से रख लें"},{"en":"Give it to a teacher","hi":"उसे शिक्षक को दें"},{"en":"Post the photo online","hi":"उसका फोटो ऑनलाइन डालें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Your friend falls while playing. What is the kind first step?","hi":"खेलते समय मित्र गिर जाए तो पहला अच्छा कदम क्या है?","ans":"Call a teacher and help","ans_hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें","options":[{"en":"Run away without telling","hi":"बिना बताए भाग जाएँ"},{"en":"Call a teacher and help","hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें"},{"en":"Push the friend again","hi":"फिर धक्का दें"},{"en":"Laugh at the friend","hi":"मित्र पर हँसें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A stranger sends a link promising free toys. What should you do?","hi":"अनजान व्यक्