","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 14 birds on a tree. 3 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 14 पक्षी थे, 3 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"11","ans_hi":"11","options":[{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 4 pages each day for 5 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 5 दिन तक रोज़ 4 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"20","ans_hi":"20","options":[{"en":"25","hi":"25"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 6 litres of water a day for 4 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 4 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 6 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"24","ans_hi":"24","options":[{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"25","hi":"25"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 20 pencils, and 2 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 20 पेंसिल में 2 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"18","ans_hi":"18","options":[{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 21 recyclable items in the morning and 5 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 21 और शाम 5 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"26","ans_hi":"26","options":[{"en":"33","hi":"33"},{"en":"25","hi":"25"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 13 seedlings. 6 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 13 पौध थे, 6 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"