 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 20 पक्षी थे, 4 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"16","ans_hi":"16","options":[{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 4 pages each day for 5 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 5 दिन तक रोज़ 4 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"20","ans_hi":"20","options":[{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"25","hi":"25"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 8 litres of water a day for 3 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 3 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 8 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"24","ans_hi":"24","options":[{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 19 pencils, and 8 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 19 पेंसिल में 8 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"11","ans_hi":"11","options":[{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 23 recyclable items in the morning and 7 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 23 और शाम 7 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"30","ans_hi":"30","options":[{"en":"32","hi":"32"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"39","hi":"39"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 20 seedlings. 6 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 20 पौध थे, 6 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"26","ans_hi":"26","options":[{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"25","hi":