1"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 7 pages each day for 4 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 4 दिन तक रोज़ 7 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 4 litres of water a day for 5 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 5 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 4 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"20","ans_hi":"20","options":[{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"25","hi":"25"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 12 pencils, and 4 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 12 पेंसिल में 4 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 12 recyclable items in the morning and 7 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 12 और शाम 7 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"19","ans_hi":"19","options":[{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"38","hi":"38"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 12 seedlings. 8 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 12 पौध थे, 8 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"20","ans_hi":"20","options":[{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"You need to wash hands before lunch. What do you use?","hi":"भोजन से पहले हाथ धोने के 