el modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 20 trees on Monday and 8 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 20 और मंगलवार को 8 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 15 paper sheets and reused 4. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 15 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 4 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"11","ans_hi":"11","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 4 rows with 3 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 4 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 3 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"9 reusable bottles are shared equally among 3 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"9 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 3 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"3","ans_hi":"3","options":[{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"1","hi":"1"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 24 birds on a tree. 4 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 24 पक्षी थे, 4 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"20","ans_hi":"20","options":[{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 5 pages each day for 4 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 4 दिन तक रोज़ 5 पृष्ठ प