inable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 7 litres of water a day for 3 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 3 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 7 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"21","ans_hi":"21","options":[{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 17 pencils, and 6 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 17 पेंसिल में 6 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"11","ans_hi":"11","options":[{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 13 recyclable items in the morning and 6 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 13 और शाम 6 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"19","ans_hi":"19","options":[{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 12 seedlings. 4 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 12 पौध थे, 4 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"16","ans_hi":"16","options":[{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"Your friend falls while playing. What is the kind first step?","hi":"खेलते समय मित्र गिर जाए तो पहला अच्छा कदम क्या है?","ans":"Call a teacher and help","ans_hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें","options":[{"en":"Run away without telling","hi":"बिना बताए भाग जाएँ"},{"en":"Laugh at the friend","hi":"मित्र पर हँसें"},{"en":"Call a teacher and help","hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें"},{"en":"Push the friend again","hi":"फिर धक्का दें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A tap is left running after use. What is the best action?","hi":"उपयोग के बाद नल खुला रह गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Turn it off safely","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें","options":[{"en":"Waste more water","hi":"और पानी बहाएँ"},{"en":"Break the tap","hi":"नल तोड़ दें"},{"en":"Leave it running","hi":"चलने दें"},{"en":"Turn it off safely","hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A stranger sends a link promising free toys. What should you do?","hi":"अनजान व्यक्ति मुफ्त खिलौनों का लिंक भेजे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask a trusted adult before opening","ans_hi":"खोलने से पहले विश्वसनीय बड़े से पूछें","options":[{"en":"Send personal photos","hi":"निजी फोटो भेजें"},{"en":"Forward without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे आगे भेजें"},{"en":"Ask a trusted adult before opening","hi":"खोलने से पहले विश्वसनीय बड़े से पूछें"},{"en":"Open it at once","hi":"तुरंत खोलें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"An unknown player asks for your home address. What should you do?","hi":"ऑनलाइन अनजान खिलाड़ी घर का पता माँगे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","ans_hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Give your school password too","hi":"स्कूल का पासवर्ड भी दें"},{"en":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Send it in chat","hi":"चैट में भेज दें"},{"en":"Post the address publicly","hi":"पता सबको दिखाएँ"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A classmate is sad. Which response shows kindness?","hi":"सहपाठी उदास हो तो कौन-सा व्यवहार अच्छा है?","ans":"Listen kindly and offer help","ans_hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें","options":[{"en":"Spread rumours","hi":"अफवाह फैलाएँ"},{"en":"Ignore them always","hi":"हमेशा अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Listen kindly and offer help","hi":"प्यार 