":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 24 paper sheets and reused 7. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 24 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 7 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"17","ans_hi":"17","options":[{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 7 rows with 2 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 7 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 2 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"14","ans_hi":"14","options":[{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"6 reusable bottles are shared equally among 2 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"6 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 2 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"3","ans_hi":"3","options":[{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 22 birds on a tree. 3 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 22 पक्षी थे, 3 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"19","ans_hi":"19","options":[{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"38","hi":"38"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 4 pages each day for 3 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 3 दिन तक रोज़ 4 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 5 litres of water a day for 5 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 5 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 5 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"25","ans_hi":"25","options":[{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"25","hi":"25"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 18 pencils, and 4 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 18 पेंसिल में 4 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"14","ans_hi":"14","options":[{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 19 recyclable items in the morning and 8 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 19 और शाम 8 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"27","ans_hi":"27","options":[{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"25","hi":"25"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 12 seedlings. 3 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 12 पौध थे, 3 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"15","ans_hi":"15","options":[{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The pedestrian light shows red. What should you do?","hi":"पैदल यात्री का सिग्नल लाल हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें","options":[{"en":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें"},{"en":"Run onto the road","hi":"सड़क पर दौड़ पड़ें"},{"en":"Close your eyes and cross","hi":"आँख बंद कर पार करें"},{"en":"Ignore road markings","hi":"चिह्न अनदेखे करें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A tap is left running after use. What is the best action?","hi":"उपयोग के बाद नल खुला रह गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Turn it off safely","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें","options":[{"en":"Waste more water","hi":"और पानी बहाएँ"},{"en":"Break the tap","hi":"नल तोड़ दें"},{"en":"Leave it running","hi":"चलने दें"},{"en":"Turn it off safely","hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A classmate is sad. Which response shows kindness?","hi":"सहपाठी उदास हो तो कौन-सा व्यवहार अच्छा है?","ans":"Listen kindly and offer help","ans_hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें","options":[{"en":"Ignore them always","hi":"हमेशा अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Listen kindly and offer help","hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें"},{"en":"Call them names","hi":"बुरे नाम से बुलाएँ"},{"en":"Spread rumours","hi":"अफवाह फैलाएँ"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A stranger sends a link promising free toys. What should you do?","hi":"अनजान व्यक्ति मुफ्त खिलौनों का लिंक भेजे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask a trusted adult before opening","ans_hi":"खोलने से पहले विश्वसनीय बड़े से पूछें","options":[{"en":"Send personal photos","hi":"निजी फोटो भेजें"},{"en":"Open it at once","hi":"तुरंत खोलें"},{"en":"Ask a trusted adult before opening","hi":"खोलने से पहले विश्वसनीय बड़े से पूछें"},{"en":"Forward without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे आगे भेजें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"An unknown player asks for your home address. What should you do?","hi":"ऑनलाइन अनजान खिलाड़ी घर का पता माँगे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","ans_hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Send it in chat","hi":"चैट में भेज दें"},{"en":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Give your school password too","hi":"स्कूल का पासवर्ड भी दें"},{"en":"Post the address publicly","hi":"पता सबको दिखाएँ"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"to