many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 4 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 5 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"20","ans_hi":"20","options":[{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 24 pencils, and 6 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 24 पेंसिल में 6 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"18","ans_hi":"18","options":[{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 24 recyclable items in the morning and 3 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 24 और शाम 3 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"27","ans_hi":"27","options":[{"en":"29","hi":"29"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"25","hi":"25"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 19 seedlings. 4 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 19 पौध थे, 4 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"23","ans_hi":"23","options":[{"en":"46","hi":"46"},{"en":"23","hi":"23"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"25","hi":"25"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"Someone is being teased unfairly in class. What is right?","hi":"कक्षा में किसी को अनुचित रूप से चिढ़ाया जा रहा है। क्या सही है?","ans":"Support them and tell a teacher","ans_hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Keep encouraging teasing","hi":"चिढ़ाना बढ़ाएँ"},{"en":"Support them and tell a teacher","hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ"},{"en":"Join in teasing","hi":"चिढ़ाने में शामिल हों"},{"en":"Record and mock them","hi":"वीडियो बनाकर मज़ाक करें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Your friend falls while playing. Wha