ी शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 6 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"17","ans_hi":"17","options":[{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"23","hi":"23"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 4 rows with 5 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 4 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 5 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"20","ans_hi":"20","options":[{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"12 reusable bottles are shared equally among 3 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"12 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 3 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"4","ans_hi":"4","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 17 birds on a tree. 3 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 17 पक्षी थे, 3 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"14","ans_hi":"14","options":[{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 7 pages each day for 4 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 4 दिन तक रोज़ 7 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"},{"en":"29","hi":"29"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 8 litres of water a day for 4 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 4 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 8 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"32","ans_hi":"32","options":[{"en":"33","hi":"33"},{"en":"31","hi":"31"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 17 pencils, and 6 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 17 पेंसिल में 6 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"11","ans_hi":"11","options":[{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 12 recyclable items in the morning and 5 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 12 और शाम 5 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"17","ans_hi":"17","options":[{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 18 seedlings. 3 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 18 पौध थे, 3 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"21","ans_hi":"21","options":[{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A tap is left running after use. What is the best action?","hi":"उपयोग के बाद नल खुला रह गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Turn it off safely","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें","options":[{"en":"Break the tap","hi":"नल तोड़ दें"},{"en":"Turn it off safely","hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें"},{"en":"Waste more water","hi":"और पानी बहाएँ"},{"en":"Leave it running","hi":"चलने दें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A screen asks you to tell your password. What should you do?","hi":"स्क्रीन पासवर्ड बताने को कहे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Keep it private and ask an adult","ans_hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें","options":[{"en":"Keep it private and ask an adult","hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें"},{"en":"Share it with strangers","hi":"अजनबियों को भेज दें"},{"en":"