ighter","hi":"अग्निशामक कर्मी"},{"en":"Painter","hi":"रंगकर्मी"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Who drives a bus?","hi":"बस कौन चलाता है?","ans":"Bus driver","ans_hi":"बस चालक","options":[{"en":"Bus driver","hi":"बस चालक"},{"en":"Veterinarian","hi":"पशु चिकित्सक"},{"en":"Dentist","hi":"दंत चिकित्सक"},{"en":"Firefighter","hi":"अग्निशामक कर्मी"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which part develops into a new plant?","hi":"कौन-सा भाग नया पौधा बन सकता है?","ans":"Seed","ans_hi":"बीज","options":[{"en":"Branches","hi":"शाखाएँ"},{"en":"Roots","hi":"जड़ें"},{"en":"Stem","hi":"तना"},{"en":"Seed","hi":"बीज"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which device has keys for typing letters?","hi":"अक्षर टाइप करने वाला उपकरण कौन-सा है?","ans":"Keyboard","ans_hi":"कीबोर्ड","options":[{"en":"Printer","hi":"प्रिंटर"},{"en":"Magnifying glass","hi":"आवर्धक काँच"},{"en":"Camera","hi":"कैमरा"},{"en":"Keyboard","hi":"कीबोर्ड"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 11 trees on Monday and 3 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 11 और मंगलवार को 3 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"14","ans_hi":"14","options":[{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 22 paper sheets and reused 5. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 22 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 5 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"17","ans_hi":"17","options":[{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 6 rows with 2 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 6 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 2 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"20 reusable bottles are shared equally among 4 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"20 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 4 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 21 birds on a tree. 8 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 21 पक्षी थे, 8 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"13","ans_hi":"13","options":[{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 4 pages each day for 4 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 4 दिन तक रोज़ 4 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"16","ans_hi":"16","options":[{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 7 litres of water a day for 4 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 4 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 7 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"29","hi":"29"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 18 pencils, and 2 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 18 पेंसिल में 2 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"16","ans_hi":"16","options":[{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 21 recyclable items in the morning and 7 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 21 और शाम 7 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"56","hi":"56"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"35","hi":"35"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 19 seedlings. 3 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 19 पौध थे, 3 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"22","ans_hi":"22","options":[{"en":"44","hi":"44"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"You find another child's ID card. What should you do?","hi":"आपको दूसरे बच्चे का पहचानपत्र मिले तो क्या करें?","ans":"Give it to a teacher","ans_hi":"उसे शिक्षक को दें","options":[{"en":"Post the photo online","hi":"उसका फोटो ऑनलाइन डालें"},{"en":"Keep it secretly","hi":"चुपके से रख लें"},{"en":"Throw it away","hi":"फेंक दें"},{"en":"Give it to a teacher","hi":"उसे शिक्षक को दें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A classmate is sad. Which response shows kindness?","hi":"सहपाठी उदास हो तो कौन-सा व्यवहार अच्छा है?","ans":"Listen kindly and offer help","ans_hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें","options":[{"en":"Ignore them always","hi":"हमेशा अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Spread rumours","hi":"अफवाह फैलाएँ"},{"en":"Call them names","hi":"बुरे नाम से बुलाएँ"},{"en":"Listen kindly and offer help","hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A screen asks you to tell your password. What should you do?","hi":"स्क्रीन पासवर्ड बताने को कहे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Keep it private and ask an adult","ans_hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें","options":[{"en":"Write it on a wall","hi":"दीवार पर लिख दें"},{"en":"Keep it private and ask an adult","hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें"},{"en":"Shout it aloud","hi":"जोर से बता दें"},{"en":"Share it with strangers","hi":"अजनबियों को भेज दें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Your friend falls while playing. What is the kind first step?","hi":"खेलते समय मित्र गिर जाए तो पहला अच्छा कदम क्या है?","ans":"Call a teacher and help","ans_hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें","options":[{"en":"Laugh at the friend","hi":"मित्र पर हँसें"},{"en":"Push the friend again","hi":"फिर धक्का दें"},{"en":"Run away without telling","hi":"बिना बताए भाग जाएँ"},{"en":"Call a teacher and help","hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Someone is being teased unfairly in class. What is right?","hi":"कक्षा में किसी को अनुचित रूप से चिढ़ाया जा रहा है। क्या सही है?","ans":"Support them and tell a teacher","ans_hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Keep encouraging teasing","hi":"चिढ़ाना बढ़ाएँ"},{"en":"Support them and tell a teacher","hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ"},{"en":"Join in teasing","hi":"चिढ़ाने में शामिल हों"},{"en":"Record and mock them","hi":"वीडियो बनाकर मज़ाक करें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"You need to wash hands before lunch. What do you use?","hi":"भोजन से पहले हाथ धोने के लिए क्या उपयोग करें?","ans":"Soap and clean water","ans_hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी","options":[{"en":"Soap and clean water","hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी"},{"en":"A dirty cloth","hi":"गंदा कपड़ा"},{"en":"Only dry soil","hi":"केवल सूखी मिट्टी"},{"en":"Only coloured paint","hi":"केवल रंग"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Which action protects a garden sapling?","hi":"बगीचे के छोटे पौधे को किससे बचाया जा सकता है?","ans":"Avoid stepping on it","ans_hi":"उस पर पैर न रखें","options":[{"en":"Break its stem","hi":"तना तोड़ें"},{"en":"Cover it with litter","hi":"उस पर कूड़ा डालें"},{"en":"Pull its leaves","hi":"पत्तियाँ नोचें"},{"en":"Avoid stepping on it","hi":"उस पर पैर न रखें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A stranger sends a link promising free toys. What should you do?","hi":"अनजान व्यक्ति मुफ्त खिलौनों का लिंक भेजे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask a trusted adult before opening","ans_hi":"खोलने से पहले विश्वसनीय बड़े से पूछें","options":[{"en":"Ask a trusted adult before opening","hi":"खोलने से पहले विश्वसनीय बड़े से पूछें"},{"en":"Open it at once","hi":"तुरंत खोलें"},{"en":"Forward without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे आगे भेजें"},{"en":"Send personal photos","hi":"निजी फोटो भेजें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-2-3-10"},"2|3|1|GK":{"grade":"2","term":3,"year":1,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"60 minutes / 60 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"Which planet is also called our home planet?","hi":"किस ग्रह को हमारा गृह ग्रह कहते हैं?","ans":"Earth","ans_hi":"पृथ्वी","options":[{"en":"Earth","hi":"पृथ्वी"},{"en":"Neptune","hi":"वरुण"},{"en":"Venus","hi":"शुक्र"},{"en":"Uranus","hi":"अरुण"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"planets"},{"en":"What is the shape of Earth roughly?","hi":"पृथ्वी का आकार लगभग कैसा है?","ans":"Spherical","ans_hi":"गोलाकार","options":[{"en":"Perfect cube","hi":"पूरा घन"},{"en":"Spherical","hi":"गोलाकार"},{"en":"Flat triangle","hi":"चपटा त्रिभुज"},{"en":"Flat rectangle","hi":"चपटा आयत"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"Which direction is opposite to north?","hi":"उत्