ly makes food in sunlight?","hi":"पौधे का कौन-सा भाग सामान्यतः सूर्यप्रकाश में भोजन बनाता है?","ans":"Leaves","ans_hi":"पत्तियाँ","options":[{"en":"Leaves","hi":"पत्तियाँ"},{"en":"Seed","hi":"बीज"},{"en":"Bark","hi":"छाल"},{"en":"Stem","hi":"तना"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which tool makes small print look larger?","hi":"छोटे अक्षरों को बड़ा देखने का उपकरण कौन-सा है?","ans":"Magnifying glass","ans_hi":"आवर्धक काँच","options":[{"en":"Printer","hi":"प्रिंटर"},{"en":"Magnifying glass","hi":"आवर्धक काँच"},{"en":"Thermometer","hi":"तापमापी"},{"en":"Monitor","hi":"मॉनिटर"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What should we do if someone is being bullied?","hi":"किसी को तंग किया जा रहा हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Tell a teacher","ans_hi":"शिक्षक को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Trusted adult","hi":"विश्वसनीय वयस्क"},{"en":"Tell a teacher","hi":"शिक्षक को बताएँ"},{"en":"Password","hi":"पासवर्ड"},{"en":"Close the tap","hi":"नल बंद करना"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 11 trees on Monday and 8 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 11 और मंगलवार को 8 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"19","ans_hi":"19","options":[{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"29","hi":"29"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 21 paper sheets and reused 7. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 21 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 7 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"14","ans_hi":"14","options":[{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 5 rows with 4 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 5 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 4 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"20","ans_hi":"20","options":[{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"16 reusable bottles are shared equally among 2 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"16 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 2 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 11 birds on a tree. 6 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 11 पक्षी थे, 6 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 4 pages each day for 4 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 4 दिन तक रोज़ 4 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"16","ans_hi":"16","options":[{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 7 litres of water a day for 2 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 2 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 7 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"14","ans_hi":"14","options":[{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 18 pencils, and 6 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 18 पेंसिल में 6 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 23 recyclable items in the morning and 7 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 23 और शाम 7 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"30","ans_hi":"30","options":[{"en":"60","hi":"60"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"37","hi":"37"},{"en":"31","hi":"31"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 23 seedlings. 8 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 23 पौध थे, 8 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"31","ans_hi":"31","options":[{"en":"33","hi":"33"},{"en":"31","hi":"31"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"Someone is being teased unfairly in class. What is right?","hi":"कक्षा में किसी को अनुचित रूप से चिढ़ाया जा रहा है। क्या सही है?","ans":"Support them and tell a teacher","ans_hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Join in teasing","hi":"चिढ़ाने में शामिल हों"},{"en":"Support them and tell a teacher","hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ"},{"en":"Keep encouraging teasing","hi":"चिढ़ाना बढ़ाएँ"},{"en":"Record and mock them","hi":"वीडियो बनाकर मज़ाक करें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A tap is left running after use. What is the best action?","hi":"उपयोग के बाद नल खुला रह गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Turn it off safely","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें","options":[{"en":"Leave it running","hi":"चलने दें"},{"en":"Waste more water","hi":"और पानी बहाएँ"},{"en":"Turn it off safely","hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें"},{"en":"Break the tap","hi":"नल तोड़ दें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The pedestrian light shows red. What should you do?","hi":"पैदल यात्री का सिग्नल लाल हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें","options":[{"en":"Run onto the road","hi":"सड़क पर दौड़ पड़ें"},{"en":"Ignore road markings","hi":"चिह्न अनदेखे करें"},{"en":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें"},{"en":"Close your eyes and cross","hi":"आँख बंद कर पार करें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Your friend falls while playing. What is the kind first step?","hi":"खेलते समय मित्र गिर जाए तो पहला अच्छा कदम क्या है?","ans":"Call a teacher and help","ans_hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें","options":[{"en":"Laugh at the friend","hi":"मित्र पर हँसें"},{"en":"Run away without telling","hi":"बिना बताए भाग जाएँ"},{"en":"Call a teacher and help","hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें"},{"en":"Push the friend again","hi":"फिर धक्का दें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"You need to wash hands before lunch. What do you use?","hi":"भोजन से पहले हाथ धोने के लिए क्या उपयोग करें?","ans":"Soap and clean water","ans_hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी","options":[{"en":"Only coloured paint","hi":"केवल रंग"},{"en":"Soap and clean water","hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी"},{"en":"Only dry soil","hi":"केवल सूखी मिट्टी"},{"en":"A dirty cloth","hi":"गंदा कपड़ा"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A classmate is sad. Which response shows kindness?","hi":"सहपाठी उदास हो तो कौन-सा व्यवहार अच्छा है?","ans":"Listen kindly and offer help","ans_hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें","options":[{"en":"Call them names","hi":"बुरे नाम से बुलाएँ"},{"en":"Ignore them always","hi":"हमेशा अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Listen kindly and offer help","hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें"},{"en":"Spread rumours","hi":"अफवाह फैलाएँ"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A stranger sends a link promising free toys. What should you do?","hi":"अनजान 