क"},{"en":"A garden has 6 rows with 2 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 6 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 2 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"32 reusable bottles are shared equally among 4 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"32 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 4 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 11 birds on a tree. 3 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 11 पक्षी थे, 3 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 8 pages each day for 5 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 5 दिन तक रोज़ 8 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"40","ans_hi":"40","options":[{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"41","hi":"41"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"45","hi":"45"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 4 litres of water a day for 2 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 2 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 4 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 21 pencils, and 8 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 21 पेंसिल में 8 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"13","ans_hi":"13","options":[{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"23","hi":"23"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 14 recyclable items in the morning and 5 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 14 और शाम 5 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"19","ans_hi":"19","options":[{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 11 seedlings. 3 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 11 पौध थे, 3 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"14","ans_hi":"14","options":[{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A screen asks you to tell your password. What should you do?","hi":"स्क्रीन पासवर्ड बताने को कहे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Keep it private and ask an adult","ans_hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें","options":[{"en":"Share it with strangers","hi":"अजनबियों को भेज दें"},{"en":"Keep it private and ask an adult","hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें"},{"en":"Write it on a wall","hi":"दीवार पर लिख दें"},{"en":"Shout it aloud","hi":"जोर से बता दें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Your friend falls while playing. What is the kind first step?","hi":"खेलते समय मित्र गिर जाए तो पहला अच्छा कदम क्या है?","ans":"Call a teacher and help","ans_hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें","options":[{"en":"Laugh at the friend","hi":"मित्र पर हँसें"},{"en":"Call a teacher and help","hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें"},{"en":"Run away without telling","hi":"बिना बताए भाग जाएँ"},{"en":"Push the friend again","hi":"फिर धक्का दें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"An unknown player asks for your home address. What should you do?","hi":"ऑनलाइन अनजान खिलाड़ी घर का पता माँगे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","ans_hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Give your school password too","hi":"स्कूल का पासवर्ड भी दें"},{"en":"Post the address publicly","hi":"पता सबको दिखाएँ"},{"en":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Send it in chat","hi":"चैट में भेज दें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"You need to wash hands before lunch. What do you use?","hi":"भोजन से पहले हाथ धोने के लिए क्या उपयोग करें?","ans":"Soap and clean water","ans_hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी","options":[{"en":"Only coloured paint","hi":"केवल रंग"},{"en":"Only dry soil","hi":"केवल सूखी मिट्टी"},{"en":"Soap and clean water","hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी"},{"en":"A dirty cloth","hi":"गंदा कपड़ा"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A classmate is sad. Which response shows kindness?","hi":"सहपाठी उदास हो तो कौन-सा व्यवहार अच्छा है?","ans":"Listen kindly and offer help","ans_hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें","options":[{"en":"Ignore them always","hi":"हमेशा अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Listen kindly and offer help","hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें"},{"en":"Call them names","hi":"बुरे नाम से बुलाएँ"},{"en":"Spread rumours","hi":"अफवाह फैलाएँ"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The pedestrian light shows red. What should you do?","hi":"पैदल यात्री का सिग्नल लाल हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें","options":[{"en":"Ignore road markings","hi":"चिह्न अनदेखे करें"},{"en":"Run onto the road","hi":"सड़क पर दौड़ पड़ें"},{"en":"Close your eyes and cross","hi":"आँख बंद कर पार करें"},{"en":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"c