},{"en":"A garden has 8 rows with 3 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 8 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 3 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"24","ans_hi":"24","options":[{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"23","hi":"23"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"15 reusable bottles are shared equally among 5 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"15 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 5 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"3","ans_hi":"3","options":[{"en":"1","hi":"1"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 23 birds on a tree. 2 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 23 पक्षी थे, 2 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"21","ans_hi":"21","options":[{"en":"25","hi":"25"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 4 pages each day for 4 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 4 दिन तक रोज़ 4 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"16","ans_hi":"16","options":[{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 7 litres of water a day for 4 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 4 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 7 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"},{"en":"56","hi":"56"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 11 pencils, and 8 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 11 पेंसिल में 8 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"3","ans_hi":"3","options":[{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 23 recyclable items in the morning and 4 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 23 और शाम 4 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"27","ans_hi":"27","options":[{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 21 seedlings. 5 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 21 पौध थे, 5 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"26","ans_hi":"26","options":[{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"33","hi":"33"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"You need to wash hands before lunch. What do you use?","hi":"भोजन से पहले हाथ धोने के लिए क्या उपयोग करें?","ans":"Soap and clean water","ans_hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी","options":[{"en":"Only coloured paint","hi":"केवल रंग"},{"en":"A dirty cloth","hi":"गंदा कपड़ा"},{"en":"Only dry soil","hi":"केवल सूखी मिट्टी"},{"en":"Soap and clean water","hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"You find another child's ID card. What should you do?","hi":"आपको दूसरे बच्चे का पहचानपत्र मिले तो क्या करें?","ans":"Give it to a teacher","ans_hi":"उसे शिक्षक को दें","options":[{"en":"Keep it secretly","hi":"चुपके से रख लें"},{"en":"Give it to a teacher","hi":"उसे शिक्षक को दें"},{"en":"Post the photo online","hi":"उसका फोटो ऑनलाइन डालें"},{"en":"Throw it away","hi":"फेंक दें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A screen asks you to tell your password. What should you do?","hi":"स्क्रीन पासवर्ड बताने को कहे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Keep it private and ask an adult","ans_hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें","options":[{"en":"Write it on a wall","hi":"दीवार पर लिख दें"},{"en":"Shout it aloud","hi":"जोर से बता दें"},{"en":"Keep it private and ask an adult","hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें"},{"en":"Share it with strangers","hi":"अजनबियों को भेज दें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A classmate is sad. Which response shows kindness?","hi":"सहपाठी उदास हो तो कौन-सा व्यवहार अच्छा है?","ans":"Listen kindly and offer help","ans_hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें","options":[{"en":"Call them names","hi":"बुरे नाम से बुलाएँ"},{"en":"Ignore them always","hi":"हमेशा अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Spread rumours","hi":"अफवाह फैलाएँ"},{"en":"Listen kindly and offer help","hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Which action protects a garden sapling?","hi":"बगीचे के छोटे पौधे को किससे बचाया जा सकता है?","ans":"Avoid stepping on it","ans_hi":"उस पर पैर न रखें","options":[{"en":"Break its stem","hi":"तना तोड़ें"},{"en":"Pull its leaves","hi":"पत्तियाँ नोचें"},{"en":"Avoid stepping on it","hi":"उस पर पैर न रखें"},{"en":"Cover it with litter","hi":"उस पर कूड़ा डालें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The pedestrian light shows red. What should you do?","hi":"पैदल यात्री का सिग्नल लाल हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें","options":[{"en":"Close your eyes and cross","hi":"आँख बंद कर पार करें"},{"en":"Ignore road markings","hi":"चिह्न अनदेखे करें"},{"en":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें"},{"en":"Run onto the road","hi":"सड़क पर दौड़ पड़ें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Someone is being teased unfairly in class. What is right?","hi":"कक्षा में किसी को अनुचित रूप से चिढ़ाया जा रहा ह