र्क"},{"en":"14 reusable bottles are shared equally among 2 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"14 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 2 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"7","ans_hi":"7","options":[{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 18 birds on a tree. 4 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 18 पक्षी थे, 4 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"14","ans_hi":"14","options":[{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 6 pages each day for 3 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 3 दिन तक रोज़ 6 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"18","ans_hi":"18","options":[{"en":"23","hi":"23"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 7 litres of water a day for 4 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 4 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 7 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 13 pencils, and 3 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 13 पेंसिल में 3 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"10","ans_hi":"10","options":[{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 21 recyclable items in the morning and 7 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 21 और शाम 7 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28"