्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which plant part usually contains seeds?","hi":"पौधे के किस भाग में सामान्यतः बीज होते हैं?","ans":"Fruit","ans_hi":"फल","options":[{"en":"Roots","hi":"जड़ें"},{"en":"Stem","hi":"तना"},{"en":"Leaves","hi":"पत्तियाँ"},{"en":"Fruit","hi":"फल"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What grows into branches from the main stem of a tree?","hi":"पेड़ के मुख्य तने से क्या निकलती हैं?","ans":"Branches","ans_hi":"शाखाएँ","options":[{"en":"Flower","hi":"फूल"},{"en":"Branches","hi":"शाखाएँ"},{"en":"Stem","hi":"तना"},{"en":"Leaves","hi":"पत्तियाँ"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 23 trees on Monday and 2 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 23 और मंगलवार को 2 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"25","ans_hi":"25","options":[{"en":"23","hi":"23"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"29","hi":"29"},{"en":"25","hi":"25"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 16 paper sheets and reused 2. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 16 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 2 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"14","ans_hi":"14","options":[{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 7 rows with 4 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 7 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 4 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"18 reusable bottles are shared equally among 3 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"18 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 3 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 13 birds on a tree. 7 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 13 पक्षी थे, 7 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 3 pages each day for 3 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 3 दिन तक रोज़ 3 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 4 litres of water a day for 4 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 4 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 4 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"16","ans_hi":"16","options":[{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 16 pencils, and 3 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 16 पेंसिल में 3 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"13","ans_hi":"13","options":[{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 12 recyclable items in the morning and 6 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 12 और शाम 6 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"18","ans_hi":"18","options":[{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 21 seedlings. 3 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 21 पौध थे, 3 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"24","ans_hi":"24","options":[{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"Which action keeps the classroom clean?","hi":"कक्षा को साफ रखने के लिए क्या करें?","ans":"Use the dustbin","ans_hi":"कूड़ादान प्रयोग करें","options":[{"en":"Scatter papers","hi":"कागज़ बिखेरें"},{"en":"Use the dustbin","hi":"कूड़ादान प्रयोग करें"},{"en":"Drop wrappers on floor","hi":"रैपर नीचे फेंकें"},{"en":"Mark desks with pen","hi":"मेज़ पर लिखें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"You need to wash hands before lunch. What do you use?","hi":"भोजन से पहले हाथ धोने के लिए क्या उपयोग करें?","ans":"Soap and clean water","ans_hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी","options":[{"en":"Soap and clean water","hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी"},{"en":"Only coloured paint","hi":"केवल रंग"},{"en":"Only dry soil","hi":"केवल सूखी मिट्टी"},{"en":"A dirty cloth","hi":"गंदा कपड़ा"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"An unknown player asks for your home address. What should you do?","hi":"ऑनलाइन अनजान खिलाड़ी घर का पता माँगे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","ans_hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Give your school password too","hi":"स्कूल का पासवर्ड भी दें"},{"en":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Send it in chat","hi":"चैट में भेज दें"},{"en":"Post the address publicly","hi":"पता सबको दिखाएँ"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A tap is left running after use. What is the best action?","hi":"उपयोग के बाद नल खुला रह गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Turn it off safely","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें","options":[{"en":"Waste more water","hi":"और पानी बहाएँ"},{"en":"Turn it off safely","hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें"},{"en":"Leave it running","hi":"चलने दें"},{"en":"Break the tap","hi":"नल तोड़ दें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Someone is being teased unfairly in class. What is right?","hi":"कक्षा में किसी को अनुचित रूप से चिढ़ाया जा रहा है। क्या सही है?","ans":"Support them and tell a teacher","ans_hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Record and mock them","hi":"वीडियो बनाकर मज़ाक करें"},{"en":"Join in teasing","hi":"चिढ़ाने में शामिल हों"},{"en":"Keep encouraging teasing","hi":"चिढ़ाना बढ़ाएँ"},{"en":"Support them and tell a teacher","hi":"उसका साथ दें और शिक्षक को बताएँ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A screen asks you to tell your password. What should you do?","hi":"स्क्रीन पासवर्ड बताने को कहे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Keep it private and ask an adult","ans_hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें","options":[{"en":"Shout it aloud","hi":"जोर से बता दें"},{"en":"Write it on a wall","hi":"दीवार पर लिख दें"},{"en":"Keep it private and ask an adult","hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें"},{"en":"Share it with strangers","hi":"अजनबियों को भेज दें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Your friend falls while playing. What is the kind first step?","hi":"खेलते समय मित्र गिर जाए तो पहला अच्छा कदम क्या है?","ans":"Call a teacher and help","ans_hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें","options":[{"en":"Push the friend again","hi":"फिर धक्का दें"},{"en":"Laugh at the friend","hi":"मित्र पर हँसें"},{"en":"Call a teacher and help","hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें"},{"en":"Run away without telling","hi":"बिना बताए भाग जाएँ"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"You find another child's ID card. What should you do?","hi":"आपको दूसरे बच्चे का पहचानपत्र मिले तो क्या करें?","ans":"Give it to a teacher","ans_hi":"उसे शिक्षक को दें","options":[{"en":"Keep it secretly","hi":"चुपके से रख लें"},{"en":"Give it to a teacher","hi":"उसे शिक्षक को दें"},{"en":"Throw it away","hi":"फेंक दें"},{"en":"Post the photo online","hi":"उसका फोटो ऑनलाइन डालें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-2-4-06"},"2|3|7|GK":{"grade":"2","term":3,"year":7,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"60 minutes / 60 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"Which planet is also called our home planet?","hi":"किस ग्रह को हमारा गृह ग्रह कहते हैं?","ans":"Earth","ans_hi":"पृथ्वी","options":[{"en":"Uranus","hi":"अरुण"},{"en":"Mercury","hi":"बुध"},{"en":"Earth","hi":"पृथ्वी"},{"en":"Venus","hi":"शुक्र"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"planets"},{"en":"What is the shape of Earth roughly?","hi":"पृथ्वी का आकार लगभग कैसा है?","ans":"Spherical","ans_hi":"गोलाकार","options":[{"en":"Flat rectangle","hi":"चपटा आयत"},{"en":"Perfect cube","hi":"पूरा घन"},{"en":"Flat triangle","hi":"चपटा त्रिभुज"},{"en":"Spherical","hi":"गोलाकार"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"Which direction is opposite to north?","hi":"उत्तर दिशा के विपरीत कौन-सी दिशा है?","ans":"South","ans_hi":"दक्षिण","options":[{"en":"South-West","hi":"दक्षिण-पश्चिम"},{"en":"North-East","hi":"उत्तर-पूर्व"},{"en":"South","hi":"दक्षिण"},{"en":"North","hi":"उत्तर"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"directions"},{"en":"What is water called when it is very hot and becomes gas?","hi":"गर्म होकर गैस के रूप में पानी क्या कहलाता है?","ans":"Water vapour","ans_hi":"जलवाष्प","options":[{"en":"Ice crystals","hi":"बर्फ के क्रिस्टल"},{"