i":"5"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 22 birds on a tree. 3 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 22 पक्षी थे, 3 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"19","ans_hi":"19","options":[{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 8 pages each day for 2 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 2 दिन तक रोज़ 8 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"16","ans_hi":"16","options":[{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 7 litres of water a day for 3 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 3 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 7 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"21","ans_hi":"21","options":[{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 14 pencils, and 7 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 14 पेंसिल में 7 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"7","ans_hi":"7","options":[{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 15 recyclable items in the morning and 5 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 15 और शाम 5 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"20","ans_hi":"20","options":[{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 13 seedlings. 3 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 13 पौध थे, 3 और ल