ं","options":[{"en":"Break the tap","hi":"नल तोड़ दें"},{"en":"Turn it off safely","hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें"},{"en":"Waste more water","hi":"और पानी बहाएँ"},{"en":"Leave it running","hi":"चलने दें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A screen asks you to tell your password. What should you do?","hi":"स्क्रीन पासवर्ड बताने को कहे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Keep it private and ask an adult","ans_hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें","options":[{"en":"Keep it private and ask an adult","hi":"गोपनीय रखें और बड़े से पूछें"},{"en":"Share it with strangers","hi":"अजनबियों को भेज दें"},{"en":"Write it on a wall","hi":"दीवार पर लिख दें"},{"en":"Shout it aloud","hi":"जोर से बता दें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A classmate is sad. Which response shows kindness?","hi":"सहपाठी उदास हो तो कौन-सा व्यवहार अच्छा है?","ans":"Listen kindly and offer help","ans_hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें","options":[{"en":"Listen kindly and offer help","hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें"},{"en":"Call them names","hi":"बुरे नाम से बुलाएँ"},{"en":"Ignore them always","hi":"हमेशा अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Spread rumours","hi":"अफवाह फैलाएँ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Your friend falls while playing. What is the kind first step?","hi":"खेलते समय मित्र गिर जाए तो पहला अच्छा कदम क्या है?","ans":"Call a teacher and help","ans_hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें","options":[{"en":"Call a teacher and help","hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें"},{"en":"Laugh at the friend","hi":"मित्र पर हँसें"},{"en":"Push the friend again","hi":"फिर धक्का दें"},{"en":"Run away without telling","hi":"बिना बताए भाग जाएँ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Which action keeps the classroom clean?","hi":"कक्षा को साफ रखने के लिए क्या करें?","ans":"Use the dustbin","ans_hi":"कूड़ादान