lant part usually makes food in sunlight?","hi":"पौधे का कौन-सा भाग सामान्यतः सूर्यप्रकाश में भोजन बनाता है?","ans":"Leaves","ans_hi":"पत्तियाँ","options":[{"en":"Bark","hi":"छाल"},{"en":"Branches","hi":"शाखाएँ"},{"en":"Leaves","hi":"पत्तियाँ"},{"en":"Seed","hi":"बीज"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which device shows images from a computer?","hi":"कंप्यूटर की तस्वीरें कौन-सा उपकरण दिखाता है?","ans":"Monitor","ans_hi":"मॉनिटर","options":[{"en":"Clock","hi":"घड़ी"},{"en":"Monitor","hi":"मॉनिटर"},{"en":"Compass","hi":"दिशासूचक यंत्र"},{"en":"Thermometer","hi":"तापमापी"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which plant part attracts pollinators with colours?","hi":"पौधे का कौन-सा भाग रंगों से परागण करने वाले जीवों को आकर्षित करता है?","ans":"Flower","ans_hi":"फूल","options":[{"en":"Seed","hi":"बीज"},{"en":"Leaves","hi":"पत्तियाँ"},{"en":"Flower","hi":"फूल"},{"en":"Fruit","hi":"फल"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which plant part absorbs water?","hi":"पौधे का कौन-सा भाग पानी सोखता है?","ans":"Roots","ans_hi":"जड़ें","options":[{"en":"Flower","hi":"फूल"},{"en":"Leaves","hi":"पत्तियाँ"},{"en":"Roots","hi":"जड़ें"},{"en":"Branches","hi":"शाखाएँ"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What is safer to share online?","hi":"ऑनलाइन कौन-सी चीज़ साझा करना सुरक्षित है?","ans":"A drawing without personal details","ans_hi":"बिना निजी जानकारी वाला चित्र","options":[{"en":"Close the tap","hi":"नल बंद करना"},{"en":"A drawing without personal details","hi":"बिना निजी जानकारी वाला चित्र"},{"en":"Trusted adult","hi":"विश्वसनीय वयस्क"},{"en":"Tell a teacher","hi":"शिक्षक को बताएँ"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What helps conserve water at home?","hi":"घर में पा