"ans_hi":"पासवर्ड","options":[{"en":"Tell a teacher","hi":"शिक्षक को बताएँ"},{"en":"Use both sides","hi":"दोनों तरफ लिखना"},{"en":"Trusted adult","hi":"विश्वसनीय वयस्क"},{"en":"Password","hi":"पासवर्ड"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What grows into branches from the main stem of a tree?","hi":"पेड़ के मुख्य तने से क्या निकलती हैं?","ans":"Branches","ans_hi":"शाखाएँ","options":[{"en":"Flower","hi":"फूल"},{"en":"Branches","hi":"शाखाएँ"},{"en":"Seed","hi":"बीज"},{"en":"Bark","hi":"छाल"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 23 trees on Monday and 8 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 23 और मंगलवार को 8 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"31","ans_hi":"31","options":[{"en":"62","hi":"62"},{"en":"31","hi":"31"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"33","hi":"33"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 20 paper sheets and reused 2. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 20 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 2 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"18","ans_hi":"18","options":[{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 7 rows with 4 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 7 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 4 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"15 reusable bottles are shared equally among 3 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"15 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 3 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 24 birds on a tree. 7 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 24 पक्षी थे, 7 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"17","ans_hi":"17","options":[{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 3 pages each day for 5 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 5 दिन तक रोज़ 3 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"15","ans_hi":"15","options":[{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 6 litres of water a day for 5 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 5 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 6 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"30","ans_hi":"30","options":[{"en":"32","hi":"32"},{"en":"60","hi":"60"},{"en":"29","hi":"29"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 19 pencils, and 4 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 19 पेंसिल में 4 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"15","ans_hi":"15","options":[{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 20 recyclable items in the morning and 5 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 20 और शाम 5 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"25","ans_hi":"25","options":[{"en":"25","hi":"25"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"50","hi":"50"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 17 seedlings. 2 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 17 पौध थे, 2 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"19","ans_hi":"19","options":[{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"23","hi":"23"},{"en":"38","hi":"38"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"You find another child's ID card. What should you do?","hi":"आपको दूसरे बच्चे का पहचानपत्र मिले तो क्या करें?","ans":"Give it to a teacher","ans_hi":"उसे शिक्षक को दें","options":[{"en":"Post the photo online","hi":"उसका फोटो ऑनलाइन डालें"},{"en":"Give it to a teacher","hi":"उसे शिक्षक को दें"},{"en":"Keep it secretly","hi":"चुपके से रख लें"},{"en":"Throw it away","hi":"फेंक दें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Which action protects a garden sapling?","hi":"बगीचे के छोटे पौधे को किससे बचाया जा सकता है?","ans":"Avoid stepping on it","ans_hi":"उस पर पैर न रखें","options":[{"en":"Pull its leaves","hi":"पत्तियाँ नोचें"},{"en":"Cover it with litter","hi":"उस पर कूड़ा डालें"},{"en":"Break its stem","hi":"तना तोड़ें"},{"en":"Avoid stepping on it","hi":"उस पर पैर न रखें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A stranger sends a link promising free toys. What should you do?","hi":"अनजान व्यक्ति मुफ्त खिलौनों का लिंक भेजे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask a trusted adult before opening","ans_hi":"खोलने से पहले विश्वसनीय बड़े से पूछें","options":[{"en":"Forward without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे आगे भेजें"},{"en":"Ask a trusted adult before opening","hi":"खोलने से पहले विश्वसनीय बड़े से पूछें"},{"en":"Send personal photos","hi":"निजी फोटो भेजें"},{"en":"Open it at once","hi":"तुरंत खोलें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"You need to wash hands before lunch. What do you use?","hi":"भोजन से पहले हाथ धोने के लिए क्या उपयोग करें?","ans":"Soap and clean water","ans_hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी",