umber","hi":"प्लंबर"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What should stay secret on a device?","hi":"डिवाइस पर क्या गोपनीय रखना चाहिए?","ans":"Password","ans_hi":"पासवर्ड","options":[{"en":"Tell a teacher","hi":"शिक्षक को बताएँ"},{"en":"Stop","hi":"रुकना"},{"en":"Close the tap","hi":"नल बंद करना"},{"en":"Password","hi":"पासवर्ड"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 23 trees on Monday and 5 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 23 और मंगलवार को 5 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"29","hi":"29"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 24 paper sheets and reused 5. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 24 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 5 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"19","ans_hi":"19","options":[{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 7 rows with 4 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 7 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 4 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"29","hi":"29"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"12 reusable bottles are shared equally among 2 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"12 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 2 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 20 birds on a tree. 7 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 20 पक्षी थे, 7 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"13","ans_hi":"13","options":[{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 4 pages each day for 2 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 2 दिन तक रोज़ 4 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 5 litres of water a day for 3 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 3 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 5 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"15","ans_hi":"15","options":[{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 11 pencils, and 6 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 11 पेंसिल में 6 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 13 recyclable items in the morning and 6 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 13 और शाम 6 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"19","ans_hi":"19","options":[{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 17 seedlings. 4 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 17 पौध थे, 4 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"21","ans_hi":"21","options":[{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"Your friend falls while playing. What is the kind first step?","hi":"खेलते समय मित्र गिर जाए तो पहला अच्छा कदम क्या है?","ans":"Call a teacher and help","ans_hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें","options":[{"en":"Call a teacher and help","hi":"शिक्षक को बुलाएँ और सहायता करें"},{"en":"Push the friend again","hi":"फिर धक्का दें"},{"en":"Laugh at the friend","hi":"मित्र पर हँसें"},{"en":"Run away without telling","hi":"बिना बताए भाग जाएँ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Which action protects a garden sapling?","hi":"बगीचे के छोटे पौधे को किससे बचाया जा सकता है?","ans":"Avoid stepping on it","ans_hi":"उस पर पैर न रखें","options":[{"en":"Break its stem","hi":"तना तोड़ें"},{"en":"Pull its leaves","hi":"पत्तियाँ नोचें"},{"en":"Cover it with litter","hi":"उस पर कूड़ा डालें"},{"en":"Avoid stepping on it","hi":"उस पर पैर न रखें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The pedestrian light shows red. What should you do?","hi":"पैदल यात्री का सिग्नल लाल हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें","options":[{"en":"Run onto the road","hi":"सड़क पर दौड़ पड़ें"},{"en":"Wait for the safe crossing signal","hi":"सुरक्षित सिग्नल की प्रतीक्षा करें"},{"en":"Ignore road markings","hi":"चिह्न अनदेखे करें"},{"en":"Close your eyes and cross","hi":"आँख बंद कर पार करें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A classmate is sad. Which response shows kindness?","hi":"सहपाठी उदास हो तो कौन-सा व्यवहार अच्छा है?","ans":"Listen kindly and offer help","ans_hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें","options":[{"en":"Call them names","hi":"बुरे नाम से बुलाएँ"},{"en":"Ignore them always","hi":"हमेशा अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Listen kindly and offer help","hi":"प्यार से सुनें और मदद करें"},{"en":"Spread rumours","hi":"अफवाह फैलाएँ"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Which action keeps the classroom clean?","hi":"कक्षा को साफ रखने के लिए क्या करें?","ans":"Use the dustbin","ans_hi":"कूड़ादान प्रयोग करें","options":[{"en":"Scatter papers","hi":"कागज़ बिखेरें"},{"en":"Use the dustbin","hi":"कूड़ादान प्रयोग करें"},{"en":"Drop wrappers on floor","hi":"रैपर नीचे फेंकें"},{"en":"Mark desks with pen","hi":"मेज़ पर लिखें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"You need to wash hands before lunch. What do you use?","hi":"भोजन से पहले हाथ धोने के लिए क्या उपयोग करें?","ans":"Soap and clean water","ans_hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी","options":[{"en":"Only coloured paint","hi":"केवल रंग"},{"en":"Soap and clean water","hi":"साबुन और स्वच्छ पानी"},{"en":"A dirty cloth","hi":"गंदा कपड़ा"},{"en":"Only dry soil","hi":"केवल सूखी मिट्टी"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A tap is left running after use. What is the best action?","hi":"उपयोग के बाद नल खुला रह गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Turn it off safely","ans_hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें","options":[{"en":"Turn it off safely","hi":"सुरक्षित रूप से नल बंद करें"},{"en":"Leave it running","hi":"चलने दें"},{"en":"Break the tap","hi":"नल तोड़ दें"},{"en":"Waste more water","hi":"और पानी बहाएँ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"An unknown player asks for your home address. What should you do?","hi":"ऑनलाइन अनजान खिलाड़ी घर का पता माँगे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","ans_hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Do not share; tell a trusted adult","hi":"पता न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Give your school password too","hi":"स्कूल का पासवर्ड भी दें"},{"en":"Post the address publicly","hi":"पता सबको दिखाएँ"},{"en":"Send it in chat","hi":"चैट में भेज दें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-2-4-09"},"2|3|10|GK":{"grade":"2","term":3,"year":10,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"60 minutes / 60 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"Which planet is also called our home planet?","hi":"किस ग्रह को हमारा गृह ग्रह कहते हैं?","ans":"Earth","ans_hi":"पृथ्वी","options":[{"en":"Jupiter","hi":"बृहस्पति"},{"en":"Earth","hi":"पृथ्वी"},{"en":"Neptune","hi":"वरुण"},{"en":"Uranus","hi":"अरुण"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"planets"},{"en":"What is the shape of Earth roughly?","hi":"पृथ्वी का आकार लगभग कैसा है?","ans":"Spherical","ans_hi":"गोलाकार","options":[{"en":"Flat rectangle","hi":"चपटा आयत"},{"en":"Perfect cube","hi":"पूरा घन"},{"en":"Spherical","hi":"गोलाकार"},{"en":"Flat triangle","hi":"चपटा त्रिभुज"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"Which direction is opposite to north?","hi":"उत्तर दिशा के विपरीत कौन-सी दिशा है?","ans":"South","ans_hi":"दक्षिण","options":[{"en":"West","hi":"पश्चिम"},{"en":"East","hi":"पूर्व"},{"en":"South","hi":"दक्षिण"},{"en":"South-West","hi":"दक्षिण-पश्चिम"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"directions"},{"en":"What is water called when it is very hot and becomes gas?","hi":"गर्म होकर गैस के रूप में पानी क्या कहलाता है?","ans":"Water vapour","ans_hi":"जलवाष्प","options":[{"en":"Ice crystals","hi":"बर्फ के क्रिस्टल"},{"en":"Liquid water","hi":"द्रव जल"},{"en":"Water vapour","hi":"जलवाष्प"},{"en":"Rain droplets","hi":"वर्षा बूँदें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What is a young butterfly called before becoming a pupa?","hi":"तितली के प्यूपा बनने से पहले लार्वा को क्