able living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 16 birds on a tree. 8 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 16 पक्षी थे, 8 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 8 pages each day for 4 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 4 दिन तक रोज़ 8 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"32","ans_hi":"32","options":[{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"},{"en":"31","hi":"31"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 6 litres of water a day for 5 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 5 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 6 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"30","ans_hi":"30","options":[{"en":"60","hi":"60"},{"en":"29","hi":"29"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 24 pencils, and 5 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 24 पेंसिल में 5 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"19","ans_hi":"19","options":[{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 13 recyclable items in the morning and 5 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 13 और शाम 5 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"18","ans_hi":"18","options":[{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"25","hi":"25"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 23 seedlings. 2 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 23 पौध थे, 2 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"25","ans_hi":"25","options":[{"en"