 modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 40 trees on Monday and 4 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 40 और मंगलवार को 4 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"44","ans_hi":"44","options":[{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"45","hi":"45"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"44","hi":"44"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 31 paper sheets and reused 6. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 31 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 6 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"25","ans_hi":"25","options":[{"en":"25","hi":"25"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"33","hi":"33"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 7 rows with 3 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 7 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 3 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"21","ans_hi":"21","options":[{"en":"23","hi":"23"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"27 reusable bottles are shared equally among 3 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"27 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 3 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 25 birds on a tree. 10 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 25 पक्षी थे, 10 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"15","ans_hi":"15","options":[{"en":"25","hi":"25"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 10 pages each day for 7 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 7 दिन तक रोज़ 10 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"70","ans_hi":"70","options":[{"en":"71","hi":"71"},{"en":"70","hi":"70"},{"en":"68","hi":"68"},{"en":"60","hi":"60"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 6 litres of water a day for 8 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 8 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 6 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"48","ans_hi":"48","options":[{"en":"96","hi":"96"},{"en":"58","hi":"58"},{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"50","hi":"50"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 40 pencils, and 4 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 40 पेंसिल में 4 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"36","ans_hi":"36","options":[{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"72","hi":"72"},{"en":"37","hi":"37"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 32 recyclable items in the morning and 15 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 32 और शाम 15 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"47","ans_hi":"47","options":[{"en":"47","hi":"47"},{"en":"46","hi":"46"},{"en":"45","hi":"45"},{"en":"62","hi":"62"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 28 seedlings. 12 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 28 पौध थे, 12 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"40","ans_hi":"40","options":[{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"54","hi":"54"},{"en":"80","hi":"80"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The science club wants to save energy. What should it do?","hi":"विज्ञान क्लब ऊर्जा बचाना चाहता है। क्या करे?","ans":"Switch off unused electrical devices","ans_hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे","options":[{"en":"Run fans in empty rooms","hi":"खाली कमरों में पंखे चलाए"},{"en":"Waste batteries","hi":"बैटरियाँ फेंके"},{"en":"Keep lights on all day","hi":"दिनभर लाइट जलाए"},{"en":"Switch off unused electrical devices","hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A confusing chart has no data source. What should you do?","hi":"अस्पष्ट चार्ट पर आँकड़ों का स्रोत न हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask where the data came from","ans_hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए","options":[{"en":"Change its numbers","hi":"आँकड़े बदल दें"},{"en":"Accept it without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे मानें"},{"en":"Hide the chart","hi":"चार्ट छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Ask where the data came from","hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"How should students check an unusual online fact?","hi":"अजीब ऑनलाइन तथ्य की जाँच कैसे करें?","ans":"Compare reliable sources","ans_hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोतों की तुलना करें","options":[{"en":"Believe the first website","hi":"पहली वेबसाइट पर भरोसा करें"},{"en":"Compare reliable sources","hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोतों की तुलना करें"},{"en":"Ignore dates and authors","hi":"तारीख और लेखक अनदेखे करें"},{"en":"Use only rumours","hi":"केवल अफवाह सुनें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Which choice reduces plastic waste on a picnic?","hi":"पिकनिक में प्लास्टिक कचरा कैसे घटेगा?","ans":"Carry a reusable water bottle","ans_hi":"दोबारा भरी जा सकने वाली बोतल रखें","options":[{"en":"Use many single-use cups","hi":"कई डिस्पोज़ेबल कप लें"},{"en":"Buy extra plastic bags","hi":"अधिक प्लास्टिक थैलियाँ लें"},{"en":"Throw wrappers in nature","hi":"रैपर प्रकृति में फेंकें"},{"en":"Carry a reusable water bottle","hi":"दोबारा भरी जा सकने वाली बोतल रखें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Students notice an injured bird. What is safe?","hi":"विद्यार्थियों को घायल पक्षी दिखे। सुरक्षित कदम क्या है?","ans":