Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which device measures rainfall?","hi":"वर्षा की मात्रा कौन-सा यंत्र मापता है?","ans":"Rain gauge","ans_hi":"वर्षामापी","options":[{"en":"Sunlight","hi":"सूर्यप्रकाश"},{"en":"Freezing","hi":"जमना"},{"en":"Evaporation","hi":"वाष्पीकरण"},{"en":"Rain gauge","hi":"वर्षामापी"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 37 trees on Monday and 13 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 37 और मंगलवार को 13 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"50","ans_hi":"50","options":[{"en":"50","hi":"50"},{"en":"63","hi":"63"},{"en":"65","hi":"65"},{"en":"51","hi":"51"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 23 paper sheets and reused 11. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 23 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 11 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"25","hi":"25"},{"en":"23","hi":"23"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 7 rows with 6 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 7 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 6 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"42","ans_hi":"42","options":[{"en":"41","hi":"41"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"50","hi":"50"},{"en":"44","hi":"44"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"44 reusable bottles are shared equally among 4 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"44 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 4 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"11","ans_hi":"11","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 40 birds on a tree. 11 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 40 पक्षी थे, 11 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"29","ans_hi":"29","options":[{"en":"58","hi":"58"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"29","hi":"29"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 9 pages each day for 7 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 7 दिन तक रोज़ 9 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"63","ans_hi":"63","options":[{"en":"63","hi":"63"},{"en":"65","hi":"65"},{"en":"64","hi":"64"},{"en":"61","hi":"61"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 12 litres of water a day for 3 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 3 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 12 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"36","ans_hi":"36","options":[{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"37","hi":"37"},{"en":"38","hi":"38"},{"en":"39","hi":"39"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 52 pencils, and 9 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 52 पेंसिल में 9 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"43","ans_hi":"43","options":[{"en":"44","hi":"44"},{"en":"43","hi":"43"},{"en":"45","hi":"45"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 37 recyclable items in the morning and 12 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 37 और शाम 12 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"49","ans_hi":"49","options":[{"en":"50","hi":"50"},{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"49","hi":"49"},{"en":"63","hi":"63"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 30 seedlings. 16 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 30 पौध थे, 16 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"46","ans_hi":"46","options":[{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"45","hi":"45"},{"en":"47","hi":"47"},{"en":"46","hi":"46"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student shares a photo of another child without permission. What is better?","hi":"बिना अनुमति दूसरे बच्चे का फोटो साझा हुआ। क्या उचित है?","ans":"Ask permission before sharing","ans_hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें","options":[{"en":"Ask permission before sharing","hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें"},{"en":"Add personal details","hi":"निजी जानकारी जोड़ें"},{"en":"Ignore privacy","hi":"गोपनीयता अनदेखी करें"},{"en":"Share more photos","hi":"और फोटो भेजें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The school garden soil dries quickly. Which practice helps?","hi":"विद्यालय बगीचे की मिट्टी जल्दी सूखती है। क्या मदद करता है?","ans":"Water carefully near plant roots","ans_hi":"पौधों की जड़ों के पास सावधानी से पानी दें","options":[{"en":"Remove all soil","hi":"पूरी मिट्टी हटा दें"},{"en":"Waste water on paths","hi":"पगडंडी पर पानी बहाएँ"},{"en":"Water carefully near plant roots","hi":"पौधों की जड़ों के पास सावधानी से पानी दें"},{"en":"Break the plants","hi":"पौधे तोड़ें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A confusing chart has no data source. What should you do?","hi":"अस्पष्ट चार्ट पर आँकड़ों का स्रोत न हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask where the data came from","ans_hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए","options":[{"en":"Hide the chart","hi":"चार्ट छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Change its numbers","hi":"आँकड़े बदल दें"},{"en":"Accept it without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे मानें"},{"en":"Ask where the data came from","hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A viral message says school is closed, but no notice is issued. What should you do?","hi":"वायरल संदेश कहे स्कूल बंद है, पर सूचना न हो, तो क्या करें?","ans":"Check the official school notice","ans_hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें","options":[{"en":"Delete official updates","hi":"आधिकारिक सूचना हटाएँ"},{"en":"Send it to everyone","hi":"सबको भेजें"},{"en":"Check the official school notice","hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें"},{"en":"Assume it is true","hi":"उसे सच मान लें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A friend is left out of a group task. What should you do?","hi":"किसी मित्र को समूह कार्य से बाहर रखा गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Invite them to participate","ans_hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ","options":[{"en":"Invite them to participate","hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ"},{"en":"Hide the task","hi":"कार्य छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Make fun of them","hi":"मज़ाक उड़ाएँ"},{"en":"Refuse to listen","hi":"बात न सुनें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-3-1-03"},"3|0|4|GK":{"grade":"3","term":0,"year":4,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"Which nutrient helps build and repair body tissues?","hi":"शरीर के ऊतकों को बनाने और सुधारने में कौन-सा पोषक तत्त्व मदद करता है?","ans":"Protein","ans_hi":"प्रोटीन","options":[{"en":"Protein","hi":"प्रोटीन"},{"en":"Fat","hi":"वसा"},{"en":"Carbohydrates","hi":"कार्बोहाइड्रेट"},{"en":"Vitamin D","hi":"विटामिन डी"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"food"},{"en":"Which mineral is important for strong bones and teeth?","hi":"मजबूत हड्डियों और दाँतों के लिए कौन-सा खनिज आवश्यक है?","ans":"Calcium","ans_hi":"कैल्शियम","options":[{"en":"Vitamin C","hi":"विटामिन सी"},{"en":"Fat","hi":"वसा"},{"en":"Calcium","hi":"कैल्शियम"},{"en":"Fibre","hi":"रेशा"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"food"},{"en":"What is the process of changing water to water vapour called?","hi":"पानी के जलवाष्प बनने की प्रक्रिया क्या कहलाती है?","ans":"Evaporation","ans_hi":"वाष्पीकरण","options":[{"en":"Melting","hi":"गलन"},{"en":"Digestion","hi":"पाचन"},{"en":"Fermentation","hi":"किण्वन"},{"en":"Evaporation","hi":"वाष्पीकरण"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"processes"},{"en":"What is the opposite process of evaporation called?","hi":"जलवाष्प के द्रव पानी में बदलने की प्रक्रिया क्या कहलाती है?","ans":"Condensation","ans_hi":"संघनन","options":[{"en":"Melting","hi":"गलन"},{"en":"Condensation","hi":"संघनन"},{"en":"Germination","hi":"अंकुरण"},{"en":"Digestion","hi":"पाचन"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"processes"},{"en":"What do we call substances needed by the body from food?","hi":"खाद्य पदार्थों से शरीर को मिलने वाले आवश्यक तत्त्व क्या कहलाते हैं?","ans":"Nutrients","ans_hi":"पोषक तत्त्व","options":[{"en":"Waste substances","hi":"अपशिष्ट पदार्थ"},{"en":"Nutrients","hi":"पोषक तत्त्व"},{"en":"Dust","hi":"धूल"},{"en":"Germs","hi":"कीटाणु"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"Which organ pumps blood through the body?","hi":"शरीर में रक्त पंप करने वाला अंग कौन-सा है?","ans":"Heart","ans_hi":"हृदय","options":[{"en":"Skull","hi":"खोपड़ी"},{"en":"Heart","hi":"हृदय"},{"en":"Brain","hi":"मस्तिष्क"},{"en":"Pancreas","hi":"अग्न्याशय"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"Which organs help us breathe?","hi":"साँस लेने में कौन-से अंग मदद करते हैं?","ans":"Lungs","ans_hi":"फेफड़े","options":[{"en":"Kidneys","hi":"गुर्दे"},{"en":"Lungs","hi":"फेफड़े"},{"en":"Brain","hi":"मस्तिष्क"},{"en":"Liver","hi":"यकृत"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"Which organ controls thinking and body movements?","hi":"सोच और शारीरिक गतिविधियों को नियंत्रित कौन-सा अंग करता है?","ans":"Brain","ans_hi":"मस्तिष्क","options":[{"en":"Brain","hi":"मस्तिष्क"},{"en":"Gallbladder","hi":"पित्ताशय"},{"en":"Hear