 क्या उचित है?","ans":"Ask permission before sharing","ans_hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें","options":[{"en":"Ask permission before sharing","hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें"},{"en":"Share more photos","hi":"और फोटो भेजें"},{"en":"Add personal details","hi":"निजी जानकारी जोड़ें"},{"en":"Ignore privacy","hi":"गोपनीयता अनदेखी करें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The science club wants to save energy. What should it do?","hi":"विज्ञान क्लब ऊर्जा बचाना चाहता है। क्या करे?","ans":"Switch off unused electrical devices","ans_hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे","options":[{"en":"Switch off unused electrical devices","hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे"},{"en":"Waste batteries","hi":"बैटरियाँ फेंके"},{"en":"Run fans in empty rooms","hi":"खाली कमरों में पंखे चलाए"},{"en":"Keep lights on all day","hi":"दिनभर लाइट जलाए"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-3-1-04"},"3|0|5|GK":{"grade":"3","term":0,"year":5,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"Which nutrient helps build and repair body tissues?","hi":"शरीर के ऊतकों को बनाने और सुधारने में कौन-सा पोषक तत्त्व मदद करता है?","ans":"Protein","ans_hi":"प्रोटीन","options":[{"en":"Fat","hi":"वसा"},{"en":"Protein","hi":"प्रोटीन"},{"en":"Vitamin D","hi":"विटामिन डी"},{"en":"Fibre","hi":"रेशा"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"food"},{"en":"Which mineral is important for strong bones and teeth?","hi":"मजबूत हड्डियों और दाँतों के लिए कौन-सा खनिज आवश्यक है?","ans":"Calcium","ans_hi":"कैल्शियम","options":[{"en":"Vitamin C","hi":"विटामिन सी"},{"en":"Calcium","hi":"कैल्शियम"},{"en":"Carbohydrates","hi":"कार्बोहाइड्रेट"},{"en":"Protein","hi":"प्रोटीन"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"food"},{"en":"What is the process of changing water to water vapour called?","hi":"पानी के जलवाष्प बनने की प्रक्रिया क्या कहलाती है?","ans":"Evaporation","ans_hi":"वाष्पीकरण","options":[{"en":"Evaporation","hi":"वाष्पीकरण"},{"en":"Freezing","hi":"जमना"},{"en":"Pollination","hi":"परागण"},{"en":"Transpiration","hi":"वाष्पोत्सर्जन"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"processes"},{"en":"What is the opposite process of evaporation called?","hi":"जलवाष्प के द्रव पानी में बदलने की प्रक्रिया क्या कहलाती है?","ans":"Condensation","ans_hi":"संघनन","options":[{"en":"Germination","hi":"अंकुरण"},{"en":"Pollination","hi":"परागण"},{"en":"Fermentation","hi":"किण्वन"},{"en":"Condensation","hi":"संघनन"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"processes"},{"en":"What do we call substances needed by the body from food?","hi":"खाद्य पदार्थों से शरीर को मिलने वाले आवश्यक तत्त्व क्या कहलाते हैं?","ans":"Nutrients","ans_hi":"पोषक तत्त्व","options":[{"en":"Nutrients","hi":"पोषक तत्त्व"},{"en":"Dust","hi":"धूल"},{"en":"Germs","hi":"कीटाणु"},{"en":"Waste substances","hi":"अपशिष्ट पदार्थ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"Which organ pumps blood through the body?","hi":"शरीर में रक्त पंप करने वाला अंग कौन-सा है?","ans":"Heart","ans_hi":"हृदय","options":[{"en":"Pancreas","hi":"अग्न्याशय"},{"en":"Heart","hi":"हृदय"},{"en":"Gallbladder","hi":"पित्ताशय"},{"en":"Stomach","hi":"आमाशय"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"Which organs help us breathe?","hi":"साँस लेने में कौन-से अंग मदद करते हैं?","ans":"Lungs","ans_hi":"फेफड़े","options":[{"en":"Liver","hi":"यकृत"},{"en":"Gallbladder","hi":"पित्ताशय"},{"en":"Heart","hi":"हृदय"},{"en":"Lungs","hi":"फेफड़े"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"Which organ controls thinking and body movements?","hi":"सोच और शारीरिक गतिविधियों को नियंत्रित कौन-सा अंग करता है?","ans":"Brain","ans_hi":"मस्तिष्क","options":[{"en":"Stomach","hi":"आमाशय"},{"en":"Kidneys","hi":"गुर्दे"},{"en":"Liver","hi":"यकृत"},{"en":"Brain","hi":"मस्तिष्क"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"What is the hardest substance in the human body?","hi":"मानव शरीर का सबसे कठोर पदार्थ कौन-सा है?","ans":"Tooth enamel","ans_hi":"दाँतों का इनेमल","options":[{"en":"Skin","hi":"त्वचा"},{"en":"Tooth enamel","hi":"दाँतों का इनेमल"},{"en":"Cartilage","hi":"उपास्थि"},{"en":"Hair","hi":"बाल"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"Which sense organ is linked to taste?","hi":"स्वाद का अनुभव किस इंद्रिय से होता है?","ans":"Tongue","ans_hi":"जीभ","options":[{"en":"Tongue","hi":"जीभ"},{"en":"Lungs","hi":"फेफड़े"},{"en":"Kidneys","hi":"गुर्दे"},{"en":"Skin","hi":"त्वचा"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"body"},{"en":"Which vitamin is made in the skin with adequate sunlight?","hi":"पर्याप्त धूप मिलने पर त्वचा में कौन-सा विटामिन बनता है?","ans":"Vitamin D","ans_hi":"विटामिन डी","options":[{"en":"Iron","hi":"आयरन"},{"en":"Carbohydrates","hi":"कार्बोहाइड्रेट"},{"en":"Vitamin C","hi":"विटामिन सी"},{"en":"Vitamin D","hi":"विटामिन डी"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"food"},{"en":"What do we call the change from solid ice to liquid water?","hi":"ठोस बर्फ से द्रव पानी बनने को क्या कहते हैं?","ans":"Melting","ans_hi":"पिघलना","options":[{"en":"Melting","hi":"पिघलना"},{"en":"Germination","hi":"अंकुरण"},{"en":"Diffusion","hi":"विसरण"},{"en":"Transpiration","hi":"वाष्पोत्सर्जन"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"processes"},{"en":"What is the main function of the skeleton?","hi":"कंकाल का मुख्य काम क्या है?","ans":"Support and protect the body","ans_hi":"शरीर को सहारा और सुरक्षा देना","options":[{"en":"Pump blood","hi":"रक्त पंप करना"},{"en":"Make food by photosynthesis","hi":"प्रकाश-संश्लेषण से भोजन बनाना"},{"en":"Support and protect the body","hi":"शरीर को सहारा और सुरक्षा देना"},{"en":"Digest starch","hi":"स्टार्च पचाना"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"Which type of food is rich in fibre?","hi":"किस प्रकार के भोजन में रेशा अधिक होता है?","ans":"Fruits and vegetables","ans_hi":"फल एवं सब्जियाँ","options":[{"en":"Iron","hi":"आयरन"},{"en":"Carbohydrates","hi":"कार्बोहाइड्रेट"},{"en":"Fibre","hi":"रेशा"},{"en":"Fruits and vegetables","hi":"फल एवं सब्जियाँ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"food"},{"en":"What should we do if we discover a small fire?","hi":"छोटी आग दिखने पर बच्चों को क्या करना चाहिए?","ans":"Alert an adult","ans_hi":"किसी बड़े को तुरंत बताना","options":[{"en":"Alert an adult","hi":"किसी बड़े को तुरंत बताना"},{"en":"Throw random chemicals","hi":"कोई भी रसायन फेंकना"},{"en":"Ignore the flames","hi":"लपटों को अनदेखा करना"},{"en":"Hide the fire","hi":"आग छिपाना"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What is a balanced diet?","hi":"संतुलित आहार क्या है?","ans":"Food with nutrients in suitable proportions","ans_hi":"उचित अनुपात में पोषक तत्त्व देने वाला आहार","options":[{"en":"Only fats","hi":"केवल वसा"},{"en":"Only sugary snacks","hi":"केवल मीठे स्नैक्स"},{"en":"Only one type of food","hi":"केवल एक तरह का भोजन"},{"en":"Food with nutrients in suitable proportions","hi":"उचित अनुपात में पोषक तत्त्व देने वाला आहार"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"How many hours are in two days?","hi":"दो दिनों में कितने घंटे होते हैं?","ans":"48","ans_hi":"48","options":[{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"Three","hi":"तीन"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"quantities"},{"en":"What organ helps break down food using acid?","hi":"अम्ल की सहायता से भोजन का पाचन कौन-सा अंग करता है?","ans":"Stomach","ans_hi":"आमाशय","options":[{"en":"Small intestine","hi":"छोटी आँत"},{"en":"Stomach","hi":"आमाशय"},{"en":"Heart","hi":"हृदय"},{"en":"Pancreas","hi":"अग्न्याशय"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"Which vitamin in citrus fruits helps prevent scurvy?","hi":"खट्टे फलों में कौन-सा विटामिन स्कर्वी से बचाव में मदद करता है?","ans":"Vitamin C","ans_hi":"विटामिन C","options":[{"en":"Vitamin C","hi":"विटामिन C"},{"en":"Fat","hi":"वसा"},{"en":"Iron","hi":"आयरन"},{"en":"Protein","hi":"प्रोटीन"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"food"},{"en":"Which part of a tooth is visible above the gum?","hi":"मसूड़े के ऊपर दिखने वाला दाँत का भाग क्या कहलाता है?","ans":"Crown","ans_hi":"मुकुट","options":[{"en":"Heart","hi":"हृदय"},{"en":"Teeth","hi":"दाँत"},{"en":"Kidneys","hi":"गुर्दे"},{"en":"Crown","hi":"मुकुट"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"body"},{"en":"What reduces plastic waste during shopping?","hi":"खरीदारी में प्लास्टिक कचरा किससे घटता है?","ans":"Reusable bag","ans_hi":"दोबारा उपयोग होने वाला थैला","options":[{"en":"Source","hi":"स्रोत"},{"en":"Paper","hi":"कागज़"},{"en":"Reusable bag","hi":"दोबारा उपयोग होने वाला थैला"},{"en":"Misinformation","hi":"भ्रामक सूचना"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What do we call false online information?","hi":"ऑनलाइन गलत सूचना क्या कहलाती है?","ans":"Misinformation","ans_hi":"भ्रामक सूचना","options":[{"en":"Misinformation","hi":"भ्रामक सूचना"},{"en":"Trusted adult","hi":"विश्वसनीय वयस्क"},{"en":"Paper","hi":"कागज़"},{"en":"Reusable bag","hi":"दोबारा उपयोग होने वाला थैला"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्त