les are shared equally among 8 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"72 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 8 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 53 birds on a tree. 7 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 53 पक्षी थे, 7 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"46","ans_hi":"46","options":[{"en":"46","hi":"46"},{"en":"53","hi":"53"},{"en":"92","hi":"92"},{"en":"48","hi":"48"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 7 pages each day for 6 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 6 दिन तक रोज़ 7 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"42","ans_hi":"42","options":[{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"50","hi":"50"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 5 litres of water a day for 4 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 4 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 5 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"20","ans_hi":"20","options":[{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 27 pencils, and 12 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 27 पेंसिल में 12 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"15","ans_hi":"15","options":[{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 45 recyclable items in the morning and 16 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 45 और शाम 16 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"61","ans_hi":"61","options":[{"en":"62","hi":"62"},{"en":"63","hi":"63"},{"en":"61","hi":"61"},{"en":"77","hi":"77"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 20 seedlings. 7 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 20 पौध थे, 7 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"27","ans_hi":"27","options":[{"en":"34","hi":"34"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"29","hi":"29"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"Which choice reduces plastic waste on a picnic?","hi":"पिकनिक में प्लास्टिक कचरा कैसे घटेगा?","ans":"Carry a reusable water bottle","ans_hi":"दोबारा भरी जा सकने वाली बोतल रखें","options":[{"en":"Buy extra plastic bags","hi":"अधिक प्लास्टिक थैलियाँ लें"},{"en":"Throw wrappers in nature","hi":"रैपर प्रकृति में फेंकें"},{"en":"Carry a reusable water bottle","hi":"दोबारा भरी जा सकने वाली बोतल रखें"},{"en":"Use many single-use cups","hi":"कई डिस्पोज़ेबल कप लें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A viral message says school is closed, but no notice is issued. What should you do?","hi":"वायरल संदेश कहे स्कूल बंद है, पर सूचना न हो, तो क्या करें?","ans":"Check the official school notice","ans_hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें","options":[{"en":"Check the official school notice","hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें"},{"en":"Send it to everyone","hi":"सबको भेजें"},{"en":"Assume it is true","hi":"उसे सच मान लें"},{"en":"Delete official updates","hi":"आधिकारिक सूचना हटाएँ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The school garden soil dries quickly. Which practice helps?","hi":"विद्यालय बगीचे की मिट्टी जल्दी सूखती है। क्या मदद करता है?","ans":"Water carefully near plant roots","ans_hi":"पौधों की जड़ों के पास सावधानी से पानी दें","options":[{"en":"Break the plants","hi":"पौधे तोड़ें"},{"en":"Waste water on paths","hi":"पगडंडी पर पानी बहाएँ"