rade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which direction is opposite to East?","hi":"पूर्व के विपरीत कौन-सी दिशा है?","ans":"West","ans_hi":"पश्चिम","options":[{"en":"West","hi":"पश्चिम"},{"en":"North-West","hi":"उत्तर-पश्चिम"},{"en":"North-East","hi":"उत्तर-पूर्व"},{"en":"South-West","hi":"दक्षिण-पश्चिम"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What removes germs during handwashing?","hi":"हाथ धोते समय कीटाणु हटाने में क्या मदद करता है?","ans":"Soap","ans_hi":"साबुन","options":[{"en":"Trusted adult","hi":"विश्वसनीय वयस्क"},{"en":"Strong password","hi":"मजबूत पासवर्ड"},{"en":"Helmet","hi":"हेलमेट"},{"en":"Soap","hi":"साबुन"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which process turns vapour into drops?","hi":"वाष्प से बूँदें बनने की प्रक्रिया क्या है?","ans":"Condensation","ans_hi":"संघनन","options":[{"en":"Freezing","hi":"जमना"},{"en":"Condensation","hi":"संघनन"},{"en":"Thunderstorm","hi":"गरज-चमक वाला तूफान"},{"en":"Rain gauge","hi":"वर्षामापी"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 31 trees on Monday and 9 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 31 और मंगलवार को 9 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"40","ans_hi":"40","options":[{"en":"80","hi":"80"},{"en":"41","hi":"41"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 27 paper sheets and reused 15. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 27 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 15 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 11 rows with 8 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 11 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 8 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"88","ans_hi":"88","options":[{"en":"176","hi":"176"},{"en":"86","hi":"86"},{"en":"89","hi":"89"},{"en":"88","hi":"88"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"96 reusable bottles are shared equally among 8 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"96 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 8 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 46 birds on a tree. 12 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 46 पक्षी थे, 12 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"34","ans_hi":"34","options":[{"en":"46","hi":"46"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"},{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"35","hi":"35"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 10 pages each day for 8 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 8 दिन तक रोज़ 10 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"80","ans_hi":"80","options":[{"en":"70","hi":"70"},{"en":"82","hi":"82"},{"en":"80","hi":"80"},{"en":"160","hi":"160"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 12 litres of water a day for 5 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 5 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 12 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"60","ans_hi":"60","options":[{"en":"60","hi":"60"},{"en":"62","hi":"62"},{"en":"120","hi":"120"},{"en":"67","hi":"67"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 55 pencils, and 14 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 55 पेंसिल में 14 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"41","ans_hi":"41","options":[{"en":"41","hi":"41"},{"en":"43","hi":"43"},{"en":"55","hi":"55"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 28 recyclable items in the morning and 16 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 28 और शाम 16 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"44","ans_hi":"44","options":[{"en":"46","hi":"46"},{"en":"62","hi":"62"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"44","hi":"44"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 49 seedlings. 14 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 49 पौध थे, 14 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"63","ans_hi":"63","options":[{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"61","hi":"61"},{"en":"64","hi":"64"},{"en":"63","hi":"63"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student shares a photo of another child without permission. What is better?","hi":"बिना अनुमति दूसरे बच्चे का फोटो साझा हुआ। क्या उचित है?","ans":"Ask permission before sharing","ans_hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें","options":[{"en":"Share more photos","hi":"और फोटो भेजें"},{"en":"Add personal details","hi":"निजी जानकारी जोड़ें"},{"en":"Ignore privacy","hi":"गोपनीयता अनदेखी करें"},{"en":"Ask permission before sharing","hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The school garden soil dries quickly. Which practice helps?","hi":"विद्यालय बगीचे की मिट्टी जल्दी सूखती है। क्या मदद करता है?","ans":"Water carefully near plant roots","ans_hi":"पौधों की जड़ों के पास सावधानी से पानी दें","options":[{"en":"Water carefully near plant roots","hi":"पौधों की जड़ों के पास सावधानी से पानी दें"},{"en":"Remove all soil","hi":"पूरी मिट्टी हटा दें"},{"en":"Waste water on paths","hi":"पगडंडी पर पानी बहाएँ"},{"en":"Break the plants","hi":"पौधे तोड़ें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A child gets a message that asks for bank details. What is right?","hi":"बैंक जानकारी माँगने वाला संदेश आए तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","ans_hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Take a stranger's advice","hi":"अजनबी की सलाह लें"},{"en":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Share a password","hi":"पासवर्ड दें"},{"en":"Reply with details","hi":"जानकारी भेजें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The science club wants to save energy. What should it do?","hi":"विज्ञान क्लब ऊर्जा बचाना चाहता है। क्या करे?","ans":"Switch off unused electrical devices","ans_hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे","options":[{"en":"Switch off unused electrical devices","hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे"},{"en":"Keep lights on all day","hi":"दिनभर लाइट जलाए"},{"en":"Waste batteries","hi":"बैटरियाँ फेंके"},{"en":"Run fans in empty rooms","hi":"खाली कमरों में पंखे चलाए"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A confusing chart has no data source. What should you do?","hi":"अस्पष्ट चार्ट पर आँकड़ों का स्रोत न हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask where the data came from","ans_hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए","options":[{"en":"Hide the chart","hi":"चार्ट छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Change its numbers","hi":"आँकड़े बदल दें"},{"en":"Accept it without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे मानें"},{"en":"Ask where the data came from","hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-3-1-06"},"3|0|7|GK":{"grade":"3","term":0,"year":7,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"Which nutrient helps build and repair body tissues?","hi":"शरीर के ऊतकों को बनाने और सुधारने में कौन-सा प