 / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 10 litres of water a day for 5 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 5 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 10 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"50","ans_hi":"50","options":[{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"51","hi":"51"},{"en":"100","hi":"100"},{"en":"50","hi":"50"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 52 pencils, and 13 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 52 पेंसिल में 13 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"39","ans_hi":"39","options":[{"en":"38","hi":"38"},{"en":"37","hi":"37"},{"en":"39","hi":"39"},{"en":"41","hi":"41"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 22 recyclable items in the morning and 10 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 22 और शाम 10 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"32","ans_hi":"32","options":[{"en":"32","hi":"32"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"},{"en":"31","hi":"31"},{"en":"64","hi":"64"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 50 seedlings. 12 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 50 पौध थे, 12 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"62","ans_hi":"62","options":[{"en":"74","hi":"74"},{"en":"124","hi":"124"},{"en":"62","hi":"62"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"How should students check an unusual online fact?","hi":"अजीब ऑनलाइन तथ्य की जाँच कैसे करें?","ans":"Compare reliable sources","ans_hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोतों की तुलना करें","options":[{"en":"Use only rumours","hi":"केवल अफवाह सुनें"},{"en":"Ignore dates and authors","hi":"तारीख और लेखक अनदेखे करें"},{"en":"Believe the first website","hi":"पहली वेबसाइट पर भरोसा करें"},{"en":"Compare reliable sources","hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोतों की तुलना करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions 