 reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 8 litres of water a day for 4 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 4 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 8 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"32","ans_hi":"32","options":[{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"64","hi":"64"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 51 pencils, and 13 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 51 पेंसिल में 13 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"38","ans_hi":"38","options":[{"en":"39","hi":"39"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"51","hi":"51"},{"en":"38","hi":"38"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 20 recyclable items in the morning and 5 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 20 और शाम 5 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"25","ans_hi":"25","options":[{"en":"25","hi":"25"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 27 seedlings. 10 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 27 पौध थे, 10 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"37","ans_hi":"37","options":[{"en":"37","hi":"37"},{"en":"74","hi":"74"},{"en":"39","hi":"39"},{"en":"49","hi":"49"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A child gets a message that asks for bank details. What is right?","hi":"बैंक जानकारी माँगने वाला संदेश आए तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","ans_hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Take a stranger's advice","hi":"अजनबी की सलाह लें"},{"en":"Reply with details","hi":"जानकारी भेजें"},{"en":"Share a password","hi":"पासवर्ड दें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A confusing chart has no data source. What should you do?","hi":"अस्पष्ट चार्ट पर आँकड़ों का स्रोत न हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask where the data came from","ans_hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए","options":[{"en":"Hide the chart","hi":"चार्ट छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Ask where the data came from","hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए"},{"en":"Change its numbers","hi":"आँकड़े बदल दें"},{"en":"Accept it without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे मानें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Students notice an injured bird. What is safe?","hi":"विद्यार्थियों को घायल पक्षी दिखे। सुरक्षित कदम क्या है?","ans":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","ans_hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Pull its wings","hi":"पंख खींचें"},{"en":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ"},{"en":"Chase it away","hi":"भगाएँ"},{"en":"Throw stones","hi":"पत्थर मारें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A viral message says school is closed, but no notice is issued. What should you do?","hi":"वायरल संदेश कहे स्कूल बंद है, पर सूचना न हो, तो क्या करें?","ans":"Check the official school notice","ans_hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें","options":[{"en":"Assume it is true","hi":"उसे सच मान लें"},{"en":"Delete official updates","hi":"आधिकारिक सूचना हटाएँ"},{"en":"Check the official school notice","hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें"},{"en":"Send it to everyone","hi":"सबको भेजें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A student shares a photo of another child without permission. What is better?","hi":"बिना अनुमति दूसरे बच्चे का फोटो साझा हुआ। क्या उचित है?","ans":"Ask permission before sharing","ans_hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें","options":[{"en":"Ask permission before sharing","hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें"},{"en":"Add personal details","hi":"निजी जानकारी जोड़ें"},{"en":"Ignore privacy","hi":"गोपनीयता अनदेखी करें"},{"en":"Share more photos","hi":"और फोटो भेजें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-3-1-09"},"3|0|10|GK":{"grade":"3","term":0,"year":10,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"Which nutrient helps build and repair body tissues?","hi":"शरीर के ऊतकों को बनाने और सुधारने में कौन-सा पोषक तत्त्व मदद करता है?","ans":"Protein","ans_hi":"प्रोटीन","options":[{"en":"Iron","hi":"आयरन"},{"en":"Calcium","hi":"कैल्शियम"},{"en":"Protein","hi":"प्रोटीन"},{"en":"Fibre","hi":"रेशा"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"food"},{"en":"Which mineral is important for strong bones and teeth?","hi":"मजबूत हड्डियों और दाँतों के लिए कौन-सा खनिज आवश्यक है?","ans":"Calcium","ans_hi":"कैल्शियम","options":[{"en":"Calcium","hi":"कैल्शियम"},{"en":"Carbohydrates","hi":"कार्बोहाइड्रेट"},{"en":"Vitamin C","hi":"विटामिन सी"},{"en":"Fibre","hi":"रेशा"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"food"},{"en":"What is the process of changing water to water vapour called?","hi":"पानी के जलवाष्प बनने की प्रक्रिया क्या कहलाती है?","ans":"Evaporation","ans_hi":"वाष्पीकरण","options":[{"en":"Freezing","hi":"जमना"},{"en":"Photosynthesis","hi":"प्रकाश-संश्लेषण"},{"en":"Evaporation","hi":"वाष्पीकरण"},{"en":"Pollination","hi":"परागण"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"processes"},{"en":"What is the opposite process of evaporation called?","hi":"जलवाष्प के द्रव पानी में बदलने की प्रक्रिया क्या कहलाती है?","ans":"Condensation","ans_hi":"संघनन","options":[{"en":"Condensation","hi":"संघनन"},{"en":"Melting","hi":"गलन"},{"en":"Digestion","hi":"पाचन"},{"en":"Diffusion","hi":"विसरण"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"processes"},{"en":"What do we call substances needed by the body from food?","hi":"खाद्य पदार्थों से शरीर को मिलने वाले आवश्यक तत्त्व क्या कहलाते हैं?","ans":"Nutrients","ans_hi":"पोषक तत्त्व","options":[{"en":"Dust","hi":"धूल"},{"en":"Waste substances","hi":"अपशिष्ट पदार्थ"},{"en":"Germs","hi":"कीटाणु"},{"en":"Nutrients","hi":"पोषक तत्त्व"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"Which organ pumps blood through the body?","hi":"शरीर में रक्त पंप करने वाला अंग कौन-सा है?","ans":"Heart","ans_hi":"हृदय","options":[{"en":"Heart","hi":"हृदय"},{"en":"Kidneys","hi":"गुर्दे"},{"en":"Small intestine","hi":"छोटी आँत"},{"en":"Liver","hi":"यकृत"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"Which organs help us breathe?","hi":"साँस लेने में कौन-से अंग मदद करते हैं?","ans":"Lungs","ans_hi":"फेफड़े","options":[{"en":"Stomach","hi":"आमाशय"},{"en":"Lungs","hi":"फेफड़े"},{"en":"Skull","hi":"खोपड़ी"},{"en":"Heart","hi":"हृदय"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"Which organ controls thinking and body movements?","hi":"सोच और शारीरिक गतिविधियों को नियंत्रित कौन-सा अंग करता है?","ans":"Brain","ans_hi":"मस्तिष्क","options":[{"en":"Brain","hi":"मस्तिष्क"},{"en":"Gallbladder","hi":"पित्ताशय"},{"en":"Liver","hi":"यकृत"},{"en":"Kidneys","hi":"गुर्दे"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"What is the hardest substance in the human body?","hi":"मानव शरीर का सबसे कठोर पदार्थ कौन-सा है?","ans":"Tooth enamel","ans_hi":"दाँतों का इनेमल","options":[{"en":"Hair","hi":"बाल"},{"en":"Skin","hi":"त्वचा"},{"en":"Cartilage","hi":"उपास्थि"},{"en":"Tooth enamel","hi":"दाँतों का इनेमल"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"Which sense organ is linked to taste?","hi":"स्वाद का अनुभव किस इंद्रिय से होता है?","ans":"Tongue","ans_hi":"जीभ","options":[{"en":"Tongue","hi":"जीभ"},{"en":"Skin","hi":"त्वचा"},{"en":"Heart","hi":"हृदय"},{"en":"Liver","hi":"यकृत"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"body"},{"en":"Which vitamin is made in the skin with adequate sunlight?","hi":"पर्याप्त धूप मिलने पर त्वचा में कौन-सा विटामिन बनता है?","ans":"Vitamin D","ans_hi":"विटामिन डी","options":[{"en":"Protein","hi":"प्रोटीन"},{"en":"Calcium","hi":"कैल्शियम"},{"en":"Iron","hi":"आयरन"},{"en":"Vitamin D","hi":"विटामिन डी"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"food"},{"en":"What do we call the change from solid ice to liquid water?","hi":"ठोस बर्फ से द्रव पानी बनने को क्या कहते हैं?","ans":"Melting","ans_hi":"पिघलना","options":[{"en":"Transpiration","hi":"वाष्पोत्सर्जन"},{"en":"Melting","hi":"पिघलना"},{"en":"Fermentation","hi":"किण्वन"},{"en":"Freezing","hi":"जमना"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"processes"},{"en":"What is the main function of the skeleton?","hi":"कंकाल का मुख्य काम क्या है?","ans":"Support and protect the body","ans_hi":"शरीर को सहारा और सुरक्षा देना","options":[{"en":"Pump blood","hi":"रक्त पंप करना"},{"en":"Support and protect the body","hi":"शरीर को सहारा और सुरक्षा देना"},{"en":"Digest starch","hi":"स्टार्च पचाना"},{"en":"Make food by photosynthesis","hi":"प्रकाश-संश्लेषण से भोजन बनाना"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"Which type of food is rich in fibre?","hi":"किस प्रकार के भोजन में रेशा अधिक होता है?","ans":"Fruits and vegetables","ans_hi":"फल एवं सब्जियाँ","options":[{"en":"Fat","hi":"वसा"},{"en":"Vitamin D","hi":"विटामिन डी"},{"en":"Fruits and vegetables","hi":"फल एवं सब्जियाँ"},{"en":"Fibre","hi":"रेशा"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"food"},{"en":"What should we do if we discover a small fire?","hi":"