ify posts","hi":"शिष्ट भाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना"},{"en":"Spread false rumours","hi":"झूठी अफवाह फैलाना"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"How should students check an unusual online fact?","hi":"अजीब ऑनलाइन तथ्य की जाँच कैसे करें?","ans":"Compare reliable sources","ans_hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोतों की तुलना करें","options":[{"en":"Believe the first website","hi":"पहली वेबसाइट पर भरोसा करें"},{"en":"Compare reliable sources","hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोतों की तुलना करें"},{"en":"Ignore dates and authors","hi":"तारीख और लेखक अनदेखे करें"},{"en":"Use only rumours","hi":"केवल अफवाह सुनें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A friend is left out of a group task. What should you do?","hi":"किसी मित्र को समूह कार्य से बाहर रखा गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Invite them to participate","ans_hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ","options":[{"en":"Hide the task","hi":"कार्य छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Make fun of them","hi":"मज़ाक उड़ाएँ"},{"en":"Invite them to participate","hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ"},{"en":"Refuse to listen","hi":"बात न सुनें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A rainwater tank is overflowing. What is a sensible response?","hi":"वर्षाजल की टंकी से पानी बह रहा हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","ans_hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ","options":[{"en":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ"},{"en":"Contaminate the water","hi":"पानी गंदा करें"},{"en":"Ignore for weeks","hi":"हफ्तों अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Break the pipe","hi":"पाइप तोड़ दें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The science club wants to save energy. What should it do?","hi":"विज्ञान क्लब ऊर्जा बचाना चाहता है। क्या करे?","ans":"Switch off unused electrical devices","ans_hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे","options":[{"en":"Run fans in empt