on Monday and 7 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 51 और मंगलवार को 7 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"58","ans_hi":"58","options":[{"en":"116","hi":"116"},{"en":"58","hi":"58"},{"en":"57","hi":"57"},{"en":"56","hi":"56"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 55 paper sheets and reused 16. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 55 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 16 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"39","ans_hi":"39","options":[{"en":"55","hi":"55"},{"en":"78","hi":"78"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"39","hi":"39"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 7 rows with 7 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 7 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 7 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"49","ans_hi":"49","options":[{"en":"47","hi":"47"},{"en":"98","hi":"98"},{"en":"49","hi":"49"},{"en":"56","hi":"56"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"42 reusable bottles are shared equally among 7 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"42 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 7 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 44 birds on a tree. 9 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 44 पक्षी थे, 9 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"35","ans_hi":"35","options":[{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"},{"en":"35","hi":"35"},{"en":"46","hi":"46"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 12 pages each day for 3 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 3 दिन तक रोज़ 12 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"36","ans_hi":"36","options":[{"en":"37","hi":"37"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"72","hi":"72"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 8 litres of water a day for 5 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 5 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 8 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"40","ans_hi":"40","options":[{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"80","hi":"80"},{"en":"38","hi":"38"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 24 pencils, and 7 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 24 पेंसिल में 7 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"17","ans_hi":"17","options":[{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 47 recyclable items in the morning and 7 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 47 और शाम 7 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"54","ans_hi":"54","options":[{"en":"53","hi":"53"},{"en":"61","hi":"61"},{"en":"54","hi":"54"},{"en":"56","hi":"56"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 25 seedlings. 16 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 25 पौध थे, 16 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"41","ans_hi":"41","options":[{"en":"59","hi":"59"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"41","hi":"41"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"What is good digital citizenship in a class group?","hi":"कक्षा समूह में अच्छा डिजिटल व्यवहार क्या है?","ans":"Use polite language and verify posts","ans_hi":"शिष्ट भाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना","options":[{"en":"Post insults","hi":"अपमान करना"},{"en":"Share classmates' secrets","hi":"सहपाठियों की गुप्त बातें भेजना"},{"en":"Use polite language and verify posts","hi":"शिष्ट भाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना"},{"en":"Spread false rumours","hi":"झूठी अफवाह फैलाना"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A child gets a message that asks for bank details. What is right?","hi":"बैंक जानकारी माँगने वाला संदेश आए तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","ans_hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Take a stranger's advice","hi":"अजनबी की सलाह लें"},{"en":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Reply with details","hi":"जानकारी भेजें"},{"en":"Share a password","hi":"पासवर्ड दें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Which choice reduces plastic waste on a picnic?","hi":"पिकनिक में प्लास्टिक कचरा कैसे घटेगा?","ans":"Carry a reusable water bottle","ans_hi":"दोबारा भरी जा सकने वाली बोतल रखें","options":[{"en":"Buy extra plastic bags","hi":"अधिक प्लास्टिक थैलियाँ लें"},{"en":"Use many single-use cups","hi":"कई डिस्पोज़ेबल कप लें"},{"en":"Carry a reusable water bottle","hi":"दोबारा भरी जा सकने वाली बोतल रखें"},{"en":"Throw wrappers in nature","hi":"रैपर प्रकृति में फेंकें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A student shares a photo of another child without permission. What is better?","hi":"बिना अनुमति दूसरे बच्चे का फोटो साझा हुआ। क्या उचित है?","ans":"Ask permission before sharing","ans_hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें","options":[{"en":"Ask permission before sharing","hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें"},{"en":"Add personal details","hi":"निजी जानकारी जोड़ें"},{"en":"Ignore privacy","hi":"गोपनीयता अनदेखी करें"},{"en":"Share more photos","hi":"और फोटो भेजें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A viral message says school is closed, but no notice is issued. What should you do?","hi":"वायरल संदेश कहे स्कूल बंद है, पर सूचना न हो, तो क्या करें?","ans":"Check the official school notice","ans_hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें","options":[{"en":"Assume it is true","hi":"उसे सच मान लें"},{"en":"Send it to everyone","hi":"सबको भेजें"},{"en":"Check the official school notice","hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें"},{"en":"Delete official updates","hi":"आधिकारिक सूचना हटाएँ"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-3-2-01"},"3|1|2|GK":{"grade":"3","term":1,"year":2,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"Which gas do plants take in for photosynthesis?","hi":"प्रकाश संश्लेषण के लिए पौधे कौन-सी गैस लेते हैं?","ans":"Carbon dioxide","ans_hi":"कार्बन डाइऑक्साइड","options":[{"en":"Methane","hi":"मीथेन"},{"en":"Ozone","hi":"ओज़ोन"},{"en":"Carbon dioxide","hi":"कार्बन डाइऑक्साइड"},{"en":"Helium","hi":"हीलियम"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"gases"},{"en":"What do plants release during photosynthesis?","hi":"प्रकाश संश्लेषण के दौरान पौधे कौन-सी गैस छोड़ते हैं?","ans":"Oxygen","ans_hi":"ऑक्सीजन","options":[{"en":"Oxygen","hi":"ऑक्सीजन"},{"en":"Helium","hi":"हीलियम"},{"en":"Carbon dioxide","hi":"कार्बन डाइऑक्साइड"},{"en":"Ozone","hi":"ओज़ोन"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"gases"},{"en":"Which part of a flower usually becomes a fruit?","hi":"फूल का कौन-सा भाग सामान्यतः फल बनता है?","ans":"Ovary","ans_hi":"अंडाशय","options":[{"en":"Leaf","hi":"पत्ती"},{"en":"Phloem","hi":"फ्लोएम"},{"en":"Stem","hi":"तना"},{"en":"Ovary","hi":"अंडाशय"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"plantparts"},{"en":"Which part of a plant transports water from roots upward?","hi":"पौधे का कौन-सा ऊतक जड़ों से पानी ऊपर पहुँचाता है?","ans":"Xylem","ans_hi":"जाइलम","options":[{"en":"Xylem","hi