ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 44 trees on Monday and 9 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 44 और मंगलवार को 9 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"53","ans_hi":"53","options":[{"en":"64","hi":"64"},{"en":"106","hi":"106"},{"en":"53","hi":"53"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 25 paper sheets and reused 7. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 25 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 7 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"18","ans_hi":"18","options":[{"en":"25","hi":"25"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 6 rows with 8 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 6 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 8 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"48","ans_hi":"48","options":[{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"58","hi":"58"},{"en":"50","hi":"50"},{"en":"56","hi":"56"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"48 reusable bottles are shared equally among 8 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"48 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 8 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 35 birds on a tree. 11 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 35 पक्षी थे, 11 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"24","ans_hi":"24","options":[{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"37","hi":"37"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 11 pages each day for 8 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 8 दिन तक रोज़ 11 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?"