करें"},{"en":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ"},{"en":"Ignore for weeks","hi":"हफ्तों अनदेखा करें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The science club wants to save energy. What should it do?","hi":"विज्ञान क्लब ऊर्जा बचाना चाहता है। क्या करे?","ans":"Switch off unused electrical devices","ans_hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे","options":[{"en":"Waste batteries","hi":"बैटरियाँ फेंके"},{"en":"Run fans in empty rooms","hi":"खाली कमरों में पंखे चलाए"},{"en":"Switch off unused electrical devices","hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे"},{"en":"Keep lights on all day","hi":"दिनभर लाइट जलाए"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A student shares a photo of another child without permission. What is better?","hi":"बिना अनुमति दूसरे बच्चे का फोटो साझा हुआ। क्या उचित है?","ans":"Ask permission before sharing","ans_hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें","options":[{"en":"Ask permission before sharing","hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें"},{"en":"Add personal details","hi":"निजी जानकारी जोड़ें"},{"en":"Share more photos","hi":"और फोटो भेजें"},{"en":"Ignore privacy","hi":"गोपनीयता अनदेखी करें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A child gets a message that asks for bank details. What is right?","hi":"बैंक जानकारी माँगने वाला संदेश आए तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","ans_hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Share a password","hi":"पासवर्ड दें"},{"en":"Reply with details","hi":"जानकारी भेजें"},{"en":"Take a stranger's advice","hi":"अजनबी की सलाह लें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Students notice an injured bird. What is safe?","hi":"विद्यार्थियों को घायल पक्षी दिखे। सुरक्षित कदम क्या है?","ans":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","ans_hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Chase it away","hi":"भगाएँ"},{"en":"Pull its wings","hi":"पंख खींचें"},{"en":"Throw stones","hi":"पत्थर मारें"},{"en":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-3-2-02"},"3|1|3|GK":{"grade":"3","term":1,"year":3,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"Which gas do plants take in for photosynthesis?","hi":"प्रकाश संश्लेषण के लिए पौधे कौन-सी गैस लेते हैं?","ans":"Carbon dioxide","ans_hi":"कार्बन डाइऑक्साइड","options":[{"en":"Carbon dioxide","hi":"कार्बन डाइऑक्साइड"},{"en":"Nitrogen","hi":"नाइट्रोजन"},{"en":"Hydrogen","hi":"हाइड्रोजन"},{"en":"Helium","hi":"हीलियम"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"gases"},{"en":"What do plants release during photosynthesis?","hi":"प्रकाश संश्लेषण के दौरान पौधे कौन-सी गैस छोड़ते हैं?","ans":"Oxygen","ans_hi":"ऑक्सीजन","options":[{"en":"Ozone","hi":"ओज़ोन"},{"en":"Helium","hi":"हीलियम"},{"en":"Carbon dioxide","hi":"कार्बन डाइऑक्साइड"},{"en":"Oxygen","hi":"ऑक्सीजन"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"gases"},{"en":"Which part of a flower usually becomes a fruit?","hi":"फूल का कौन-सा भाग सामान्यतः फल बनता है?","ans":"Ovary","ans_hi":"अंडाशय","options":[{"en":"Ovary","hi":"अंडाशय"},{"en":"Flower","hi":"फूल"},{"en":"Leaf","hi":"पत्ती"},{"en":"Fruit","hi":"फल"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"plantparts"},{"en":"Which part of a plant transports water from roots upward?","hi":"पौधे का कौन-सा ऊतक जड़ों से पानी ऊपर पहुँचाता है?","ans":"Xylem","ans_hi":"जाइलम","options":[{"en":"Root","hi":"जड़"},{"en":"Flower","hi":"फ