ागण"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"processes"},{"en":"Which part of a plant makes most of its food?","hi":"पौधे का अधिकांश भोजन कौन-सा भाग बनाता है?","ans":"Leaves","ans_hi":"पत्तियाँ","options":[{"en":"Fruit","hi":"फल"},{"en":"Leaves","hi":"पत्तियाँ"},{"en":"Leaf","hi":"पत्ती"},{"en":"Phloem","hi":"फ्लोएम"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"plantparts"},{"en":"What do earthworms help improve?","hi":"केंचुए किसे बेहतर बनाने में मदद करते हैं?","ans":"Soil","ans_hi":"मिट्टी","options":[{"en":"Metal","hi":"धातु"},{"en":"Soil","hi":"मिट्टी"},{"en":"Glass","hi":"काँच"},{"en":"Plastic","hi":"प्लास्टिक"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"materials-forced"},{"en":"Why do birds have beaks?","hi":"पक्षियों की चोंच का एक प्रमुख उपयोग क्या है?","ans":"Picking up food","ans_hi":"भोजन उठाना","options":[{"en":"Breathing through gills","hi":"गलफड़ों से साँस लेना"},{"en":"Producing milk","hi":"दूध बनाना"},{"en":"Picking up food","hi":"भोजन उठाना"},{"en":"Growing leaves","hi":"पत्तियाँ उगाना"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What is a food chain?","hi":"खाद्य शृंखला क्या दिखाती है?","ans":"Who eats whom","ans_hi":"कौन किसे खाता है","options":[{"en":"How clouds look","hi":"बादल कैसे दिखते हैं"},{"en":"How rain is measured","hi":"वर्षा कैसे मापते हैं"},{"en":"Who eats whom","hi":"कौन किसे खाता है"},{"en":"How rocks form","hi":"चट्टानें कैसे बनती हैं"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"definitions-forced"},{"en":"Which animal is an amphibian?","hi":"कौन-सा जीव उभयचर है?","ans":"Frog","ans_hi":"मेंढक","options":[{"en":"Camel","hi":"ऊँट"},{"en":"Goat","hi":"बकरी"},{"en":"Cow","hi":"गाय"},{"en":"Frog","hi":"मेंढक"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"animals"},{"en":"What is a group of fish called?","h