20 birds on a tree. 13 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 20 पक्षी थे, 13 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"7","ans_hi":"7","options":[{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 9 pages each day for 3 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 3 दिन तक रोज़ 9 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"27","ans_hi":"27","options":[{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"29","hi":"29"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 10 litres of water a day for 8 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 8 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 10 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"80","ans_hi":"80","options":[{"en":"81","hi":"81"},{"en":"70","hi":"70"},{"en":"90","hi":"90"},{"en":"80","hi":"80"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 37 pencils, and 11 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 37 पेंसिल में 11 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"26","ans_hi":"26","options":[{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"39","hi":"39"},{"en":"25","hi":"25"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 33 recyclable items in the morning and 16 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 33 और शाम 16 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"49","ans_hi":"49","options":[{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"67","hi":"67"},{"en":"49","hi":"49"},{"en":"65","hi":"65"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 52 seedlings. 8 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 52 पौध थे, 8 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"60","ans_hi":"60","options":[{"en":"58","hi":"58"},{"en":"61","hi":"61"},{"en":"70","hi"