 school notice","hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें"},{"en":"Send it to everyone","hi":"सबको भेजें"},{"en":"Assume it is true","hi":"उसे सच मान लें"},{"en":"Delete official updates","hi":"आधिकारिक सूचना हटाएँ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Students notice an injured bird. What is safe?","hi":"विद्यार्थियों को घायल पक्षी दिखे। सुरक्षित कदम क्या है?","ans":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","ans_hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Chase it away","hi":"भगाएँ"},{"en":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ"},{"en":"Throw stones","hi":"पत्थर मारें"},{"en":"Pull its wings","hi":"पंख खींचें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-3-2-07"},"3|1|8|GK":{"grade":"3","term":1,"year":8,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"Which gas do plants take in for photosynthesis?","hi":"प्रकाश संश्लेषण के लिए पौधे कौन-सी गैस लेते हैं?","ans":"Carbon dioxide","ans_hi":"कार्बन डाइऑक्साइड","options":[{"en":"Methane","hi":"मीथेन"},{"en":"Oxygen","hi":"ऑक्सीजन"},{"en":"Carbon dioxide","hi":"कार्बन डाइऑक्साइड"},{"en":"Hydrogen","hi":"हाइड्रोजन"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"gases"},{"en":"What do plants release during photosynthesis?","hi":"प्रकाश संश्लेषण के दौरान पौधे कौन-सी गैस छोड़ते हैं?","ans":"Oxygen","ans_hi":"ऑक्सीजन","options":[{"en":"Methane","hi":"मीथेन"},{"en":"Oxygen","hi":"ऑक्सीजन"},{"en":"Nitrogen","hi":"नाइट्रोजन"},{"en":"Hydrogen","hi":"हाइड्रोजन"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"gases"},{"en":"Which part of a flower usually becomes a fruit?","hi":"फूल का कौन-सा भाग सामान्यतः फल बनता है?","ans":"Ovary","ans_hi":"अंडाशय","options":[{"en":"Ovary","hi":"अंडाशय"},{"en":"Xylem","hi":"जाइलम"},{"en":"Petals","hi":"पंखुड़ियाँ"},{"en":"Phloem","hi":"फ्लोएम"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"plantparts"},{"en":"Which part of a plant transports water from roots upward?","hi":"पौधे का कौन-सा ऊतक जड़ों से पानी ऊपर पहुँचाता है?","ans":"Xylem","ans_hi":"जाइलम","options":[{"en":"Seed","hi":"बीज"},{"en":"Fruit","hi":"फल"},{"en":"Xylem","hi":"जाइलम"},{"en":"Flower","hi":"फूल"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"plantparts"},{"en":"What do we call animals that eat only plants?","hi":"केवल पौधे खाने वाले पशु क्या कहलाते हैं?","ans":"Herbivores","ans_hi":"शाकाहारी","options":[{"en":"Omnivores","hi":"सर्वाहारी"},{"en":"Herbivores","hi":"शाकाहारी"},{"en":"Producers","hi":"उत्पादक"},{"en":"Predators","hi":"परभक्षी"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"ecology"},{"en":"What do we call animals that eat other animals?","hi":"दूसरे जानवरों को खाने वाले पशु क्या कहलाते हैं?","ans":"Carnivores","ans_hi":"मांसाहारी","options":[{"en":"Predators","hi":"परभक्षी"},{"en":"Carnivores","hi":"मांसाहारी"},{"en":"Parasites","hi":"परजीवी"},{"en":"Consumers","hi":"उपभोक्ता"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"ecology"},{"en":"What do we call animals that eat both plants and animals?","hi":"पौधे और पशु दोनों खाने वाले जीव क्या कहलाते हैं?","ans":"Omnivores","ans_hi":"सर्वाहारी","options":[{"en":"Consumers","hi":"उपभोक्ता"},{"en":"Decomposers","hi":"अपघटक"},{"en":"Omnivores","hi":"सर्वाहारी"},{"en":"Carnivores","hi":"मांसाहारी"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"ecology"},{"en":"What is a frog's young stage called?","hi":"मेंढक के बच्चे की प्रारंभिक अवस्था क्या कहलाती है?","ans":"Tadpole","ans_hi":"टैडपोल","options":[{"en":"Kitten","hi":"बिल्ली का बच्चा"},{"en":"Caterpillar","hi":"इल्ली"},{"en":"Calf","hi":"बछड़ा"},{"en":"Tadpole","hi":"टैडपोल"}],"