ng / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 38 birds on a tree. 4 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 38 पक्षी थे, 4 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"34","ans_hi":"34","options":[{"en":"32","hi":"32"},{"en":"68","hi":"68"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 6 pages each day for 7 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 7 दिन तक रोज़ 6 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"42","ans_hi":"42","options":[{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"49","hi":"49"},{"en":"84","hi":"84"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 12 litres of water a day for 8 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 8 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 12 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"96","ans_hi":"96","options":[{"en":"95","hi":"95"},{"en":"96","hi":"96"},{"en":"98","hi":"98"},{"en":"94","hi":"94"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 38 pencils, and 8 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 38 पेंसिल में 8 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"30","ans_hi":"30","options":[{"en":"32","hi":"32"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"29","hi":"29"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 47 recyclable items in the morning and 8 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 47 और शाम 8 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"55","ans_hi":"55","options":[{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"55","hi":"55"},{"en":"54","hi":"54"},{"en":"53","hi":"53"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 23 seedlings. 16 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 23 पौध थे, 16 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"39","ans_hi":"39","options":[{"en":"39","hi":