 और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 49 seedlings. 14 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 49 पौध थे, 14 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"63","ans_hi":"63","options":[{"en":"64","hi":"64"},{"en":"62","hi":"62"},{"en":"63","hi":"63"},{"en":"61","hi":"61"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student shares a photo of another child without permission. What is better?","hi":"बिना अनुमति दूसरे बच्चे का फोटो साझा हुआ। क्या उचित है?","ans":"Ask permission before sharing","ans_hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें","options":[{"en":"Share more photos","hi":"और फोटो भेजें"},{"en":"Ignore privacy","hi":"गोपनीयता अनदेखी करें"},{"en":"Ask permission before sharing","hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें"},{"en":"Add personal details","hi":"निजी जानकारी जोड़ें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A child gets a message that asks for bank details. What is right?","hi":"बैंक जानकारी माँगने वाला संदेश आए तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","ans_hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Take a stranger's advice","hi":"अजनबी की सलाह लें"},{"en":"Reply with details","hi":"जानकारी भेजें"},{"en":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Share a password","hi":"पासवर्ड दें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"How should students check an unusual online fact?","hi":"अजीब ऑनलाइन तथ्य की जाँच कैसे करें?","ans":"Compare reliable sources","ans_hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोतों की तुलना करें","options":[{"en":"Believe the first website","hi":"पहली वेबसाइट पर भरोसा करें"},{"en":"Ignore dates and authors","hi":"तारीख और लेखक अनदेखे करें"},{"en":"Use only rumours","hi":"केवल अफवाह सुनें"},{"en":"Compare reliable sources","hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोतों की तुलना करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक 