"70 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 7 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"10","ans_hi":"10","options":[{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 19 birds on a tree. 6 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 19 पक्षी थे, 6 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"13","ans_hi":"13","options":[{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 12 pages each day for 5 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 5 दिन तक रोज़ 12 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"60","ans_hi":"60","options":[{"en":"59","hi":"59"},{"en":"60","hi":"60"},{"en":"58","hi":"58"},{"en":"61","hi":"61"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 10 litres of water a day for 7 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 7 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 10 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"70","ans_hi":"70","options":[{"en":"68","hi":"68"},{"en":"60","hi":"60"},{"en":"79","hi":"79"},{"en":"70","hi":"70"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 29 pencils, and 10 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 29 पेंसिल में 10 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"19","ans_hi":"19","options":[{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"38","hi":"38"},{"en":"29","hi":"29"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 52 recyclable items in the morning and 8 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 52 और शाम 8 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"60","ans_hi":"60","options":[{"en":"68","hi":"68"},{"en":"70","hi":"70"},{"en":"58","hi":"58"},{"en":"60","hi":"60"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 43 seedlings. 11 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 43 पौध थे, 11 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"54","ans_hi":"54","options":[{"en":"67","hi":"67"},{"en":"108","hi":"108"},{"en":"54","hi":"54"},{"en":"65","hi":"65"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"Students notice an injured bird. What is safe?","hi":"विद्यार्थियों को घायल पक्षी दिखे। सुरक्षित कदम क्या है?","ans":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","ans_hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Pull its wings","hi":"पंख खींचें"},{"en":"Throw stones","hi":"पत्थर मारें"},{"en":"Chase it away","hi":"भगाएँ"},{"en":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A viral message says school is closed, but no notice is issued. What should you do?","hi":"वायरल संदेश कहे स्कूल बंद है, पर सूचना न हो, तो क्या करें?","ans":"Check the official school notice","ans_hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें","options":[{"en":"Delete official updates","hi":"आधिकारिक सूचना हटाएँ"},{"en":"Check the official school notice","hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें"},{"en":"Assume it is true","hi":"उसे सच मान लें"},{"en":"Send it to everyone","hi":"सबको भेजें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A friend is left out of a group task. What should you do?","hi":"किसी मित्र को समूह कार्य से बाहर रखा गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Invite them to participate","ans_hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ","options":[{"en":"Refuse to listen","hi":"बात न सुनें"},{"en":"Hide the task","hi":"कार्य छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Make fun of them","hi":"मज़ाक उड़ाएँ"},{"en":"Invite them to participate","hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Which choice reduces plastic waste on a picnic?","hi":"पिकनिक में प्लास्टिक कचरा कैसे घटेगा?","ans":"Carry a reusable water bottle","ans_hi":"दोबारा भरी जा सकने वाली बोतल रखें","options":[{"en":"Use many single-use cups","hi":"कई डिस्पोज़ेबल कप लें"},{"en":"Throw wrappers in nature","hi":"रैपर प्रकृति में फेंकें"},{"en":"Carry a reusable water bottle","hi":"दोबारा भरी जा सकने वाली बोतल रखें"},{"en":"Buy extra plastic bags","hi":"अधिक प्लास्टिक थैलियाँ लें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A rainwater tank is overflowing. What is a sensible response?","hi":"वर्षाजल की टंकी से पानी बह रहा हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","ans_hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ","options":[{"en":"Contaminate the water","hi":"पानी गंदा करें"},{"en":"Break the pipe","hi":"पाइप तोड़ दें"},{"en":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ"},{"en":"Ignore for weeks","hi":"हफ्तों अनदेखा करें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-3-2-10"},"3|2|1|GK":{"grade":"3","term":2,"year":1,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"Which city is the capital of Uttar Pradesh?","hi":"उत्तर प्रदेश की राजधानी कौन-सा शहर है?","ans":"Lucknow","ans_hi":"लखनऊ","options":[{"en":"Kolkata","hi":"कोलकाता"},{"en":"Chennai","hi":"चेन्नई"},{"en":"Agra","hi":"आगरा"},{"en":"Lucknow","hi":"लखनऊ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"cities"},{"en":"Which state contains the city of Jaipur?","hi":"जयपुर किस राज्य में स्थित है?","ans":"Rajasthan","ans_hi":"राजस्थान","options":[{"en":"Rajasthan","hi":"राजस्थान"},{"en":"Uttar Pradesh","hi":"उत्तर प्रदेश"},{"en":"Karnataka","hi":"कर्नाटक"},{"en":"Madhya Pradesh","hi