","hi":"होली"},{"en":"Diwali","hi":"दीपावली"},{"en":"Dussehra","hi":"दशहरा"},{"en":"Raksha Bandhan","hi":"रक्षाबंधन"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"festivals"},{"en":"Which river is associated with the holy city of Haridwar?","hi":"हरिद्वार किस नदी से जुड़ा है?","ans":"Ganga","ans_hi":"गंगा","options":[{"en":"Narmada","hi":"नर्मदा"},{"en":"Ganga","hi":"गंगा"},{"en":"Godavari","hi":"गोदावरी"},{"en":"Yamuna","hi":"यमुना"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"rivers"},{"en":"What is a compass used to find?","hi":"कंपास से क्या पता चलता है?","ans":"Directions","ans_hi":"दिशाएँ","options":[{"en":"Directions","hi":"दिशाएँ"},{"en":"Mass of a stone","hi":"पत्थर का द्रव्यमान"},{"en":"Body temperature","hi":"शरीर का तापमान"},{"en":"Time of day","hi":"दिन का समय"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"Which colour is in the centre stripe of India's flag?","hi":"भारतीय ध्वज की मध्य पट्टी किस रंग की है?","ans":"White","ans_hi":"सफेद","options":[{"en":"Blue","hi":"नीला"},{"en":"White","hi":"सफेद"},{"en":"Green","hi":"हरा"},{"en":"Black","hi":"काला"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"colors"},{"en":"Which direction is opposite to North?","hi":"उत्तर के विपरीत कौन-सी दिशा है?","ans":"South","ans_hi":"दक्षिण","options":[{"en":"North-West","hi":"उत्तर-पश्चिम"},{"en":"East","hi":"पूर्व"},{"en":"South-East","hi":"दक्षिण-पूर्व"},{"en":"South","hi":"दक्षिण"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What improves road safety while cycling?","hi":"साइकिल चलाते समय सुरक्षा किससे बढ़ती है?","ans":"Helmet","ans_hi":"हेलमेट","options":[{"en":"Paper","hi":"कागज़"},{"en":"Strong password","hi":"मजबूत पासवर्ड"},{"en":"Helmet","hi":"हेलमेट"},{"en":"Soap","hi":"साबुन"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स