जमना"},{"en":"Evaporation","hi":"वाष्पीकरण"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which organ digests much of our food?","hi":"भोजन के अधिकांश पाचन में कौन-सा अंग महत्वपूर्ण है?","ans":"Small intestine","ans_hi":"छोटी आँत","options":[{"en":"Small intestine","hi":"छोटी आँत"},{"en":"Eyes","hi":"आँखें"},{"en":"Ears","hi":"कान"},{"en":"Lungs","hi":"फेफड़े"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which process causes rainwater to move downhill?","hi":"वर्षा का पानी ढलान पर किस कारण बहता है?","ans":"Gravity","ans_hi":"गुरुत्वाकर्षण","options":[{"en":"Melting","hi":"पिघलना"},{"en":"Freezing","hi":"जमना"},{"en":"Evaporation","hi":"वाष्पीकरण"},{"en":"Gravity","hi":"गुरुत्वाकर्षण"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 44 trees on Monday and 15 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 44 और मंगलवार को 15 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"59","ans_hi":"59","options":[{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"59","hi":"59"},{"en":"61","hi":"61"},{"en":"60","hi":"60"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 24 paper sheets and reused 13. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 24 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 13 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"11","ans_hi":"11","options":[{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 12 rows with 4 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 12 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 4 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"48","ans_hi":"48","options":[{"en":"50","hi":"50"},{"en":"96","hi":"96"},{"en":"54","hi":"54"},{"en":"48","hi":"48"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"56 reusable bottles are shared equally among 7 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"56 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 7 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 23 birds on a tree. 9 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 23 पक्षी थे, 9 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"14","ans_hi":"14","options":[{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 7 pages each day for 3 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 3 दिन तक रोज़ 7 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"21","ans_hi":"21","options":[{"en":"23","hi":"23"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 11 litres of water a day for 4 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 4 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 11 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"44","ans_hi":"44","options":[{"en":"50","hi":"50"},{"en":"46","hi":"46"},{"en":"44","hi":"44"},{"en":"43","hi":"43"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 35 pencils, and 13 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 35 पेंसिल में 13 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"22","ans_hi":"22","options":[{"en":"44","hi":"44"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"23","hi":"23"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 53 recyclable items in the morning and 4 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 53 और शाम 4 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। 