1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"40 reusable bottles are shared equally among 4 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"40 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 4 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"10","ans_hi":"10","options":[{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 27 birds on a tree. 4 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 27 पक्षी थे, 4 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"23","ans_hi":"23","options":[{"en":"23","hi":"23"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"29","hi":"29"},{"en":"25","hi":"25"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 6 pages each day for 6 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 6 दिन तक रोज़ 6 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"36","ans_hi":"36","options":[{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"37","hi":"37"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"38","hi":"38"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 9 litres of water a day for 5 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 5 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 9 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"45","ans_hi":"45","options":[{"en":"44","hi":"44"},{"en":"45","hi":"45"},{"en":"90","hi":"90"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 19 pencils, and 6 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 19 पेंसिल में 6 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"13","ans_hi":"13","options":[{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 50 recyclable items in the morning and 14 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 50 और शाम 14 