owers?","hi":"बगीचे में 10 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 3 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"30","ans_hi":"30","options":[{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"60","hi":"60"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"18 reusable bottles are shared equally among 3 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"18 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 3 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 29 birds on a tree. 8 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 29 पक्षी थे, 8 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"21","ans_hi":"21","options":[{"en":"31","hi":"31"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 10 pages each day for 5 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 5 दिन तक रोज़ 10 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"50","ans_hi":"50","options":[{"en":"51","hi":"51"},{"en":"50","hi":"50"},{"en":"49","hi":"49"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 9 litres of water a day for 8 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 8 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 9 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"72","ans_hi":"72","options":[{"en":"72","hi":"72"},{"en":"144","hi":"144"},{"en":"73","hi":"73"},{"en":"63","hi":"63"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 51 pencils, and 7 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 51 पेंसिल में 7 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"44","ans_hi":"44","options":[{"en":"43","hi":"43"},{"en":"88","hi":"88"},{"en":"46","hi":"46"},{"en":"44","hi