्षा समूह में अच्छा डिजिटल व्यवहार क्या है?","ans":"Use polite language and verify posts","ans_hi":"शिष्ट भाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना","options":[{"en":"Spread false rumours","hi":"झूठी अफवाह फैलाना"},{"en":"Post insults","hi":"अपमान करना"},{"en":"Share classmates' secrets","hi":"सहपाठियों की गुप्त बातें भेजना"},{"en":"Use polite language and verify posts","hi":"शिष्ट भाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The science club wants to save energy. What should it do?","hi":"विज्ञान क्लब ऊर्जा बचाना चाहता है। क्या करे?","ans":"Switch off unused electrical devices","ans_hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे","options":[{"en":"Keep lights on all day","hi":"दिनभर लाइट जलाए"},{"en":"Waste batteries","hi":"बैटरियाँ फेंके"},{"en":"Switch off unused electrical devices","hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे"},{"en":"Run fans in empty rooms","hi":"खाली कमरों में पंखे चलाए"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A rainwater tank is overflowing. What is a sensible response?","hi":"वर्षाजल की टंकी से पानी बह रहा हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","ans_hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ","options":[{"en":"Break the pipe","hi":"पाइप तोड़ दें"},{"en":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ"},{"en":"Contaminate the water","hi":"पानी गंदा करें"},{"en":"Ignore for weeks","hi":"हफ्तों अनदेखा करें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-3-3-04"},"3|2|5|GK":{"grade":"3","term":2,"year":5,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"Which city is the capital of Uttar Pradesh?","hi":"उत्तर प्रदेश की राजधानी कौन-सा शहर है?","ans":"Lucknow","ans_hi":"लखनऊ","options":[{"en":"Agra","hi":"आगरा"},{"en":"Mu