correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 11 rows with 4 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 11 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 4 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"44","ans_hi":"44","options":[{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"43","hi":"43"},{"en":"45","hi":"45"},{"en":"44","hi":"44"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"50 reusable bottles are shared equally among 5 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"50 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 5 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"10","ans_hi":"10","options":[{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 38 birds on a tree. 11 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 38 पक्षी थे, 11 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"27","ans_hi":"27","options":[{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 7 pages each day for 4 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 4 दिन तक रोज़ 7 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 11 litres of water a day for 5 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 5 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 11 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"55","ans_hi":"55","options":[{"en":"56","hi":"56"},{"en":"110","hi":"110"},{"en":"53","hi":"53"},{"en":"55","hi":"55"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 53 pencils, and 6 are used. How many remain?",