t":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A viral message says school is closed, but no notice is issued. What should you do?","hi":"वायरल संदेश कहे स्कूल बंद है, पर सूचना न हो, तो क्या करें?","ans":"Check the official school notice","ans_hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें","options":[{"en":"Assume it is true","hi":"उसे सच मान लें"},{"en":"Check the official school notice","hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें"},{"en":"Delete official updates","hi":"आधिकारिक सूचना हटाएँ"},{"en":"Send it to everyone","hi":"सबको भेजें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The school garden soil dries quickly. Which practice helps?","hi":"विद्यालय बगीचे की मिट्टी जल्दी सूखती है। क्या मदद करता है?","ans":"Water carefully near plant roots","ans_hi":"पौधों की जड़ों के पास सावधानी से पानी दें","options":[{"en":"Water carefully near plant roots","hi":"पौधों की जड़ों के पास सावधानी से पानी दें"},{"en":"Break the plants","hi":"पौधे तोड़ें"},{"en":"Remove all soil","hi":"पूरी मिट्टी हटा दें"},{"en":"Waste water on paths","hi":"पगडंडी पर पानी बहाएँ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A friend is left out of a group task. What should you do?","hi":"किसी मित्र को समूह कार्य से बाहर रखा गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Invite them to participate","ans_hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ","options":[{"en":"Hide the task","hi":"कार्य छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Refuse to listen","hi":"बात न सुनें"},{"en":"Invite them to participate","hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ"},{"en":"Make fun of them","hi":"मज़ाक उड़ाएँ"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-3-3-06"},"3|2|7|GK":{"grade":"3","term":2,"year":7,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"Which city is the capital of Uttar