ted 45 paper sheets and reused 16. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 45 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 16 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"29","ans_hi":"29","options":[{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"29","hi":"29"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"47","hi":"47"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 10 rows with 4 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 10 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 4 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"40","ans_hi":"40","options":[{"en":"46","hi":"46"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"80","hi":"80"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"18 reusable bottles are shared equally among 3 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"18 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 3 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 25 birds on a tree. 10 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 25 पक्षी थे, 10 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"15","ans_hi":"15","options":[{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"25","hi":"25"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 9 pages each day for 4 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 4 दिन तक रोज़ 9 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"36","ans_hi":"36","options":[{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"72","hi":"72"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 5 litres of water a day for 3 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 3 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 5 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"15","ans_hi":"15","options":[{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 35 pencils, and 7 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 35 पेंसिल में 7 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 53 recyclable items in the morning and 8 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 53 और शाम 8 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"61","ans_hi":"61","options":[{"en":"61","hi":"61"},{"en":"59","hi":"59"},{"en":"122","hi":"122"},{"en":"69","hi":"69"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 37 seedlings. 8 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 37 पौध थे, 8 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"45","ans_hi":"45","options":[{"en":"90","hi":"90"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"45","hi":"45"},{"en":"43","hi":"43"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The science club wants to save energy. What should it do?","hi":"विज्ञान क्लब ऊर्जा बचाना चाहता है। क्या करे?","ans":"Switch off unused electrical devices","ans_hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे","options":[{"en":"Waste batteries","hi":"बैटरियाँ फेंके"},{"en":"Switch off unused electrical devices","hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे"},{"en":"Keep lights on all day","hi":"दिनभर लाइट जलाए"},{"en":"Run fans in empty rooms","hi":"खाली कमरों में पंखे चलाए"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Students notice an injured bird. What is safe?","hi":"विद्यार्थियों को घायल पक्षी दिखे। सुरक्षित कदम क्या है?","ans":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","ans_hi":"शिक