":"57","hi":"57"},{"en":"59","hi":"59"},{"en":"58","hi":"58"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 18 paper sheets and reused 7. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 18 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 7 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"11","ans_hi":"11","options":[{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 5 rows with 6 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 5 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 6 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"30","ans_hi":"30","options":[{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"60","hi":"60"},{"en":"38","hi":"38"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"42 reusable bottles are shared equally among 7 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"42 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 7 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 25 birds on a tree. 15 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 25 पक्षी थे, 15 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"10","ans_hi":"10","options":[{"en":"25","hi":"25"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 11 pages each day for 7 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 7 दिन तक रोज़ 11 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"77","ans_hi":"77","options":[{"en":"78","hi":"78"},{"en":"76","hi":"76"},{"en":"154","hi":"154"},{"en":"77","hi":"77"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क