},{"en":"Condensation","hi":"संघनन"},{"en":"Gravity","hi":"गुरुत्वाकर्षण"},{"en":"Freezing","hi":"जमना"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 20 trees on Monday and 15 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 20 और मंगलवार को 15 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"35","ans_hi":"35","options":[{"en":"50","hi":"50"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"37","hi":"37"},{"en":"35","hi":"35"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 48 paper sheets and reused 8. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 48 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 8 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"40","ans_hi":"40","options":[{"en":"38","hi":"38"},{"en":"50","hi":"50"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"80","hi":"80"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 11 rows with 6 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 11 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 6 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"66","ans_hi":"66","options":[{"en":"67","hi":"67"},{"en":"132","hi":"132"},{"en":"66","hi":"66"},{"en":"64","hi":"64"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"84 reusable bottles are shared equally among 7 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"84 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 7 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 28 birds on a tree. 4 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 28 पक्षी थे, 4 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"24","ans_hi":"24","options":[{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 12 pages each day for 8 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 8 दिन तक रोज़ 12 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"96","ans_hi":"96","options":[{"en":"95","hi":"95"},{"en":"192","hi":"192"},{"en":"96","hi":"96"},{"en":"106","hi":"106"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 7 litres of water a day for 4 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 4 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 7 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"32","hi":"32"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 50 pencils, and 15 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 50 पेंसिल में 15 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"35","ans_hi":"35","options":[{"en":"37","hi":"37"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"35","hi":"35"},{"en":"50","hi":"50"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 27 recyclable items in the morning and 9 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 27 और शाम 9 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"36","ans_hi":"36","options":[{"en":"34","hi":"34"},{"en":"38","hi":"38"},{"en":"47","hi":"47"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 33 seedlings. 13 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 33 पौध थे, 13 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"46","ans_hi":"46","options":[{"en":"47","hi":"47"},{"en":"59","hi":"59"},{"en":"92","hi":"92"},{"en":"46","hi":"46"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A rainwater tank is overflowing. What is a sensible response?","hi":"वर्षाजल की टंकी से पानी बह रहा हो