eco-club planted 35 trees on Monday and 8 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 35 और मंगलवार को 8 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"43","ans_hi":"43","options":[{"en":"43","hi":"43"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"44","hi":"44"},{"en":"86","hi":"86"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 19 paper sheets and reused 11. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 19 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 11 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 8 rows with 5 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 8 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 5 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"40","ans_hi":"40","options":[{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"39","hi":"39"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"44 reusable bottles are shared equally among 4 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"44 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 4 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"11","ans_hi":"11","options":[{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 42 birds on a tree. 9 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 42 पक्षी थे, 9 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"33","ans_hi":"33","options":[{"en":"32","hi":"32"},{"en":"66","hi":"66"},{"en":"33","hi":"33"},{"en":"44","hi":"44"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 9 pages each day for 8 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 8 दिन तक रोज़ 9 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"72","ans_hi":"72","options":[{"en":"73","hi":"73"},{"en":"63","hi":"63"},{"en":"144","hi":"144"},{"en":"72","hi":"72"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 9 litres of water a day for 4 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 4 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 9 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"36","ans_hi":"36","options":[{"en":"37","hi":"37"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"35","hi":"35"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 32 pencils, and 4 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 32 पेंसिल में 4 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"},{"en":"56","hi":"56"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 27 recyclable items in the morning and 12 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 27 और शाम 12 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"39","ans_hi":"39","options":[{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"39","hi":"39"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"37","hi":"37"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 41 seedlings. 4 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 41 पौध थे, 4 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"45","ans_hi":"45","options":[{"en":"90","hi":"90"},{"en":"45","hi":"45"},{"en":"43","hi":"43"},{"en":"46","hi":"46"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A confusing chart has no data source. What should you do?","hi":"अस्पष्ट चार्ट पर आँकड़ों का स्रोत न हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask where the data came from","ans_hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए","options":[{"en":"Hide the chart","hi":"चार्ट छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Accept it without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे मानें"},{"en":"Change its numbers","hi":"आँकड़े बदल दें"},{"en":"Ask where the data came from","hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A friend is left out of a group task. What should you do?","hi":"किसी मित्र को समूह कार्य से बाहर रखा गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Invite them to participate","ans_hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ","options":[{"en":"Make fun of them","hi":"मज़ाक उड़ाएँ"},{"en":"Refuse to listen","hi":"बात न सुनें"},{"en":"Hide the task","hi":"कार्य छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Invite them to participate","hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"What is good digital citizenship in a class group?","hi":"कक्षा समूह में अच्छा डिजिटल व्यवहार क्या है?","ans":"Use polite language and verify posts","ans_hi":"शिष्ट भाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना","options":[{"en":"Use polite language and verify posts","hi":"शिष्ट भाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना"},{"en":"Spread false rumours","hi":"झूठी अफवाह फैलाना"},{"en":"Post insults","hi":"अपमान करना"},{"en":"Share classmates' secrets","hi":"सहपाठियों की गुप्त बातें भेजना"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Students notice an injured bird. What is safe?","hi":"विद्यार्थियों को घायल पक्षी दिखे। सुरक्षित कदम क्या है?","ans":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","ans_hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Throw stones","hi":"पत्थर मारें"},{"en":"Chase it away","hi":"भगाएँ"},{"en":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ"},{"en":"Pull its wings","hi":"पंख खींचें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Which choice reduces plastic waste on a picnic?","hi":"पिकनिक में प्लास्टिक कचरा कैसे घटेगा?","ans":"Carry a reusable water bottle","ans_hi":"दोबारा भरी जा सकने वाली बोतल रखें","options":[{"en":"Use many single-use cups","hi":"कई डिस्पोज़ेबल कप लें"},{"en":"Throw w