arks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 6 litres of water a day for 6 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 6 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 6 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"36","ans_hi":"36","options":[{"en":"35","hi":"35"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"38","hi":"38"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 18 pencils, and 6 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 18 पेंसिल में 6 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 29 recyclable items in the morning and 11 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 29 और शाम 11 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"40","ans_hi":"40","options":[{"en":"53","hi":"53"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"41","hi":"41"},{"en":"39","hi":"39"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 46 seedlings. 14 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 46 पौध थे, 14 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"60","ans_hi":"60","options":[{"en":"62","hi":"62"},{"en":"60","hi":"60"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"61","hi":"61"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A confusing chart has no data source. What should you do?","hi":"अस्पष्ट चार्ट पर आँकड़ों का स्रोत न हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask where the data came from","ans_hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए","options":[{"en":"Accept it without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे मानें"},{"en":"Hide the chart","hi":"चार्ट छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Change its numbers","hi":"आँकड़े बदल दें"},{"en":"Ask where the data came from","hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topi