 secrets","hi":"सहपाठियों की गुप्त बातें भेजना"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-3-4-03"},"3|3|4|GK":{"grade":"3","term":3,"year":4,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"How many continents are commonly identified?","hi":"सामान्यतः कितने महाद्वीप माने जाते हैं?","ans":"Seven","ans_hi":"सात","options":[{"en":"Europe","hi":"यूरोप"},{"en":"Seven","hi":"सात"},{"en":"Asia","hi":"एशिया"},{"en":"North America","hi":"उत्तरी अमेरिका"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"continents"},{"en":"How many oceans are commonly recognised?","hi":"सामान्यतः कितने महासागर माने जाते हैं?","ans":"Five","ans_hi":"पाँच","options":[{"en":"Five","hi":"पाँच"},{"en":"Indian Ocean","hi":"हिंद महासागर"},{"en":"Pacific Ocean","hi":"प्रशांत महासागर"},{"en":"Southern Ocean","hi":"दक्षिणी महासागर"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"oceans"},{"en":"What is the largest ocean on Earth?","hi":"पृथ्वी का सबसे बड़ा महासागर कौन-सा है?","ans":"Pacific Ocean","ans_hi":"प्रशांत महासागर","options":[{"en":"Southern Ocean","hi":"दक्षिणी महासागर"},{"en":"Pacific Ocean","hi":"प्रशांत महासागर"},{"en":"Arctic Ocean","hi":"आर्कटिक महासागर"},{"en":"Indian Ocean","hi":"हिंद महासागर"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"oceans"},{"en":"What is the smallest continent by land area?","hi":"क्षेत्रफल की दृष्टि से सबसे छोटा महाद्वीप कौन-सा है?","ans":"Australia","ans_hi":"ऑस्ट्रेलिया","options":[{"en":"Australia","hi":"ऑस्ट्रेलिया"},{"en":"North America","hi":"उत्तरी अमेरिका"},{"en":"South America","hi":"दक्षिण अमेरिका"},{"en":"Asia","hi":"एशिया"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"continents"},{"en":"What causes day and night on Earth?","hi":"पृथ्वी पर दिन और रात किस कारण होते हैं?","ans":"Earth's rotation","ans_hi":"पृथ्वी का घूर्णन","options":[{"en":"Change in cloud cover","hi":"बादलों का बदलना"},{"en":"Moon's rotation","hi":"चंद्रमा का घूर्णन"},{"en":"Earth's revolution","hi":"पृथ्वी की परिक्रमा"},{"en":"Earth's rotation","hi":"पृथ्वी का घूर्णन"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"earth_time"},{"en":"How long does Earth take to rotate once approximately?","hi":"पृथ्वी को एक घूर्णन में लगभग कितना समय लगता है?","ans":"24 hours","ans_hi":"24 घंटे","options":[{"en":"24 hours","hi":"24 घंटे"},{"en":"Three","hi":"तीन"},{"en":"60","hi":"60"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"quantities"},{"en":"What causes the seasons mainly?","hi":"ऋतुएँ मुख्यतः किस कारण बदलती हैं?","ans":"Earth's axial tilt and revolution","ans_hi":"पृथ्वी की धुरी का झुकाव और परिक्रमण","options":[{"en":"Earth's rotation","hi":"पृथ्वी का घूर्णन"},{"en":"Change in cloud cover","hi":"बादलों का बदलना"},{"en":"Earth's revolution","hi":"पृथ्वी की परिक्रमा"},{"en":"Earth's axial tilt and revolution","hi":"पृथ्वी की धुरी का झुकाव और परिक्रमण"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"earth_time"},{"en":"What is Earth's natural satellite?","hi":"पृथ्वी का प्राकृतिक उपग्रह कौन-सा है?","ans":"Moon","ans_hi":"चंद्रमा","options":[{"en":"Moon","hi":"चंद्रमा"},{"en":"Sun","hi":"सूर्य"},{"en":"Mars","hi":"मंगल"},{"en":"Venus","hi":"शुक्र"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"Which planet is closest to the Sun?","hi":"सूर्य के सबसे निकट कौन-सा ग्रह है?","ans":"Mercury","ans_hi":"बुध","options":[{"en":"Venus","hi":"शुक्र"},{"en":"Mercury","hi":"बुध"},{"en":"Earth","hi":"पृथ्वी"},{"en":"Jupiter","hi":"बृहस्पति"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"planets"},{"en":"Which planet is known as the Red Planet?","hi":"लाल ग्रह किसे कहा जाता है?","ans":"Mars","ans_hi":"मंगल","options":[{"en":"Earth","hi":"पृथ्वी"},{"en":"Jupiter","hi":"बृहस्पति"},{"en":"Neptune","hi":"वरुण"},{"en":"Mars","hi":"मंगल"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"planets"},{"en":"Which is the largest planet in our solar system?","hi":"हमारे सौरमंडल का सबसे बड़ा ग्रह कौन-सा है?","ans":"Jupiter","ans_hi":"बृहस्पति","options":[{"en":"Neptune","hi":"वरुण"},{"en":"Jupiter","hi":"बृहस्पति"},{"en":"Mars","hi":"मंगल"},{"en":"Uranus","hi":"अरुण"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"planets"},{"en":"Which star is at the centre of our solar system?","hi":"हमारे सौरमंडल के केंद्र में कौन-सा तारा है?","ans":"Sun","ans_hi":"सूर्य","options":[{"en":"Mars","hi":"मंगल"},{"en":"Sun","hi":"सूर्य"},{"en":"Moon","hi":"चंद्रमा"},{"en":"Venus","hi":"शुक्र"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What instrument is used to measure temperature?","hi":"तापमान मापने के लिए कौन-सा यंत्र प्रयोग होता है?","ans":"Thermometer","ans_hi":"तापमापी","options":[{"en":"Thermometer","hi":"तापमापी"},{"en":"Telescope","hi":"दूरबीन"},{"en":"Ammeter","hi":"ऐमीटर"},{"en":"Microscope","hi":"सूक्ष्मदर्शी"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"instruments"},{"en":"What do we call water vapour changing into tiny water drops?","hi":"जलवाष्प का पानी की छोटी बूँदों में बदलना क्या कहलाता है?","ans":"Condensation","ans_hi":"संघनन","options":[{"en":"Germination","hi":"अंकुरण"},{"en":"Pollination","hi":"परागण"},{"en":"Fermentation","hi":"किण्वन"},{"en":"Condensation","hi":"संघनन"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"processes"},{"en":"What is a renewable energy source?","hi":"नवीकरणीय ऊर्जा स्रोत का एक उदाहरण क्या है?","ans":"Solar energy","ans_hi":"सौर ऊर्जा","options":[{"en":"Solar energy","hi":"सौर ऊर्जा"},{"en":"Wind energy","hi":"पवन 