 drops?","hi":"वाष्प से बूँदें बनने की प्रक्रिया क्या है?","ans":"Condensation","ans_hi":"संघनन","options":[{"en":"Melting","hi":"पिघलना"},{"en":"Rain gauge","hi":"वर्षामापी"},{"en":"Condensation","hi":"संघनन"},{"en":"Gravity","hi":"गुरुत्वाकर्षण"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What do we call false online information?","hi":"ऑनलाइन गलत सूचना क्या कहलाती है?","ans":"Misinformation","ans_hi":"भ्रामक सूचना","options":[{"en":"Source","hi":"स्रोत"},{"en":"Strong password","hi":"मजबूत पासवर्ड"},{"en":"Paper","hi":"कागज़"},{"en":"Misinformation","hi":"भ्रामक सूचना"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What should we verify before sharing news?","hi":"खबर साझा करने से पहले क्या जाँचना चाहिए?","ans":"Source","ans_hi":"स्रोत","options":[{"en":"Helmet","hi":"हेलमेट"},{"en":"Source","hi":"स्रोत"},{"en":"Soap","hi":"साबुन"},{"en":"Misinformation","hi":"भ्रामक सूचना"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which direction lies between North and West?","hi":"उत्तर और पश्चिम के बीच कौन-सी दिशा है?","ans":"North-West","ans_hi":"उत्तर-पश्चिम","options":[{"en":"South-East","hi":"दक्षिण-पूर्व"},{"en":"North-East","hi":"उत्तर-पूर्व"},{"en":"South-West","hi":"दक्षिण-पश्चिम"},{"en":"North-West","hi":"उत्तर-पश्चिम"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"In which direction does the Sun appear to set?","hi":"सूर्य किस दिशा में अस्त होता दिखाई देता है?","ans":"West","ans_hi":"पश्चिम","options":[{"en":"North-West","hi":"उत्तर-पश्चिम"},{"en":"East","hi":"पूर्व"},{"en":"South-East","hi":"दक्षिण-पूर्व"},{"en":"West","hi":"पश्चिम"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which organ helps us hear?","hi":"सुनने में कौन-सा अंग मदद करता है?","ans":"Ears","ans_hi":"कान","options":[{"en":"Kidneys","hi":"गुर्दे"},{"en":"Small intestine","hi":"छोटी आँत"},{"en":"Heart","hi":"हृदय"},{"en":"Ears","hi":"कान"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which process turns water into ice?","hi":"पानी के बर्फ बनने की प्रक्रिया क्या है?","ans":"Freezing","ans_hi":"जमना","options":[{"en":"Freezing","hi":"जमना"},{"en":"Thunderstorm","hi":"गरज-चमक वाला तूफान"},{"en":"Melting","hi":"पिघलना"},{"en":"Gravity","hi":"गुरुत्वाकर्षण"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What protects the brain inside the head?","hi":"सिर के भीतर मस्तिष्क की रक्षा क्या करता है?","ans":"Skull","ans_hi":"खोपड़ी","options":[{"en":"Lungs","hi":"फेफड़े"},{"en":"Skull","hi":"खोपड़ी"},{"en":"Brain","hi":"मस्तिष्क"},{"en":"Ears","hi":"कान"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which organ filters blood to form urine?","hi":"रक्त छानकर मूत्र कौन-सा अंग बनाता है?","ans":"Kidneys","ans_hi":"गुर्दे","options":[{"en":"Lungs","hi":"फेफड़े"},{"en":"Brain","hi":"मस्तिष्क"},{"en":"Kidneys","hi":"गुर्दे"},{"en":"Heart","hi":"हृदय"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which direction lies between South and East?","hi":"दक्षिण और पूर्व के बीच कौन-सी दिशा है?","ans":"South-East","ans_hi":"दक्षिण-पूर्व","options":[{"en":"South-East","hi":"दक्षिण-पूर्व"},{"en":"North-West","hi":"उत्तर-पश्चिम"},{"en":"South","hi":"दक्षिण"},{"en":"West","hi":"पश्चिम"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which organ pumps blood?","hi":"कौन-सा अंग रक्त पंप करता है?","ans":"Heart","ans_hi":"हृदय","options":[{"en":"Heart","hi":"हृदय"},{"en":"Brain","hi":"मस्तिष्क"},{"en":"Ears","hi":"कान"},{"en":"Eyes","hi":"आँखें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which natural event produces thunder and lightning?","hi":"गर्जन और बिजली किस प्राकृतिक घटना में होते हैं?","ans":"Thunderstorm","ans_hi":"गरज-चमक वाला तूफान","options":[{"en":"Gravity","hi":"गुरुत्वाकर्षण"},{"en":"Sunlight","hi":"सूर्यप्रकाश"},{"en":"Thunderstorm","hi":"गरज-चमक वाला तूफान"},{"en":"Rain gauge","hi":"वर्षामापी"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which organ helps us see?","hi":"देखने में कौन-सा अंग मदद करता है?","ans":"Eyes","ans_hi":"आँखें","options":[{"en":"Lungs","hi":"फेफड़े"},{"en":"Small intestine","hi":"छोटी आँत"},{"en":"Eyes","hi":"आँखें"},{"en":"Heart","hi":"हृदय"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which organ takes in air?","hi":"कौन-सा अंग वायु ग्रहण करता है?","ans":"Lungs","ans_hi":"फेफड़े","options":[{"en":"Eyes","hi":"आँखें"},{"en":"Heart","hi":"हृदय"},{"en":"Lungs","hi":"फेफड़े"},{"en":"Brain","hi":"मस्तिष्क"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What reduces plastic waste during shopping?","hi":"खरीदारी में प्लास्टिक कचरा किससे घटता है?","ans":"Reusable bag","ans_hi":"दोबारा उपयोग होने वाला थैला","options":[{"en":"Reusable bag","hi":"दोबारा उपयोग होने वाला थैला"},{"en":"Trusted adult","hi":"विश्वसनीय वयस्क"},{"en":"Helmet","hi":"हेलमेट"},{"en":"Strong password","hi":"मजबूत पासवर्ड"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 38 trees on Monday and 11 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 38 और मंगलवार को 11 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"49","ans_hi":"49","options":[{"en":"98","hi":"98"},{"en":"50","hi":"50"},{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"49","hi":"49"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 38 paper sheets and reused 5. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 38 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 5 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"33","ans_hi":"33","options":[{"en":"33","hi":"33"},{"en":"31","hi":"31"},{"en":"35","hi":"35"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 6 rows with 5 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 6 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 5 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"30","ans_hi":"30","options":[{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"20 reusable bottles are shared equally among 4 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"20 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 4 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 39 birds on a tree. 7 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 39 पक्षी थे, 7 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"32","ans_hi":"32","options":[{"en":"32","hi":"32"},{"en":"31","hi":"31"},{"en":"41","hi":"41"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 9 pages each day for 8 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 8 दिन तक रोज़ 9 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"72","ans_hi":"72","options":[{"en":"74","hi":"74"},{"en":"70","hi":"70"},{"en":"72","hi":"72"},{"en":"71","hi":"71"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 8 litres of water a day for 4 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 4 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 8 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"32","ans_hi":"32","options":[{"en":"31","hi":"31"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 22 pencils, and 4 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 22 पेंसिल में 4 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"18","ans_hi":"18","options":[{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 30 recyclable items in the morning and 11 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 30 और शाम 11 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"41","ans_hi":"41","options":[{"en":"39","hi":"39"},{"en":"43","hi":"43"},{"en":"41","hi":"41"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 55 seedlings. 12 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 55 पौध थे, 12 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"67","ans_hi":"67","options":[{"en":"67","hi":"67"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"65","hi":"65"},{"en":"134","hi":"134"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"What is good digital citizenship in a class group?","hi":"कक्षा समूह में अच्छा डिजिटल व्यवहार क्या है?","ans":"Use polite language and verify posts","ans_hi":"शिष्ट भाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना","options":[{"en":"Share classmates' secrets","hi":"सहपाठियों की गुप्त बातें भेजना"},{"en":"Post insults","hi":"अपमान करना"},{"en":"Spread false rumours","hi":"झूठी अफवाह फैलाना"},{"en":"Use polite language and verify posts","hi":"शिष्ट भाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A student shares a photo of another child without permission. What is better?","hi":"बिना अनुमति दूसरे बच्चे का फोटो साझा हुआ। क्या उचित है?","ans":"Ask permission before sharing","ans_hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें","options":[{"en":"Ask permission before sharing","hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें"},{"en":"Share more photos","hi":"और फोटो भेजें"},{"en":"Add personal details","hi":"निजी जानकारी जोड़ें"},{"en":"Ignore privacy","hi":"गोपनीयता अनदेखी करें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A confusing chart has no data source. What should you do?","hi":"अस्पष्ट चार्ट पर आँकड़ों का स्रोत न हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask where the data came from","ans_hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए","options":[{"en":"Hide the chart","hi":"चार्ट छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Ask where the data came from","hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए"},{"en":"Change its numbers","hi":"आँकड़े बदल दें"},{"en":"Accept it without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे मानें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A child gets a message that asks for bank details. What is right?","hi":"बैंक जानकारी माँगने वाला संदेश आए तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","ans_hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Take a stranger's advice","hi":"अजनबी की सलाह लें"},{"en":"Share a password","hi":"पासवर्ड दें"},{"en":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Reply with details","hi":"जानकारी भेजें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A friend is left out of a group task. What should you do?","hi":"किसी मित्र को समूह कार्य से बाहर रखा गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Invite them to participate","ans_hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ","options":[{"en":"Hide the task","hi":"कार्य छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Refuse to listen","hi":"बात न सुनें"},{"en":"Invite them to participate","hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ"},{"en":"Make fun of them","hi":"मज़ाक उड़ाएँ"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-3-4-04"},"3|3|5|GK":{"grade":"3","term":3,"year":5,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"How many continents are commonly identified?","hi":"सामान्यतः कितने महाद्वीप माने जाते हैं?","ans":"Seven","ans_hi":"सात","options":[{"en":"Seven","hi":"सात"},{"en":"Africa","hi":"अफ्रीका"},{"en":"South America","hi":"दक्षिण अमेरिका"},{"en":"Europe","hi":"यूरोप"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"continents"},{"en":"How many oceans are commonly recognised?","hi":"सामान्यतः कितने महासागर माने जाते हैं?","ans":"Five","ans_hi":"पाँच","options":[{"en":"Southern Ocean","hi":"दक्षिणी महासागर"},{"en":"Five","hi":"पाँच"},{"en":"Pacific Ocean","hi":"प्रशांत महासागर"},{"en":"Arctic Ocean","hi":"आर्कटिक महासागर"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"oceans"},{"en":"What is the largest ocean on Earth?","hi":"पृथ्वी का सबसे बड़ा महासागर कौन-सा है?","ans":"Pacific Ocean","ans_hi":"प्रशांत महासागर","options":[{"en":"Indian Ocean","hi":"हिंद महासागर"},{"en":"Pacific Ocean","hi":"प्रशांत महासागर"},{"en":"Arctic Ocean","hi":"आर्कटिक महासागर"},{"en":"Atlantic Ocean","hi":"अटलांटिक महासागर"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"oceans"},{"en":"What is the smallest continent by land area?","hi":"क्षेत्रफल की दृष्टि से सबसे छोटा महाद्वीप कौन-सा है?","ans":"Australia","ans_hi":"ऑस्ट्रेलिया","options":[{"en":"Asia","hi":"एशिया"},{"en":"South America","hi":"दक्षिण अमेरिका"},{"en":"Europe","hi":"यूरोप"},{"en":"Australia","hi":"ऑस्ट्रेलिया"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"continents"},{"en":"What causes day and night on Earth?","hi":"पृथ्वी पर दिन और रात किस कारण होते हैं?","ans":"Earth's rotation","ans_hi":"पृथ्वी का घूर्णन","options":[{"en":"Change in cloud cover","hi":"बादलों का बदलना"},{"en":"Earth's axial tilt and revolution","hi":"पृथ्वी का झुकाव एवं परिक्रमण"},{"en":"Earth's rotation","hi":"पृथ्वी का घूर्णन"},{"en":"Earth's revolution","hi":"पृथ्वी की परिक्रमा"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"earth_time"},{"en":"How long does Earth take to rotate once approximately?","hi":"पृथ्वी को एक घूर्णन में लगभग कितना समय लगता है?","ans":"24 hours","ans_hi":"24 घंटे","options":[{"en":"Four","hi":"चार"},{"en":"Ten","hi":"दस"},{"en":"24 hours","hi":"24 घंटे"},{"en":"Twelve","hi":"बारह"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"quantities"},{"en":"What causes the seasons mainly?","hi":"ऋतुएँ मुख्यतः किस कारण बदलती हैं?","ans":"Earth's axial tilt and revolution","ans_hi":"पृथ्वी की धुरी का झुकाव और परिक्रमण","options":[{"en":"Earth's axial tilt and revolution","hi":"पृथ्वी की धुरी का झुकाव और परिक्रमण"},{"en":"Earth's rotation","hi":"पृथ्वी का घूर्णन"},{"en":"Earth's revolution","hi":"पृथ्वी की परिक्रमा"},{"en":"Change in cloud cover","hi":"बादलों का बदलना"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"earth_time"},{"en":"What is Earth's natural satellite?","hi":"पृथ्वी का प्राकृतिक उपग्रह कौन-सा है?","ans":"Moon","ans_hi":"चंद्रमा","options":[{"en":"Mars","hi":"मंगल"},{"en":"Moon","hi":"चंद्रमा"},{"en":"Venus","hi":"शुक्र"},{"en":"Sun","hi":"सूर्य"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"Which planet is closest to the Sun?","hi":"सूर्य के सबसे निकट कौन-सा ग्रह है?","ans":"Mercury","ans_hi":"बुध","options":[{"en":"Earth","hi":"पृथ्वी"},{"en":"Neptune","hi":"वरुण"},{"en":"Mercury","hi":"बुध"},{"en":"Jupiter","hi":"बृहस्पति"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"planets"},{"en":"Which planet is known as the Red Planet?","hi":"लाल ग्रह किसे कहा जाता है?","ans":"Mars","ans_hi":"मंगल","options":[{"en":"Mars","hi":"मंगल"},{"en":"Venus","hi":"शुक्र"},{"en":"Saturn","hi":"शनि"},{"en":"Mercury","hi":"बुध"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"planets"},{"en":"Which is the largest planet in our solar system?","hi":"हमारे सौरमंडल का सबसे बड़ा ग्रह कौन-सा है?","ans":"Jupiter","ans_hi":"बृहस्पति","options":[{"en":"Uranus","hi":"अरुण"},{"en":"Neptune","hi":"वरुण"},{"en":"Earth","hi":"पृथ्वी"},{"en":"Jupiter","hi":"बृहस्पति"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"planets"},{"en":"Which star is at the centre of our solar system?","hi":"हमारे सौरमंडल के केंद्र में कौन-सा तारा है?","ans":"Sun","ans_hi":"सूर्य","options":[{"en":"Mars","hi":"मंगल"},{"en":"Sun","hi":"सूर्य"},{"en":"Venus","hi":"शुक्र"},{"en":"Moon","hi":"चंद्रमा"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What instrument is used to measure temperature?","hi":"तापमान मापने के लिए कौन-सा यंत्र प्रयोग होता है?","ans":"Thermometer","ans_hi":"तापमापी","options":[{"en":"Thermometer","hi":"तापमापी"},{"en":"Compass","hi":"दिशासूचक"},{"en":"Rain gauge","hi":"वर्षामापी"},{"en":"Speedometer","hi":"गतिमापी"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"instruments"},{"en":"What do we call water vapour changing into tiny water drops?","hi":"जलवाष्प का पानी की छोटी बूँदों में बदलना क्या कहलाता है?","ans":"Condensation","ans_hi":"संघनन","options":[{"en":"Condensation","hi":"संघनन"},{"en":"Evaporation","hi":"वाष्पीकरण"},{"en":"Transpiration","hi":"वाष्पोत्सर्जन"},{"en":"Fermentation","hi":"किण्वन"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"processes"},{"en":"What is a renewable energy source?","hi":"नवीकरणीय ऊर्जा स्रोत का एक उदाहरण क्या है?","ans":"Solar energy","ans_hi":"सौर ऊर्जा","options":[{"en":"Wind energy","hi":"पवन ऊर्जा"},{"en":"Solar energy","hi":"सौर ऊर्जा"},{"en":"Natural gas","hi":"प्राकृतिक गैस"},{"en":"Coal","hi":"कोयला"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"energy"},{"en":"Which material is attracted strongly by a magnet?","hi":"चुंबक किस पदार्थ को प्रबलता से आकर्षित करता है?","ans":"Iron","ans_hi":"लोहा","options":[{"en":"Protein","hi":"प्रोटीन"},{"en":"Fat","hi":"वसा"},{"en":"Fibre","hi":"रेशा"},{"en":"Iron","hi":"लोहा"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"food"},{"en":"What is the solid state of water?","hi":"पानी की ठोस अवस्था क्या कहलाती है?","ans":"Ice","ans_hi":"बर्फ","options":[{"en":"Ice","hi":"बर्फ"},{"en":"Steam","hi":"भाप"},{"en":"Mist","hi":"धुंध"},{"en":"Vapour","hi":"वाष्प"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"Which planet has a moon called Titan?","hi":"किस ग्रह का एक उपग्रह टाइटन है?","ans":"Saturn","ans_hi":"शनि","options":[{"en":"Venus","hi":"शुक्र"},{"en":"Mercury","hi":"बुध"},{"en":"Saturn","hi":"शनि"},{"en":"Uranus","hi":"अरुण"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"planets"},{"en":"What is the name for the path Earth takes around the Sun?","hi":"सूर्य के चारों ओर पृथ्वी के पथ को क्या कहते हैं?","ans":"Orbit","ans_hi":"कक्षा","options":[{"en":"Rotation","hi":"घूर्णन"},{"en":"Axis","hi":"अक्ष"},{"en":"Orbit","hi":"कक्षा"},{"en":"Equator","hi":"भूमध्य रेखा"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"Which force pulls objects toward Earth?","hi":"वस्तुओं को पृथ्वी की ओर खींचने वाला बल क्या है?","ans":"Gravity","ans_hi":"गुरुत्वाकर्षण","options":[{"en":"Magnetism","hi":"चुंबकत्व"},{"en":"Friction","hi":"घर्षण"},{"en":"Gravity","hi":"गुरुत्वाकर्षण"},{"en":"Buoyancy","hi":"उत्प्लावन"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"Which organ takes in air?","hi":"कौन-सा अंग वायु ग्रहण करता है?","ans":"Lungs","ans_hi":"फेफड़े","options":[{"en":"Lungs","hi":"फेफड़े"},{"en":"Ears","hi":"कान"},{"en":"Eyes","hi":"आँखें"},{"en":"Skull","hi":"खोपड़ी"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What should we verify before sharing news?","hi":"खबर साझा करने से पहले क्या जाँचना चाहिए?","ans":"Source","ans_hi":"स्रोत","options":[{"en":"Trusted adult","hi":"विश्वसनीय वयस्क"},{"en":"Strong password","hi":"मजबूत पासवर्ड"},{"en":"Source","hi":"स्रोत"},{"en":"Misinformation","hi":"भ्रामक सूचना"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"In which direction does the Sun appear to rise?","hi":"सूर्य किस दिशा में उगता हुआ दिखाई देता है?","ans":"East","ans_hi":"पूर्व","options":[{"en":"East","hi":"पूर्व"},{"en":"North-East","hi":"उत्तर-पूर्व"},{"en":"South-West","hi":"दक्षिण-पश्चिम"},{"en":"West","hi":"पश्चिम"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which direction lies between South and West?","hi":"दक्षिण और पश्चिम के बीच कौन-सी दिशा है?","ans":"South-West","ans_hi":"दक्षिण-पश्चिम","options":[{"en":"East","hi":"पूर्व"},{"en":"South-East","hi":"दक्षिण-पूर्व"},{"en":"South","hi":"दक्षिण"},{"en":"South-West","hi":"दक्षिण-पश्चिम"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which device measures rainfall?","hi":"वर्षा की मात्रा कौन-सा यंत्र मापता है?","ans":"Rain gauge","ans_hi":"वर्षामापी","options":[{"en":"Thunderstorm","hi":"गरज-चमक वाला तूफान"},{"en":"Rain gauge","hi":"वर्षामापी"},{"en":"Gravity","hi":"गुरुत्वाकर्षण"},{"en":"Evaporation","hi":"वाष्पीकरण"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which organ helps us hear?","hi":"सुनने में कौन-सा अंग मदद करता है?","ans":"Ears","ans_hi":"कान","options":[{"en":"Skull","hi":"खोपड़ी"},{"en":"Ears","hi":"कान"},{"en":"Eyes","hi":"आँखें"},{"en":"Heart","hi":"हृदय"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which natural event produces thunder and lightning?","hi":"गर्जन और बिजली किस प्राकृतिक घटना में होते हैं?","ans":"Thunderstorm","ans_hi":"गरज-चमक वाला तूफान","options":[{"en":"Sunlight","hi":"सूर्यप्रकाश"},{"en":"Condensation","hi":"संघनन"},{"en":"Gravity","hi":"गुरुत्वाकर्षण"},{"en":"Thunderstorm","hi":"गरज-चमक वाला तूफान"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which organ controls thinking?","hi":"सोचने का नियंत्रण कौन-सा अंग करता है?","ans":"Brain","ans_hi":"मस्तिष्क","options":[{"en":"Kidneys","hi":"गुर्दे"},{"en":"Heart","hi":"हृदय"},{"en":"Skull","hi":"खोपड़ी"},{"en":"Brain","hi":"मस्तिष्क"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which organ digests much of our food?","hi":"भोजन के अधिकांश पाचन में कौन-सा अंग महत्वपूर्ण है?","ans":"Small intestine","ans_hi":"छोटी आँत","options":[{"en":"Lungs","hi":"फेफड़े"},{"en":"Kidneys","hi":"गुर्दे"},{"en":"Eyes","hi":"आँखें"},{"en":"Small intestine","hi":"छोटी आँत"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which organ pumps blood?","hi":"कौन-सा अंग रक्त पंप करता है?","ans":"Heart","ans_hi":"हृदय","options":[{"en":"Heart","hi":"हृदय"},{"en":"Eyes","hi":"आँखें"},{"en":"Brain","hi":"मस्तिष्क"},{"en":"Skull","hi":"खोपड़ी"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"In which direction does the Sun appear to set?","hi":"सूर्य किस दिशा में अस्त होता दिखाई देता है?","ans":"West","ans_hi":"पश्चिम","options":[{"en":"North-West","hi":"उत्तर-पश्चिम"},{"en":"West","hi":"पश्चिम"},{"en":"North-East","hi":"उत्तर-पूर्व"},{"en":"South","hi":"दक्षिण"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which process causes rainwater to move downhill?","hi":"वर्षा का पानी ढलान पर किस कारण बहता है?","ans":"Gravity","ans_hi":"गुरुत्वाकर्षण","options":[{"en":"Evaporation","hi":"वाष्पीकरण"},{"en":"Freezing","hi":"जमना"},{"en":"Sunlight","hi":"सूर्यप्रकाश"},{"en":"Gravity","hi":"गुरुत्वाकर्षण"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which process turns ice into water?","hi":"बर्फ के जल बनने की प्रक्रिया क्या है?","ans":"Melting","ans_hi":"पिघलना","options":[{"en":"Thunderstorm","hi":"गरज-चमक वाला तूफान"},{"en":"Melting","hi":"पिघलना"},{"en":"Rain gauge","hi":"वर्षामापी"},{"en":"Evaporation","hi":"वाष्पीकरण"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which direction is opposite to North?","hi":"उत्तर के विपरीत कौन-सी दिशा है?","ans":"South","ans_hi":"दक्षिण","options":[{"en":"South-East","hi":"दक्षिण-पूर्व"},{"en":"East","hi":"पूर्व"},{"en":"South","hi":"दक्षिण"},{"en":"West","hi":"पश्चिम"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which process turns water to vapour?","hi":"जल के वाष्प बनने की प्रक्रिया क्या है?","ans":"Evaporation","ans_hi":"वाष्पीकरण","options":[{"en":"Freezing","hi":"जमना"},{"en":"Evaporation","hi":"वाष्पीकरण"},{"en":"Melting","hi":"पिघलना"},{"en":"Condensation","hi":"संघनन"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 34 trees on Monday and 11 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 34 और मंगलवार को 11 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"45","ans_hi":"45","options":[{"en":"44","hi":"44"},{"en":"43","hi":"43"},{"en":"90","hi":"90"},{"en":"45","hi":"45"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 18 paper sheets and reused 4. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 18 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 4 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"14","ans_hi":"14","options":[{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 6 rows with 5 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 6 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 5 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"30","ans_hi":"30","options":[{"en":"60","hi":"60"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"28 reusable bottles are shared equally among 4 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"28 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 4 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"7","ans_hi":"7","options":[{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 24 birds on a tree. 14 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 24 पक्षी थे, 14 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"10","ans_hi":"10","options":[{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 11 pages each day for 5 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 5 दिन तक रोज़ 11 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"55","ans_hi":"55","options":[{"en":"55","hi":"55"},{"en":"57","hi":"57"},{"en":"53","hi":"53"},{"en":"54","hi":"54"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 7 litres of water a day for 4 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 4 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 7 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 28 pencils, and 11 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 28 पेंसिल में 11 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"17","ans_hi":"17","options":[{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 44 recyclable items in the morning and 7 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 44 और शाम 7 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"51","ans_hi":"51","options":[{"en":"51","hi":"51"},{"en":"50","hi":"50"},{"en":"102","hi":"102"},{"en":"58","hi":"58"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 26 seedlings. 13 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 26 पौध थे, 13 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"39","ans_hi":"39","options":[{"en":"54","hi":"54"},{"en":"38","hi":"38"},{"en":"39","hi":"39"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A rainwater tank is overflowing. What is a sensible response?","hi":"वर्षाजल की टंकी से पानी बह रहा हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","ans_hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ","options":[{"en":"Ignore for weeks","hi":"हफ्तों अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Break the pipe","hi":"पाइप तोड़ दें"},{"en":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ"},{"en":"Contaminate the water","hi":"पानी गंदा करें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A student shares a photo of another child without permission. What is better?","hi":"बिना अनुमति दूसरे बच्चे का फोटो साझा हुआ। क्या उचित है?","ans":"Ask permission before sharing","ans_hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें","options":[{"en":"Ignore privacy","hi":"गोपनीयता अनदेखी करें"},{"en":"Add personal details","hi":"निजी जानकारी जोड़ें"},{"en":"Ask permission before sharing","hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें"},{"en":"Share more photos","hi":"और फोटो भेजें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The school garden soil dries quickly. Which practice helps?","hi":"विद्यालय बगीचे की मिट्टी जल्दी सूखती है। क्या मदद करता है?","ans":"Water carefully near plant roots","ans_hi":"पौधों की जड़ों के पास सावधानी से पानी दें","options":[{"en":"Break the plants","hi":"पौधे तोड़ें"},{"en":"Remove all soil","hi":"पूरी मिट्टी हटा दें"},{"en":"Water carefully near plant roots","hi":"पौधों की जड़ों के पास सावधानी से पानी दें"},{"en":"Waste water on paths","hi":"पगडंडी पर पानी बहाएँ"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A friend is left out of a group task. What should you do?","hi":"किसी मित्र को समूह कार्य से बाहर रखा गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Invite them to participate","ans_hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ","options":[{"en":"Hide the task","hi":"कार्य छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Invite them to participate","hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ"},{"en":"Refuse to listen","hi":"बात न सुनें"},{"en":"Make fun of them","hi":"मज़ाक उड़ाएँ"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A child gets a message that asks for bank details. What is right?","hi":"बैंक जानकारी माँगने वाला संदेश आए तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","ans_hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Share a password","hi":"पासवर्ड दें"},{"en":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Take a stranger's advice","hi":"अजनबी की सलाह लें"},{"en":"Reply with details","hi":"जानकारी भेजें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-3-4-05"},"3|3|6|GK":{"grade":"3","term":3,"year":6,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"How many continents are commonly identified?","hi":"सामान्यतः कितने महाद्वीप माने जाते हैं?","ans":"Seven","ans_hi":"सात","options":[{"en"