 कितने फूल?","ans":"36","ans_hi":"36","options":[{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"38","hi":"38"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"37","hi":"37"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"50 reusable bottles are shared equally among 5 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"50 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 5 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"10","ans_hi":"10","options":[{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 35 birds on a tree. 15 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 35 पक्षी थे, 15 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"20","ans_hi":"20","options":[{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"37","hi":"37"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 10 pages each day for 4 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 4 दिन तक रोज़ 10 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"40","ans_hi":"40","options":[{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"39","hi":"39"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"80","hi":"80"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 5 litres of water a day for 4 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 4 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 5 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"20","ans_hi":"20","options":[{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 21 pencils, and 16 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 21 पेंसिल में 16 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustaina