on?","hi":"ऑनलाइन गलत सूचना क्या कहलाती है?","ans":"Misinformation","ans_hi":"भ्रामक सूचना","options":[{"en":"Misinformation","hi":"भ्रामक सूचना"},{"en":"Strong password","hi":"मजबूत पासवर्ड"},{"en":"Soap","hi":"साबुन"},{"en":"Source","hi":"स्रोत"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which direction lies between North and West?","hi":"उत्तर और पश्चिम के बीच कौन-सी दिशा है?","ans":"North-West","ans_hi":"उत्तर-पश्चिम","options":[{"en":"South-East","hi":"दक्षिण-पूर्व"},{"en":"North-West","hi":"उत्तर-पश्चिम"},{"en":"South-West","hi":"दक्षिण-पश्चिम"},{"en":"West","hi":"पश्चिम"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"In which direction does the Sun appear to set?","hi":"सूर्य किस दिशा में अस्त होता दिखाई देता है?","ans":"West","ans_hi":"पश्चिम","options":[{"en":"East","hi":"पूर्व"},{"en":"West","hi":"पश्चिम"},{"en":"South-West","hi":"दक्षिण-पश्चिम"},{"en":"North-West","hi":"उत्तर-पश्चिम"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 30 trees on Monday and 13 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 30 और मंगलवार को 13 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"43","ans_hi":"43","options":[{"en":"86","hi":"86"},{"en":"43","hi":"43"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"44","hi":"44"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 45 paper sheets and reused 13. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 45 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 13 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"32","ans_hi":"32","options":[{"en":"33","hi":"33"},{"en":"31","hi":"31"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"},{"en":"64","hi":"64"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 12 rows with 8 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 12 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 8 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"96","ans_hi":"96","options":[{"en":"95","hi":"95"},{"en":"94","hi":"94"},{"en":"106","hi":"106"},{"en":"96","hi":"96"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"36 reusable bottles are shared equally among 4 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"36 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 4 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 39 birds on a tree. 4 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 39 पक्षी थे, 4 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"35","ans_hi":"35","options":[{"en":"37","hi":"37"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"41","hi":"41"},{"en":"35","hi":"35"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 5 pages each day for 4 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 4 दिन तक रोज़ 5 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"20","ans_hi":"20","options":[{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 5 litres of water a day for 4 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 4 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 5 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"20","ans_hi":"20","options":[{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 32 pencils, and 9 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 32 पेंसिल में 9 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"23","ans_hi":"23","options":[{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"},{"en":"46","hi":"46"},{"en":"23","hi":"23"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 25 recyclable items in the morning and 8 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 25 और शाम 8 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"33","ans_hi":"33","options":[{"en":"31","hi":"31"},{"en":"33","hi":"33"},{"en":"43","hi":"43"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 39 seedlings. 4 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 39 पौध थे, 4 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"43","ans_hi":"43","options":[{"en":"47","hi":"47"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"41","hi":"41"},{"en":"43","hi":"43"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"What is good digital citizenship in a class group?","hi":"कक्षा समूह में अच्छा डिजिटल व्यवहार क्या है?","ans":"Use polite language and verify posts","ans_hi":"शिष्ट भाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना","options":[{"en":"Post insults","hi":"अपमान करना"},{"en":"Spread false rumours","hi":"झूठी अफवाह फैलाना"},{"en":"Use polite language and verify posts","hi":"शिष्ट भाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना"},{"en":"Share classmates' secrets","hi":"सहपाठियों की गुप्त बातें भेजना"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A child gets a message that asks for bank details. What is right?","hi":"बैंक जानकारी माँगने वाला संदेश आए तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","ans_hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Take a stranger's advice","hi":"अजनबी की सलाह लें"},{"en":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Reply with details","hi":"जानकारी भेजें"},{"en":"Share a password","hi":"पासवर्ड दें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Students notice an injured bird. What is safe?","hi":"विद्यार्थियों को घायल पक्षी दिखे। सुरक्षित कदम क्या है?","ans":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","ans_hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Chase it away","hi":"भगाएँ"},{"en":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ"},{"en":"Throw stones","hi":"पत्थर मारें"},{"en":"Pull its wings","hi":"पंख खींचें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A rainwater tank is overflowing. What is a sensible response?","hi":"वर्षाजल की टंकी से पानी बह रहा हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","ans_hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ","options":[{"en":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ"},{"en":"Ignore for weeks","hi":"हफ्तों अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Contaminate the water","hi":"पानी गंदा करें"},{"en":"Break the pipe","hi":"पाइप तोड़ दें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A viral message says school is closed, but no notice is issued. What should you do?","hi":"वायरल संदेश कहे स्कूल बंद है, पर सूचना न हो, तो क्या करें?","ans":"Check the official school notice","ans_hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें","options":[{"en":"Delete official updates","hi":"आधिकारिक सूचना हटाएँ"},{"en":"Send it to everyone","hi":"सबको भेजें"},{"en":"Check the official school notice","hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें"},{"en":"Assume it is true","hi":"उसे सच मान लें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-3-4-07"},"3|3|8|GK":{"grade":"3","term":3,"year":8,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"How many continents are commonly identified?","hi":"सामान्यतः कितने महाद्वीप माने जाते हैं?","ans":"Seven","ans_hi":"सात","options":[{"en":"North America","hi":"उत्तरी अमेरिका"},{"en":"Seven","hi":"सात"},{"en":"Eur