","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"continents"},{"en":"How many oceans are commonly recognised?","hi":"सामान्यतः कितने महासागर माने जाते हैं?","ans":"Five","ans_hi":"पाँच","options":[{"en":"Arctic Ocean","hi":"आर्कटिक महासागर"},{"en":"Atlantic Ocean","hi":"अटलांटिक महासागर"},{"en":"Five","hi":"पाँच"},{"en":"Pacific Ocean","hi":"प्रशांत महासागर"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"oceans"},{"en":"What is the largest ocean on Earth?","hi":"पृथ्वी का सबसे बड़ा महासागर कौन-सा है?","ans":"Pacific Ocean","ans_hi":"प्रशांत महासागर","options":[{"en":"Pacific Ocean","hi":"प्रशांत महासागर"},{"en":"Arctic Ocean","hi":"आर्कटिक महासागर"},{"en":"Indian Ocean","hi":"हिंद महासागर"},{"en":"Atlantic Ocean","hi":"अटलांटिक महासागर"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"oceans"},{"en":"What is the smallest continent by land area?","hi":"क्षेत्रफल की दृष्टि से सबसे छोटा महाद्वीप कौन-सा है?","ans":"Australia","ans_hi":"ऑस्ट्रेलिया","options":[{"en":"South America","hi":"दक्षिण अमेरिका"},{"en":"Antarctica","hi":"अंटार्कटिका"},{"en":"Australia","hi":"ऑस्ट्रेलिया"},{"en":"Europe","hi":"यूरोप"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"continents"},{"en":"What causes day and night on Earth?","hi":"पृथ्वी पर दिन और रात किस कारण होते हैं?","ans":"Earth's rotation","ans_hi":"पृथ्वी का घूर्णन","options":[{"en":"Moon's rotation","hi":"चंद्रमा का घूर्णन"},{"en":"Change in cloud cover","hi":"बादलों का बदलना"},{"en":"Earth's revolution","hi":"पृथ्वी की परिक्रमा"},{"en":"Earth's rotation","hi":"पृथ्वी का घूर्णन"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"earth_time"},{"en":"How long does Earth take to rotate once approximately?","hi":"पृथ्वी को एक घूर्णन में लगभग कितना समय लगता है?","ans":"24 hours","ans_hi":"24 घंटे","options":[{"en":"24 hours","hi":"24 घंटे"},{"en":"Six","hi":"छह"},{"en":"Ten","hi":"दस"},{"en":"Four","hi":"चार"}