re are 61 birds on a tree. 11 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 61 पक्षी थे, 11 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"50","ans_hi":"50","options":[{"en":"63","hi":"63"},{"en":"51","hi":"51"},{"en":"50","hi":"50"},{"en":"49","hi":"49"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 12 pages each day for 7 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 7 दिन तक रोज़ 12 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"84","ans_hi":"84","options":[{"en":"82","hi":"82"},{"en":"85","hi":"85"},{"en":"84","hi":"84"},{"en":"168","hi":"168"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 8 litres of water a day for 6 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 6 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 8 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"48","ans_hi":"48","options":[{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"47","hi":"47"},{"en":"46","hi":"46"},{"en":"50","hi":"50"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 68 pencils, and 7 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 68 पेंसिल में 7 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"61","ans_hi":"61","options":[{"en":"59","hi":"59"},{"en":"61","hi":"61"},{"en":"68","hi":"68"},{"en":"60","hi":"60"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 55 recyclable items in the morning and 4 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 55 और शाम 4 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"59","ans_hi":"59","options":[{"en":"65","hi":"65"},{"en":"118","hi":"118"},{"en":"63","hi":"63"},{"en":"59","hi":"59"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 61 seedlings. 5 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 61 पौध थे, 5 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"66","ans_hi":"66","options":[{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"64","hi":"64"},{"