eve the first website","hi":"पहली वेबसाइट पर भरोसा करें"},{"en":"Compare reliable sources","hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोतों की तुलना करें"},{"en":"Ignore dates and authors","hi":"तारीख और लेखक अनदेखे करें"},{"en":"Use only rumours","hi":"केवल अफवाह सुनें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Students notice an injured bird. What is safe?","hi":"विद्यार्थियों को घायल पक्षी दिखे। सुरक्षित कदम क्या है?","ans":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","ans_hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ"},{"en":"Chase it away","hi":"भगाएँ"},{"en":"Throw stones","hi":"पत्थर मारें"},{"en":"Pull its wings","hi":"पंख खींचें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A child gets a message that asks for bank details. What is right?","hi":"बैंक जानकारी माँगने वाला संदेश आए तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","ans_hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Take a stranger's advice","hi":"अजनबी की सलाह लें"},{"en":"Reply with details","hi":"जानकारी भेजें"},{"en":"Share a password","hi":"पासवर्ड दें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A confusing chart has no data source. What should you do?","hi":"अस्पष्ट चार्ट पर आँकड़ों का स्रोत न हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask where the data came from","ans_hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए","options":[{"en":"Ask where the data came from","hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए"},{"en":"Accept it without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे मानें"},{"en":"Change its numbers","hi":"आँकड़े बदल दें"},{"en":"Hide the chart","hi":"चार्ट छिपाएँ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"What is good digital citizenship in a class group?","hi":"कक्षा समूह म