,"hi":"57"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 11 rows with 7 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 11 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 7 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"77","ans_hi":"77","options":[{"en":"75","hi":"75"},{"en":"84","hi":"84"},{"en":"76","hi":"76"},{"en":"77","hi":"77"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"30 reusable bottles are shared equally among 6 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"30 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 6 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 46 birds on a tree. 7 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 46 पक्षी थे, 7 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"39","ans_hi":"39","options":[{"en":"41","hi":"41"},{"en":"39","hi":"39"},{"en":"38","hi":"38"},{"en":"46","hi":"46"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 11 pages each day for 4 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 4 दिन तक रोज़ 11 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"44","ans_hi":"44","options":[{"en":"44","hi":"44"},{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"88","hi":"88"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 5 litres of water a day for 5 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 5 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 5 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"25","ans_hi":"25","options":[{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"50","hi":"50"},{"en":"25","hi":"25"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 43 pencils, and 13 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 43 पेंसिल में 13 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"30","ans_hi":"30","options":[{"en":"43","hi":"43"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"},{"en":"31","hi":"31"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 51 recyclable items in the morning and 6 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 51 और शाम 6 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"57","ans_hi":"57","options":[{"en":"57","hi":"57"},{"en":"59","hi":"59"},{"en":"56","hi":"56"},{"en":"65","hi":"65"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 59 seedlings. 13 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 59 पौध थे, 13 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"72","ans_hi":"72","options":[{"en":"85","hi":"85"},{"en":"72","hi":"72"},{"en":"144","hi":"144"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"Students notice an injured bird. What is safe?","hi":"विद्यार्थियों को घायल पक्षी दिखे। सुरक्षित कदम क्या है?","ans":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","ans_hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ"},{"en":"Pull its wings","hi":"पंख खींचें"},{"en":"Throw stones","hi":"पत्थर मारें"},{"en":"Chase it away","hi":"भगाएँ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A child gets a message that asks for bank details. What is right?","hi":"बैंक जानकारी माँगने वाला संदेश आए तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","ans_hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Share a password","hi":"पासवर्ड दें"},{"en":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Take a stranger's advice","hi":"अजनबी की सलाह लें"},{"en":"Reply with details","hi":"जानकारी भेजें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Which choice reduces plastic waste on a picnic?","hi":"पिकनिक में प्लास्टिक कचरा कैसे घटेगा?","ans":"Carry a reusable water bottle","ans_hi":"दोबारा भरी जा सकने वाली बोतल रखें","options":[{"en":"Use many single-use cups","hi":"कई डिस्पोज़ेबल कप लें"},{"en":"Buy extra plastic bags","hi":"अधिक प्लास्टिक थैलियाँ लें"},{"en":"Throw wrappers in nature","hi":"रैपर प्रकृति में फेंकें"},{"en":"Carry a reusable water bottle","hi":"दोबारा भरी जा सकने वाली बोतल रखें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The science club wants to save energy. What should it do?","hi":"विज्ञान क्लब ऊर्जा बचाना चाहता है। क्या करे?","ans":"Switch off unused electrical devices","ans_hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे","options":[{"en":"Keep lights on all day","hi":"दिनभर लाइट जलाए"},{"en":"Run fans in empty rooms","hi":"खाली कमरों में पंखे चलाए"},{"en":"Waste batteries","hi":"बैटरियाँ फेंके"},{"en":"Switch off unused electrical devices","hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A confusing chart has no data source. What should you do?","hi":"अस्पष्ट चार्ट पर आँकड़ों का स्रोत न हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask where the data came from","ans_hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए","options":[{"en":"Change its numbers","hi":"आँकड़े बदल दें"},{"en":"Ask where the data came from","hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए"},{"en":"Accept it without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे मानें"},{"en":"Hide the chart","hi":"चार्ट छिपाएँ"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A student shares a photo of another child without permission. What is better?","hi":"बिना अनुमति दूसरे बच्चे का फोटो साझा हुआ। क्या उचित है?","ans":"Ask permission before sharing","ans_hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें","options":[{"en":"Ignore privacy","hi":"गोपनीयता