core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"gases"},{"en":"What do we call the body's network of bones?","hi":"शरीर की हड्डियों के ढाँचे को क्या कहते हैं?","ans":"Skeleton","ans_hi":"कंकाल","options":[{"en":"Respiratory system","hi":"श्वसन तंत्र"},{"en":"Nervous system","hi":"तंत्रिका तंत्र"},{"en":"Digestive system","hi":"पाचन तंत्र"},{"en":"Skeleton","hi":"कंकाल"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What do we call joints between bones?","hi":"दो हड्डियों के मिलने के स्थान को क्या कहते हैं?","ans":"Joints","ans_hi":"संधियाँ","options":[{"en":"Nerves","hi":"तंत्रिकाएँ"},{"en":"Joints","hi":"संधियाँ"},{"en":"Veins","hi":"शिराएँ"},{"en":"Muscles","hi":"मांसपेशियाँ"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What helps protect the brain inside the head?","hi":"सिर के भीतर मस्तिष्क की रक्षा क्या करता है?","ans":"Skull","ans_hi":"खोपड़ी","options":[{"en":"Skull","hi":"खोपड़ी"},{"en":"Stomach","hi":"आमाशय"},{"en":"Pancreas","hi":"अग्न्याशय"},{"en":"Liver","hi":"यकृत"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"Which part of a flower attracts many pollinators through colour?","hi":"फूल का कौन-सा भाग रंग से परागणकर्ताओं को आकर्षित करता है?","ans":"Petals","ans_hi":"पंखुड़ियाँ","options":[{"en":"Phloem","hi":"फ्लोएम"},{"en":"Petals","hi":"पंखुड़ियाँ"},{"en":"Xylem","hi":"जाइलम"},{"en":"Stem","hi":"तना"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"plantparts"},{"en":"Which planet is famous for its Great Red Spot?","hi":"कौन-सा ग्रह ग्रेट रेड स्पॉट के लिए प्रसिद्ध है?","ans":"Jupiter","ans_hi":"बृहस्पति","options":[{"en":"Saturn","hi":"शनि"},{"en":"Jupiter","hi":"बृहस्पति"},{"en":"Neptune","hi":"वरुण"},{"en":"Uranus","hi":"अरुण"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"planets"},{"en":"Which river is associated with th