tice is issued. What should you do?","hi":"वायरल संदेश कहे स्कूल बंद है, पर सूचना न हो, तो क्या करें?","ans":"Check the official school notice","ans_hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें","options":[{"en":"Send it to everyone","hi":"सबको भेजें"},{"en":"Assume it is true","hi":"उसे सच मान लें"},{"en":"Check the official school notice","hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें"},{"en":"Delete official updates","hi":"आधिकारिक सूचना हटाएँ"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The science club wants to save energy. What should it do?","hi":"विज्ञान क्लब ऊर्जा बचाना चाहता है। क्या करे?","ans":"Switch off unused electrical devices","ans_hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे","options":[{"en":"Keep lights on all day","hi":"दिनभर लाइट जलाए"},{"en":"Run fans in empty rooms","hi":"खाली कमरों में पंखे चलाए"},{"en":"Switch off unused electrical devices","hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे"},{"en":"Waste batteries","hi":"बैटरियाँ फेंके"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"How should students check an unusual online fact?","hi":"अजीब ऑनलाइन तथ्य की जाँच कैसे करें?","ans":"Compare reliable sources","ans_hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोतों की तुलना करें","options":[{"en":"Believe the first website","hi":"पहली वेबसाइट पर भरोसा करें"},{"en":"Ignore dates and authors","hi":"तारीख और लेखक अनदेखे करें"},{"en":"Use only rumours","hi":"केवल अफवाह सुनें"},{"en":"Compare reliable sources","hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोतों की तुलना करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A student shares a photo of another child without permission. What is better?","hi":"बिना अनुमति दूसरे बच्चे का फोटो साझा हुआ। क्या उचित है?","ans":"Ask permission before sharing","ans_hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें","options":[{"en":"Ignore privacy","hi":"गोपनीयता अनदेखी करें"},{"en":"Add personal details","hi":"निजी जानकारी जोड़ें"},{"en":"Ask permission before sharing","hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें"},{"en":"Share more photos","hi":"और फोटो भेजें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A friend is left out of a group task. What should you do?","hi":"किसी मित्र को समूह कार्य से बाहर रखा गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Invite them to participate","ans_hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ","options":[{"en":"Make fun of them","hi":"मज़ाक उड़ाएँ"},{"en":"Hide the task","hi":"कार्य छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Invite them to participate","hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ"},{"en":"Refuse to listen","hi":"बात न सुनें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A confusing chart has no data source. What should you do?","hi":"अस्पष्ट चार्ट पर आँकड़ों का स्रोत न हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask where the data came from","ans_hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए","options":[{"en":"Ask where the data came from","hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए"},{"en":"Accept it without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे मानें"},{"en":"Change its numbers","hi":"आँकड़े बदल दें"},{"en":"Hide the chart","hi":"चार्ट छिपाएँ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Students notice an injured bird. What is safe?","hi":"विद्यार्थियों को घायल पक्षी दिखे। सुरक्षित कदम क्या है?","ans":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","ans_hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Chase it away","hi":"भगाएँ"},{"en":"Pull its wings","hi":"पंख खींचें"},{"en":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ"},{"en":"Throw stones","hi":"पत्थर मारें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Which choice reduces plastic waste on a picnic?","hi":"पिकनिक में प्लास्टिक कचरा कैसे घटेगा?","ans":"Carry a reusable water bottle","ans_hi":"दोबारा भरी जा सकने वाली बोतल रखें","options":[{"en":"Throw wrappers in nature","hi":"रैपर प्रकृति में फेंकें"},{"en":"Use many single-use cups","hi":"कई डिस्पोज़ेबल कप लें"},{"en":"Carry a reusable water bottle","hi":"दोबारा भरी जा सकने वाली बोतल रखें"},{"en":"Buy extra plastic bags","hi":"अधिक प्लास्टिक थैलियाँ लें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-4-1-05"},"4|0|6|GK":{"grade":"4","term":0,"year":6,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"Which gas do humans breathe out in greater proportion than breathed in?","hi":"मानव श्वास छोड़ते समय किस गैस का अनुपात बढ़ जाता है?","ans":"Carbon dioxide","ans_hi":"कार्बन डाइऑक्साइड","options":[{"en":"Nitrogen","hi":"नाइट्रोजन"},{"en":"Helium","hi":"हीलियम"},{"en":"Carbon dioxide","hi":"कार्बन डाइऑक्साइड"},{"en":"Oxygen","hi":"ऑक्सीजन"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"gases"},{"en":"What do we call the body's network of bones?","hi":"शरीर की हड्डियों के ढाँचे को क्या कहते हैं?","ans":"Skeleton","ans_hi":"कंकाल","options":[{"en":"Digestive system","hi":"पाचन तंत्र"},{"en":"Respiratory system","hi":"श्वसन तंत्र"},{"en":"Skeleton","hi":"कंकाल"},{"en":"Nervous system","hi":"तंत्रिका तंत्र"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What do we call joints between bones?","hi":"दो हड्डियों के मिलने के स्थान को क्या कहते हैं?","ans":"Joints","ans_hi":"संधियाँ","options":[{"en":"Nerves","hi":"तंत्रिकाएँ"},{"en":"Muscles","hi":"मांसपेशियाँ"},{"en":"Joints","hi":"संधियाँ"},{"en":"Veins","hi":"शिराएँ"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What helps protect the brain inside the head?","hi":"सिर के भीतर मस्तिष्क की रक्षा क्या करता है?","ans":"Skull","ans_hi":"खोपड़ी","options":[{"en":"Kidneys","hi":"गुर्दे"},{"en":"Skull","hi":"खोपड़ी"},{"en":"Pancreas","hi":"अग्न्याशय"},{"en":"Stomach","hi":"आमाशय"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","top