Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 56 trees on Monday and 15 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 56 और मंगलवार को 15 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"71","ans_hi":"71","options":[{"en":"142","hi":"142"},{"en":"71","hi":"71"},{"en":"86","hi":"86"},{"en":"72","hi":"72"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 58 paper sheets and reused 4. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 58 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 4 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"54","ans_hi":"54","options":[{"en":"54","hi":"54"},{"en":"108","hi":"108"},{"en":"60","hi":"60"},{"en":"56","hi":"56"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 10 rows with 5 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 10 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 5 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"50","ans_hi":"50","options":[{"en":"100","hi":"100"},{"en":"49","hi":"49"},{"en":"50","hi":"50"},{"en":"57","hi":"57"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"48 reusable bottles are shared equally among 6 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"48 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 6 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 46 birds on a tree. 6 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 46 पक्षी थे, 6 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"40","ans_hi":"40","options":[{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"46","hi":"46"},{"en":"39","hi":"39"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 12 pages each day for 4 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्या