ool finds directions?","hi":"दिशा ज्ञात करने में कौन-सा यंत्र सहायक है?","ans":"Compass","ans_hi":"दिशासूचक","options":[{"en":"Anemometer","hi":"पवनवेगमापी"},{"en":"Troposphere","hi":"क्षोभमंडल"},{"en":"Compass","hi":"दिशासूचक"},{"en":"Thermometer","hi":"तापमापी"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which instrument shows air pressure?","hi":"वायुदाब कौन-सा यंत्र मापता है?","ans":"Barometer","ans_hi":"वायुदाबमापी","options":[{"en":"Microscope","hi":"सूक्ष्मदर्शी"},{"en":"Thermometer","hi":"तापमापी"},{"en":"Barometer","hi":"वायुदाबमापी"},{"en":"Compass","hi":"दिशासूचक"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which planet is the largest in our Solar System?","hi":"सौरमंडल का सबसे बड़ा ग्रह कौन-सा है?","ans":"Jupiter","ans_hi":"बृहस्पति","options":[{"en":"Earth","hi":"पृथ्वी"},{"en":"Uranus","hi":"अरुण"},{"en":"Mercury","hi":"बुध"},{"en":"Jupiter","hi":"बृहस्पति"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which is the brightest planet commonly seen in the evening sky?","hi":"शाम में अक्सर चमकीला दिखने वाला ग्रह कौन-सा है?","ans":"Venus","ans_hi":"शुक्र","options":[{"en":"Saturn","hi":"शनि"},{"en":"Mercury","hi":"बुध"},{"en":"Jupiter","hi":"बृहस्पति"},{"en":"Venus","hi":"शुक्र"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which tool measures rainfall?","hi":"वर्षा की मात्रा कौन-सा यंत्र मापता है?","ans":"Rain gauge","ans_hi":"वर्षामापी","options":[{"en":"Microscope","hi":"सूक्ष्मदर्शी"},{"en":"Rain gauge","hi":"वर्षामापी"},{"en":"Thermometer","hi":"तापमापी"},{"en":"Telescope","hi":"दूरबीन"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 41 trees on Monday and 4 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 41 और मंगलवार को 4 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"45","ans_hi":"45","options":[{"en":"45","hi":"45"},{"en":"49","hi":"49"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"51","hi":"51"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 61 paper sheets and reused 14. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 61 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 14 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"47","ans_hi":"47","options":[{"en":"47","hi":"47"},{"en":"63","hi":"63"},{"en":"94","hi":"94"},{"en":"49","hi":"49"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 12 rows with 6 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 12 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 6 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"72","ans_hi":"72","options":[{"en":"80","hi":"80"},{"en":"78","hi":"78"},{"en":"72","hi":"72"},{"en":"71","hi":"71"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"88 reusable bottles are shared equally among 8 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"88 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 8 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"11","ans_hi":"11","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 55 birds on a tree. 6 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 55 पक्षी थे, 6 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"49","ans_hi":"49","options":[{"en":"51","hi":"51"},{"en":"49","hi":"49"},{"en":"57","hi":"57"},{"en":"48","hi":"48"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 11 pages each day for 6 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 6 दिन तक रोज़ 11 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"66","ans_hi":"66","options":[{"en":"132","hi":"132"},{"en":"67","hi":"67"},{"en":"66","hi":"66"},{"en":"72","hi":"72"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 7 litres of water a day for 4 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 4 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 7 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"56","hi":"56"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 44 pencils, and 16 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 44 पेंसिल में 16 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"56","hi":"56"},{"en":"46","hi":"46"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 52 recyclable items in the morning and 5 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 52 और शाम 5 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"57","ans_hi":"57","options":[{"en":"62","hi":"62"},{"en":"58","hi":"58"},{"en":"57","hi":"57"},{"en":"114","hi":"114"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 73 seedlings. 8 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 73 पौध थे, 8 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"81","ans_hi":"81","options":[{"en":"162","hi":"162"},{"en":"82","hi":"82"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"81","hi":"81"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"Which choice reduces plastic waste on a picnic?","hi":"पिकनिक में प्लास्टिक कचरा कैसे घटेगा?","ans":"Carry a reusable water bottle","ans_hi":"दोबारा भरी जा सकने वाली बोतल रखें","options":[{"en":"Carry a reusable water bottle","hi":"दोबारा भरी जा सकने वाली बोतल रखें"},{"en":"Throw wrappers in nature","hi":"रैपर प्रकृति में फेंकें"},{"en":"Use many single-use cups","hi":"कई डिस्पोज़ेबल कप लें"},{"en":"Buy extra plastic bags","hi":"अधिक प्लास्टिक थैलियाँ लें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A rainwater tank is overflowing. What is a sensible response?","hi":"वर्षाजल की टंकी से पानी बह रहा हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","ans_hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ","options":[{"en":"Contaminate the water","hi":"पानी गंदा करें"},{"en":"Break the pipe","hi":"पाइप तोड़ दें"},{"en":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ"},{"en":"Ignore for weeks","hi":"हफ्तों अनदेखा करें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Students notice an injured bird. What is safe?","hi":"विद्यार्थियों को घायल पक्षी दिखे। सुरक्षित कदम क्या है?","ans":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","ans_hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Throw stones","hi":"पत्थर मारें"},{"en":"Chase it away","hi":"भगाएँ"},{"en":"Pull its wings","hi":"पंख खींचें"},{"en":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The school garden soil dries quickly. Which practice helps?","hi":"विद्यालय बगीचे की मिट्टी जल्दी सूखती है। क्या मदद करता है?","ans":"Water carefully near plant roots","ans_hi":"पौधों की जड़ों के पास सावधानी से पानी दें","options":[{"en":"Waste water on paths","hi":"पगडंडी पर पानी बहाएँ"},{"en":"Water carefully near plant roots","hi":"पौधों की जड़ों के पास सावधानी से पानी दें"},{"en":"Break the plants","hi":"पौधे तोड़ें"},{"en":"Remove all soil","hi":"पूरी मिट्टी हटा दें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A viral message says school is closed, but no notice is issued. What should you do?","hi":"वायरल संदेश कहे स्कूल बंद है, पर सूचना न हो, तो क्या करें?","ans":"Check the official school notice","ans_hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें","options":[{"en":"Send it to everyone","hi":"सबको भेजें"},{"en":"Assume it is true","hi":"उसे सच मान लें"},{"en":"Check the official school notice","hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें"},{"en":"Delete official updates","hi":"आधिकारिक सूचना हटाएँ"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"What is good digital citizenship in a class group?","hi":"कक्षा समूह में अच्छा डिजिटल व्यवहार क्या है?","ans":"Use polite language and verify posts","ans_hi":"शिष्ट भाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना","options":[{"en":"Share classmates' secrets","hi":"सहपाठियों की गुप्त बातें भेजना"},{"en":"Spread false rumours","hi":"झूठी अफवाह फैलाना"},{"en":"Use polite language and verify posts","hi":"शिष्ट भाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना"},{"en":"Post insults","hi":"अपमान करना"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A student shares a photo of another child without permission. What is better?","hi":"बिना अनुमति दूसरे बच्चे का फोटो साझा हुआ। क्या उचित है?","ans":"Ask permission before sharing","ans_hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें","options":[{"en":"Share more photos","hi":"और फोटो भेजें"},{"en":"Add personal details","hi":"निजी जानकारी जोड़ें"},{"en":"Ask permission before sharing","hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें"},{"en":"Ignore privacy","hi":"गोपनीयता अनदेखी करें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A child gets a message that asks for bank details. What is right?","hi":"बैंक जानकारी माँगने वाला संदेश आए तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","ans_hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Share a password","hi":"पासवर्ड दें"},{"en":"Reply with details","hi":"जानकारी भेजें"},{"en":"Take a stranger's advice","hi":"अजनबी की सलाह लें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digit