athering","hi":"अपक्षय"},{"en":"Melting","hi":"गलन"},{"en":"Condensation","hi":"संघनन"},{"en":"Gravity","hi":"गुरुत्वाकर्षण"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which planet is farthest from the Sun among the eight planets?","hi":"आठ ग्रहों में सूर्य से सबसे दूर कौन-सा है?","ans":"Neptune","ans_hi":"वरुण","options":[{"en":"Neptune","hi":"वरुण"},{"en":"Saturn","hi":"शनि"},{"en":"Venus","hi":"शुक्र"},{"en":"Earth","hi":"पृथ्वी"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which force makes objects fall downward?","hi":"वस्तुओं को नीचे गिराने वाला बल क्या है?","ans":"Gravity","ans_hi":"गुरुत्वाकर्षण","options":[{"en":"Gravity","hi":"गुरुत्वाकर्षण"},{"en":"Condensation","hi":"संघनन"},{"en":"Erosion","hi":"अपरदन"},{"en":"Atmosphere","hi":"वायुमंडल"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which instrument records temperature?","hi":"तापमान कौन-सा यंत्र मापता है?","ans":"Thermometer","ans_hi":"तापमापी","options":[{"en":"Thermometer","hi":"तापमापी"},{"en":"Compass","hi":"दिशासूचक"},{"en":"Telescope","hi":"दूरबीन"},{"en":"Rain gauge","hi":"वर्षामापी"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which planet is nearest the Sun?","hi":"सूर्य के सबसे निकट ग्रह कौन-सा है?","ans":"Mercury","ans_hi":"बुध","options":[{"en":"Neptune","hi":"वरुण"},{"en":"Mercury","hi":"बुध"},{"en":"Jupiter","hi":"बृहस्पति"},{"en":"Venus","hi":"शुक्र"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which material is widely recyclable?","hi":"कौन-सी सामग्री सामान्यतः पुनर्चक्रित होती है?","ans":"Paper","ans_hi":"कागज़","options":[{"en":"Paper","hi":"कागज़"},{"en":"Verify the claim","hi":"दावे की पुष्टि"},{"en":"Check its source and date","hi":"स्रोत और तारीख जाँचना"},{"en":"Turn off the tap","hi":"नल बंद रखें"}],"cor