lected 39 paper sheets and reused 4. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 39 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 4 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"35","ans_hi":"35","options":[{"en":"39","hi":"39"},{"en":"37","hi":"37"},{"en":"35","hi":"35"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 12 rows with 8 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 12 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 8 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"96","ans_hi":"96","options":[{"en":"94","hi":"94"},{"en":"96","hi":"96"},{"en":"95","hi":"95"},{"en":"104","hi":"104"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"56 reusable bottles are shared equally among 7 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"56 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 7 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 42 birds on a tree. 14 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 42 पक्षी थे, 14 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 10 pages each day for 3 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 3 दिन तक रोज़ 10 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"30","ans_hi":"30","options":[{"en":"60","hi":"60"},{"en":"31","hi":"31"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 9 litres of water a day for 8 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 8 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 9 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"72","ans_hi":"72","