Ask where the data came from","ans_hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए","options":[{"en":"Accept it without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे मानें"},{"en":"Ask where the data came from","hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए"},{"en":"Change its numbers","hi":"आँकड़े बदल दें"},{"en":"Hide the chart","hi":"चार्ट छिपाएँ"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Students notice an injured bird. What is safe?","hi":"विद्यार्थियों को घायल पक्षी दिखे। सुरक्षित कदम क्या है?","ans":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","ans_hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ"},{"en":"Pull its wings","hi":"पंख खींचें"},{"en":"Throw stones","hi":"पत्थर मारें"},{"en":"Chase it away","hi":"भगाएँ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"What is good digital citizenship in a class group?","hi":"कक्षा समूह में अच्छा डिजिटल व्यवहार क्या है?","ans":"Use polite language and verify posts","ans_hi":"शिष्ट भाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना","options":[{"en":"Spread false rumours","hi":"झूठी अफवाह फैलाना"},{"en":"Post insults","hi":"अपमान करना"},{"en":"Use polite language and verify posts","hi":"शिष्ट भाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना"},{"en":"Share classmates' secrets","hi":"सहपाठियों की गुप्त बातें भेजना"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A child gets a message that asks for bank details. What is right?","hi":"बैंक जानकारी माँगने वाला संदेश आए तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","ans_hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Reply with details","hi":"जानकारी भेजें"},{"en":"Take a stranger's advice","hi":"अजनबी की सलाह लें"},{"en":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Share a password","hi":"पासवर्ड दें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The school garden soil dries quickly. Which practice helps?","hi":"विद्यालय बगीचे की मिट्टी जल्दी सूखती है। क्या मदद करता है?","ans":"Water carefully near plant roots","ans_hi":"पौधों की जड़ों के पास सावधानी से पानी दें","options":[{"en":"Remove all soil","hi":"पूरी मिट्टी हटा दें"},{"en":"Break the plants","hi":"पौधे तोड़ें"},{"en":"Waste water on paths","hi":"पगडंडी पर पानी बहाएँ"},{"en":"Water carefully near plant roots","hi":"पौधों की जड़ों के पास सावधानी से पानी दें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A student shares a photo of another child without permission. What is better?","hi":"बिना अनुमति दूसरे बच्चे का फोटो साझा हुआ। क्या उचित है?","ans":"Ask permission before sharing","ans_hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें","options":[{"en":"Ignore privacy","hi":"गोपनीयता अनदेखी करें"},{"en":"Add personal details","hi":"निजी जानकारी जोड़ें"},{"en":"Ask permission before sharing","hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें"},{"en":"Share more photos","hi":"और फोटो भेजें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"How should students check an unusual online fact?","hi":"अजीब ऑनलाइन तथ्य की जाँच कैसे करें?","ans":"Compare reliable sources","ans_hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोतों की तुलना करें","options":[{"en":"Use only rumours","hi":"केवल अफवाह सुनें"},{"en":"Ignore dates and authors","hi":"तारीख और लेखक अनदेखे करें"},{"en":"Compare reliable sources","hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोतों की तुलना करें"},{"en":"Believe the first website","hi":"पहली वेबसाइट पर भरोसा करें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-4-2-03"},"4|1|4|GK":{"grade":"4","term":1,"year":4,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"Which organ absorbs most nutrients from digested food?","hi":"पचे हुए भोजन के अधिकां