ny flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 6 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 3 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"18","ans_hi":"18","options":[{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"48 reusable bottles are shared equally among 6 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"48 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 6 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 43 birds on a tree. 14 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 43 पक्षी थे, 14 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"29","ans_hi":"29","options":[{"en":"45","hi":"45"},{"en":"29","hi":"29"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"43","hi":"43"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 8 pages each day for 8 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 8 दिन तक रोज़ 8 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"64","ans_hi":"64","options":[{"en":"63","hi":"63"},{"en":"64","hi":"64"},{"en":"74","hi":"74"},{"en":"72","hi":"72"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 6 litres of water a day for 8 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 8 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 6 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"48","ans_hi":"48","options":[{"en":"50","hi":"50"},{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"56","hi":"56"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 68 pencils, and 7 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 68 पेंसिल में 7 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"61","ans_hi":"61","options":[{"en":"59","hi":"59"},{"en":"61","hi":"61"},{"en":"60","hi":"60"},{"en":"70","hi":"70"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 54 recyclable items in the morning and 4 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 54 और शाम 4 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"58","ans_hi":"58","options":[{"en":"62","hi":"62"},{"en":"58","hi":"58"},{"en":"64","hi":"64"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 46 seedlings. 10 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 46 पौध थे, 10 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"56","ans_hi":"56","options":[{"en":"57","hi":"57"},{"en":"55","hi":"55"},{"en":"56","hi":"56"},{"en":"112","hi":"112"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A confusing chart has no data source. What should you do?","hi":"अस्पष्ट चार्ट पर आँकड़ों का स्रोत न हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask where the data came from","ans_hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए","options":[{"en":"Hide the chart","hi":"चार्ट छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Ask where the data came from","hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए"},{"en":"Accept it without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे मानें"},{"en":"Change its numbers","hi":"आँकड़े बदल दें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Students notice an injured bird. What is safe?","hi":"विद्यार्थियों को घायल पक्षी दिखे। सुरक्षित कदम क्या है?","ans":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","ans_hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Throw stones","hi":"पत्थर मारें"},{"en":"Pull its wings","hi":"पंख खींचें"},{"en":"Chase it away","hi":"भगाएँ"},{"en":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"How should students check an unusual online fact?","hi":"अजीब ऑनलाइन तथ्य की जाँच कैसे करें?","ans":"Compare reliable sources","ans_hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोतों की तुलना करें","options":[{"en":"Believe the first website","hi":"पहली वेबसाइट पर भरोसा करें"},{"en":"Ignore dates and authors","hi":"तारीख और लेखक अनदेखे करें"},{"en":"Use only rumours","hi":"केवल अफवाह सुनें"},{"en":"Compare reliable sources","hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोतों की तुलना करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A rainwater tank is overflowing. What is a sensible response?","hi":"वर्षाजल की टंकी से पानी बह रहा हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","ans_hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ","options":[{"en":"Break the pipe","hi":"पाइप तोड़ दें"},{"en":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ"},{"en":"Ignore for weeks","hi":"हफ्तों अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Contaminate the water","hi":"पानी गंदा करें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A student shares a photo of another child without permission. What is better?","hi":"बिना अनुमति दूसरे बच्चे का फोटो साझा हुआ। क्या उचित है?","ans":"Ask permission before sharing","ans_hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें","options":[{"en":"Add personal details","hi":"निजी जानकारी जोड़ें"},{"en":"Ignore privacy","hi":"गोपनीयता अनदेखी करें"},{"en":"Ask permission before sharing","hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें"},{"en":"Share more photos","hi":"और फोटो भेजें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A viral message says school is closed, but no notice is issued. What should you do?","hi":"वायरल संदेश कहे स्कूल बंद है, पर सूचना न हो, तो क्या करें?","ans":"Check the official school notice","ans_hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें","options":[{"en":"Send it to everyone","hi":"सबको भेजें"},{"en":"Assume it is true","hi":"उसे सच मान लें"},{"en":"Delete official updates","hi":"आधिकारिक सूचना हटाएँ"},{"en":"Check the official school notice","hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सू