bottles are shared equally among 5 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"50 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 5 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"10","ans_hi":"10","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 71 birds on a tree. 16 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 71 पक्षी थे, 16 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"55","ans_hi":"55","options":[{"en":"110","hi":"110"},{"en":"55","hi":"55"},{"en":"54","hi":"54"},{"en":"57","hi":"57"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 10 pages each day for 8 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 8 दिन तक रोज़ 10 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"80","ans_hi":"80","options":[{"en":"79","hi":"79"},{"en":"80","hi":"80"},{"en":"81","hi":"81"},{"en":"160","hi":"160"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 12 litres of water a day for 8 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 8 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 12 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"96","ans_hi":"96","options":[{"en":"98","hi":"98"},{"en":"192","hi":"192"},{"en":"104","hi":"104"},{"en":"96","hi":"96"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 42 pencils, and 16 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 42 पेंसिल में 16 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"26","ans_hi":"26","options":[{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 43 recyclable items in the morning and 16 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 43 और शाम 16 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"59","ans_hi":"