onday and 11 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 62 और मंगलवार को 11 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"73","ans_hi":"73","options":[{"en":"75","hi":"75"},{"en":"72","hi":"72"},{"en":"74","hi":"74"},{"en":"73","hi":"73"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 66 paper sheets and reused 4. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 66 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 4 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"62","ans_hi":"62","options":[{"en":"66","hi":"66"},{"en":"62","hi":"62"},{"en":"60","hi":"60"},{"en":"68","hi":"68"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 11 rows with 7 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 11 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 7 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"77","ans_hi":"77","options":[{"en":"76","hi":"76"},{"en":"84","hi":"84"},{"en":"79","hi":"79"},{"en":"77","hi":"77"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"21 reusable bottles are shared equally among 3 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"21 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 3 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"7","ans_hi":"7","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 53 birds on a tree. 5 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 53 पक्षी थे, 5 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"48","ans_hi":"48","options":[{"en":"55","hi":"55"},{"en":"53","hi":"53"},{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"50","hi":"50"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 7 pages each day for 6 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 6 दिन तक रोज़ 7 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"42","ans_hi":"42","options":[{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"41","hi":"41"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 10 litres of water a day for 3 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 3 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 10 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"30","ans_hi":"30","options":[{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 62 pencils, and 15 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 62 पेंसिल में 15 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"47","ans_hi":"47","options":[{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"64","hi":"64"},{"en":"46","hi":"46"},{"en":"47","hi":"47"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 38 recyclable items in the morning and 11 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 38 और शाम 11 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"49","ans_hi":"49","options":[{"en":"49","hi":"49"},{"en":"51","hi":"51"},{"en":"50","hi":"50"},{"en":"98","hi":"98"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 64 seedlings. 5 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 64 पौध थे, 5 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"69","ans_hi":"69","options":[{"en":"69","hi":"69"},{"en":"76","hi":"76"},{"en":"71","hi":"71"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The science club wants to save energy. What should it do?","hi":"विज्ञान क्लब ऊर्जा बचाना चाहता है। क्या करे?","ans":"Switch off unused electrical devices","ans_hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे","options":[{"en":"Run fans in empty rooms","hi":"खाली कमरों में पंखे चलाए"},{"en":"Switch off unused electrical devices","hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे"},{"en":"Keep lights on all day","hi":"दिनभर लाइट जलाए"},{"en":"Waste batteries","hi":"बैटरियाँ फेंके"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A rainwater tank is overflowing. What is a sensible response?","hi":"वर्षाजल की टंकी से पानी बह रहा हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","ans_hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ","options":[{"en":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ"},{"en":"Ignore for weeks","hi":"हफ्तों अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Contaminate the water","hi":"पानी गंदा करें"},{"en":"Break the pipe","hi":"पाइप तोड़ दें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A friend is left out of a group task. What should you do?","hi":"किसी मित्र को समूह कार्य से बाहर रखा गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Invite them to participate","ans_hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ","options":[{"en":"Hide the task","hi":"कार्य छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Invite them to participate","hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ"},{"en":"Make fun of them","hi":"मज़ाक उड़ाएँ"},{"en":"Refuse to listen","hi":"बात न सुनें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A confusing chart has no data source. What should you do?","hi":"अस्पष्ट चार्ट पर आँकड़ों का स्रोत न हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask where the data came from","ans_hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए","options":[{"en":"Hide the chart","hi":"चार्ट छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Accept it without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे मानें"},{"en":"Change its numbers","hi":"आँकड़े बदल दें"},{"en":"Ask where the data came from","hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A student shares a photo of another child without permission. What is better?","hi":"बिना अनुमति दूसरे बच्चे का फोटो साझा हुआ। क्या उचित है?","ans":"Ask permission before sharing","ans_hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें","options":[{"en":"Ask permission before sharing","hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें"},{"en":"Share more photos","hi":"और फोटो भेजें"},{"en":"Ignore privacy","hi":"गोपनीयता अनदेखी करें"},{"en":"Add personal details","hi":"निजी जानकारी जोड़ें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A viral message says school is closed, but no notice is issued. What should you do?","hi":"वायरल संदेश कहे स्कूल बंद है, पर सूचना न हो, तो क्या करें?","ans":"Check the official school notice","ans_hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें","options":[{"en":"Assume it is true","hi":"उसे सच मान लें"},{"en":"Delete official updates","hi":"आधिकारिक सूचना हटाएँ"},{"en":"Send it to everyone","hi":"सबको भेजें"},{"en":"Check the official school notice","hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Students notice an injured bird. What is safe?","hi":"विद्यार्थियों को घायल पक्षी दिखे। सुरक्षित कदम क्या है?","ans":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","ans_hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Throw stones","hi":"पत्थर मारें"},{"en":"Pull its wings","hi":"पंख खींचें"},{"en":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ"},{"en":"Chase it away","hi":"भगाएँ"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"What is good digital citizenship in a class group?","hi":"कक्षा समूह में अच्छा डिजिटल व्यवहार क्या है?","ans":"Use polite language and verify posts","ans_hi":"शिष्ट भाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना","options":[{"en":"Spread false rumours","hi":"झूठी अफवाह फैलाना"},{"en":"Post insults","hi":"अपमान करना"},{"en":"Use polite language and verify posts","hi":"शिष्ट भाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना"},{"en":"Share classmates' secrets","hi":"सहपाठियों की गुप्त बातें भेजना"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied