sation","hi":"संघनन"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which is the third planet from the Sun?","hi":"सूर्य से तीसरा ग्रह कौन-सा है?","ans":"Earth","ans_hi":"पृथ्वी","options":[{"en":"Mars","hi":"मंगल"},{"en":"Earth","hi":"पृथ्वी"},{"en":"Saturn","hi":"शनि"},{"en":"Venus","hi":"शुक्र"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which planet is famous for its rings?","hi":"अपने छल्लों के लिए प्रसिद्ध ग्रह कौन-सा है?","ans":"Saturn","ans_hi":"शनि","options":[{"en":"Saturn","hi":"शनि"},{"en":"Jupiter","hi":"बृहस्पति"},{"en":"Mars","hi":"मंगल"},{"en":"Uranus","hi":"अरुण"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What should we do before forwarding an unverified message?","hi":"अपुष्ट संदेश आगे भेजने से पहले क्या करें?","ans":"Verify the claim","ans_hi":"दावे की पुष्टि","options":[{"en":"Turn off the tap","hi":"नल बंद रखें"},{"en":"Verify the claim","hi":"दावे की पुष्टि"},{"en":"Check its source and date","hi":"स्रोत और तारीख जाँचना"},{"en":"Switch off unused lights","hi":"अनुपयोगी लाइट बंद करना"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which instrument helps see tiny objects?","hi":"बहुत छोटी वस्तुओं को देखने का यंत्र कौन-सा है?","ans":"Microscope","ans_hi":"सूक्ष्मदर्शी","options":[{"en":"Microscope","hi":"सूक्ष्मदर्शी"},{"en":"Barometer","hi":"वायुदाबमापी"},{"en":"Anemometer","hi":"पवनवेगमापी"},{"en":"Compass","hi":"दिशासूचक"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which planet is nearest the Sun?","hi":"सूर्य के सबसे निकट ग्रह कौन-सा है?","ans":"Mercury","ans_hi":"बुध","options":[{"en":"Earth","hi":"पृथ्वी"},{"en":"Venus","hi":"शुक्र"},{"en":"Mercury","hi":"बुध"},{"en":"Neptune","hi":"वरुण"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which instrument measures wind speed?","hi":"हवा की गति कौन-सा यंत्र मापता है?","ans":"Anemometer","ans_hi":"पवनवेगमापी","options":[{"en":"Troposphere","hi":"क्षोभमंडल"},{"en":"Microscope","hi":"सूक्ष्मदर्शी"},{"en":"Anemometer","hi":"पवनवेगमापी"},{"en":"Thermometer","hi":"तापमापी"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which instrument records temperature?","hi":"तापमान कौन-सा यंत्र मापता है?","ans":"Thermometer","ans_hi":"तापमापी","options":[{"en":"Compass","hi":"दिशासूचक"},{"en":"Thermometer","hi":"तापमापी"},{"en":"Anemometer","hi":"पवनवेगमापी"},{"en":"Telescope","hi":"दूरबीन"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 46 trees on Monday and 4 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 46 और मंगलवार को 4 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"50","ans_hi":"50","options":[{"en":"52","hi":"52"},{"en":"100","hi":"100"},{"en":"56","hi":"56"},{"en":"50","hi":"50"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 59 paper sheets and reused 12. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 59 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 12 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"47","ans_hi":"47","options":[{"en":"49","hi":"49"},{"en":"47","hi":"47"},{"en":"46","hi":"46"},{"en":"45","hi":"45"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 5 rows with 3 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 5 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 3 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"15","ans_hi":"15","options":[{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"88 reusable bottles are shared equally among 8 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"88 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 8 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"11","ans_hi":"11","options":[{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 44 birds on a tree. 7 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 44 पक्षी थे, 7 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"37","ans_hi":"37","options":[{"en":"46","hi":"46"},{"en":"39","hi":"39"},{"en":"35","hi":"35"},{"en":"37","hi":"37"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 5 pages each day for 3 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 3 दिन तक रोज़ 5 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"15","ans_hi":"15","options":[{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 6 litres of water a day for 6 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 6 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 6 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"36","ans_hi":"36","options":[{"en":"38","hi":"38"},{"en":"72","hi":"72"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 48 pencils, and 4 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 48 पेंसिल में 4 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"44","ans_hi":"44","options":[{"en":"88","hi":"88"},{"en":"46","hi":"46"},{"en":"50","hi":"50"},{"en":"44","hi":"44"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 72 recyclable items in the morning and 15 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 72 और शाम 15 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"87","ans_hi":"87","options":[{"en":"87","hi":"87"},{"en":"89","hi":"89"},{"en":"104","hi":"104"},{"en":"86","hi":"86"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 41 seedlings. 16 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 41 पौध थे, 16 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"57","ans_hi":"57","options":[{"en":"57","hi":"57"},{"en":"58","hi":"58"},{"en":"75","hi":"75"},{"en":"73","hi":"73"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A viral message says school is closed, but no notice is issued. What should you do?","hi":"वायरल संदेश कहे स्कूल बंद है, पर सूचना न हो, तो क्या करें?","ans":"Check the official school notice","ans_hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें","options":[{"en":"Assume it is true","hi":"उसे सच मान लें"},{"en":"Check the official school notice","hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें"},{"en":"Send it to everyone","hi":"सबको भेजें"},{"en":"Delete official updates","hi":"आधिकारिक सूचना हटाएँ"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A student shares a photo of another child without permission. What is better?","hi":"बिना अनुमति दूसरे बच्चे का फोटो साझा हुआ। क्या उचित है?","ans":"Ask permission before sharing","ans_hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें","options":[{"en":"Ask permission before sharing","hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें"},{"en":"Ignore privacy","hi":"गोपनीयता अनदेखी करें"},{"en":"Add personal details","hi":"निजी जानकारी जोड़ें"},{"en":"Share more photos","hi":"और फोटो भेजें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A confusing chart has no data source. What should you do?","hi":"अस्पष्ट चार्ट पर आँकड़ों का स्रोत न हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask where the data came from","ans_hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए","options":[{"en":"Change its numbers","hi":"आँकड़े बदल दें"},{"en":"Ask where the data came from","hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए"},{"en":"Accept it without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे मानें"},{"en":"Hide the chart","hi":"चार्ट छिपाएँ"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A rainwater tank is overflowing. What is a sensible response?","hi":"वर्षाजल की टंकी से पानी बह रहा हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","ans_hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ","options":[{"en":"Break the pipe","hi":"पाइप तोड़ दें"},{"en":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ"},{"en":"Ignore for weeks","hi":"हफ्तों अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Contaminate the water","hi":"पानी गंदा करें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A child gets a message that asks for bank details. What is right?","hi":"बैंक जानकारी माँगने वाला संदेश आए तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","ans_hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Share a password","hi":"पासवर्ड दें"},{"en":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Take a stranger's advice","hi":"अजनबी की सलाह लें"},{"en":"Reply with details","hi":"जानकारी भेजें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The school garden soil dries quickly. Which practice helps?","hi":"विद्यालय बगीचे की मिट्टी जल्दी सूखती है। क्या मदद करता है?","ans":"Water carefully near plant roots","ans_hi":"पौधों की जड़ों के पास सावधानी से पानी दें","options":[{"en":"Water carefully near plant roots","hi":"पौधों की जड़ों के पास सावधानी से पानी दें"},{"en":"Waste water on paths","hi":"पगडंडी पर पानी बहाएँ"},{"en":"Break the plants","hi":"पौधे तोड़ें"},{"en":"Remove all soil","hi":"पूरी मिट्टी हटा दें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Which choice reduces plastic waste on a picnic?","hi":"पिकनिक में प्लास्टिक कचरा कैसे घटेगा?","ans":"Carry a reusable water bottle","ans_hi":"दोबारा भरी जा सकने वाली बोतल रखें","options":[{"en":"Buy extra plastic bags","hi":"अधिक प्लास्टिक थैलियाँ लें"},{"en":"Use many single-use cups","hi":"कई डिस्पोज़ेबल कप लें"},{"en":"Carry a reusable water bottle","hi":"दोबारा भरी जा सकने वाली बोतल रखें"},{"en":"Throw wrappers in nature","hi":"रैपर प्रकृति में फेंकें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A friend is left out of a group task. What should you do?","hi":"किसी मित्र को समूह कार्य से बाहर रखा गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Invite them to participate","ans_hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ","options":[{"en":"Invite them to participate","hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ"},{"en":"Refuse to listen","hi":"बात न सुनें"},{"en":"Make fun of them","hi":"मज़ाक उड़ाएँ"},{"en":"Hide the task","hi":"कार्य छिपाएँ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-4-2-09"},"4|1|10|GK":{"grade":"4","term":1,"year":10,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"Which organ absorbs most nutrients from digested food?","hi":"पचे हुए भोजन के अधिकांश पोषक तत्त्व कहाँ अवशोषित होते हैं?","ans":"Small intestine","ans_hi":"छोटी आंत","options":[{"en":"Skull","hi":"खोपड़ी"},{"en":"Pancreas","hi":"अग्न्याशय"},{"en":"Small intestine","hi":"छोटी आंत"},{"en":"Heart","hi":"हृदय"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"What do we call water plants with roots in mud and leaves on water?","hi":"कीचड़ में जड़ और पानी पर पत्तियों वाले पौधे का एक उदाहरण क्या है?","ans":"Lotus","ans_hi":"कमल","options":[{"en":"Lotus","hi":"कमल"},{"en":"Marigold","hi":"गेंदा"},{"en":"Sunflower","hi":"सूरजमुखी"},{"en":"Rose","hi":"गुलाब"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"Which part of a flower attracts many pollinators through colour?","hi":"फूल का कौन-सा भाग रंग से परागणकर्ताओं को