"},{"en":"Twenty","hi":"बीस"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"quantities"},{"en":"Which gas do humans breathe out in greater proportion than breathed in?","hi":"मानव श्वास छोड़ते समय किस गैस का अनुपात बढ़ जाता है?","ans":"Carbon dioxide","ans_hi":"कार्बन डाइऑक्साइड","options":[{"en":"Methane","hi":"मीथेन"},{"en":"Oxygen","hi":"ऑक्सीजन"},{"en":"Helium","hi":"हीलियम"},{"en":"Carbon dioxide","hi":"कार्बन डाइऑक्साइड"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"gases"},{"en":"What helps protect the brain inside the head?","hi":"सिर के भीतर मस्तिष्क की रक्षा क्या करता है?","ans":"Skull","ans_hi":"खोपड़ी","options":[{"en":"Skull","hi":"खोपड़ी"},{"en":"Brain","hi":"मस्तिष्क"},{"en":"Stomach","hi":"आमाशय"},{"en":"Heart","hi":"हृदय"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"Which planet is famous for its Great Red Spot?","hi":"कौन-सा ग्रह ग्रेट रेड स्पॉट के लिए प्रसिद्ध है?","ans":"Jupiter","ans_hi":"बृहस्पति","options":[{"en":"Mars","hi":"मंगल"},{"en":"Jupiter","hi":"बृहस्पति"},{"en":"Venus","hi":"शुक्र"},{"en":"Saturn","hi":"शनि"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"planets"},{"en":"Which process breaks rocks into smaller pieces naturally?","hi":"चट्टानों के प्राकृतिक रूप से टूटने की प्रक्रिया क्या है?","ans":"Weathering","ans_hi":"अपक्षय","options":[{"en":"Weathering","hi":"अपक्षय"},{"en":"Erosion","hi":"अपरदन"},{"en":"Transpiration","hi":"वाष्पोत्सर्जन"},{"en":"Condensation","hi":"संघनन"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"How can we save water while brushing?","hi":"ब्रश करते समय पानी कैसे बचाएँ?","ans":"Turn off the tap","ans_hi":"नल बंद रखें","options":[{"en":"Switch off unused lights","hi":"अनुपयोगी लाइट बंद करना"},{"en":"Tell a trusted adult","hi":"विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Turn off the tap","hi":"नल बंद रखें"},{"en":"Paper