ा"},{"en":"Patna","hi":"पटना"},{"en":"Delhi","hi":"दिल्ली"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"cities"},{"en":"Which Indian city is known for the Gateway of India monument?","hi":"गेटवे ऑफ इंडिया स्मारक किस शहर में है?","ans":"Mumbai","ans_hi":"मुंबई","options":[{"en":"Jaipur","hi":"जयपुर"},{"en":"Agra","hi":"आगरा"},{"en":"Patna","hi":"पटना"},{"en":"Mumbai","hi":"मुंबई"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"cities"},{"en":"How many minutes are in one hour?","hi":"एक घंटे में कितने मिनट होते हैं?","ans":"60","ans_hi":"60","options":[{"en":"Twenty","hi":"बीस"},{"en":"60","hi":"60"},{"en":"Twelve","hi":"बारह"},{"en":"Seven","hi":"सात"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"quantities"},{"en":"Which part of a flower attracts many pollinators through colour?","hi":"फूल का कौन-सा भाग रंग से परागणकर्ताओं को आकर्षित करता है?","ans":"Petals","ans_hi":"पंखुड़ियाँ","options":[{"en":"Stem","hi":"तना"},{"en":"Seed","hi":"बीज"},{"en":"Petals","hi":"पंखुड़ियाँ"},{"en":"Xylem","hi":"जाइलम"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"plantparts"},{"en":"Which part of a plant supports leaves and flowers?","hi":"पौधे का कौन-सा भाग पत्तियों और फूलों को सहारा देता है?","ans":"Stem","ans_hi":"तना","options":[{"en":"Seed","hi":"बीज"},{"en":"Stem","hi":"तना"},{"en":"Petals","hi":"पंखुड़ियाँ"},{"en":"Xylem","hi":"जाइलम"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"plantparts"},{"en":"Which planet is famous for its Great Red Spot?","hi":"कौन-सा ग्रह ग्रेट रेड स्पॉट के लिए प्रसिद्ध है?","ans":"Jupiter","ans_hi":"बृहस्पति","options":[{"en":"Saturn","hi":"शनि"},{"en":"Uranus","hi":"अरुण"},{"en":"Jupiter","hi":"बृहस्पति"},{"en":"Venus","hi":"शुक्र"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"planets"},{"en":"Which instrument helps view distant stars?","hi":"दूर के तारों क