 / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which instrument measures wind speed?","hi":"हवा की गति कौन-सा यंत्र मापता है?","ans":"Anemometer","ans_hi":"पवनवेगमापी","options":[{"en":"Troposphere","hi":"क्षोभमंडल"},{"en":"Barometer","hi":"वायुदाबमापी"},{"en":"Anemometer","hi":"पवनवेगमापी"},{"en":"Compass","hi":"दिशासूचक"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"What do we call the change from gas to liquid?","hi":"गैस से द्रव बनने की प्रक्रिया क्या है?","ans":"Condensation","ans_hi":"संघनन","options":[{"en":"Erosion","hi":"अपरदन"},{"en":"Transpiration","hi":"वाष्पोत्सर्जन"},{"en":"Evaporation","hi":"वाष्पीकरण"},{"en":"Condensation","hi":"संघनन"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which planet is called the Red Planet?","hi":"लाल ग्रह किसे कहते हैं?","ans":"Mars","ans_hi":"मंगल","options":[{"en":"Uranus","hi":"अरुण"},{"en":"Mars","hi":"मंगल"},{"en":"Saturn","hi":"शनि"},{"en":"Neptune","hi":"वरुण"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which instrument records temperature?","hi":"तापमान कौन-सा यंत्र मापता है?","ans":"Thermometer","ans_hi":"तापमापी","options":[{"en":"Compass","hi":"दिशासूचक"},{"en":"Rain gauge","hi":"वर्षामापी"},{"en":"Thermometer","hi":"तापमापी"},{"en":"Telescope","hi":"दूरबीन"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 40 trees on Monday and 6 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 40 और मंगलवार को 6 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"46","ans_hi":"46","options":[{"en":"46","hi":"46"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"44","hi":"44"},{"en":"52","hi":"52"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 62 paper sheets and reused 10. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 62 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 10 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"52","ans_hi":"52","options":[{"en":"62","hi":"62"},{"en":"53","hi":"53"},{"en":"52","hi":"52"},{"en":"51","hi":"51"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 8 rows with 5 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 8 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 5 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"40","ans_hi":"40","options":[{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"80","hi":"80"},{"en":"39","hi":"39"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"33 reusable bottles are shared equally among 3 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"33 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 3 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"11","ans_hi":"11","options":[{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 67 birds on a tree. 9 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 67 पक्षी थे, 9 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"58","ans_hi":"58","options":[{"en":"59","hi":"59"},{"en":"58","hi":"58"},{"en":"56","hi":"56"},{"en":"69","hi":"69"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 6 pages each day for 7 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 7 दिन तक रोज़ 6 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"42","ans_hi":"42","options":[{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"49","hi":"49"},{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"44","hi":"44"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 10 litres of water a day for 3 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 3 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 10 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"30","ans_hi":"30","options":[{"en":"31","hi":"31"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"35","hi":"35"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 64 pencils, and 8 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 64 पेंसिल में 8 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"56","ans_hi":"56","options":[{"en":"54","hi":"54"},{"en":"56","hi":"56"},{"en":"55","hi":"55"},{"en":"66","hi":"66"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 73 recyclable items in the morning and 15 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 73 और शाम 15 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"88","ans_hi":"88","options":[{"en":"103","hi":"103"},{"en":"89","hi":"89"},{"en":"90","hi":"90"},{"en":"88","hi":"88"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 54 seedlings. 13 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 54 पौध थे, 13 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"67","ans_hi":"67","options":[{"en":"68","hi":"68"},{"en":"65","hi":"65"},{"en":"66","hi":"66"},{"en":"67","hi":"67"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"Which choice reduces plastic waste on a picnic?","hi":"पिकनिक में प्लास्टिक कचरा कैसे घटेगा?","ans":"Carry a reusable water bottle","ans_hi":"दोबारा भरी जा सकने वाली बोतल रखें","options":[{"en":"Throw wrappers in nature","hi":"रैपर प्रकृति में फेंकें"},{"en":"Carry a reusable water bottle","hi":"दोबारा भरी जा सकने वाली बोतल रखें"},{"en":"Buy extra plastic bags","hi":"अधिक प्लास्टिक थैलियाँ लें"},{"en":"Use many single-use cups","hi":"कई डिस्पोज़ेबल कप लें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Students notice an injured bird. What is safe?","hi":"विद्यार्थियों को घायल पक्षी दिखे। सुरक्षित कदम क्या है?","ans":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","ans_hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Chase it away","hi":"भगाएँ"},{"en":"Pull its wings","hi":"प