l modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which planet is the largest in our Solar System?","hi":"सौरमंडल का सबसे बड़ा ग्रह कौन-सा है?","ans":"Jupiter","ans_hi":"बृहस्पति","options":[{"en":"Jupiter","hi":"बृहस्पति"},{"en":"Earth","hi":"पृथ्वी"},{"en":"Uranus","hi":"अरुण"},{"en":"Saturn","hi":"शनि"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which force makes objects fall downward?","hi":"वस्तुओं को नीचे गिराने वाला बल क्या है?","ans":"Gravity","ans_hi":"गुरुत्वाकर्षण","options":[{"en":"Melting","hi":"गलन"},{"en":"Atmosphere","hi":"वायुमंडल"},{"en":"Transpiration","hi":"वाष्पोत्सर्जन"},{"en":"Gravity","hi":"गुरुत्वाकर्षण"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which is the third planet from the Sun?","hi":"सूर्य से तीसरा ग्रह कौन-सा है?","ans":"Earth","ans_hi":"पृथ्वी","options":[{"en":"Saturn","hi":"शनि"},{"en":"Earth","hi":"पृथ्वी"},{"en":"Mercury","hi":"बुध"},{"en":"Jupiter","hi":"बृहस्पति"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 55 trees on Monday and 13 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 55 और मंगलवार को 13 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"68","ans_hi":"68","options":[{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"68","hi":"68"},{"en":"67","hi":"67"},{"en":"69","hi":"69"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 72 paper sheets and reused 8. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 72 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 8 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"64","ans_hi":"64","options":[{"en":"63","hi":"63"},{"en":"62","hi":"62"},{"en":"128","hi":"128"},{"en":"64","hi":"64"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 11 rows with 5 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 11 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 5 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"55","ans_hi":"55","options":[{"en":"62","hi":"62"},{"en":"55","hi":"55"},{"en":"54","hi":"54"},{"en":"110","hi":"110"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"48 reusable bottles are shared equally among 6 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"48 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 6 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"8","ans_hi":"8","options":[{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 54 birds on a tree. 9 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 54 पक्षी थे, 9 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"45","ans_hi":"45","options":[{"en":"56","hi":"56"},{"en":"47","hi":"47"},{"en":"44","hi":"44"},{"en":"45","hi":"45"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 8 pages each day for 5 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 5 दिन तक रोज़ 8 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"40","ans_hi":"40","options":[{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"47","hi":"47"},{"en":"39","hi":"39"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 7 litres of water a day for 8 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 8 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 7 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"56","ans_hi":"56","options":[{"en":"56","hi":"56"},{"en":"112","hi":"112"},{"en":"55","hi":"55"},{"en":"49","hi":"49"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 72 pencils, and 6 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 72 पेंसिल में 6 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"66","ans_hi":"66","options":[{"en":"68","hi":"68"},{"en":"132","hi":"132"},{"en":"72","hi":"72"},{"en":"66","hi":"66"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 73 recyclable items in the morning and 13 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 73 और शाम 13 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"86","ans_hi":"86","options":[{"en":"172","hi":"172"},{"en":"99","hi":"99"},{"en":"85","hi":"85"},{"en":"86","hi":"86"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 41 seedlings. 4 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 41 पौध थे, 4 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"45","ans_hi":"45","options":[{"en":"47","hi":"47"},{"en":"51","hi":"51"},{"en":"43","hi":"43"},{"en":"45","hi":"45"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The school garden soil dries quickly. Which practice helps?","hi":"विद्यालय बगीचे की मिट्टी जल्दी सूखती है। क्या मदद करता है?","ans":"Water carefully near plant roots","ans_hi":"पौधों की जड़ों के पास सावधानी से पानी दें","options":[{"en":"Water carefully near plant roots","hi":"पौधों की जड़ों के पास सावधानी से पानी दें"},{"en":"Remove all soil","hi":"पूरी मिट्टी हटा दें"},{"en":"Waste water on paths","hi":"पगडंडी पर पानी बहाएँ"},{"en":"Break the plants","hi":"पौधे तोड़ें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The science club wants to save energy. What should it do?","hi":"विज्ञान क्लब ऊर्जा बचाना चाहता है। क्या करे?","ans":"Switch off unused electrical devices","ans_hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे","options":[{"en":"Keep lights on all day","hi":"दिनभर लाइट जलाए"},{"en":"Switch off unused electrical devices","hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे"},{"en":"Run fans in empty rooms","hi":"खाली कमरों में पंखे चलाए"},{"en":"Waste batteries","hi":"बैटरियाँ फेंके"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"What is good digital citizenship in a class group?","hi":"कक्षा समूह में अच्छा डिजिटल व्यवहार क्या है?","ans":"Use polite language and verify posts","ans_hi":"शिष्ट भाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना","options":[{"en":"Post insults","hi":"अपमान करना"},{"en":"Spread false rumours","hi":"झूठी अफवाह फैलाना"},{"en":"Use polite language and verify posts","hi":"शिष्ट भाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना"},{"en":"Share classmates' secrets","hi":"सहपाठियों की गुप्त बातें भेजना"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A student shares a photo of another child without permission. What is better?","hi":"बिना अनुमति दूसरे बच्चे का फोटो साझा हुआ। क्या उचित है?","ans":"Ask permission before sharing","ans_hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें","options":[{"en":"Add personal details","hi":"निजी जानकारी जोड़ें"},{"en":"Ask permission before sharing","hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें"},{"en":"Share more photos","hi":"और फोटो भेजें"},{"en":"Ignore privacy","hi":"गोपनीयता अनदेखी करें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A friend is left out of a group task. What should you do?","hi":"किसी मित्र को समूह कार्य से बाहर रखा गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Invite them to participate","ans_hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ","options":[{"en":"Invite them to participate","hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ"},{"en":"Refuse to listen","hi":"बात न सुनें"},{"en":"Hide the task","hi":"कार्य छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Make fun of them","hi":"मज़ाक उड़ाएँ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"How should students check an unusual online fact?","hi":"अजीब ऑनलाइन तथ्य की जाँच कैसे करें?","ans":"Compare reliable sources","ans_hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोतों की तुलना करें","options":[{"en":"Ignore dates and authors","hi":"तारीख और लेखक अनदेखे करें"},{"en":"Compare reliable sources","hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोतों की तुलना करें"},{"en":"Use only rumours","hi":"केवल अफवाह सुनें"},{"en":"Believe the first website","hi":"पहली वेबसाइट पर भरोसा करें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A confusing chart has no data source. What should you do?","hi":"अस्पष्ट चार्ट पर आँकड़ों का स्रोत न हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask where the data came from","ans_hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए","options":[{"en":"Hide the chart","hi":"चार्ट छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Accept it without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे मानें"},{"en":"Change its numbers","hi":"आँकड़े बदल दें"},{"en":"Ask where the data came from","hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Which choice reduces plastic waste on a picnic?","hi":"पिकनिक में प्लास्टिक कचरा कैसे घटेगा?","ans":"Carry a reusable water bottle","ans_hi":"दोबारा भरी जा सकने वाली बोतल रखें","options":[{"en":"Carry a reusable water bottle","hi":"दोबारा भरी जा सकने वाली बोतल रखें"},{"en":"Use many single-use cups","hi":"कई डिस्पोज़ेबल कप लें"},{"en":"Buy extra plastic bags","hi":"अधिक प्लास्टिक थैलियाँ लें"},{"en":"Throw wrappers in nature","hi":"रैपर प्रकृति में फेंकें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-4-3-06"},"4|2|7|GK":{"grade":"4","term":2,"year":7,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"Which river is associated with the city of Prayagraj?","hi":"प्रयागराज से कौन-सी नदी जुड़ी है?","ans":"Ganga","ans_hi":"गंगा","options":[{"en":"Krishna","hi":"कृष्णा"},{"en":"Kaveri","hi":"कावेरी"},{"en":"Narmada","hi":"नर्मदा"},{"en":"Ganga","hi":"गंगा"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"rivers"},{"en":"Which Indian state is popularly associated with the Kaziranga National Park?","hi":"काजीरंगा राष्ट्रीय उद्यान किस राज्य में है?","ans":"Assam","ans_hi":"असम","options":[{"en":"Assam","hi":"असम"},{"en":"West Bengal","hi":"पश्चिम बंगाल"},{"en":"Madhya Pradesh","hi":"मध