लाह लें"},{"en":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Share a password","hi":"पासवर्ड दें"},{"en":"Reply with details","hi":"जानकारी भेजें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A rainwater tank is overflowing. What is a sensible response?","hi":"वर्षाजल की टंकी से पानी बह रहा हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","ans_hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ","options":[{"en":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ"},{"en":"Contaminate the water","hi":"पानी गंदा करें"},{"en":"Ignore for weeks","hi":"हफ्तों अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Break the pipe","hi":"पाइप तोड़ दें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The science club wants to save energy. What should it do?","hi":"विज्ञान क्लब ऊर्जा बचाना चाहता है। क्या करे?","ans":"Switch off unused electrical devices","ans_hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे","options":[{"en":"Switch off unused electrical devices","hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे"},{"en":"Keep lights on all day","hi":"दिनभर लाइट जलाए"},{"en":"Run fans in empty rooms","hi":"खाली कमरों में पंखे चलाए"},{"en":"Waste batteries","hi":"बैटरियाँ फेंके"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Students notice an injured bird. What is safe?","hi":"विद्यार्थियों को घायल पक्षी दिखे। सुरक्षित कदम क्या है?","ans":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","ans_hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Chase it away","hi":"भगाएँ"},{"en":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ"},{"en":"Pull its wings","hi":"पंख खींचें"},{"en":"Throw stones","hi":"पत्थर मारें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-4-3-09"},"4|2|10|GK":{"grade":"4","term":2,"year":10,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"Which river is associated with the city of Prayagraj?","hi":"प्रयागराज से कौन-सी नदी जुड़ी है?","ans":"Ganga","ans_hi":"गंगा","options":[{"en":"Narmada","hi":"नर्मदा"},{"en":"Krishna","hi":"कृष्णा"},{"en":"Ganga","hi":"गंगा"},{"en":"Brahmaputra","hi":"ब्रह्मपुत्र"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"rivers"},{"en":"Which Indian state is popularly associated with the Kaziranga National Park?","hi":"काजीरंगा राष्ट्रीय उद्यान किस राज्य में है?","ans":"Assam","ans_hi":"असम","options":[{"en":"Kerala","hi":"केरल"},{"en":"Gujarat","hi":"गुजरात"},{"en":"Rajasthan","hi":"राजस्थान"},{"en":"Assam","hi":"असम"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"states"},{"en":"Where is the Red Fort located?","hi":"लाल किला कहाँ स्थित है?","ans":"Delhi","ans_hi":"दिल्ली","options":[{"en":"Delhi","hi":"दिल्ली"},{"en":"Bhopal","hi":"भोपाल"},{"en":"Jaipur","hi":"जयपुर"},{"en":"Varanasi","hi":"वाराणसी"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"cities"},{"en":"Which Indian city is known for the Gateway of India monument?","hi":"गेटवे ऑफ इंडिया स्मारक किस शहर में है?","ans":"Mumbai","ans_hi":"मुंबई","options":[{"en":"Bhopal","hi":"भोपाल"},{"en":"Jaipur","hi":"जयपुर"},{"en":"Mumbai","hi":"मुंबई"},{"en":"Chennai","hi":"चेन्नई"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"cities"},{"en":"Which part of a plant supports leaves and flowers?","hi":"पौधे का कौन-सा भाग पत्तियों और फूलों को सहारा देता है?","ans":"Stem","ans_hi":"तना","options":[{"en":"Petals","hi":"पंखुड़ियाँ"},{"en":"Flower","hi":"फूल"},{"en":"Fruit","hi":"फल"},{"en":"Stem","hi":"तना"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"plantparts"},{"en":"What do we call joints between bones?","hi":"दो हड्डियों के मिलने के स्थान क