,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which process breaks rocks into smaller pieces naturally?","hi":"चट्टानों के प्राकृतिक रूप से टूटने की प्रक्रिया क्या है?","ans":"Weathering","ans_hi":"अपक्षय","options":[{"en":"Transpiration","hi":"वाष्पोत्सर्जन"},{"en":"Atmosphere","hi":"वायुमंडल"},{"en":"Condensation","hi":"संघनन"},{"en":"Weathering","hi":"अपक्षय"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 49 trees on Monday and 12 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 49 और मंगलवार को 12 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"61","ans_hi":"61","options":[{"en":"60","hi":"60"},{"en":"59","hi":"59"},{"en":"61","hi":"61"},{"en":"122","hi":"122"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 62 paper sheets and reused 8. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 62 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 8 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"54","ans_hi":"54","options":[{"en":"108","hi":"108"},{"en":"55","hi":"55"},{"en":"54","hi":"54"},{"en":"64","hi":"64"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 5 rows with 4 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 5 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 4 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"20","ans_hi":"20","options":[{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"15","hi":"15"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"36 reusable bottles are shared equally among 6 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"36 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 6 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 40 birds on a tree. 12 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 40 पक्षी थे, 12 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"29","hi":"29"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 7 pages each day for 4 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 4 दिन तक रोज़ 7 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"21","hi":"21"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 5 litres of water a day for 6 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 6 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 5 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"30","ans_hi":"30","options":[{"en":"60","hi":"60"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 66 pencils, and 12 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 66 पेंसिल में 12 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"54","ans_hi":"54","options":[{"en":"108","hi":"108"},{"en":"66","hi":"66"},{"en":"54","hi":"54"},{"en":"53","hi":"53"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 45 recyclable items in the morning and 4 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 45 और शाम 4 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"49","ans_hi":"49","options":[{"en":"55","hi":"55"},{"en":"47","hi":"47"},{"en":"49","hi":"49"},{"en":"53","hi":"53"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 75 seedlings. 10 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 75 पौध थे, 10 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"85","ans_hi":"85","options":[{"en":"95","hi":"95"},{"en":"85","hi":"85"},{"en":"86","hi":"86"},{"en":"97","hi":"97"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"Students notice an injured bird. What is safe?","hi":"विद्यार्थियों को घायल पक्षी दिखे। सुरक्षित कदम क्या है?","ans":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","ans_hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Pull its wings","hi":"पंख खींचें"},{"en":"Chase it away","hi":"भगाएँ"},{"en":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ"},{"en":"Throw stones","hi":"पत्थर मारें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A child gets a message that asks for bank details. What is right?","hi":"बैंक जानकारी माँगने वाला संदेश आए तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","ans_hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Reply with details","hi":"जानकारी भेजें"},{"en":"Share a password","hi":"पासवर्ड दें"},{"en":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"},{"en":"Take a stranger's advice","hi":"अजनबी की सलाह लें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"What is good digital citizenship in a class group?","hi":"कक्षा समूह में अच्छा डिजिटल व्यवहार क्या है?","ans":"Use polite language and verify posts","ans_hi":"शिष्ट भाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना","options":[{"en":"Use polite language and verify posts","hi":"शिष्ट भाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना"},{"en":"Spread false rumours","hi":"झूठी अफवाह फैलाना"},{"en":"Share classmates' secrets","hi":"सहपाठियों की गुप्त बातें भेजना"},{"en":"Post insults","hi":"अपमान करना"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A viral message says school is closed, but no notice is issued. What should you do?","hi":"वायरल संदेश कहे स्कूल बंद है, पर सूचना न हो, तो क्या करें?","ans":"Check the official school notice","ans_hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें","options":[{"en":"Assume it is true","hi":"उसे सच मान लें"},{"en":"Send it to everyone","hi":"सबको भेजें"},{"en":"Delete official updates","hi":"आधिकारिक सूचना हटाएँ"},{"en":"Check the official school notice","hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A rainwater tank is overflowing. What is a sensible response?","hi":"वर्षाजल की टंकी से पानी बह रहा हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","ans_hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ","options":[{"en":"Break the pipe","hi":"पाइप तोड़ दें"},{"en":"Ignore for weeks","hi":"हफ्तों अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Contaminate the water","hi":"पानी गंदा करें"},{"en":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A student shares a photo of another child without permission. What is better?","hi":"बिना अनुमति दूसरे बच्चे का फोटो साझा हुआ। क्या उचित है?","ans":"Ask permission before sharing","ans_hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें","options":[{"en":"Share more photos","hi":"और फोटो भेजें"},{"en":"Add personal details","hi":"निजी जानकारी जोड़ें"},{"en":"Ask permission before sharing","hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें"},{"en":"Ignore privacy","hi":"गोपनीयता अनदेखी करें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The science club wants to save energy. What should it do?","hi":"विज्ञान क्लब ऊर्जा बचाना चाहता है। क्या करे?","ans":"Switch off unused electrical devices","ans_hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे","options":[{"en":"Keep lights on all day","hi":"दिनभर लाइट जलाए"},{"en":"Waste batteries","hi":"बैटरियाँ फेंके"},{"en":"Run fans in empty rooms","hi":"खाली कमरों में पंखे चलाए"},{"en":"Switch off unused electrical devices","hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्य