ars","ans_hi":"मंगल","options":[{"en":"Mercury","hi":"बुध"},{"en":"Neptune","hi":"वरुण"},{"en":"Mars","hi":"मंगल"},{"en":"Venus","hi":"शुक्र"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which planet is the largest in our Solar System?","hi":"सौरमंडल का सबसे बड़ा ग्रह कौन-सा है?","ans":"Jupiter","ans_hi":"बृहस्पति","options":[{"en":"Mars","hi":"मंगल"},{"en":"Jupiter","hi":"बृहस्पति"},{"en":"Mercury","hi":"बुध"},{"en":"Neptune","hi":"वरुण"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which instrument measures wind speed?","hi":"हवा की गति कौन-सा यंत्र मापता है?","ans":"Anemometer","ans_hi":"पवनवेगमापी","options":[{"en":"Troposphere","hi":"क्षोभमंडल"},{"en":"Barometer","hi":"वायुदाबमापी"},{"en":"Anemometer","hi":"पवनवेगमापी"},{"en":"Rain gauge","hi":"वर्षामापी"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which tool measures rainfall?","hi":"वर्षा की मात्रा कौन-सा यंत्र मापता है?","ans":"Rain gauge","ans_hi":"वर्षामापी","options":[{"en":"Thermometer","hi":"तापमापी"},{"en":"Troposphere","hi":"क्षोभमंडल"},{"en":"Rain gauge","hi":"वर्षामापी"},{"en":"Compass","hi":"दिशासूचक"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 56 trees on Monday and 4 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 56 और मंगलवार को 4 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"60","ans_hi":"60","options":[{"en":"60","hi":"60"},{"en":"120","hi":"120"},{"en":"61","hi":"61"},{"en":"66","hi":"66"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 67 paper sheets and reused 8. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 67 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 8 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"59","ans_hi":"59","options":[{"en":"59","hi":"59"},{"en":"118","hi":"118"},{"en":"69","hi":"69"},{"en":