fore forwarding an unverified message?","hi":"अपुष्ट संदेश आगे भेजने से पहले क्या करें?","ans":"Verify the claim","ans_hi":"दावे की पुष्टि","options":[{"en":"Switch off unused lights","hi":"अनुपयोगी लाइट बंद करना"},{"en":"Paper","hi":"कागज़"},{"en":"Verify the claim","hi":"दावे की पुष्टि"},{"en":"Turn off the tap","hi":"नल बंद रखें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 69 trees on Monday and 8 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 69 और मंगलवार को 8 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"77","ans_hi":"77","options":[{"en":"8","hi":"8"},{"en":"79","hi":"79"},{"en":"87","hi":"87"},{"en":"77","hi":"77"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 62 paper sheets and reused 8. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 62 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 8 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"54","ans_hi":"54","options":[{"en":"53","hi":"53"},{"en":"52","hi":"52"},{"en":"54","hi":"54"},{"en":"55","hi":"55"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 8 rows with 7 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 8 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 7 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"56","ans_hi":"56","options":[{"en":"55","hi":"55"},{"en":"63","hi":"63"},{"en":"56","hi":"56"},{"en":"48","hi":"48"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"60 reusable bottles are shared equally among 5 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"60 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 5 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"12","ans_hi":"12","options":[{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"13","hi":"13"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 61 birds on a tree. 13 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 61 पक्षी थे, 13 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"48","ans_hi":"48","options":[{"en":"50","hi":"50"},{"en":"96","hi":"96"},{"en":"49","hi":"49"},{"en":"48","hi":"48"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 12 pages each day for 4 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 4 दिन तक रोज़ 12 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"48","ans_hi":"48","options":[{"en":"49","hi":"49"},{"en":"54","hi":"54"},{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"52","hi":"52"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 6 litres of water a day for 6 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 6 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 6 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"36","ans_hi":"36","options":[{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"72","hi":"72"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"},{"en":"37","hi":"37"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 47 pencils, and 6 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 47 पेंसिल में 6 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"41","ans_hi":"41","options":[{"en":"49","hi":"49"},{"en":"39","hi":"39"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"41","hi":"41"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 52 recyclable items in the morning and 10 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 52 और शाम 10 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"62","ans_hi":"62","options":[{"en":"72","hi":"72"},{"en":"62","hi":"62"},{"en":"63","hi":"63"},{"en":"64","hi":"64"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 72 seedlings. 7 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 72 पौध थे, 7 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"79","ans_hi":"79","options":[{"en":"86","hi":"86"},{"en":"80","hi":"80"},{"en":"78","hi":"78"},{"en":"79","h