ाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना","options":[{"en":"Use polite language and verify posts","hi":"शिष्ट भाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना"},{"en":"Post insults","hi":"अपमान करना"},{"en":"Spread false rumours","hi":"झूठी अफवाह फैलाना"},{"en":"Share classmates' secrets","hi":"सहपाठियों की गुप्त बातें भेजना"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A confusing chart has no data source. What should you do?","hi":"अस्पष्ट चार्ट पर आँकड़ों का स्रोत न हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask where the data came from","ans_hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए","options":[{"en":"Accept it without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे मानें"},{"en":"Ask where the data came from","hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए"},{"en":"Change its numbers","hi":"आँकड़े बदल दें"},{"en":"Hide the chart","hi":"चार्ट छिपाएँ"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A rainwater tank is overflowing. What is a sensible response?","hi":"वर्षाजल की टंकी से पानी बह रहा हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","ans_hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ","options":[{"en":"Ignore for weeks","hi":"हफ्तों अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Break the pipe","hi":"पाइप तोड़ दें"},{"en":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ"},{"en":"Contaminate the water","hi":"पानी गंदा करें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"How should students check an unusual online fact?","hi":"अजीब ऑनलाइन तथ्य की जाँच कैसे करें?","ans":"Compare reliable sources","ans_hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोतों की तुलना करें","options":[{"en":"Use only rumours","hi":"केवल अफवाह सुनें"},{"en":"Compare reliable sources","hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोतों की तुलना करें"},{"en":"Believe the first website","hi":"पहली वेबसाइट पर भरोसा करें"},{"en":"Ignore dates and authors","hi":"तारीख और लेखक अनदेखे करें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Students notice