":"पृथ्वी","options":[{"en":"Jupiter","hi":"बृहस्पति"},{"en":"Earth","hi":"पृथ्वी"},{"en":"Uranus","hi":"अरुण"},{"en":"Mars","hi":"मंगल"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 72 trees on Monday and 12 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 72 और मंगलवार को 12 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"84","ans_hi":"84","options":[{"en":"168","hi":"168"},{"en":"84","hi":"84"},{"en":"83","hi":"83"},{"en":"98","hi":"98"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 73 paper sheets and reused 11. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 73 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 11 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"62","ans_hi":"62","options":[{"en":"60","hi":"60"},{"en":"73","hi":"73"},{"en":"63","hi":"63"},{"en":"62","hi":"62"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 9 rows with 3 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 9 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 3 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"27","ans_hi":"27","options":[{"en":"54","hi":"54"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"35 reusable bottles are shared equally among 7 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"35 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 7 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 44 birds on a tree. 11 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 44 पक्षी थे, 11 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"33","ans_hi":"33","options":[{"en":"66","hi":"66"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"},{"en":"33","hi":"33"},{"en":"31","hi":"31"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 8 pages each day for 6 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 6 दिन तक रोज़ 8 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"48","ans_hi":"48","options":[{"en":"54","hi":"54"},{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"47","hi":"47"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 8 litres of water a day for 5 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 5 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 8 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"40","ans_hi":"40","options":[{"en":"80","hi":"80"},{"en":"47","hi":"47"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 45 pencils, and 12 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 45 पेंसिल में 12 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"33","ans_hi":"33","options":[{"en":"33","hi":"33"},{"en":"45","hi":"45"},{"en":"31","hi":"31"},{"en":"35","hi":"35"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 66 recyclable items in the morning and 4 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 66 और शाम 4 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"70","ans_hi":"70","options":[{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"70","hi":"70"},{"en":"72","hi":"72"},{"en":"76","hi":"76"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 41 seedlings. 10 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 41 पौध थे, 10 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"51","ans_hi":"51","options":[{"en":"53","hi":"53"},{"en":"51","hi":"51"},{"en":"102","hi":"102"},{"en":"61","hi":"61"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"Students notice an injured bird. What is safe?","hi":"विद्यार्थियों को घायल पक्षी दिखे। सुरक्षित कदम क्या है?","ans":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","ans_hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Throw stones","hi":"पत्थर मारें"},{"en":"Pull its wings","hi":"पंख खींचें"},{"en":"Chase it away","hi":"भगाएँ"},{"en":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A viral message says school is closed, but no notice is issued. What should you do?","hi":"वायरल संदेश कहे स्कूल बंद है, पर सूचना न हो, तो क्या करें?","ans":"Check the official school notice","ans_hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें","options":[{"en":"Send it to everyone","hi":"सबको भेजें"},{"en":"Check the official school notice","hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें"},{"en":"Delete official updates","hi":"आधिकारिक सूचना हटाएँ"},{"en":"Assume it is true","hi":"उसे सच मान लें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A rainwater tank is overflowing. What is a sensible response?","hi":"वर्षाजल की टंकी से पानी बह रहा हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","ans_hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ","options":[{"en":"Break the pipe","hi":"पाइप तोड़ दें"},{"en":"Ignore for weeks","hi":"हफ्तों अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ"},{"en":"Contaminate the water","hi":"पानी गंदा करें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The science club wants to save energy. What should it do?","hi":"विज्ञान क्लब ऊर्जा बचाना चाहता है। क्या करे?","ans":"Switch off unused electrical devices","ans_hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे","options":[{"en":"Run fans in empty rooms","hi":"खाली कमरों में पंखे चलाए"},{"en":"Waste batteries","hi":"बैटरियाँ फेंके"},{"en":"Switch off unused electrical devices","hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे"},{"en":"Keep lights on all day","hi":"दिन