h 8 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 5 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 8 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"40","ans_hi":"40","options":[{"en":"41","hi":"41"},{"en":"80","hi":"80"},{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"24 reusable bottles are shared equally among 4 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"24 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 4 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"6","ans_hi":"6","options":[{"en":"4","hi":"4"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"},{"en":"10","hi":"10"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 56 birds on a tree. 6 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 56 पक्षी थे, 6 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"50","ans_hi":"50","options":[{"en":"50","hi":"50"},{"en":"52","hi":"52"},{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"49","hi":"49"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 7 pages each day for 4 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 4 दिन तक रोज़ 7 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"28","ans_hi":"28","options":[{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"27","hi":"27"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 6 litres of water a day for 4 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 4 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 6 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"24","ans_hi":"24","options":[{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 66 pencils, and 15 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 66 पेंसिल में 15 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"51","ans_hi":"51","options":[{"en":"66","hi":"66"},{"en":"51","hi":"51"},{"en":"5