","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The school garden soil dries quickly. Which practice helps?","hi":"विद्यालय बगीचे की मिट्टी जल्दी सूखती है। क्या मदद करता है?","ans":"Water carefully near plant roots","ans_hi":"पौधों की जड़ों के पास सावधानी से पानी दें","options":[{"en":"Break the plants","hi":"पौधे तोड़ें"},{"en":"Remove all soil","hi":"पूरी मिट्टी हटा दें"},{"en":"Waste water on paths","hi":"पगडंडी पर पानी बहाएँ"},{"en":"Water carefully near plant roots","hi":"पौधों की जड़ों के पास सावधानी से पानी दें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The science club wants to save energy. What should it do?","hi":"विज्ञान क्लब ऊर्जा बचाना चाहता है। क्या करे?","ans":"Switch off unused electrical devices","ans_hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे","options":[{"en":"Run fans in empty rooms","hi":"खाली कमरों में पंखे चलाए"},{"en":"Switch off unused electrical devices","hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे"},{"en":"Waste batteries","hi":"बैटरियाँ फेंके"},{"en":"Keep lights on all day","hi":"दिनभर लाइट जलाए"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-4-4-07"},"4|3|8|GK":{"grade":"4","term":3,"year":8,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"What is the process of a liquid becoming a solid called?","hi":"द्रव के ठोस बनने की प्रक्रिया क्या कहलाती है?","ans":"Freezing","ans_hi":"जमना","options":[{"en":"Transpiration","hi":"वाष्पोत्सर्जन"},{"en":"Germination","hi":"अंकुरण"},{"en":"Diffusion","hi":"विसरण"},{"en":"Freezing","hi":"जमना"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"processes"},{"en":"Which device measures how fast a vehicle moves?","hi":"वाहन की गति बताने वाला यंत्र क्या कहलाता है?","ans":"Speedometer","ans_hi":"स्पीडोमीटर","options":[{"en":"Compass","hi