,{"en":"Evaporation","hi":"वाष्पीकरण"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 58 trees on Monday and 12 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 58 और मंगलवार को 12 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"70","ans_hi":"70","options":[{"en":"68","hi":"68"},{"en":"82","hi":"82"},{"en":"140","hi":"140"},{"en":"70","hi":"70"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 69 paper sheets and reused 8. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 69 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 8 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"61","ans_hi":"61","options":[{"en":"62","hi":"62"},{"en":"61","hi":"61"},{"en":"60","hi":"60"},{"en":"71","hi":"71"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 10 rows with 4 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 10 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 4 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"40","ans_hi":"40","options":[{"en":"38","hi":"38"},{"en":"39","hi":"39"},{"en":"80","hi":"80"},{"en":"40","hi":"40"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"40 reusable bottles are shared equally among 8 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"40 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 8 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"13","hi":"13"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"5","hi":"5"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 54 birds on a tree. 5 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 54 पक्षी थे, 5 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"49","ans_hi":"49","options":[{"en":"49","hi":"49"},{"en":"50","hi":"50"},{"en":"56","hi":"56"},{"en":"51","hi":"51"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 10 pages each day for 6 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 6 दिन तक रोज़ 10 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"60","ans_hi":"60","options":[{"en":"59","hi":"59"},{"en":"60","hi":"60"},{"en":"120","hi":"120"},{"en":"58","hi":"58"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 5 litres of water a day for 6 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 6 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 5 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"30","ans_hi":"30","options":[{"en":"38","hi":"38"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 65 pencils, and 11 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 65 पेंसिल में 11 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"54","ans_hi":"54","options":[{"en":"53","hi":"53"},{"en":"54","hi":"54"},{"en":"52","hi":"52"},{"en":"65","hi":"65"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 50 recyclable items in the morning and 4 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 50 और शाम 4 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"54","ans_hi":"54","options":[{"en":"108","hi":"108"},{"en":"56","hi":"56"},{"en":"55","hi":"55"},{"en":"54","hi":"54"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 38 seedlings. 6 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 38 पौध थे, 6 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"44","ans_hi":"44","options":[{"en":"88","hi":"88"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"},{"en":"44","hi":"44"},{"en":"52","hi":"52"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A friend is left out of a group task. What should you do?","hi":"किसी मित्र को समूह कार्य से बाहर रखा गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Invite them to participate","ans_hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ","options":[{"en":"Hide the task","hi":"कार्य छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Refuse to listen","hi":"बात न सुनें"},{"en":"Make fun of them","hi":"मज़ाक उड़ाएँ"},{"en":"Invite them to participate","hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The science club wants to save energy. What should it do?","hi":"विज्ञान क्लब ऊर्जा बचाना चाहता है। क्या करे?","ans":"Switch off unused electrical devices","ans_hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे","options":[{"en":"Run fans in empty rooms","hi":"खाली कमरों में पंखे चलाए"},{"en":"Switch off unused electrical devices","hi":"अनुपयोगी विद्युत उपकरण बंद करे"},{"en":"Waste batteries","hi":"बैटरियाँ फेंके"},{"en":"Keep lights on all day","hi":"दिनभर लाइट जलाए"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A confusing chart has no data source. What should you do?","hi":"अस्पष्ट चार्ट पर आँकड़ों का स्रोत न हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask where the data came from","ans_hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए","options":[{"en":"Ask where the data came from","hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए"},{"en":"Accept it without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे मानें"},{"en":"Hide the chart","hi":"चार्ट छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Change its numbers","hi":"आँकड़े बदल दें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The school garden soil dries quickly. Which practice helps?","hi":"विद्यालय बगीचे की मिट्टी जल्दी सूखती है। क्या मदद करता है?","ans":"Water carefully near plant roots","ans_hi":"पौधों की जड़ों के पास सावधानी से पानी दें","options":[{"en":"Remove all soil","hi":"पूरी मिट्टी हटा दें"},{"en":"Break the plants","hi":"पौधे तोड़ें"},{"en":"Water carefully near plant roots","hi":"पौधों की जड़ों के पास सावधानी से पानी दें"},{"en":"Waste water on paths","hi":"पगडंडी पर पानी बहाएँ"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A viral message says school is closed, but no notice is issued. What should you do?","hi":"वायरल संदेश कहे स्कूल बंद है, पर सूचना न हो, तो क्या करें?","ans":"Check the official school notice","ans_hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें","options":[{"en":"Assume it is true","hi":"उसे सच मान लें"},{"en":"Delete official updates","hi":"आधिकारिक सूचना हटाएँ"},{"en":"Check the official school notice","hi":"विद्यालय की आधिकारिक सूचना जाँचें"},{"en":"Send it to everyone","hi":"सबको भेजें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A rainwater tank is overflowing. What is a sensible response?","hi":"वर्षाजल की टंकी से पानी बह रहा हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","ans_hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ","options":[{"en":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ"},{"en":"Break the pipe","hi":"पाइप तोड़ दें"},{"en":"Contaminate the water","hi":"पानी गंदा करें"},{"en":"Ignore for weeks","hi":"हफ्तों अनदेखा करें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A child gets a message that asks for bank details. What is right?","hi":"बैंक जानकारी माँगने वाला संदेश आए तो क्या करें?","ans":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","ans_hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Reply with details","hi":"जानकारी भेजें"},{"en":"Take a stranger's advice","hi":"अजनबी की सलाह लें"},{"en":"Share a password","hi":"पासवर्ड दें"},{"en":"Do not reply; inform a trusted adult","hi":"उत्तर न दें; विश्वसनीय बड़े को बताएँ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Which choice reduces plastic waste on a picnic?","hi":"पिकनिक में प्लास्टिक कचरा कैसे घटेगा?","ans":"Carry a reusable water bottle","ans_hi":"दोबारा भरी जा सकने वाली बोतल रखें","options":[{"en":"Throw wrappers in nature","hi":"रैपर प्रकृति में फेंकें"},{"en":"Use many single-use cups","hi":"कई डिस्पोज़ेबल कप लें"},{"en":"Buy extra plastic bags","hi":"अधिक प्लास्टिक थैलियाँ लें"},{"en":"Carry a reusable water bottle","hi":"दोबारा भरी जा सकने वाली बोतल रखें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-4-4-08"},"4|3|9|GK":{"grade":"4","term":3,"year":9,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"What is the process of a liquid becoming a solid called?","hi":"द्रव के ठोस बनने की प्रक्रिया क्या कहलाती है?","ans":"Freezing","ans_hi":"जमना","options":[{"en":"Transpiration","hi":"वाष्पोत्सर्जन"},{"en":"Freezing","hi":"जमना"},{"en":"Photosynthesis","hi":"प्रकाश-संश्लेषण"},{"en":"Digestion","hi":"पाचन"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"processes"},{"en":"Which device measures how fast a vehicle moves?","hi":"वाहन की गति बताने वाला यंत्र क्या कहलाता है?","ans":"Speedometer","ans_hi":"स्पीडोमीटर","options":[{"en":"Rain gauge","hi":"वर्षामापी"},{"en":"Voltmeter","hi":"वोल्टमीटर"},{"en":"Speedometer","hi":"स्पीडोमीटर"},{"en":"Compass","hi":"दिशासूचक"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"instruments"},{"en":"How many minutes are in one hour?","hi":"एक घंटे में कितने मिनट होते हैं?","ans":"60","ans_hi":"60","options":[{"en":"Four","hi":"चार"},{"en":"Twelve","hi":"बारह"},{"en":"60","hi":"60"},{"en":"Three","hi":"तीन"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"quantities"},{"en":"Which planet is famous for its Great Red Spot?","hi":"कौन-सा ग्रह ग्रेट रेड स्पॉट के लिए प्रसिद्ध है?","ans":"Jupiter","ans_hi":"बृहस्पति","options":[{"en":"Neptune","hi":"वरुण"},{"en":"Jupiter","hi":"बृहस्पति"},{"en":"Mercury","hi":"बुध"},{"en":"Mars","hi":"मंगल"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"planets"},{"en":"Which organ absorbs most nutrients from digested food?","hi":"पचे हुए भोजन के अधिकांश पोष