 3 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 11 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 3 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"33","ans_hi":"33","options":[{"en":"66","hi":"66"},{"en":"33","hi":"33"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"38","hi":"38"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"36 reusable bottles are shared equally among 4 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"36 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 4 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"9","ans_hi":"9","options":[{"en":"11","hi":"11"},{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"9","hi":"9"},{"en":"7","hi":"7"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 71 birds on a tree. 16 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 71 पक्षी थे, 16 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"55","ans_hi":"55","options":[{"en":"56","hi":"56"},{"en":"71","hi":"71"},{"en":"55","hi":"55"},{"en":"54","hi":"54"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 7 pages each day for 3 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 3 दिन तक रोज़ 7 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"21","ans_hi":"21","options":[{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"26","hi":"26"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 12 litres of water a day for 3 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 3 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 12 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"36","ans_hi":"36","options":[{"en":"72","hi":"72"},{"en":"39","hi":"39"},{"en":"41","hi":"41"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 75 pencils, and 4 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 75 पेंसिल में 4 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"71","ans_hi":"71","options":[{"en":"73","hi":"73"},{"en":"75","hi":"75"},{"en":"71","hi":"71"},{"en":"72","hi":"72"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 54 recyclable items in the morning and 16 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 54 और शाम 16 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"70","ans_hi":"70","options":[{"en":"70","hi":"70"},{"en":"69","hi":"69"},{"en":"88","hi":"88"},{"en":"71","hi":"71"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 53 seedlings. 10 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 53 पौध थे, 10 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"63","ans_hi":"63","options":[{"en":"65","hi":"65"},{"en":"63","hi":"63"},{"en":"61","hi":"61"},{"en":"75","hi":"75"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student shares a photo of another child without permission. What is better?","hi":"बिना अनुमति दूसरे बच्चे का फोटो साझा हुआ। क्या उचित है?","ans":"Ask permission before sharing","ans_hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें","options":[{"en":"Share more photos","hi":"और फोटो भेजें"},{"en":"Add personal details","hi":"निजी जानकारी जोड़ें"},{"en":"Ask permission before sharing","hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें"},{"en":"Ignore privacy","hi":"गोपनीयता अनदेखी करें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A friend is left out of a group task. What should you do?","hi":"किसी मित्र को समूह कार्य से बाहर रखा गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Invite them to participate","ans_hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ","options":[{"en":"Hide the task","hi":"कार्य छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Refuse to listen","hi":"बात न सुनें"},{"en":"Make fun of them","hi":"मज़ाक उड़ाएँ"},{"en":"Invite them to participate","hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"What is good digital citizenship in a class group?","hi":"कक्षा स