1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 71 trees on Monday and 4 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 71 और मंगलवार को 4 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"75","ans_hi":"75","options":[{"en":"77","hi":"77"},{"en":"150","hi":"150"},{"en":"75","hi":"75"},{"en":"79","hi":"79"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 45 paper sheets and reused 15. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 45 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 15 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"30","ans_hi":"30","options":[{"en":"60","hi":"60"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"47","hi":"47"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 6 rows with 6 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 6 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 6 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"36","ans_hi":"36","options":[{"en":"42","hi":"42"},{"en":"36","hi":"36"},{"en":"37","hi":"37"},{"en":"44","hi":"44"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"35 reusable bottles are shared equally among 7 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"35 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 7 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"5","ans_hi":"5","options":[{"en":"5","hi":"5"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"},{"en":"3","hi":"3"},{"en":"6","hi":"6"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 39 birds on a tree. 15 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 39 पक्षी थे, 15 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"24","ans_hi":"24","options":[{"en":"48","hi":"48"},{"en":"41","hi":"41"},{"en":"24","hi":"24"},{"en":"25","hi":"25"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 6 pages each day for 5 days. How many pages?","hi":"वि