bsite","hi":"पहली वेबसाइट पर भरोसा करें"},{"en":"Ignore dates and authors","hi":"तारीख और लेखक अनदेखे करें"},{"en":"Compare reliable sources","hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोतों की तुलना करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A rainwater tank is overflowing. What is a sensible response?","hi":"वर्षाजल की टंकी से पानी बह रहा हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","ans_hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ","options":[{"en":"Break the pipe","hi":"पाइप तोड़ दें"},{"en":"Contaminate the water","hi":"पानी गंदा करें"},{"en":"Tell an adult to fix the overflow","hi":"किसी बड़े को बताकर निकास ठीक कराएँ"},{"en":"Ignore for weeks","hi":"हफ्तों अनदेखा करें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A student shares a photo of another child without permission. What is better?","hi":"बिना अनुमति दूसरे बच्चे का फोटो साझा हुआ। क्या उचित है?","ans":"Ask permission before sharing","ans_hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें","options":[{"en":"Ask permission before sharing","hi":"साझा करने से पहले अनुमति लें"},{"en":"Ignore privacy","hi":"गोपनीयता अनदेखी करें"},{"en":"Share more photos","hi":"और फोटो भेजें"},{"en":"Add personal details","hi":"निजी जानकारी जोड़ें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A friend is left out of a group task. What should you do?","hi":"किसी मित्र को समूह कार्य से बाहर रखा गया। क्या करें?","ans":"Invite them to participate","ans_hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ","options":[{"en":"Refuse to listen","hi":"बात न सुनें"},{"en":"Make fun of them","hi":"मज़ाक उड़ाएँ"},{"en":"Hide the task","hi":"कार्य छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Invite them to participate","hi":"उसे भाग लेने बुलाएँ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"What is good digital citizenship in a class group?","hi":"कक्षा समूह में अच्छा डिजिटल व्यवहार क्या है?","ans":"Use polite language and verify posts","ans_hi":"शिष्ट भाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना","options":[{"en":"Spread false rumours","hi":"झूठी अफवाह फैलाना"},{"en":"Use polite language and verify posts","hi":"शिष्ट भाषा और जाँचकर संदेश भेजना"},{"en":"Post insults","hi":"अपमान करना"},{"en":"Share classmates' secrets","hi":"सहपाठियों की गुप्त बातें भेजना"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A confusing chart has no data source. What should you do?","hi":"अस्पष्ट चार्ट पर आँकड़ों का स्रोत न हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Ask where the data came from","ans_hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए","options":[{"en":"Ask where the data came from","hi":"पूछें आँकड़े कहाँ से आए"},{"en":"Accept it without checking","hi":"बिना जाँचे मानें"},{"en":"Change its numbers","hi":"आँकड़े बदल दें"},{"en":"Hide the chart","hi":"चार्ट छिपाएँ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Students notice an injured bird. What is safe?","hi":"विद्यार्थियों को घायल पक्षी दिखे। सुरक्षित कदम क्या है?","ans":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","ans_hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ","options":[{"en":"Pull its wings","hi":"पंख खींचें"},{"en":"Chase it away","hi":"भगाएँ"},{"en":"Throw stones","hi":"पत्थर मारें"},{"en":"Inform a teacher or animal rescuer","hi":"शिक्षक या पशु बचावकर्ता को बताएँ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"The school garden soil dries quickly. Which practice helps?","hi":"विद्यालय बगीचे की मिट्टी जल्दी सूखती है। क्या मदद करता है?","ans":"Water carefully near plant roots","ans_hi":"पौधों की जड़ों के पास सावधानी से पानी दें","options":[{"en":"Remove all soil","hi":"पूरी मिट्टी हटा दें"},{"en":"Break the plants","hi":"पौधे तोड़ें"},{"en":"Waste water on paths","hi":"पगडंडी पर पानी बहाएँ"},{"en":"Water carefully near plant roots","hi":"पौधों की जड़ों के पास सावधानी से पानी दें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक न