oning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A chart claims one medicine cures all illnesses. What is best?","hi":"चार्ट दावा करे एक दवा सभी रोग ठीक करती है। क्या उचित है?","ans":"Check with qualified health professionals","ans_hi":"योग्य स्वास्थ्य विशेषज्ञों से जाँचें","options":[{"en":"Check with qualified health professionals","hi":"योग्य स्वास्थ्य विशेषज्ञों से जाँचें"},{"en":"Accept as science","hi":"विज्ञान मान लें"},{"en":"Share as certain cure","hi":"पक्का उपचार बताकर फैलाएँ"},{"en":"Use without guidance","hi":"बिना सलाह उपयोग करें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"An AI chatbot gives a medical fact without a source. What is responsible?","hi":"AI चैटबॉट चिकित्सा तथ्य बिना स्रोत दे तो क्या उचित है?","ans":"Verify with reliable sources and an adult","ans_hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोत व बड़े से पुष्टि करें","options":[{"en":"Verify with reliable sources and an adult","hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोत व बड़े से पुष्टि करें"},{"en":"Treat it as certain","hi":"बिना जाँच पूर्ण सच मान लें"},{"en":"Ignore experts","hi":"विशेषज्ञ को अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Forward it as advice","hi":"सलाह बताकर फैलाएँ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"What reduces the risk of online account theft?","hi":"ऑनलाइन खाते की चोरी का जोखिम कैसे घटेगा?","ans":"Use a unique strong password","ans_hi":"अलग मजबूत पासवर्ड प्रयोग करें","options":[{"en":"Write it on public board","hi":"बोर्ड पर लिखें"},{"en":"Use birth date only","hi":"केवल जन्मतिथि रखें"},{"en":"Share passwords widely","hi":"पासवर्ड सबको दें"},{"en":"Use a unique strong password","hi":"अलग मजबूत पासवर्ड प्रयोग करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Two websites disagree on a scientific fact. What helps decide?","hi":"दो वेबसाइटों पर विज्ञान का तथ्य अलग हो तो क्या मदद करेगा?","ans":"Compare credible scientific references","ans_hi":"विश्वसनीय विज्ञान स्रोतों की तुलना","options":[{"en"