omponents help clotting?","hi":"रक्त का थक्का बनाने में कौन-से घटक मदद करते हैं?","ans":"Platelets","ans_hi":"प्लेटलेट्स","options":[{"en":"Small intestine","hi":"छोटी आँत"},{"en":"Platelets","hi":"प्लेटलेट्स"},{"en":"Skull","hi":"खोपड़ी"},{"en":"Pancreas","hi":"अग्न्याशय"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"Which organ filters blood to produce urine?","hi":"कौन-सा अंग रक्त छानकर मूत्र बनाता है?","ans":"Kidneys","ans_hi":"वृक्क (गुर्दे)","options":[{"en":"Skull","hi":"खोपड़ी"},{"en":"Lungs","hi":"फेफड़े"},{"en":"Kidneys","hi":"वृक्क (गुर्दे)"},{"en":"Pancreas","hi":"अग्न्याशय"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"Which organ stores bile made by the liver?","hi":"यकृत द्वारा बना पित्त कौन-सा अंग संग्रह करता है?","ans":"Gallbladder","ans_hi":"पित्ताशय","options":[{"en":"Stomach","hi":"आमाशय"},{"en":"Brain","hi":"मस्तिष्क"},{"en":"Liver","hi":"यकृत"},{"en":"Gallbladder","hi":"पित्ताशय"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"What is the main gas in Earth's atmosphere?","hi":"पृथ्वी के वायुमंडल में सर्वाधिक मात्रा में कौन-सी गैस है?","ans":"Nitrogen","ans_hi":"नाइट्रोजन","options":[{"en":"Hydrogen","hi":"हाइड्रोजन"},{"en":"Helium","hi":"हीलियम"},{"en":"Nitrogen","hi":"नाइट्रोजन"},{"en":"Oxygen","hi":"ऑक्सीजन"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"gases"},{"en":"Which gas is essential for human cellular respiration?","hi":"मानव कोशिकीय श्वसन के लिए कौन-सी गैस आवश्यक है?","ans":"Oxygen","ans_hi":"ऑक्सीजन","options":[{"en":"Oxygen","hi":"ऑक्सीजन"},{"en":"Ozone","hi":"ओज़ोन"},{"en":"Nitrogen","hi":"नाइट्रोजन"},{"en":"Carbon dioxide","hi":"कार्बन डाइऑक्साइड"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"gases"},{"en":"What is the SI unit of length?","hi":"लंबाई का SI मात्रक क्या है?","ans":"Metre","ans_hi":"मीटर","options":[{"en":"Co