 garden has 21 rows with 8 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 21 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 8 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"168","ans_hi":"168","options":[{"en":"170","hi":"170"},{"en":"168","hi":"168"},{"en":"147","hi":"147"},{"en":"167","hi":"167"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"180 reusable bottles are shared equally among 10 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"180 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 10 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"18","ans_hi":"18","options":[{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"28","hi":"28"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 103 birds on a tree. 26 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 103 पक्षी थे, 26 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"77","ans_hi":"77","options":[{"en":"77","hi":"77"},{"en":"76","hi":"76"},{"en":"79","hi":"79"},{"en":"105","hi":"105"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 21 pages each day for 5 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 5 दिन तक रोज़ 21 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"105","ans_hi":"105","options":[{"en":"103","hi":"103"},{"en":"84","hi":"84"},{"en":"105","hi":"105"},{"en":"210","hi":"210"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 26 litres of water a day for 9 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 9 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 26 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"234","ans_hi":"234","options":[{"en":"235","hi":"235"},{"en":"234","hi":"234"},{"en":"245","hi":"245"},{"en":"233","hi":"233"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 70 pencils, and 37 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 70 पेंसिल में 37 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"33","an