ं?","ans":"Check author and date","ans_hi":"लेखक और तारीख जाँचें","options":[{"en":"Check author and date","hi":"लेखक और तारीख जाँचें"},{"en":"Do not open it","hi":"उसे न खोलना"},{"en":"Solar panel","hi":"सौर पैनल"},{"en":"Verify with reliable sources","hi":"भरोसेमंद स्रोतों से जाँचें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which gas is formed when people breathe out?","hi":"श्वास छोड़ते समय कौन-सी गैस अधिक निकलती है?","ans":"Carbon dioxide","ans_hi":"कार्बन डाइऑक्साइड","options":[{"en":"Methane","hi":"मीथेन"},{"en":"Nitrogen","hi":"नाइट्रोजन"},{"en":"Oxygen","hi":"ऑक्सीजन"},{"en":"Carbon dioxide","hi":"कार्बन डाइऑक्साइड"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 184 trees on Monday and 38 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 184 और मंगलवार को 38 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"222","ans_hi":"222","options":[{"en":"260","hi":"260"},{"en":"38","hi":"38"},{"en":"222","hi":"222"},{"en":"262","hi":"262"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 115 paper sheets and reused 32. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 115 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 32 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"83","ans_hi":"83","options":[{"en":"82","hi":"82"},{"en":"166","hi":"166"},{"en":"84","hi":"84"},{"en":"83","hi":"83"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 17 rows with 8 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 17 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 8 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"136","ans_hi":"136","options":[{"en":"136","hi":"136"},{"en":"138","hi":"138"},{"en":"146","hi":"146"},{"en":"137","hi":"137"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"154 reusable bottles are shared equally among 11 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"154 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 11 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"14","ans_hi":"14","options":[{"en":"27","hi":"27"},{"en":"14","hi":"14"},{"en":"25","hi":"25"},{"en":"12","hi":"12"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 116 birds on a tree. 32 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 116 पक्षी थे, 32 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"84","ans_hi":"84","options":[{"en":"84","hi":"84"},{"en":"82","hi":"82"},{"en":"168","hi":"168"},{"en":"83","hi":"83"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 14 pages each day for 8 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 8 दिन तक रोज़ 14 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"112","ans_hi":"112","options":[{"en":"110","hi":"110"},{"en":"112","hi":"112"},{"en":"98","hi":"98"},{"en":"113","hi":"113"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 23 litres of water a day for 12 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 12 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 23 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"276","ans_hi":"276","options":[{"en":"290","hi":"290"},{"en":"274","hi":"274"},{"en":"276","hi":"276"},{"en":"277","hi":"277"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 122 pencils, and 16 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 122 पेंसिल में 16 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"106","ans_hi":"106","options":[{"en":"106","hi":"106"},{"en":"108","hi":"108"},{"en":"104","hi":"104"},{"en":"212","hi":"212"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 86 recyclable items in the morning and 21 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 86 और शाम 21 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"107","ans_hi":"107","options":[{"en":"107","hi":"107"},{"en":"105","hi":"105"},{"en":"106","hi":"106"},{"en":"214","hi":"214"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 109 seedlings. 29 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 109 पौध थे, 29 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"138","ans_hi":"138","options":[{"en":"167","hi":"167"},{"en":"169","hi":"169"},{"en":"139","hi":"139"},{"en":"138","hi":"138"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A worksheet asks you to cite information. Which is responsible?","hi":"कार्यपत्रक में सूचना का संदर्भ देना हो तो क्या उचित है?","ans":"Name the source and publication date","ans_hi":"स्रोत और प्रकाशित होने की तारीख लिखें","options":[{"en":"Name the source and publication date","hi":"स्रोत और प्रकाशित होने की तारीख लिखें"},{"en":"Use no reference","hi":"बिना संदर्भ लिखें"},{"en":"Invent a source","hi":"झूठा स्रोत बनाएँ"},{"en":"Copy without acknowledgement","hi":"बिना श्रेय नकल करें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"An old phone no longer works. What is an environmentally sound step?","hi":"पुराना फोन काम न करे तो पर्यावरण के लिए क्या सही है?","ans":"Take it to authorised e-waste collection","ans_hi":"अधिकृत ई-कचरा केंद्र पर दें","options":[{"en":"Burn it at home","hi":"घर में जलाएँ"},{"en":"Throw it in a river","hi":"नदी में फेंकें"},{"en":"Bury the battery in soil","hi":"बैटरी जमीन में दबाएँ"},{"en":"Take it to authorised e-waste collection","hi":"अधिकृत ई-कचरा केंद्र पर दें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"An AI chatbot gives a medical fact without a source. What is responsible?","hi":"AI चैटबॉट चिकित्सा तथ्य बिना स्रोत दे तो क्या उचित है?","ans":"Verify with reliable sources and an adult","ans_hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोत व बड़े से पुष्टि करें","options":[{"en":"Verify with reliable sources and an adult","hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोत व बड़े से पुष्टि करें"},{"en":"Ignore experts","hi":"विशेषज्ञ को अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Forward it as advice","hi":"सलाह बताकर फैलाएँ"},{"en":"Treat it as certain","hi":"बिना जाँच पूर्ण सच मान लें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A presentation contains a copied photo. What should a student do?","hi":"प्रस्तुति में दूसरे का फोटो लिया गया हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Credit the creator and check permission","ans_hi":"रचनाकार को श्रेय दें और अनुमति देखें","options":[{"en":"Erase attribution","hi":"श्रेय मिटाएँ"},{"en":"Credit the creator and check permission","hi":"रचनाकार को श्रेय दें और अनुमति देखें"},{"en":"Claim personal ownership","hi":"अपना बताएं"},{"en":"Ignore permissions","hi":"अनुमति अनदेखी करें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Which school project supports local biodiversity?","hi":"कौन-सी विद्यालय परियोजना स्थानीय जैव विविधता बचाएगी?","ans":"Grow and protect native plants","ans_hi":"स्थानीय पौधे उगाना और बचाना","options":[{"en":"Use litter as compost without sorting","hi":"बिना छाँटे कूड़ा डालना"},{"en":"Remove all small plants","hi":"सारे छोटे पौधे उखाड़ना"},{"en":"Grow and protect native plants","hi":"स्थानीय पौधे उगाना और बचाना"},{"en":"Destroy insect habitats","hi":"कीट आवास नष्ट करना"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-5-1-04"},"5|0|5|GK":{"grade":"5","term":0,"year":5,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"Which blood cells transport oxygen?","hi":"कौन-सी रक्त कोशिकाएँ ऑक्सीजन पहुँचाती हैं?","ans":"Red blood cells","ans_hi":"लाल रक्त कोशिकाएँ","options":[{"en":"Brain","hi":"मस्तिष्क"},{"en":"Small intestine","hi":"छोटी आँत"},{"en":"Gallbladder","hi":"पित्ताशय"},{"en":"Red blood cells","