्क"},{"en":"A class collected 122 paper sheets and reused 23. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 122 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 23 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"99","ans_hi":"99","options":[{"en":"100","hi":"100"},{"en":"99","hi":"99"},{"en":"101","hi":"101"},{"en":"124","hi":"124"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 35 rows with 5 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 35 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 5 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"175","ans_hi":"175","options":[{"en":"180","hi":"180"},{"en":"175","hi":"175"},{"en":"350","hi":"350"},{"en":"173","hi":"173"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"330 reusable bottles are shared equally among 11 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"330 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 11 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"30","ans_hi":"30","options":[{"en":"30","hi":"30"},{"en":"31","hi":"31"},{"en":"29","hi":"29"},{"en":"41","hi":"41"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 164 birds on a tree. 26 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 164 पक्षी थे, 26 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"138","ans_hi":"138","options":[{"en":"276","hi":"276"},{"en":"166","hi":"166"},{"en":"136","hi":"136"},{"en":"138","hi":"138"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 20 pages each day for 10 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 10 दिन तक रोज़ 20 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"200","ans_hi":"200","options":[{"en":"210","hi":"210"},{"en":"198","hi":"198"},{"en":"200","hi":"200"},{"en":"212","hi":"212"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 29 litres of water a day for 12 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 12 दिनों