 What should a student do?","hi":"प्रस्तुति में दूसरे का फोटो लिया गया हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Credit the creator and check permission","ans_hi":"रचनाकार को श्रेय दें और अनुमति देखें","options":[{"en":"Ignore permissions","hi":"अनुमति अनदेखी करें"},{"en":"Erase attribution","hi":"श्रेय मिटाएँ"},{"en":"Credit the creator and check permission","hi":"रचनाकार को श्रेय दें और अनुमति देखें"},{"en":"Claim personal ownership","hi":"अपना बताएं"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"An AI chatbot gives a medical fact without a source. What is responsible?","hi":"AI चैटबॉट चिकित्सा तथ्य बिना स्रोत दे तो क्या उचित है?","ans":"Verify with reliable sources and an adult","ans_hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोत व बड़े से पुष्टि करें","options":[{"en":"Forward it as advice","hi":"सलाह बताकर फैलाएँ"},{"en":"Verify with reliable sources and an adult","hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोत व बड़े से पुष्टि करें"},{"en":"Ignore experts","hi":"विशेषज्ञ को अनदेखा करें"},{"en":"Treat it as certain","hi":"बिना जाँच पूर्ण सच मान लें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A worksheet asks you to cite information. Which is responsible?","hi":"कार्यपत्रक में सूचना का संदर्भ देना हो तो क्या उचित है?","ans":"Name the source and publication date","ans_hi":"स्रोत और प्रकाशित होने की तारीख लिखें","options":[{"en":"Invent a source","hi":"झूठा स्रोत बनाएँ"},{"en":"Copy without acknowledgement","hi":"बिना श्रेय नकल करें"},{"en":"Use no reference","hi":"बिना संदर्भ लिखें"},{"en":"Name the source and publication date","hi":"स्रोत और प्रकाशित होने की तारीख लिखें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A small fire starts in a lab. What should students do first?","hi":"प्रयोगशाला में छोटी आग लगे तो विद्यार्थियों को पहले क्या करना चाहिए?","ans":"Alert the teacher and follow safety rules","ans_hi":"शिक्षक को बताएँ और सुरक्षा नियम मानें","options":[{"en":"Hide the incident","hi":"घटना छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Pour unknown chemicals","hi":"अनजान रसायन डालें"},{"en":"Crowd around the flame","hi":"लपटों के पास भीड़ लगाएँ"},{"en":"Alert the teacher and follow safety rules","hi":"शिक्षक को बताएँ और सुरक्षा नियम मानें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-5-1-05"},"5|0|6|GK":{"grade":"5","term":0,"year":6,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"Which blood cells transport oxygen?","hi":"कौन-सी रक्त कोशिकाएँ ऑक्सीजन पहुँचाती हैं?","ans":"Red blood cells","ans_hi":"लाल रक्त कोशिकाएँ","options":[{"en":"Liver","hi":"यकृत"},{"en":"Skull","hi":"खोपड़ी"},{"en":"Heart","hi":"हृदय"},{"en":"Red blood cells","hi":"लाल रक्त कोशिकाएँ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"Which blood cells help fight infections?","hi":"कौन-सी रक्त कोशिकाएँ संक्रमण से लड़ने में मदद करती हैं?","ans":"White blood cells","ans_hi":"श्वेत रक्त कोशिकाएँ","options":[{"en":"Skull","hi":"खोपड़ी"},{"en":"Kidneys","hi":"गुर्दे"},{"en":"Pancreas","hi":"अग्न्याशय"},{"en":"White blood cells","hi":"श्वेत रक्त कोशिकाएँ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"Which blood components help clotting?","hi":"रक्त का थक्का बनाने में कौन-से घटक मदद करते हैं?","ans":"Platelets","ans_hi":"प्लेटलेट्स","options":[{"en":"Small intestine","hi":"छोटी आँत"},{"en":"Kidneys","hi":"गुर्दे"},{"en":"Platelets","hi":"प्लेटलेट्स"},{"en":"Skull","hi":"खोपड़ी"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"Which organ filters blood to produce urine?","hi":"कौन-सा अंग रक्त छानकर मूत्र बनाता है?","ans":"Kidneys","ans_hi":"वृक्क (गुर्दे)","options":[{"en":"Gallbladder","hi":"पित्ताशय"},{"en":"Kidneys","hi":"वृक्क (गुर्दे)"},{"en":"Skull","hi":"खोपड़ी"},{"en":"S