ase results from vitamin C deficiency?","hi":"विटामिन C की कमी से कौन-सा रोग होता है?","ans":"Scurvy","ans_hi":"स्कर्वी","options":[{"en":"Vitamin D","hi":"विटामिन डी"},{"en":"Fibre","hi":"रेशा"},{"en":"Scurvy","hi":"स्कर्वी"},{"en":"Protein","hi":"प्रोटीन"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"food"},{"en":"Which disease results from vitamin D deficiency in growing children?","hi":"बढ़ते बच्चों में विटामिन D की कमी से कौन-सा रोग होता है?","ans":"Rickets","ans_hi":"रिकेट्स","options":[{"en":"Rickets","hi":"रिकेट्स"},{"en":"Iron","hi":"आयरन"},{"en":"Protein","hi":"प्रोटीन"},{"en":"Vitamin C","hi":"विटामिन सी"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"food"},{"en":"What is the general term for organisms too small to see unaided?","hi":"बिना उपकरण के न दिखने वाले अत्यंत छोटे जीव क्या कहलाते हैं?","ans":"Microorganisms","ans_hi":"सूक्ष्मजीव","options":[{"en":"Planets","hi":"ग्रह"},{"en":"Large mammals","hi":"बड़े स्तनधारी"},{"en":"Microorganisms","hi":"सूक्ष्मजीव"},{"en":"Rocks","hi":"चट्टानें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"Which part of the ear helps maintain balance?","hi":"कान का कौन-सा भाग संतुलन बनाए रखने में मदद करता है?","ans":"Inner ear","ans_hi":"भीतरी कान","options":[{"en":"Skull","hi":"खोपड़ी"},{"en":"Inner ear","hi":"भीतरी कान"},{"en":"Stomach","hi":"आमाशय"},{"en":"Small intestine","hi":"छोटी आँत"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"What are tissues made of?","hi":"ऊतक किससे मिलकर बनते हैं?","ans":"Cells","ans_hi":"कोशिकाएँ","options":[{"en":"Water droplets","hi":"पानी की बूँदें"},{"en":"Minerals","hi":"खनिज"},{"en":"Bones only","hi":"केवल हड्डियाँ"},{"en":"Cells","hi":"कोशिकाएँ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"Which organ produces bile?","hi":"पित्त किस अंग में बनता है?","ans":"Liv