्त कोशिकाएँ ऑक्सीजन पहुँचाती हैं?","ans":"Red blood cells","ans_hi":"लाल रक्त कोशिकाएँ","options":[{"en":"Lungs","hi":"फेफड़े"},{"en":"Liver","hi":"यकृत"},{"en":"Red blood cells","hi":"लाल रक्त कोशिकाएँ"},{"en":"Heart","hi":"हृदय"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"Which blood cells help fight infections?","hi":"कौन-सी रक्त कोशिकाएँ संक्रमण से लड़ने में मदद करती हैं?","ans":"White blood cells","ans_hi":"श्वेत रक्त कोशिकाएँ","options":[{"en":"Heart","hi":"हृदय"},{"en":"Skull","hi":"खोपड़ी"},{"en":"Pancreas","hi":"अग्न्याशय"},{"en":"White blood cells","hi":"श्वेत रक्त कोशिकाएँ"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"Which blood components help clotting?","hi":"रक्त का थक्का बनाने में कौन-से घटक मदद करते हैं?","ans":"Platelets","ans_hi":"प्लेटलेट्स","options":[{"en":"Platelets","hi":"प्लेटलेट्स"},{"en":"Liver","hi":"यकृत"},{"en":"Heart","hi":"हृदय"},{"en":"Lungs","hi":"फेफड़े"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"Which organ filters blood to produce urine?","hi":"कौन-सा अंग रक्त छानकर मूत्र बनाता है?","ans":"Kidneys","ans_hi":"वृक्क (गुर्दे)","options":[{"en":"Heart","hi":"हृदय"},{"en":"Small intestine","hi":"छोटी आँत"},{"en":"Liver","hi":"यकृत"},{"en":"Kidneys","hi":"वृक्क (गुर्दे)"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"Which organ stores bile made by the liver?","hi":"यकृत द्वारा बना पित्त कौन-सा अंग संग्रह करता है?","ans":"Gallbladder","ans_hi":"पित्ताशय","options":[{"en":"Brain","hi":"मस्तिष्क"},{"en":"Gallbladder","hi":"पित्ताशय"},{"en":"Lungs","hi":"फेफड़े"},{"en":"Stomach","hi":"आमाशय"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"What is the main gas in Earth's atmosphere?","hi":"पृथ्वी के वायुमंडल में सर्वाधिक मात्रा में कौन-सी गैस है?","ans":"Nitrogen","ans_hi":"नाइट्रोजन","options":[