ng / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 111 recyclable items in the morning and 35 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 111 और शाम 35 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"146","ans_hi":"146","options":[{"en":"35","hi":"35"},{"en":"292","hi":"292"},{"en":"146","hi":"146"},{"en":"147","hi":"147"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 181 seedlings. 16 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 181 पौध थे, 16 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"197","ans_hi":"197","options":[{"en":"197","hi":"197"},{"en":"394","hi":"394"},{"en":"213","hi":"213"},{"en":"195","hi":"195"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"An old phone no longer works. What is an environmentally sound step?","hi":"पुराना फोन काम न करे तो पर्यावरण के लिए क्या सही है?","ans":"Take it to authorised e-waste collection","ans_hi":"अधिकृत ई-कचरा केंद्र पर दें","options":[{"en":"Bury the battery in soil","hi":"बैटरी जमीन में दबाएँ"},{"en":"Burn it at home","hi":"घर में जलाएँ"},{"en":"Take it to authorised e-waste collection","hi":"अधिकृत ई-कचरा केंद्र पर दें"},{"en":"Throw it in a river","hi":"नदी में फेंकें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A worksheet asks you to cite information. Which is responsible?","hi":"कार्यपत्रक में सूचना का संदर्भ देना हो तो क्या उचित है?","ans":"Name the source and publication date","ans_hi":"स्रोत और प्रकाशित होने की तारीख लिखें","options":[{"en":"Invent a source","hi":"झूठा स्रोत बनाएँ"},{"en":"Use no reference","hi":"बिना संदर्भ लिखें"},{"en":"Name the source and publication date","hi":"स्रोत और प्रकाशित होने की तारीख लिखें"},{"en":"Copy without acknowledgement","hi":"बिना श्रेय नकल करें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A webpage asks for a one-time password. What should you do?","hi":"वेबपेज एक बार इस्तेमाल होने वाला पासवर्ड माँगे तो क्या करें?","ans":"Never share OTP with others","ans_hi":"OTP किसी और को न दें","options":[{"en":"Post it publicly","hi":"सबके सामने डालें"},{"en":"Share it by message","hi":"संदेश में भेजें"},{"en":"Reuse it as a school password","hi":"उसे स्कूल पासवर्ड बनाएँ"},{"en":"Never share OTP with others","hi":"OTP किसी और को न दें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"When a local pond is polluted, what should a school project examine?","hi":"स्थानीय तालाब प्रदूषित हो तो विद्यालय परियोजना में क्या देखें?","ans":"Sources of pollution and solutions","ans_hi":"प्रदूषण के स्रोत व समाधान","options":[{"en":"Ways to add litter","hi":"कूड़ा बढ़ाने के तरीके"},{"en":"Ways to hide pollution","hi":"प्रदूषण छिपाने के तरीके"},{"en":"Only the pond's name","hi":"केवल नाम"},{"en":"Sources of pollution and solutions","hi":"प्रदूषण के स्रोत व समाधान"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"An AI chatbot gives a medical fact without a source. What is responsible?","hi":"AI चैटबॉट चिकित्सा तथ्य बिना स्रोत दे तो क्या उचित है?","ans":"Verify with reliable sources and an adult","ans_hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोत व बड़े से पुष्टि करें","options":[{"en":"Treat it as certain","hi":"बिना जाँच पूर्ण सच मान लें"},{"en":"Forward it as advice","hi":"सलाह बताकर फैलाएँ"},{"en":"Verify with reliable sources and an adult","hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोत व बड़े से पुष्टि करें"},{"en":"Ignore experts","hi":"विशेषज्ञ को अनदेखा करें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-5-1-10"},"5|1|1|GK":{"grade":"5","term":1,"year":1,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"Which green pigment helps plants absorb light?","hi":"कौन-सा हरा वर्णक पौधों को प्रकाश सोखने में मदद करता है?","ans":"Chlorophyll","ans_hi":"पर्णहरित","options":[{"en":"Chlorophyll","hi":"पर्णहरित"},{"en":"Keratin","hi":"केराटिन"},{"en":"Insulin","hi":"इंसुलिन"},{"en":"Haemoglobin","hi":"हीमोग्लोबिन"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What is the loss of water vapour from leaves called?","hi":"पत्तियों से जलवाष्प निकलने की प्रक्रिया क्या कहलाती है?","ans":"Transpiration","ans_hi":"वाष्पोत्सर्जन","options":[{"en":"Freezing","hi":"जमना"},{"en":"Melting","hi":"गलन"},{"en":"Transpiration","hi":"वाष्पोत्सर्जन"},{"en":"Germination","hi":"अंकुरण"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"processes"},{"en":"What are the tiny pores in leaves called?","hi":"पत्तियों पर सूक्ष्म रंध्र क्या कहलाते हैं?","ans":"Stomata","ans_hi":"रंध्र","options":[{"en":"Root hairs","hi":"जड़ रोम"},{"en":"Xylem vessels","hi":"जाइलम वाहिकाएँ"},{"en":"Petals","hi":"पंखुड़ियाँ"},{"en":"Stomata","hi":"रंध्र"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"Which flower part produces pollen?","hi":"फूल का कौन-सा भाग पराग बनाता है?","ans":"Anther","ans_hi":"परागकोष","options":[{"en":"Ovary","hi":"अंडाशय"},{"en":"Anther","hi":"परागकोष"},{"en":"Sepal","hi":"बाह्यदल"},{"en":"Stigma","hi":"वर्तिकाग्र"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What is the transfer of pollen to the stigma called?","hi":"परागकण का वर्तिकाग्र तक पहुँचना क्या कहलाता है?","ans":"Pollination","ans_hi":"परागण","options":[{"en":"Digestion","hi":"पाचन"},{"en":"Germination","hi":"अंकुरण"},{"en":"Pollination","hi":"परागण"},{"en":"Transpiration","hi":"वाष्पोत्सर्जन"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"processes"},{"en":"Which organism fixes nitrogen in legume root nodules?","hi":"दलहनी पौधों की जड़ों की ग्रंथियों में नाइट्रोजन स्थिरीकरण करने वाला जीव कौन-सा है?","ans":"Rhizobium bacteria","ans_hi":"राइजोबियम जीवाणु","options":[{"en":"Small intestine","hi":"छोटी आँत"},{"en":"Rhizobium bacteria","hi":"राइजोबियम जीवाणु"},{"en":"Skull","hi":"खोपड़ी"},{"en":"Brain","hi":"मस्तिष्क"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"What is the natural home of an organism called?","hi":"किसी जीव का प्राकृतिक निवास क्या कहलाता है?","ans":"Habitat","ans_hi":"आवास","options":[{"en":"Food chain","hi":"खाद्य श्रृंखला"},{"en":"Population","hi":"जनसंख्या"},{"en":"Habitat","hi":"आवास"},{"en":"Niche alone","hi":"केवल पारिस्थितिक स्थान"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What is the variety of living organisms called?","hi":"जीवों की विविधता क्या कहलाती है?","ans":"Biodiversity","ans_hi":"जैव विविधता","options":[{"en":"Deforestation","hi":"वनों की कटाई"},{"en":"Monoculture","hi":"एकल फसल"},{"en":"Erosion","hi":"अपरदन"},{"en":"Biodiversity","hi":"जैव विविधता"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What is an animal that hunts other animals called?","hi":"दूसरे जीवों का शिकार करने वाला जीव क्या कहलाता है?","ans":"Predator","ans_hi":"परभक्षी","options":[{"en":"Decomposer","hi":"अपघटक"},{"en":"Prey","hi":"शिकार"},{"en":"Producer","hi":"उत्पादक"},{"en":"Predator","hi":"परभक्षी"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What is the organism eaten by a predator called?","hi":"परभक्षी द्वारा खाया जाने वाला जीव क्या कहलाता है?","ans":"Prey","ans_hi":"शिकार जीव","options":[{"en":"Parasites","hi":"परजीवी"},{"en":"Prey","hi":"शिकार जीव"},{"en":"Decomposers","hi":"अपघटक"},{"en":"Consumers","hi":"उपभोक्ता"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"ecology"},{"en":"Which part of a seed stores food in many bean seeds?","hi":"राजमा जैसी कई बीजों में भोजन कहाँ संग्रहित रहता है?","ans":"Cotyledons","ans_hi":"बीजपत्र","options":[{"en":"Petals","hi":"पंखुड़ियाँ"},{"en":"Stem bark","hi":"तने की छाल"},{"en":"Cotyledons","hi":"बीजपत्र"},{"en":"Root hairs","hi":"जड़ रोम"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What is the movement of water through a plant called?","hi":"पौधे में पानी के ऊपर पहुँचने की प्रक्रिया में कौन-सा ऊतक मुख्य है?","ans":"Xylem transport","ans_hi":"जाइलम द्वारा जल परिवहन","options":[{"en":"Condensation","hi":"संघनन"},{"en":"Sublimation","hi":"उर्ध्वपातन"},{"en":"Xylem transport","hi":"जाइलम द्वारा जल परिवहन"},{"en":"Fermentation","hi":"किण्वन"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"processes"},{"en":"Which nutrient is typically fixed by nitrogen-fixing bacteria?","hi":"नाइट्रोजन स्थिरीकरण जीवाणु किस तत्व को उपयोगी रूप में बदलते हैं?","ans":"Nitrogen","ans_hi":"नाइट्रोजन","options":[{"en":"Carbohydrates","hi":"कार्बोहाइड्रेट"},{"en":"Protein","hi":"प्रोटीन"},{"en":"Nitrogen","hi":"नाइट्रोजन"},{"en":"Vitamin C","hi":"विटामिन सी"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"food"},{"en":"What do fungi often help do in ecosystems?","hi":"पारितंत्र में कवक प्रायः क्या कार्य करते हैं?","ans":"Decomposition","ans_hi":"अपघटन","options":[{"en":"Evaporation","hi":"वाष्पीकरण"},{"en":"Pollination","hi":"परागण"},{"en":"Decomposition","hi":"अपघटन"},{"en":"Photosynthesis","hi":"प्रकाश-संश्लेषण"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What is a community of organisms and surroundings called?","hi":"जीव समुदाय और उसके परिवेश की संयुक्त प्रणाली क्या कहलाती है?","ans":"Ecosystem","ans_hi":"पारितंत्र","options":[{"en":"Only the air","hi":"केवल वायु"},{"en":"Single organism","hi":"एक जीव"},{"en":"Ecosystem","hi":"पारितंत्र"},{"en":"Only the soil","hi":"केवल मिट्टी"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What is an organism that makes its own food called?","hi":"अपना भोजन स्वयं बनाने वाला जीव क्या कहलाता है?","ans":"Autotroph","ans_hi":"स्वपोषी","options":[{"en":"Decomposer","hi":"अपघटक"},{"en":"Herbivore","hi":"शाकाहारी"},{"en":"Autotroph","hi":"स्वपोषी"},{"en":"Parasite","hi":"परजीवी"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What is the main component of the cell wall in plants?","hi":"पादप कोशिका भित्ति का प्रमुख पदार्थ क्या है?","ans":"Cellulose","ans_hi":"सेलुलोज","options":[{"en":"Starch","hi":"स्टार्च"},{"en":"Keratin","hi":"केराटिन"},{"en":"Haemoglobin","hi":"हीमोग्लोबिन"},{"en":"Cellulose","hi":"सेलुलोज"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"Which plant process transfers pollen to stigma?","hi":"पौधों में परागकण वर्तिकाग्र तक पहुँचने की प्रक्रिया क्या है?","ans":"Pollination","ans_hi":"परागण","options":[{"en":"Photosynthesis","hi":"प्रकाश-संश्लेषण"},{"en":"Diffusion","hi":"विसरण"},{"en":"Sublimation","hi":"उर्ध्वपातन"},{"en":"Pollination","hi":"परागण"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"processes"},{"en":"Which part of a plant holds seeds in many flowering plants?","hi":"अनेक पुष्पीय पौधों में बीज कहाँ सुरक्षित रहते हैं?","ans":"Fruit","ans_hi":"फल","options":[{"en":"Phloem","hi":"फ्लोएम"},{"en":"Leaf","hi":"पत्ती"},{"en":"Flower","hi":"फूल"},{"en":"Fruit","hi":"फल"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"plantparts"},{"en":"Which water cycle process forms clouds?","hi":"जल चक्र में बादल बनने में कौन-सी प्रक्रिया प्रमुख है?","ans":"Condensation","ans_hi":"संघनन","options":[{"en":"Evaporation","hi":"वाष्पीकरण"},{"en":"Germination","hi":"अंकुरण"},{"en":"Sublimation","hi":"उर्ध्वपातन"},{"en":"Condensation","hi":"संघनन"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"processes"},{"en":"Which cell part regulates materials entering 