here are 145 birds on a tree. 27 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 145 पक्षी थे, 27 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"118","ans_hi":"118","options":[{"en":"118","hi":"118"},{"en":"145","hi":"145"},{"en":"119","hi":"119"},{"en":"117","hi":"117"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 18 pages each day for 5 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 5 दिन तक रोज़ 18 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"90","ans_hi":"90","options":[{"en":"92","hi":"92"},{"en":"95","hi":"95"},{"en":"90","hi":"90"},{"en":"88","hi":"88"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 19 litres of water a day for 7 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 7 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 19 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"133","ans_hi":"133","options":[{"en":"140","hi":"140"},{"en":"132","hi":"132"},{"en":"133","hi":"133"},{"en":"135","hi":"135"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 137 pencils, and 15 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 137 पेंसिल में 15 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"122","ans_hi":"122","options":[{"en":"124","hi":"124"},{"en":"122","hi":"122"},{"en":"123","hi":"123"},{"en":"244","hi":"244"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 90 recyclable items in the morning and 26 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 90 और शाम 26 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"116","ans_hi":"116","options":[{"en":"115","hi":"115"},{"en":"118","hi":"118"},{"en":"117","hi":"117"},{"en":"116","hi":"116"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 121 seedlings. 19 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 121 पौध थे, 19 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"140","ans_hi":"140","options":[{"en":"161","hi":"161"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"138","hi":"138"},{"en":"140","hi":"140"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"An old phone no longer works. What is an environmentally sound step?","hi":"पुराना फोन काम न करे तो पर्यावरण के लिए क्या सही है?","ans":"Take it to authorised e-waste collection","ans_hi":"अधिकृत ई-कचरा केंद्र पर दें","options":[{"en":"Throw it in a river","hi":"नदी में फेंकें"},{"en":"Bury the battery in soil","hi":"बैटरी जमीन में दबाएँ"},{"en":"Burn it at home","hi":"घर में जलाएँ"},{"en":"Take it to authorised e-waste collection","hi":"अधिकृत ई-कचरा केंद्र पर दें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"What reduces the risk of online account theft?","hi":"ऑनलाइन खाते की चोरी का जोखिम कैसे घटेगा?","ans":"Use a unique strong password","ans_hi":"अलग मजबूत पासवर्ड प्रयोग करें","options":[{"en":"Use birth date only","hi":"केवल जन्मतिथि रखें"},{"en":"Write it on public board","hi":"बोर्ड पर लिखें"},{"en":"Use a unique strong password","hi":"अलग मजबूत पासवर्ड प्रयोग करें"},{"en":"Share passwords widely","hi":"पासवर्ड सबको दें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A chart claims one medicine cures all illnesses. What is best?","hi":"चार्ट दावा करे एक दवा सभी रोग ठीक करती है। क्या उचित है?","ans":"Check with qualified health professionals","ans_hi":"योग्य स्वास्थ्य विशेषज्ञों से जाँचें","options":[{"en":"Check with qualified health professionals","hi":"योग्य स्वास्थ्य विशेषज्ञों से जाँचें"},{"en":"Use without guidance","hi":"बिना सलाह उपयोग करें"},{"en":"Accept as science","hi":"विज्ञान मान लें"},{"en":"Share as certain cure","hi":"पक्का उपचार बताकर फैलाएँ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A presentation contains a copied photo. What should a student do?","hi":"प्रस्तुति में दूसरे का फोटो लिया गया हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Credit the creator and check permission","ans_hi":"रचनाकार को श्रेय दें और अनुमति देखें","options":[{"en":"Erase attribution","hi":"श्रेय मिटाएँ"},{"en":"Ignore permissions","hi":"अनुमति अनदेखी करें"},{"en":"Credit the creator and check permission","hi":"रचनाकार को श्रेय दें और अनुमति देखें"},{"en":"Claim personal ownership","hi":"अपना बताएं"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A small fire starts in a lab. What should students do first?","hi":"प्रयोगशाला में छोटी आग लगे तो विद्यार्थियों को पहले क्या करना चाहिए?","ans":"Alert the teacher and follow safety rules","ans_hi":"शिक्षक को बताएँ और सुरक्षा नियम मानें","options":[{"en":"Hide the incident","hi":"घटना छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Pour unknown chemicals","hi":"अनजान रसायन डालें"},{"en":"Crowd around the flame","hi":"लपटों के पास भीड़ लगाएँ"},{"en":"Alert the teacher and follow safety rules","hi":"शिक्षक को बताएँ और सुरक्षा नियम मानें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-5-2-01"},"5|1|2|GK":{"grade":"5","term":1,"year":2,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"Which green pigment helps plants absorb light?","hi":"कौन-सा हरा वर्णक पौधों को प्रकाश सोखने में मदद करता है?","ans":"Chlorophyll","ans_hi":"पर्णहरित","options":[{"en":"Chlorophyll","hi":"पर्णहरित"},{"en":"Haemoglobin","hi":"हीमोग्लोबिन"},{"en":"Keratin","hi":"केराटिन"},{"en":"Insulin","hi":"इंसुलिन"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What is the loss of water vapour from leaves called?","hi":"पत्तियों से जलवाष्प निकलने की प्रक्रिया क्या कहलाती है?","ans":"Transpiration","ans_hi":"वाष्पोत्सर्जन","options":[{"en":"Germination","hi":"अंकुरण"},{"en":"Fermentation","hi":"किण्वन"},{"en":"Transpiration","hi":"वाष्पोत्सर्जन"},{"en":"Evaporation","hi":"वाष्पीकरण"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"processes"},{"en":"What are the tiny pores in leaves called?","hi":"पत्तियों पर सूक्ष्म रंध्र क्या कहलाते हैं?","ans":"Stomata","ans_hi":"रंध्र","options":[{"en":"Root hairs","hi":"जड़ रोम"},{"en":"Xylem vessels","hi":"जाइलम वाहिकाएँ"},{"en":"Petals","hi":"पंखुड़ियाँ"},{"en":"Stomata","hi":"रंध्र"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"Which flower part produces pollen?","hi":"फूल का कौन-सा भाग पराग बनाता है?","ans":"Anther","ans_hi":"परागकोष","options":[{"en":"Stigma","hi":"वर्तिकाग्र"},{"en":"Sepal","hi":"बाह्यदल"},{"en":"Ovary","hi":"अंडाशय"},{"en":"Anther","hi":"परागकोष"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What is the transfer of pollen to the stigma called?","hi":"परागकण का वर्तिकाग्र तक पहुँचना क्या कहलाता है?","ans":"Pollination","ans_hi":"परागण","options":[{"en":"Pollination","hi":"परागण"},{"en":"Melting","hi":"गलन"},{"en":"Freezing","hi":"जमना"},{"en":"Transpiration","hi":"वाष्पोत्सर्जन"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"processes"},{"en":"Which organism fixes nitrogen in legume root nodules?","hi":"दलहनी पौधों की जड़ों की ग्रंथियों में नाइट्रोजन स्थिरीकरण करने वाला जीव कौन-सा है?","ans":"Rhizobium bacteria","ans_hi":"राइजोबियम जीवाणु","options":[{"en":"Pancreas","hi":"अग्न्याशय"},{"en":"Heart","hi":"हृदय"},{"en":"Rhizobium bacteria","hi":"राइजोबियम जीवाणु"},{"en":"Lungs","hi":"फेफड़े"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"organs"},{"en":"What is the natural home of an organism called?","hi":"किसी जीव का प्राकृतिक निवास क्या कहलाता है?","ans":"Habitat","ans_hi":"आवास","options":[{"en":"Food chain","hi":"खाद्य श्रृंखला"},{"en":"Population","hi":"जनसंख्या"},{"en":"Habitat","hi":"आवास"},{"en":"Niche alone","hi":"केवल पारिस्थ