िवहन"},{"en":"Fermentation","hi":"किण्वन"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"processes"},{"en":"Which nutrient is typically fixed by nitrogen-fixing bacteria?","hi":"नाइट्रोजन स्थिरीकरण जीवाणु किस तत्व को उपयोगी रूप में बदलते हैं?","ans":"Nitrogen","ans_hi":"नाइट्रोजन","options":[{"en":"Calcium","hi":"कैल्शियम"},{"en":"Nitrogen","hi":"नाइट्रोजन"},{"en":"Fibre","hi":"रेशा"},{"en":"Carbohydrates","hi":"कार्बोहाइड्रेट"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"food"},{"en":"What do fungi often help do in ecosystems?","hi":"पारितंत्र में कवक प्रायः क्या कार्य करते हैं?","ans":"Decomposition","ans_hi":"अपघटन","options":[{"en":"Photosynthesis","hi":"प्रकाश-संश्लेषण"},{"en":"Evaporation","hi":"वाष्पीकरण"},{"en":"Decomposition","hi":"अपघटन"},{"en":"Pollination","hi":"परागण"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What is a community of organisms and surroundings called?","hi":"जीव समुदाय और उसके परिवेश की संयुक्त प्रणाली क्या कहलाती है?","ans":"Ecosystem","ans_hi":"पारितंत्र","options":[{"en":"Only the air","hi":"केवल वायु"},{"en":"Single organism","hi":"एक जीव"},{"en":"Ecosystem","hi":"पारितंत्र"},{"en":"Only the soil","hi":"केवल मिट्टी"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What is an organism that makes its own food called?","hi":"अपना भोजन स्वयं बनाने वाला जीव क्या कहलाता है?","ans":"Autotroph","ans_hi":"स्वपोषी","options":[{"en":"Decomposer","hi":"अपघटक"},{"en":"Autotroph","hi":"स्वपोषी"},{"en":"Parasite","hi":"परजीवी"},{"en":"Herbivore","hi":"शाकाहारी"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What is the main component of the cell wall in plants?","hi":"पादप कोशिका भित्ति का प्रमुख पदार्थ क्या है?","ans":"Cellulose","ans_hi":"सेलुलोज","options":[{"en":"Keratin","hi":"केराटिन"},{"en":"Cellulose","hi":"स