 reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 110 paper sheets and reused 22. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 110 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 22 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"88","ans_hi":"88","options":[{"en":"86","hi":"86"},{"en":"87","hi":"87"},{"en":"112","hi":"112"},{"en":"88","hi":"88"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 18 rows with 12 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 18 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 12 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"216","ans_hi":"216","options":[{"en":"432","hi":"432"},{"en":"228","hi":"228"},{"en":"216","hi":"216"},{"en":"215","hi":"215"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"288 reusable bottles are shared equally among 9 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"288 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 9 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"32","ans_hi":"32","options":[{"en":"31","hi":"31"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"},{"en":"33","hi":"33"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 119 birds on a tree. 16 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 119 पक्षी थे, 16 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"103","ans_hi":"103","options":[{"en":"103","hi":"103"},{"en":"101","hi":"101"},{"en":"121","hi":"121"},{"en":"105","hi":"105"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 25 pages each day for 5 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 5 दिन तक रोज़ 25 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"125","ans_hi":"125","options":[{"en":"125","hi":"125"},{"en":"100","hi":"100"},{"en":"123","hi":"123"},{"en":"126","hi":"126"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 33 litres of water a day for 9 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 9 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 33 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"297","ans_hi":"297","options":[{"en":"295","hi":"295"},{"en":"308","hi":"308"},{"en":"297","hi":"297"},{"en":"298","hi":"298"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 92 pencils, and 25 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 92 पेंसिल में 25 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"67","ans_hi":"67","options":[{"en":"66","hi":"66"},{"en":"69","hi":"69"},{"en":"67","hi":"67"},{"en":"134","hi":"134"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 190 recyclable items in the morning and 34 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 190 और शाम 34 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"224","ans_hi":"224","options":[{"en":"224","hi":"224"},{"en":"260","hi":"260"},{"en":"226","hi":"226"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 118 seedlings. 25 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 118 पौध थे, 25 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"143","ans_hi":"143","options":[{"en":"25","hi":"25"},{"en":"143","hi":"143"},{"en":"141","hi":"141"},{"en":"170","hi":"170"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A worksheet asks you to cite information. Which is responsible?","hi":"कार्यपत्रक में सूचना का संदर्भ देना हो तो क्या उचित है?","ans":"Name the source and publication date","ans_hi":"स्रोत और प्रकाशित होने की तारीख लिखें","options":[{"en":"Use no reference","hi":"बिना संदर्भ लिखें"},{"en":"Copy without acknowledgement","hi":"बिना श्रेय नकल करें"},{"en":"Name the source and publication date","hi":"स्रोत और प्रकाशित होने की तारीख लिखें"},{"en":"Invent a source","hi":"झूठा स्रोत बनाएँ"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A presentation contains a copied photo. What should a student do?","hi":"प्रस्तुति में दूसरे का फोटो लिया गया हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Credit the creator and check permission","ans_hi":"रचनाकार को श्रेय दें और अनुमति देखें","options":[{"en":"Erase attribution","hi":"श्रेय मिटाएँ"},{"en":"Ignore permissions","hi":"अनुमति अनदेखी करें"},{"en":"Claim personal ownership","hi":"अपना बताएं"},{"en":"Credit the creator and check permission","hi":"रचनाकार को श्रेय दें और अनुमति देखें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Two websites disagree on a scientific fact. What helps decide?","hi":"दो वेबसाइटों पर विज्ञान का तथ्य अलग हो तो क्या मदद करेगा?","ans":"Compare credible scientific references","ans_hi":"विश्वसनीय विज्ञान स्रोतों की तुलना","options":[{"en":"Select the more colourful site","hi":"रंगीन वेबसाइट चुनें"},{"en":"Choose whichever is first","hi":"जो पहले आए वही चुनें"},{"en":"Compare credible scientific references","hi":"विश्वसनीय विज्ञान स्रोतों की तुलना"},{"en":"Stop all inquiry","hi":"जाँच बंद करें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"An AI chatbot gives a medical fact without a source. What is responsible?","hi":"AI चैटबॉट चिकित्सा तथ्य बिना स्रोत दे तो क्या उचित है?","ans":"Verify with reliable sources and an adult","ans_hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोत व बड़े से पुष्टि करें","options":[{"en":"Verify with reliable sources and an adult","hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोत व बड़े से पुष्टि करें"},{"en":"Treat it as certain","hi":"बिना जाँच पूर्ण सच मान लें"},{"en":"Forward it as advice","hi":"सलाह बताकर फैलाएँ"},{"en":"Ignore experts","hi":"विशेषज्ञ को अनदेखा करें"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A chart claims one medicine cures all illnesses. What is best?","hi":"चार्ट दावा करे एक दवा सभी रोग ठीक करती है। क्या उचित है?","ans":"Check with qualified health professionals","ans_hi":"योग्य स्वास्थ्य विशेषज्ञों स