"},{"en":"210","hi":"210"},{"en":"203","hi":"203"},{"en":"170","hi":"170"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"216 reusable bottles are shared equally among 12 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"216 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 12 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"18","ans_hi":"18","options":[{"en":"18","hi":"18"},{"en":"17","hi":"17"},{"en":"16","hi":"16"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 126 birds on a tree. 22 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 126 पक्षी थे, 22 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"104","ans_hi":"104","options":[{"en":"128","hi":"128"},{"en":"106","hi":"106"},{"en":"103","hi":"103"},{"en":"104","hi":"104"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 17 pages each day for 8 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 8 दिन तक रोज़ 17 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"136","ans_hi":"136","options":[{"en":"272","hi":"272"},{"en":"138","hi":"138"},{"en":"119","hi":"119"},{"en":"136","hi":"136"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 35 litres of water a day for 12 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 12 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 35 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"420","ans_hi":"420","options":[{"en":"420","hi":"420"},{"en":"432","hi":"432"},{"en":"418","hi":"418"},{"en":"385","hi":"385"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 142 pencils, and 16 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 142 पेंसिल में 16 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"126","ans_hi":"126","options":[{"en":"252","hi":"252"},{"en":"126","hi":"126"},{"en":"124","hi":"124"},{"en":"142","hi":"142"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 155 recyclable items in the morning and 28 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 155 और शाम 28 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"183","ans_hi":"183","options":[{"en":"211","hi":"211"},{"en":"184","hi":"184"},{"en":"183","hi":"183"},{"en":"366","hi":"366"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 46 seedlings. 18 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 46 पौध थे, 18 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"64","ans_hi":"64","options":[{"en":"64","hi":"64"},{"en":"65","hi":"65"},{"en":"66","hi":"66"},{"en":"82","hi":"82"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"When a local pond is polluted, what should a school project examine?","hi":"स्थानीय तालाब प्रदूषित हो तो विद्यालय परियोजना में क्या देखें?","ans":"Sources of pollution and solutions","ans_hi":"प्रदूषण के स्रोत व समाधान","options":[{"en":"Ways to add litter","hi":"कूड़ा बढ़ाने के तरीके"},{"en":"Only the pond's name","hi":"केवल नाम"},{"en":"Ways to hide pollution","hi":"प्रदूषण छिपाने के तरीके"},{"en":"Sources of pollution and solutions","hi":"प्रदूषण के स्रोत व समाधान"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Which school project supports local biodiversity?","hi":"कौन-सी विद्यालय परियोजना स्थानीय जैव विविधता बचाएगी?","ans":"Grow and protect native plants","ans_hi":"स्थानीय पौधे उगाना और बचाना","options":[{"en":"Use litter as compost without sorting","hi":"बिना छाँटे कूड़ा डालना"},{"en":"Grow and protect native plants","hi":"स्थानीय पौधे उगाना और बचाना"},{"en":"Destroy insect habitats","hi":"कीट आवास नष्ट करना"},{"en":"Remove all small plants","hi":"सारे छोटे पौधे उखाड़ना"}],"correct":1,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A presentation contains a copied photo. What should a student do?","hi":"प्रस्तुति में दूसरे का फोटो लिया गया हो तो क्या करें?","ans":"Credit the creator and check permission","ans_hi":"रचनाकार को श्रेय दें और अनुमति देखें","options":[{"en":"Claim personal ownership","hi":"अपना बताएं"},{"en":"Erase attribution","hi":"श्रेय मिटाएँ"},{"en":"Ignore permissions","hi":"अनुमति अनदेखी करें"},{"en":"Credit the creator and check permission","hi":"रचनाकार को श्रेय दें और अनुमति देखें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A chart claims one medicine cures all illnesses. What is best?","hi":"चार्ट दावा करे एक दवा सभी रोग ठीक करती है। क्या उचित है?","ans":"Check with qualified health professionals","ans_hi":"योग्य स्वास्थ्य विशेषज्ञों से जाँचें","options":[{"en":"Share as certain cure","hi":"पक्का उपचार बताकर फैलाएँ"},{"en":"Accept as science","hi":"विज्ञान मान लें"},{"en":"Use without guidance","hi":"बिना सलाह उपयोग करें"},{"en":"Check with qualified health professionals","hi":"योग्य स्वास्थ्य विशेषज्ञों से जाँचें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A small fire starts in a lab. What should students do first?","hi":"प्रयोगशाला में छोटी आग लगे तो विद्यार्थियों को पहले क्या करना चाहिए?","ans":"Alert the teacher and follow safety rules","ans_hi":"शिक्षक को बताएँ और सुरक्षा नियम मानें","options":[{"en":"Crowd around the flame","hi":"लपटों के पास भीड़ लगाएँ"},{"en":"Hide the incident","hi":"घटना छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Alert the teacher and follow safety rules","hi":"शिक्षक को बताएँ और सुरक्षा नियम मानें"},{"en":"Pour unknown chemicals","hi":"अनजान रसायन डालें"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"}],"structure":"Core learning + digital/environment + applied reasoning / मूल + आधुनिक + तर्क","paper_code":"GK-5-2-03"},"5|1|4|GK":{"grade":"5","term":1,"year":4,"subject":"GK","kind":"gk","marks":50,"duration":"75 minutes / 75 मिनट","qs":[{"en":"Which green pigment helps plants absorb light?","hi":"कौन-सा हरा वर्णक पौधों को प्रकाश सोखने में मदद करता है?","ans":"Chlorophyll","ans_hi":"पर्णहरित","options":[{"en":"Haemoglobin","hi":"हीमोग्लोबिन"},{"en":"Chlorophyll","hi":"पर्णहरित"},{"en":"Keratin","hi":"केराटिन"},{"en":"Insulin","hi":"इंसुलिन"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What is the loss of water vapour from leaves called?","hi":"पत्तियों से जलवाष्प निकलने की प्रक्रिया क्या कहलाती है?","ans":"Transpiration","ans_hi":"वाष्पोत्सर्जन","options":[{"en":"Freezing","hi":"जमना"},{"en":"Melting","hi":"गलन"},{"en":"Transpiration","hi":"वाष्पोत्सर्जन"},{"en":"Evaporation","hi":"वाष्पीकरण"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"processes"},{"en":"What are the tiny pores in leaves called?","hi":"पत्तियों पर सूक्ष्म रंध्र क्या कहलाते हैं?","ans":"Stomata","ans_hi":"रंध्र","options":[{"en":"Stomata","hi":"रंध्र"},{"en":"Root hairs","hi":"जड़ रोम"},{"en":"Petals","hi":"पंखुड़ियाँ"},{"en":"Xylem vessels","hi":"जाइलम वाहिकाएँ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"Which flower part produces pollen?","hi":"फूल का कौन-सा भाग पराग बनाता है?","ans":"Anther","ans_hi":"परागकोष","options":[{"en":"Sepal","hi":"बाह्यदल"},{"en":"Ovary","hi":"अंडाशय"},{"en":"Stigma","hi":"वर्तिकाग्र"},{"en":"Anther","hi":"परागकोष"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What is the transfer of pollen to the stigma called?","hi":"परागकण का वर्तिकाग्र तक पहुँचना क्या कहलाता है?","ans":"Pollination","ans_hi":"परागण","options":[{"en":"Sublimation","hi":"उर्ध्वपातन"},{"en":"Photosynthesis","hi":"प्रकाश-संश्लेषण"},{"en":"Pollination","hi":"परागण"},{"en":"Digestion","hi":"पाचन"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"processes"},{"en":"Which organism fixes nitrogen in legume root nodules?","hi":"दलहनी पौधों की जड़ों की ग्रंथि