 में भोजन कहाँ संग्रहित रहता है?","ans":"Cotyledons","ans_hi":"बीजपत्र","options":[{"en":"Cotyledons","hi":"बीजपत्र"},{"en":"Root hairs","hi":"जड़ रोम"},{"en":"Petals","hi":"पंखुड़ियाँ"},{"en":"Stem bark","hi":"तने की छाल"}],"correct":0,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What is the movement of water through a plant called?","hi":"पौधे में पानी के ऊपर पहुँचने की प्रक्रिया में कौन-सा ऊतक मुख्य है?","ans":"Xylem transport","ans_hi":"जाइलम द्वारा जल परिवहन","options":[{"en":"Digestion","hi":"पाचन"},{"en":"Evaporation","hi":"वाष्पीकरण"},{"en":"Xylem transport","hi":"जाइलम द्वारा जल परिवहन"},{"en":"Transpiration","hi":"वाष्पोत्सर्जन"}],"correct":2,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"processes"},{"en":"Which nutrient is typically fixed by nitrogen-fixing bacteria?","hi":"नाइट्रोजन स्थिरीकरण जीवाणु किस तत्व को उपयोगी रूप में बदलते हैं?","ans":"Nitrogen","ans_hi":"नाइट्रोजन","options":[{"en":"Fat","hi":"वसा"},{"en":"Calcium","hi":"कैल्शियम"},{"en":"Carbohydrates","hi":"कार्बोहाइड्रेट"},{"en":"Nitrogen","hi":"नाइट्रोजन"}],"correct":3,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"food"},{"en":"What do fungi often help do in ecosystems?","hi":"पारितंत्र में कवक प्रायः क्या कार्य करते हैं?","ans":"Decomposition","ans_hi":"अपघटन","options":[{"en":"Photosynthesis","hi":"प्रकाश-संश्लेषण"},{"en":"Decomposition","hi":"अपघटन"},{"en":"Pollination","hi":"परागण"},{"en":"Evaporation","hi":"वाष्पीकरण"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","marks":1,"_domain":"CURATED_ANSWER"},{"en":"What is a community of organisms and surroundings called?","hi":"जीव समुदाय और उसके परिवेश की संयुक्त प्रणाली क्या कहलाती है?","ans":"Ecosystem","ans_hi":"पारितंत्र","options":[{"en":"Only the soil","hi":"केवल मिट्टी"},{"en":"Ecosystem","hi":"पारितंत्र"},{"en":"Single organism","hi":"एक जीव"},{"en":"Only the air","hi":"केवल वायु"}],"correct":1,"kind":"core","topic":"Core GK / मूल ज्ञान","ma