":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which action protects local biodiversity?","hi":"स्थानीय जैव विविधता की रक्षा किससे होगी?","ans":"Protect native plants","ans_hi":"स्थानीय पौधे बचाना","options":[{"en":"Do not open it","hi":"उसे न खोलना"},{"en":"Protect native plants","hi":"स्थानीय पौधे बचाना"},{"en":"Limit personal information","hi":"निजी जानकारी सीमित रखना"},{"en":"Use refillable bottles","hi":"दोबारा भरी जाने वाली बोतलें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which ocean lies to India's south?","hi":"भारत के दक्षिण में कौन-सा महासागर है?","ans":"Indian Ocean","ans_hi":"हिंद महासागर","options":[{"en":"Indian Ocean","hi":"हिंद महासागर"},{"en":"Tropic of Cancer","hi":"कर्क रेखा"},{"en":"Prime Meridian","hi":"प्रधान मध्याह्न रेखा"},{"en":"Himalayas","hi":"हिमालय"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which mountain range lies to the north of the Indian plains?","hi":"भारतीय मैदानों के उत्तर में कौन-सी पर्वतमाला है?","ans":"Himalayas","ans_hi":"हिमालय","options":[{"en":"Tropic of Capricorn","hi":"मकर रेखा"},{"en":"Prime Meridian","hi":"प्रधान मध्याह्न रेखा"},{"en":"Himalayas","hi":"हिमालय"},{"en":"Antarctica","hi":"अंटार्कटिका"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which gas is formed when people breathe out?","hi":"श्वास छोड़ते समय कौन-सी गैस अधिक निकलती है?","ans":"Carbon dioxide","ans_hi":"कार्बन डाइऑक्साइड","options":[{"en":"Helium","hi":"हीलियम"},{"en":"Carbon dioxide","hi":"कार्बन डाइऑक्साइड"},{"en":"Oxygen","hi":"ऑक्सीजन"},{"en":"Methane","hi":"मीथेन"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"How can a school reduce single-use plastic?","hi":"विद्यालय एकबारगी प्लास्टिक कैसे घटाए?","ans":"Use refillable bottles","ans_hi":"दोबारा भरी जाने वाली बोतलें","options":[{"en":"Limit personal information","hi":"निजी जानकारी सीमित रखना"},{"en":"Solar panel","hi":"सौर पैनल"},{"en":"Do not open it","hi":"उसे न खोलना"},{"en":"Use refillable bottles","hi":"दोबारा भरी जाने वाली बोतलें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 119 trees on Monday and 23 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 119 और मंगलवार को 23 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"142","ans_hi":"142","options":[{"en":"143","hi":"143"},{"en":"142","hi":"142"},{"en":"140","hi":"140"},{"en":"141","hi":"141"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 128 paper sheets and reused 29. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 128 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 29 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"99","ans_hi":"99","options":[{"en":"97","hi":"97"},{"en":"99","hi":"99"},{"en":"130","hi":"130"},{"en":"198","hi":"198"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 14 rows with 6 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 14 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 6 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"84","ans_hi":"84","options":[{"en":"70","hi":"70"},{"en":"90","hi":"90"},{"en":"84","hi":"84"},{"en":"92","hi":"92"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"252 reusable bottles are shared equally among 12 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"252 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 12 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"21","ans_hi":"21","options":[{"en":"33","hi":"33"},{"en":"23","hi":"23"},{"en":"19","hi":"19"},{"en":"21","hi":"21"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 84 birds on a tree. 19 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 84 पक्षी थे, 19 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"65","ans_hi":"65","options":[{"en":"84","hi":"84"},{"en":"65","hi":"65"},{"en":"64","hi":"64"},{"en":"63","hi":"63"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 16 pages each day for 4 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 4 दिन तक रोज़ 16 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"64","ans_hi":"64","options":[{"en":"68","hi":"68"},{"en":"62","hi":"62"},{"en":"64","hi":"64"},{"en":"66","hi":"66"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 30 litres of water a day for 5 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 5 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 30 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"150","ans_hi":"150","options":[{"en":"151","hi":"151"},{"en":"120","hi":"120"},{"en":"155","hi":"155"},{"en":"150","hi":"150"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 95 pencils, and 26 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 95 पेंसिल में 26 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"69","ans_hi":"69","options":[{"en":"71","hi":"71"},{"en":"69","hi":"69"},{"en":"68","hi":"68"},{"en":"67","hi":"67"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 88 recyclable items in the morning and 38 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 88 और शाम 38 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"126","ans_hi":"126","options":[{"en":"38","hi":"38"},{"en":"126","hi":"126"},{"en":"127","hi":"127"},{"en":"252","hi":"252"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 128 seedlings. 23 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 128 पौध थे, 23 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"151","ans_hi":"151","options":[{"en":"302","hi":"302"},{"en":"153","hi":"153"},{"en":"151","hi":"151"},{"en":"149","hi":"149"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A small fire starts in a lab. What should students do first?","hi":"प्रयोगशाला में छोटी आग लगे तो विद्यार्थियों को पहले क्या करना चाहिए?","ans":"Alert the teacher and follow safety rules","ans_hi":"शिक्षक को बताएँ और सुरक्षा नियम मानें","options":[{"en":"Pour unknown chemicals","hi":"अनजान रसायन डालें"},{"en":"Crowd around the flame","hi":"लपटों के पास भीड़ लगाएँ"},{"en":"Hide the incident","hi":"घटना छिपाएँ"},{"en":"Alert the teacher and follow safety rules","hi":"शिक्षक को बताएँ और सुरक्षा नियम मानें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"A news image looks shocking. What should you do before forwarding?","hi":"चौंकाने वाली समाचार तस्वीर आगे भेजने से पहले क्या करें?","ans":"Check original source and date","ans_hi":"मूल स्रोत और तारीख देखें","options":[{"en":"Crop away the source","hi":"स्रोत काट दें"},{"en":"Forward immediately","hi":"तुरंत भेजें"},{"en":"Add rumours","hi":"अफवाह जोड़ें"},{"en":"Check original source and date","hi":"मूल स्रोत और तारीख देखें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"An old phone no longer works. What is an environmentally sound step?","hi":"पुराना फोन काम न करे तो पर्यावरण के लिए क्या सही है?","ans":"Take it to authorised e-waste collection","ans_hi":"अधिकृत ई-कचरा केंद्र पर दें","options":[{"en":"Take it to authorised e-waste collection","hi":"अधिकृत ई-कचरा केंद्र पर दें"},{"en":"Burn it at home","hi":"घर में जलाएँ"},{"en":"Throw it in a river","hi":"नदी में फेंकें"},{"en":"Bury the battery in soil","hi":"बैटरी जमीन में दबाएँ"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"An AI chatbot gives a medical fact without a source. What is responsible?","hi":"AI चैटबॉट चिकित्सा तथ्य बिना स्रोत दे तो क्या उचित है?","ans":"Verify with reliable sources and an adult","ans_hi":"विश्वसनीय स्रोत व बड़े से पुष्टि करें","options":[