 were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 188 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 15 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"173","ans_hi":"173","options":[{"en":"188","hi":"188"},{"en":"171","hi":"171"},{"en":"173","hi":"173"},{"en":"175","hi":"175"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 35 rows with 11 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 35 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 11 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"385","ans_hi":"385","options":[{"en":"386","hi":"386"},{"en":"383","hi":"383"},{"en":"385","hi":"385"},{"en":"396","hi":"396"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"138 reusable bottles are shared equally among 6 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"138 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 6 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"23","ans_hi":"23","options":[{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"23","hi":"23"},{"en":"25","hi":"25"},{"en":"46","hi":"46"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 140 birds on a tree. 32 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 140 पक्षी थे, 32 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"108","ans_hi":"108","options":[{"en":"107","hi":"107"},{"en":"110","hi":"110"},{"en":"109","hi":"109"},{"en":"108","hi":"108"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 23 pages each day for 10 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 10 दिन तक रोज़ 23 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"230","ans_hi":"230","options":[{"en":"230","hi":"230"},{"en":"229","hi":"229"},{"en":"232","hi":"232"},{"en":"228","hi":"228"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 23 litres of water a day for 9 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 9 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 23 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"207","an