नल","options":[{"en":"Solar panel","hi":"सौर पैनल"},{"en":"Limit personal information","hi":"निजी जानकारी सीमित रखना"},{"en":"Use refillable bottles","hi":"दोबारा भरी जाने वाली बोतलें"},{"en":"Make backups","hi":"बैकअप बनाना"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which imaginary line lies near 23.5° N?","hi":"लगभग 23.5° उत्तर अक्षांश की रेखा कौन-सी है?","ans":"Tropic of Cancer","ans_hi":"कर्क रेखा","options":[{"en":"Tropic of Capricorn","hi":"मकर रेखा"},{"en":"Arctic","hi":"आर्कटिक"},{"en":"Himalayas","hi":"हिमालय"},{"en":"Tropic of Cancer","hi":"कर्क रेखा"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which action protects local biodiversity?","hi":"स्थानीय जैव विविधता की रक्षा किससे होगी?","ans":"Protect native plants","ans_hi":"स्थानीय पौधे बचाना","options":[{"en":"Use refillable bottles","hi":"दोबारा भरी जाने वाली बोतलें"},{"en":"Solar panel","hi":"सौर पैनल"},{"en":"Limit personal information","hi":"निजी जानकारी सीमित रखना"},{"en":"Protect native plants","hi":"स्थानीय पौधे बचाना"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which substance carries oxygen in red blood cells?","hi":"लाल रक्त कोशिकाओं में ऑक्सीजन कौन ले जाता है?","ans":"Haemoglobin","ans_hi":"हीमोग्लोबिन","options":[{"en":"Protein","hi":"प्रोटीन"},{"en":"Cell","hi":"कोशिका"},{"en":"Haemoglobin","hi":"हीमोग्लोबिन"},{"en":"Cell wall","hi":"कोशिका भित्ति"}],"correct":2,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which greenhouse gas is emitted when methane-rich natural gas leaks?","hi":"प्राकृतिक गैस रिसाव में कौन-सी ग्रीनहाउस गैस निकलती है?","ans":"Methane","ans_hi":"मीथेन","options":[{"en":"Methane","hi":"मीथेन"},{"en":"Oxygen","hi":"ऑक्सीजन"},{"en":"Helium","hi":"हीलियम"},{"en":"Ozone","hi":"ओज़ोन"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्