 refillable bottles","hi":"दोबारा भरी जाने वाली बोतलें"}],"correct":1,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which ocean lies to India's south?","hi":"भारत के दक्षिण में कौन-सा महासागर है?","ans":"Indian Ocean","ans_hi":"हिंद महासागर","options":[{"en":"Antarctica","hi":"अंटार्कटिका"},{"en":"Arctic","hi":"आर्कटिक"},{"en":"Equator","hi":"भूमध्य रेखा"},{"en":"Indian Ocean","hi":"हिंद महासागर"}],"correct":3,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"Which gas is released by photosynthesis?","hi":"प्रकाश-संश्लेषण में कौन-सी गैस निकलती है?","ans":"Oxygen","ans_hi":"ऑक्सीजन","options":[{"en":"Oxygen","hi":"ऑक्सीजन"},{"en":"Ozone","hi":"ओज़ोन"},{"en":"Helium","hi":"हीलियम"},{"en":"Nitrogen","hi":"नाइट्रोजन"}],"correct":0,"kind":"modern","marks":1,"topic":"Grade-level modern GK / कक्षा-स्तरीय ज्ञान"},{"en":"The eco-club planted 171 trees on Monday and 30 on Tuesday. How many trees?","hi":"ईको-क्लब ने सोमवार को 171 और मंगलवार को 30 पेड़ लगाए। कुल कितने पेड़?","ans":"201","ans_hi":"201","options":[{"en":"201","hi":"201"},{"en":"202","hi":"202"},{"en":"200","hi":"200"},{"en":"233","hi":"233"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A class collected 69 paper sheets and reused 17. How many were left unused?","hi":"कक्षा ने 69 कागज़ की शीट इकट्ठी कीं और 17 फिर उपयोग कीं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"52","ans_hi":"52","options":[{"en":"54","hi":"54"},{"en":"69","hi":"69"},{"en":"53","hi":"53"},{"en":"52","hi":"52"}],"correct":3,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A garden has 31 rows with 12 flowers each. How many flowers?","hi":"बगीचे में 31 कतारें हैं और हर कतार में 12 फूल हैं। कुल कितने फूल?","ans":"372","ans_hi":"372","options":[{"en":"341","hi":"341"},{"en":"372","hi":"372"},{"en":"744","hi":"744"},{"en":"373","hi":"373"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"363 reusable bottles are shared equally among 11 groups. How many in each group?","hi":"363 दोबारा प्रयोग होने वाली बोतलें 11 समूहों में बराबर बाँटी गईं। हर समूह में कितनी?","ans":"33","ans_hi":"33","options":[{"en":"31","hi":"31"},{"en":"33","hi":"33"},{"en":"32","hi":"32"},{"en":"34","hi":"34"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 52 birds on a tree. 30 fly away. How many stay?","hi":"पेड़ पर 52 पक्षी थे, 30 उड़ गए। कितने बचे?","ans":"22","ans_hi":"22","options":[{"en":"20","hi":"20"},{"en":"22","hi":"22"},{"en":"44","hi":"44"},{"en":"54","hi":"54"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A student reads 21 pages each day for 7 days. How many pages?","hi":"विद्यार्थी 7 दिन तक रोज़ 21 पृष्ठ पढ़ता है। कुल कितने?","ans":"147","ans_hi":"147","options":[{"en":"154","hi":"154"},{"en":"126","hi":"126"},{"en":"147","hi":"147"},{"en":"146","hi":"146"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"The class saves 27 litres of water a day for 9 days. How many litres?","hi":"कक्षा 9 दिनों तक प्रतिदिन 27 लीटर पानी बचाती है। कुल कितने लीटर?","ans":"243","ans_hi":"243","options":[{"en":"243","hi":"243"},{"en":"486","hi":"486"},{"en":"242","hi":"242"},{"en":"254","hi":"254"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 124 pencils, and 38 are used. How many remain?","hi":"कुल 124 पेंसिल में 38 उपयोग हो गईं। कितनी बचीं?","ans":"86","ans_hi":"86","options":[{"en":"85","hi":"85"},{"en":"87","hi":"87"},{"en":"86","hi":"86"},{"en":"126","hi":"126"}],"correct":2,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A team collects 129 recyclable items in the morning and 17 in the evening. How many items?","hi":"टीम ने सुबह 129 और शाम 17 पुनर्चक्रण योग्य वस्तुएँ जुटाईं। कुल कितनी?","ans":"146","ans_hi":"146","options":[{"en":"147","hi":"147"},{"en":"146","hi":"146"},{"en":"163","hi":"163"},{"en":"292","hi":"292"}],"correct":1,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"There are 73 seedlings. 20 more are planted. How many now?","hi":"पहले 73 पौध थे, 20 और लगाए गए। अब कुल कितने?","ans":"93","ans_hi":"93","options":[{"en":"93","hi":"93"},{"en":"113","hi":"113"},{"en":"95","hi":"95"},{"en":"20","hi":"20"}],"correct":0,"kind":"applied","marks":1,"topic":"Sustainable living & reasoning / पर्यावरण और तर्क"},{"en":"A chart claims one medicine cures all illnesses. What is best?","hi":"चार्ट दावा करे एक दवा सभी रोग ठीक करती है। क्या उचित है?","ans":"Check with qualified health professionals","ans_hi":"योग्य स्वास्थ्य विशेषज्ञों से जाँचें","options":[{"en":"Share as certain cure","hi":"पक्का उपचार बताकर फैलाएँ"},{"en":"Use without guidance","hi":"बिना सलाह उपयोग करें"},{"en":"Accept as science","hi":"विज्ञान मान लें"},{"en":"Check with qualified health professionals","hi":"योग्य स्वास्थ्य विशेषज्ञों से जाँचें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"When a local pond is polluted, what should a school project examine?","hi":"स्थानीय तालाब प्रदूषित हो तो विद्यालय परियोजना में क्या देखें?","ans":"Sources of pollution and solutions","ans_hi":"प्रदूषण के स्रोत व समाधान","options":[{"en":"Sources of pollution and solutions","hi":"प्रदूषण के स्रोत व समाधान"},{"en":"Ways to hide pollution","hi":"प्रदूषण छिपाने के तरीके"},{"en":"Ways to add litter","hi":"कूड़ा बढ़ाने के तरीके"},{"en":"Only the pond's name","hi":"केवल नाम"}],"correct":0,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"What reduces the risk of online account theft?","hi":"ऑनलाइन खाते की चोरी का जोखिम कैसे घटेगा?","ans":"Use a unique strong password","ans_hi":"अलग मजबूत पासवर्ड प्रयोग करें","options":[{"en":"Use birth date only","hi":"केवल जन्मतिथि रखें"},{"en":"Write it on public board","hi":"बोर्ड पर लिखें"},{"en":"Share passwords widely","hi":"पासवर्ड सबको दें"},{"en":"Use a unique strong password","hi":"अलग मजबूत पासवर्ड प्रयोग करें"}],"correct":3,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Which school project supports local biodiversity?","hi":"कौन-सी विद्यालय परियोजना स्थानीय जैव विविधता बचाएगी?","ans":"Grow and protect native plants","ans_hi":"स्थानीय पौधे उगाना और बचाना","options":[{"en":"Destroy insect habitats","hi":"कीट आवास नष्ट करना"},{"en":"Use litter as compost without sorting","hi":"बिना छाँटे कूड़ा डालना"},{"en":"Grow and protect native plants","hi":"स्थानीय पौधे उगाना और बचाना"},{"en":"Remove all small plants","hi":"सारे छोटे पौधे उखाड़ना"}],"correct":2,"kind":"case","marks":1,"topic":"Practical decisions / व्यवहारिक निर्णय"},{"en":"Two websites disagree on a scientific fact. What helps decide?","hi":"दो वेबसाइटों 